    p "是的。他说在帆上待过后想找个地方暖和一下。我觉得你的舱室是个……合适的选择。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19750
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_c0772466:

    # p "Was I wrong?"
    p "我错了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19752
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_228e3b68:

    # n "Well..."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:19754
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_98485659:

    # p "I can smell him on you. No need to play coy."
    p "我能闻到你身上的他的味道。没必要装模作样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19762
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_6c4b09c7:

    # "You step closer, lifting his chin gently with a finger, forcing him to meet your eyes."
    "你走近一步，用一根手指轻轻抬起他的下巴，迫使他与你对视。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19764
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_2f19f0f7:

    # "His ears wilt, and he struggles for words."
    "他的耳朵耷拉下来，支支吾吾说不出话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19766
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_93d16455:

    # p "Either you tell me, or he will—and believe me, that lizard? Phew, he is not shy about sharing every last detail. This way, you control what I hear."
    p "要么你告诉我，要么他来说——相信我，那条蜥蜴？啧，他可一点不介意分享每一个细节。这样，你还能控制我听到的内容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19770
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_24796dbe:

    # n ". . ."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:19772
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_1a06fcb5:

    # n "He said you gave him permission to... do whatever he wanted to."
    n "他说你允许他……想做什么就做什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19774
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_836a70b2:

    # "It sounds more like he's asking a question rather than a statement."
    "听起来更像是在提问，而非陈述。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19776
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_7be2603f:

    # p "I did."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:19778
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_439f8e98:

    # n "Well... he wanted... sex."
    n "嗯……他想要……做爱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19780
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_737b63ca:

    # "Your eyebrows lift slightly in a flicker of surprise, and if the red across his cheeks could get any redder, then you are sure that it would."
    "你的眉毛因一丝惊讶而微微扬起，而他脸颊上的红晕如果能更红的话，你确信它会的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19787
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_cca7b8f1:

    # p "And you agreed?"
    p "而你同意了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19789
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_5a8dd762:

    # "He nods, and a mischievous grin tugs at your lips."
    "他点点头，一抹促狭的笑容爬上你的嘴角。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19791
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_a00d447b:

    # "The images of Julian and him in every imaginable permutation immediately flash across your mind."
    "朱利安和他以各种你能想象到的姿势纠缠的画面立刻在你脑海中闪过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19793
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_3bd9d09b:

    # p "Mm... hot."
    p "嗯……真够劲。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19795
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_e2a3f1f4:

    # p "On all fours?"
    p "趴着？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19797
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_35a04ece:

    # "His snout dips in another nod."
    "他的口鼻部再次低垂，点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19801
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_26db9df7:

    # p "I like the sound of that.{w} Paying you a visit back then was far from a mistake."
    p "我喜欢这说法。{w} 当时去拜访你，可远不是个错误。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19803
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_24f05e3f:

    # p "But, as much as I could listen to you describe it for hours on end, and I'm sure you have many {i}sensations{/i} to describe in vivid detail, the wine is why I'm actually here. You don't happen to have a bottle you could spare?"
    p "不过，尽管我能听你描述上好几个小时，而且我相信你有很多{i}感觉{/i}可以生动细致地描述，但葡萄酒才是我来这里的真正原因。你碰巧有瓶能匀给我的酒吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19805
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_9a83dc92:

    # p "I could, you know, return the favor by sending Julian again—since it seems you two got along quite nicely."
    p "我可以，你知道的，作为回报再派朱利安过来——既然你们俩似乎相处得挺不错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19810
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_336d3c36:

    # p "So you have a bottle you might be able to part with?"
    p "所以你有瓶可能愿意割爱的酒？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19814
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_844743ef:

    # p "I'd pay you back for it, of course."
    p "我当然会付钱给你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19817
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_336d3c36_1:

    # p "So you have a bottle you might be able to part with?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:19821
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_844743ef_1:

    # p "I'd pay you back for it, of course."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:19823
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_a8bb7f71:

    # n "I did not say that I have one."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:19827
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_7de11729:

    # n "Did you happen to notice a huge stash of wine when you were in here?"
    n "你在这儿的时候，碰巧注意到一大堆藏酒了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19829
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_8285e711:

    # p "No, not that I recall."
    p "没有，我不记得有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19833
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_df6c1539:

    # p "But I was a bit... distracted."
    p "但我当时有点……分心了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19835
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_d18d1594:

    # p "Bottles of wine, your balls...{w} let's just say the scales tipped pretty fast."
    p "葡萄酒，你的蛋蛋……{w} 只能说天平倾斜得相当快。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19839
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_c36f489e:

    # n "I can... imagine."
    n "我……能想象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19841
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_d3237980:

    # p "And trust me, they didn't tip toward the wine."
    p "相信我，它们可没倒向葡萄酒那边。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19843
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_756ac470:

    # "For some reason you feel compelled to clarify."
    "出于某种原因，你觉得有必要澄清一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19845
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_1b55939d:

    # n "I... I understood you the first time."
    n "我……我第一次就听懂了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19849
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_9eda166e:

    # p "You really don't have anything? You know you'd be doing me a huge favor."
    p "你真的一点都没有？你知道这会帮我一个大忙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19853
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_07f7c8cc:

    # n "Getting you drunk is not exactly a habit I intend on encouraging."
    n "让你喝醉可不是我打算鼓励的习惯。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19857
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_6e7bb8b9:

    # n "Why, of all things, do you require a bottle of wine so desperately?"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:19859
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_3ba74409:

    # n "We are only a few days out from Morocco. You can spend your pay on drinks when we get there."
    n "我们离摩洛哥只有几天航程了。到那儿你可以用你的薪水买酒喝。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19861
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_1ff39a0c:

    # p "It's not for me. Besides, you know the trouble I'm in."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:19863
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_2cccc075:

    # p "That's why I need it. Can you keep quiet? If you can, I'll explain."
    p "所以才需要它。你能保密吗？如果你能，我就解释。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19865
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_e48b5029:

    # "He nods, uncertain but curious."
    "他点点头，虽不确定但很好奇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19867
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_cba0e0c8:

    # n "Uh, sure. Whatever it may be, it is safe with me."
    n "呃，当然。无论是什么，我都会保密。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19874
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_ceafafed:

    # "You lean in closer, lowering your voice to a whisper, making sure no one else could overhear."
    "你凑得更近，将声音压低成耳语，确保没人能偷听到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19876
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_8b0260fa:

    # p "One of the crew mentioned that with a little gift, I might have a better chance convincing the first mate."
    p "有个船员提到，带点小礼物，我或许更有机会说服大副。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19878
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_28f1dfa9:

    # p "Apparently, he enjoys a drink now and then. I thought it might help persuade him to let me stay on if I bring him a little something."
    p "显然，他偶尔喜欢喝一杯。我想如果我带点小礼物给他，可能有助于说服他让我留在船上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19882
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_3fdd52c4:

    # "He studies you for a moment, his expression softening briefly."
    "他端详了你片刻，表情短暂地柔和下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19884
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_4d5a99cc:

    # n "I see..."
    n "我明白了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:19888
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_27a4d8bc:

    # n "I dearly hope you are telling the truth, and not playing on my goodwill."
    n "我衷心希望你说的是实话，而不是在利用我的善意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19896
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_b330877d:

    # "You place a hand over your heart, raising the other as if swearing an oath."
    "你一手按在心口，另一只手举起，仿佛在发誓。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19898
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_2535e958:

    # "He frowns, holding your gaze for several long seconds before letting out a weary sigh."
    "他皱起眉，凝视了你好几秒，然后发出一声疲惫的叹息。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19904
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_c0ab40c2:

    # n "I hope I am judging you correctly—that you really are a gentleman of your word. I am not entirely convinced, though..."
    n "我希望我对你的判断是正确的——你真的是个信守诺言的绅士。不过，我并没有完全被说服……"

# game/script day12.rpy:19908
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_5deed91f:

    # n "Especially after everything you have done so far."
    n "尤其是在你迄今为止所做的一切之后。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19912
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_e905a8cd:

    # p "Oh, hush. You were excited for all of it. If anything, you would probably be more likely to agree if I'd be asking for wine {i}and{/i} for you to get on your knees to suck me off."
    p "哦，闭嘴。你对那些事可兴奋着呢。要我说，如果我想要酒{i}并且{/i}要你跪下来给我口交，你同意的可能性恐怕更大。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19916
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_2390b6d0:

    # n "Especially after you barged into my room that time."
    n "尤其是在你那次闯进我房间之后。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19920
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_5b904389:

    # p "Oh, hush. You were excited the whole time."
    p "哦，闭嘴。你从头到尾都很兴奋。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19924
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_127c4c94:

    # p "Think of this as an opportunity to teach me the ways of a proper gentleman like yourself."
    p "把这看作一个机会，教我像你这样一位真正绅士的处世之道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19930
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_a8e515b1:

    # n "I think you are making quite the fine gentleman."
    n "我觉得你正在成为一位相当出色的绅士。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19932
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_dd5bdf78:

    # p "Thank you."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:19934
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_b9c4f5c5:

    # p "Maybe this could be another chance to refine my more... gentlemanly side."
    p "也许这可以成为另一个机会，来打磨我更为……绅士的一面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19936
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_8d7a00b5:

    # p "So I can learn to appreciate good wine... though I doubt Arthur will share it with me."
    p "这样我就能学会欣赏好酒了……虽然我怀疑亚瑟会不会和我分享。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19944
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_257ca57b:

    # "He turns smoothly, stepping behind the door and leaving you with an empty view of his cabin. His bedsheet is heaped in a messy pile at the far end of the bed."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:19948
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_a44a2003:

    # "He turns smoothly, stepping behind the door and leaving you with an empty view of his cabin."
    "他利落地转身，退到门后，让你只能望着他空无一人的船舱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19952
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_491d5e5b:

    # "You hear him rummaging through something, the soft clinking of objects and the occasional flicker of his tail as it flashes past the doorway."
    "你听见他翻找东西的声音，有物品轻微的叮当声，还有他尾巴偶尔闪过门廊的摇曳光影。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19957
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_5251e747:

    # "A moment later, he reappears, glancing briefly behind him as if to check for anything he missed before refocusing on you."
    "片刻之后，他重新出现，飞快地朝身后瞥了一眼，仿佛在检查是否遗漏了什么，随后目光重新聚焦在你身上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19962
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_8a66b457:

    # "He holds out a bottle, the label adorned with artfully drawn grapes and a French-sounding name.{w} {i}Gevrey-Chambertin{/i}."
    "他递出一只酒瓶，标签上装饰着精美的葡萄图案和一个听起来像法文的名字。{w}{i}热夫雷-香贝丹{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19964
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_3bffbd22:

    # p "Thank you. Really, thank you so much!"
    p "谢谢你。真的，太感谢你了！"

# game/script day12.rpy:19968
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_dae7cae5:

    # "You take the bottle eagerly, completely giddy as you slip it from his paws. He can't hide his smile, clearly amused by your excitement."
    "你急切地接过酒瓶，从他爪中抽出时完全乐昏了头。他藏不住笑意，显然被你的兴奋劲儿逗乐了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19970
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_9415940e:

    # n "It's fine. I was planning to pick up something at Mogador's harbor anyway. It is probably prudent to clear out some of my storage before we arrive."
    n "没关系。反正我也打算在莫加多尔港买点东西。在抵达前清掉些库存可能更明智。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19972
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_b2bdb83a:

    # n "After all, we are not exactly granted the luxury of excessive space around here."
    n "毕竟，我们这地方可没奢侈到有多余空间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19974
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_08c79cb4:

    # n "Just... make sure I will not regret this by finding you drunk in some corner of the ship."
    n "只是……别让我后悔，别让我发现你在船上哪个角落醉得不省人事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19976
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_020c6ddc:

    # p "I'd be a fool to waste it like that."
    p "我要是那样浪费它，可就太蠢了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19978
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_d3a04171:

    # "You can barely stop yourself from thanking him repeatedly, and with a polite nod, you manage to peel yourself away from the doorway and let him get back to whatever he was doing."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:19990
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_818acc57:

    # "As you walk away, you spin the bottle in your hands, admiring just how—well, you'd almost call it {i}noble{/i}—it looks."
    "离开时，你转动着手中的酒瓶，欣赏着它那——嗯，你几乎想用{i}高贵{/i}来形容——的外观。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19994
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_6962204f:

    # "With something this fancy, you feel that your chances of success are better than you could have hoped for."
    "拿着这么精致的东西，你觉得成功的希望比预想的还要大。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19996
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_cbd922c2:

    # "You wouldn't be at all surprised if this might be the most expensive bottle of wine you will ever hold in your life."
    "就算说这是你此生拿过的最贵的一瓶酒，你也毫不意外。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20000
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_f364fc53:

    # "Looking at it, you begin to recall Wolf mentioning a story about him and his friends, enjoying an evening over wine..."
    "看着它，你开始想起沃尔夫提过的一个故事，关于他和朋友们共度美酒良宵……"

# game/script day12.rpy:20028
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_88ca3cae:

    # r "You need what?"
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20030
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_b9d7858d:

    # "She looks ready to shut the door in your face again."
    "她看起来又准备当着你的面摔门了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20032
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_38e6423c:

    # "The candle burning on her table casts her in a soft orange glow, making her expression all the more unyielding."
    "桌上燃烧的蜡烛给她罩上一层柔和的橙光，让她的表情显得更加不容商量。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20034
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_0f6a86a4_1:

    # p "Just one bottle."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20038
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_540270e1:

    # p "Please, Rajeeyah, remember when I helped you with Perce before we even knew each other? All I'm asking for is a small favor in return."
    p "求你了，拉吉娅，还记得我们甚至互不相识时，我就帮你照顾珀斯了吗？我只求你帮个小忙作为回报。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20043
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_cc7b8f18:

    # "She steadies herself against the frame of the door."
    "她稳住身子，靠在门框上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20045
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_a24dc1b9:

    # r "You helped me because you're a sailor,{w} sailor."
    r "你帮我是因为你是水手，{w}水手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20047
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_c206fa9f:

    # r "It is what you are paid to do."
    r "那是你拿钱该做的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20051
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_1f4feb6f:

    # r "And from what I recall, it was more a matter of me saving your behind from getting disciplined for breaking rank."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20055
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_70640f7a:

    # p "Please, Rajeeyah, it's just a small favor."
    p "求你了，拉吉娅，只是个小忙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20060
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_cc7b8f18_1:

    # "She steadies herself against the frame of the door."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20062
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_424d88d0:

    # r "It's not as small of a favor as you seem to think. Do you even realize the trouble I could be in if anyone found out?"
    r "这可不是你以为的那么小的忙。你有没有想过，要是被人发现，我会有多大麻烦？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20064
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_f01a1ff1:

    # p "I swear, I won't tell a soul."
    p "我发誓，绝不会告诉任何人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20068
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_99b866d9:

    # "You place a hand over your heart, raising the other as if swearing a sacred oath."
    "你将一只手放在心口，举起另一只手，仿佛在起一个神圣的誓言。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20072
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_4ce4e570:

    # "She frowns, holding your gaze for several long seconds before letting out a weary sigh."
    "她皱起眉头，紧紧盯着你看了好几秒，然后疲惫地叹了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20074
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_1bd8fe3c:

    # r "The problem isn't just you blabbing—actually, on second thought, that is one too—but the far bigger issue is someone finding out on their own."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20076
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_e45340bc:

    # p "Please, Rajeeyah. I'm begging you. Just this once."
    p "求你了，拉吉娅。我在求你。就这一次。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20078
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_24317ba1:

    # r ". . ."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20085
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_9823712e:

    # p "How about when I warned you yesterday about that bucket you nearly tripped over during your exercise?"
    p "那说说昨天我提醒你注意锻炼时差点绊倒你的那个水桶，怎么样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20089
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_9fb6ba2e:

    # p "I help you out, you help me out. It's a simple give and take."
    p "我帮了你，你帮帮我。简单的礼尚往来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20093
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_898f4c41:

    # r "And who distracted me in the first place?"
    r "而且当初是谁先让我分心的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20095
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_12cd3a24:

    # p "Well..."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20097
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_6700803f:

    # r "Besides, warning someone about a trip hazard is just basic decency—you don't get extra points for that."
    r "再说了，提醒别人注意绊脚的危险只是基本礼貌——这可不额外加分。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20099
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_84fef24e:

    # "She pauses, giving you a sideways glance."
    "她顿了顿，侧目瞥了你一眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20101
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_bd84308a:

    # r "Or, well, you {i}shouldn't{/i} get any points for that.{w} But I will admit, given the low standards of some of the crew, at times even basic decency appears to be a lost art."
    r "或者说，嗯，你{i}本来就不该{/i}因此得到任何加分。{w}但我得承认，考虑到有些船员标准之低，有时候连基本礼貌都像失传的艺术。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20103
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_1ea6a769:

    # r "It should not be a difficult target to hit, yet here we are."
    r "这本该是个不难命中的目标，可现实却如此。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20105
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_badaedb4:

    # p "Still, I did hit it."
    p "可我还是命中了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20109
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_f186ac28:

    # p "Remember when you were trapped in that painfully boring conversation with that guy, and practically begged me to rescue you?"
    p "还记得你被那个家伙困在那场痛苦无聊的对话里，几乎是求我来救你的时候吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20113
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_2901f6fe:

    # p "What was it he was talking about again?{w} His personal theories on the intricacies of different rope splicing techniques?"
    p "他当时又在说什么来着？{w}他对不同绳索接合技巧奥妙的个人理论？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20115
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_4d50c876:

    # r "Knot splicing..."
    r "绳结接合……"

# game/script day12.rpy:20117
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_93151b25:

    # r "And I didn't {i}beg{/i} you."
    r "而且我可没{i}求{/i}你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20119
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_1bc0ab25:

    # p "I saw the panic in your eyes."
    p "我看到了你眼里的慌乱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20123
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_2f73fc5d:

    # "She sighs, exasperated but unable to hide a small smile."
    "她叹了口气，既恼火又忍不住露出一丝微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20125
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_b56473a9:

    # r "Fine,{w} I admit that perhaps your request for assistance came at a fortunate time."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20129
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_11d86000:

    # p "How about when I sat down to fix the frayed edge on one of your garments?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20131
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_75d66198:

    # r "You're not the only one on this ship who can sew. Someone else could have done it."
    r "这船上会缝补的又不只你一个。别人也能做。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20135
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_9e767fde:

    # p "But did they?"
    p "但他们做了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20137
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_03a8fdba:

    # p "No, {i}I{/i} did it. And now I'm asking you, not someone else."
    p "没有，是{i}我{/i}做的。而现在是我在求你，不是别人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20139
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_f32a9441:

    # p "Fair's fair, right? I help you, you help me. That's how it works."
    p "公平交换，对吧？我帮你，你帮我。规矩就是这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20141
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_4fac4519:

    # "You throw in a hand gesture for emphasis."
    "你加上一个手势来强调。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20145
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_904fa1f8:

    # p "Raj, remember that drink I asked for back then?"
    p "拉吉，还记得我那时问你要的那杯酒吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20147
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_0768d003:

    # p "You told me you'd give it to me—so here I am."
    p "你答应过要给我的——所以我现在来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20151
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_7ad10b25:

    # r "It's been a while, and forgive me if my memory's fuzzy, but I don't recall a full bottle being part of that deal."
    r "有段时间了，如果我记不清了请见谅，但我可不记得那交易里包括一整瓶酒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20153
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_e19f5435:

    # p "It might not have been..."
    p "可能是不包括……"

# game/script day12.rpy:20155
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_ec262d4b:

    # p "But it's been days, so that means I get... what's the word? You know, when you pay back more than you borrowed"
    p "但这都过去好几天了，所以意思是我该得到……那个词叫什么来着？你知道的，就是你还的比借的多"

# game/script day12.rpy:20159
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_3a6dd305:

    # r "Interest?"
    r "利息？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20163
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_89306a96:

    # "You snap your fingers, as if her answer has jogged your cobwebbed memory."
    "你打了个响指，仿佛她的回答唤醒了你尘封的记忆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20165
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_f437743d:

    # p "That's it!"
    p "对，就是这个！"

# game/script day12.rpy:20167
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_1e61d2b6:

    # r "I'm sorry, but no amount of interest is going to turn a single mug of grog into a full bottle in under two weeks."
    r "抱歉，但再多的利息也不可能在不到两周内把一杯格罗格酒变成一整瓶。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20169
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_983d3107:

    # p "It doesn't have to be a big bottle, Rajeeyah."
    p "不一定非要一大瓶，拉吉娅。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20173
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_e70d111e:

    # r "And you think I'm the weakest link in the chain that's keeping the drinks at bay from you lot."
    r "所以你觉得我是那条防着你们这帮人喝酒的链条上最薄弱的一环。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20177
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_85b76af9:

    # "She releases her grip on the door frame, crossing her arms and letting her shoulder rest against it instead."
    "她松开门框，抱起双臂，转而将肩膀靠在上面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20179
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_241bd202:

    # p "Well... you didn't have to phrase it like that."
    p "这个嘛……你倒不必说得这么直白。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20181
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_5c0fbf5b:

    # p "Besides, I'm not planning on drinking it myself. It's, um, I guess a surprise for someone."
    p "再说了，我不是打算自己喝。是，呃，我想给某人一个惊喜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20185
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_8745c295:

    # "Her tail flicks behind her, brushing against the edge of the door."
    "她的尾巴在身后轻摆，扫过门边。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20187
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_21a740db:

    # r "Why would you choose to surprise anyone on this ship with alcohol, of all things?"
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20189
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_f3144d27:

    # p "Come on, that shouldn't surprise you. Is it so strange that I'd want to make friends with the crew?"
    p "得了吧，这有什么好惊讶的。我想和船员们交朋友，这很奇怪吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20191
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_95399ce5:

    # p "He told me about some of his favorite memories—sharing drinks with friends. So, I thought... maybe I could help create a few more of those."
    p "他跟我讲过一些他最珍爱的回忆——和朋友们共饮。所以，我想……也许我能帮忙再创造一些那样的回忆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20193
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_5e6debf6:

    # p "Good memories, that is."
    p "我是说，美好的回忆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20195
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_2a27360a:

    # p "Plus... I won't lie, I could use a little pick-me-up myself. You'd be helping out two crew members at once."
    p "而且……说实话，我自己也需要提提神。你等于一下子帮了两个船员。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20197
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_1f280ea4:

    # p "Think of it as a... a morale booster! A medical intervention for the crew's spirits!"
    p "就当是……提振士气！对船员精神的一次医疗干预！"

# game/script day12.rpy:20199
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_0b26eed0:

    # "You pause for a second to search for any sign of agreement, but her expression remains impassive. So you push ahead and rattle on."
    "你停顿片刻，寻找她同意的迹象，但她表情依旧冷淡。于是你硬着头皮继续喋喋不休。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20201
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_5f932bdc:

    # p "And I promise, neither of us will spill a word about where we got it from."
    p "而且我保证，我们俩都不会透露是从哪儿弄来的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20203
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_291c4841:

    # p "And, and,... uh..."
    p "还有，还有，……呃……"

# game/script day12.rpy:20214
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_4814987d:

    # "You glance around, desperately searching for something to strengthen your case. Your eyes land on the disarray of papers and writing utensils strewn across her table."
    "你环顾四周，拼命想找点什么来加强你的说辞。你的目光落在她桌上散乱的文件和书写工具上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20216
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_8d3ab683:

    # p "If you ever need help tidying up, sorting out bottles, or uh, anything really, I'm the one to call over."
    p "如果你需要帮忙整理、分拣瓶子，或者呃，任何事真的，我随叫随到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20218
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_179423be:

    # p "I might even be able to rope him into helping too—actually, don't count on that. I can't speak for him."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20222
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_496cc358:

    # "You quickly backtrack, realizing you're in no position to convince Arthur to do {i}anything{/i}—and certainly not menial tasks."
    "你赶紧改口，意识到自己根本没立场说服亚瑟做{i}任何事{/i}——尤其是杂活。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20224
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_c8ee31cb:

    # "She stretches the silence to let you sweat for a few seconds.{w} Mercifully, she exhales a long, exaggerated sigh, rolling her eyes as she does."
    "她故意沉默了几秒，让你紧张得冒汗。{w}仁慈的是，她夸张地长叹一声，同时翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20228
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_b744f986:

    # "A sigh of defeat, no doubt about it!"
    "毫无疑问，这是认输的叹息！"

# game/script day12.rpy:20230
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_7a31c75f:

    # r "Where did you even get the idea that I might have anything like that in here?"
    r "你到底是哪儿来的念头，觉得我这儿可能有那种东西？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20234
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_44456ae0:

    # r "You know I don't really drink alcohol. So why, of all people, would {i}I{/i} have a bottle of wine?"
    r "你知道我不怎么喝酒。所以为什么，在所有人中，偏偏{i}我{/i}会有一瓶葡萄酒？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20236
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_129afbb5:

    # p "I don't know.{w} Some important surgeon... stuff."
    p "我不知道。{w}一些重要的外科医生……用的东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20238
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_e5874f57:

    # p "You gave Samuel the rum, after all."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20242
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_ebe52fda:

    # p "Perce had some with him in his room."
    p "珀斯自己房间里就有一些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20244
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_e486d92b:

    # p "You're the surgeon, so I figured you probably keep some around for important... surgeon-related business."
    p "你是外科医生，所以我猜你大概会备一些，用于重要的……外科医生相关的事务。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20248
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_38210b52:

    # p "You're the surgeon, so I figured you might have something for all that important surgeon... stuff."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20252
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_cbdba9e2:

    # r "So you assume I just keep a variety of drinks stashed here, like I'm a tavern maid?"
    r "所以你以为我在这儿藏了各式各样的酒，像个酒馆女招待？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20256
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_51d2237e:

    # r "I'm a surgeon, not running a bar."
    r "我是外科医生，不是开酒吧的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20262
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_96007423:

    # "You notice her gradually leaning back until she steps away from the doorway. She catches herself smoothly and pivots, disappearing behind it to leave you with the view of her empty cabin."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20266
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_1173a363:

    # "The soft clink of glass bottles spills from her cabin as she rummages through them, with the occasional flicker of her tail appearing briefly in the doorway."
    "她翻找时，玻璃瓶轻微的叮当声从船舱里传出，她的尾巴偶尔在门廊短暂地闪现。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20270
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_b16708f8:

    # "Moments later, she reappears, casting a quick glance over her shoulder as if checking for something before focusing back on you."
    "片刻之后，她重新出现，飞快地朝肩后扫了一眼，仿佛在检查什么，然后重新把注意力放回你身上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20275
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_1290b862:

    # "She extends a small bottle towards you. The label clearly says wine{w}—specifically, \"Wormwood Wine.\""
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20277
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_e4fdf5d5:

    # r "Here. This is all I can spare without raising suspicion if someone sees you with it."
    r "给。这是我能匀出来的全部了，要是有人看见你拿着它，也不会太引人怀疑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20279
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_4537a5c0:

    # r "It's not the best, though. Quite bitter."
    r "不过，这不是最好的。相当苦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20281
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_09268a6f:

    # r "We do have better wine on board, but it's reserved for the captain."
    r "船上确实有更好的酒，但那是留给船长的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20283
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_192eaeb2:

    # "You feel the corners of your lips tug into a smile, excitement bubbling up. But just as you reach for the bottle, she pulls it back slightly, demanding your attention once more."
    "你感到嘴角不由自主地上扬，兴奋感涌上心头。但就在你伸手去接瓶子时，她微微往后一收，再次要求你集中注意力。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20285
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_562f8169:

    # r "If anyone asks, you feel bloated, have abdominal pain, nausea, and were vomiting earlier. Symptoms of intestinal worms. This will help."
    r "如果有人问起，你就说你感觉腹胀、腹痛、恶心，之前还吐过。是肠道寄生虫的症状。这个（酒）会有帮助。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20287
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_1cf69150:

    # "She rattles the symptoms off while counting them with her fingers."
    "她一边掰着手指数，一边飞快地报出这些症状。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20291
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_1a47f3e4:

    # r "And you {i}will{/i} work this off. Don't think you're getting it for free."
    r "而且你{i}必须{/i}用工作来偿还。别以为这是白给你的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20293
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_2fe3daae:

    # r "And don't you dare make a habit out of this. I am willing to break the rules but not on the regular, so I do hope that whoever it is is worth it."
    r "还有，你最好别养成习惯。我愿意破例，但不是经常性的，所以我真希望那个人值得你这么做。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20295
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_0a1de0ea:

    # p "Got it. Believe me Rajeeyah, he very much is."
    p "明白了。相信我，拉吉娅，他绝对值得。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20299
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_68943230:

    # p "You're amazing, thank you so, so, {i}so{/i}, so much!"
    p "你太棒了，真的，真的，{i}真的{/i}，太感谢你了！"

# game/script day12.rpy:20301
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_21719ba9:

    # "She extends the bottle with both hands, almost like she's presenting you with a rare and precious artifact."
    "她双手递过瓶子，那架势几乎像是在向你呈献一件稀世珍宝。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20303
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_ea79b811:

    # "And on this ship? Well, in a way, it was."
    "而在这艘船上？嗯，从某种意义上说，它确实是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20305
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_96e1b3bd:

    # r "Very good, here. Remember why you have it, and do not make me regret this, please."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20307
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_0fb57c56:

    # "You can barely contain your gratitude, your words tumbling out in a rush of thanks. Eventually though you manage to tear yourself away from the doorway, leaving her to return to her work."
    "你几乎按捺不住感激之情，感谢的话语一股脑儿倾泻而出。不过最终，你还是设法让自己从门口离开，留她回去继续工作。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20315
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_b465f204:

    # "The mention of its supposed bitterness lingers in your mind, though. Hopefully, it won't be too off-putting—or you'll just have to hope that Arthur values the gesture more than the gift itself."
    "然而，她提到的那种所谓的苦味仍在你的脑海中挥之不去。但愿它不会太难以下咽——否则，你就只能希望亚瑟更看重这份心意，而不是礼物本身了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20322
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_32723c32:

    # "But what if he doesn't? What if it's wasted on Arthur?"
    "但如果他不领情呢？如果这酒对亚瑟来说是白费了呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20335
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_7618fcc8:

    # "Though, if only you could overcome the suffocating anxiety of actually confronting the first mate..."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20337
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_ad643128:

    # "An hour later you manage to go as far as to stand in front of the door, but you don't have it in you to actually knock."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20339
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_4d705b17:

    # "You just can't get your arm to move, no matter how hard you try."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20341
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_e7fe4713:

    # "What if this'll make it worse?"
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20343
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_09eac890:

    # "Instead you watch the day pass with the bottle sitting among your belongings."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20349
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_68d79200:

    # "If only you could overcome the suffocating anxiety of actually confronting the first mate..."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20351
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_ad643128_1:

    # "An hour later you manage to go as far as to stand in front of the door, but you don't have it in you to actually knock."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20353
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_4d705b17_1:

    # "You just can't get your arm to move, no matter how hard you try."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20355
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_e7fe4713_1:

    # "What if this'll make it worse?"
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20357
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_alcohol_09eac890_1:

    # "Instead you watch the day pass with the bottle sitting among your belongings."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20398
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_5908d89e:

    # "This feels different."
    "这次感觉不一样了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20400
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f77fbb9a:

    # "Ears twitching, fur standing on end, and every fiber of your being wound into a stiff coil."
    "耳朵抽动，毛发竖立，身体的每一根纤维都绷紧得像僵硬的弹簧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20402
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_1bc8fe6c:

    # "Something in you has changed."
    "你内在的某些东西已经改变了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20404
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_35786562:

    # "You bite your lip, appreciating the fresh clarity a small, sharp injection of pain can bring. A narrow, steely focus that pushes aside those irritating doubts."
    "你咬紧嘴唇，品味着一阵微小而尖锐的痛楚所带来的清新明晰感。那是一种狭窄、钢铁般的专注，将那些恼人的疑虑统统推开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20410
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_51ea4bb6:

    # "This is a necessity. Moral qualms, a landlubber's ball and chain, you tell yourself."
    "这是必要的。道德上的顾虑，不过是陆上人的枷锁罢了，你告诉自己。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20412
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2ccdb4fa:

    # "You know there's no other way."
    "你知道别无他法。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20417
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_dbd9fab3:

    # "It's not like Arthur will listen to reason."
    "亚瑟又不是那种会听道理的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20419
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e95f896f:

    # "Stepping towards the quarterdeck, you trace the mizzenmast down into the deck, eyeing up the door that leads into the officer's cabins."
    "你朝着后甲板走去，目光沿着后桅向下，落向甲板，审视着通往军官舱室的那扇门。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20425
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_7ff700a2:

    # "Even though it's a quiet night, there's still some of the crew of the starboard watch staying alert, especially this close to the ship's wheel and the officer's quarters."
    "尽管是个宁静的夜晚，右舷值班的船员中仍有一些人保持着警惕，尤其是在靠近船舵和军官住舱的地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20433
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3d06b3ec:

    # "You do your best to act casual, trying to muffle the sloshing liquid while holding the bottle close to your chest."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20435
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6fe13c18:

    # "Hiding a bottle on your person is harder than expected, but you manage a convincing attempt, while the wind and the splash of waves hides any unfortunate misstep."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20441
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4ee893ce:

    # "As you push through the door leading towards the officer's cabins, you struggle to keep your resolve."
    "当你推开那扇通往军官舱室的门时，你努力维持着自己的决心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20443
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d933c4e5:

    # "All you can really do is feel this heavy, leaden weight in your chest. It's not the bottle, but the sense of time pressing down, towards your fateful appointment."
    "你唯一能真切感受到的，是胸口那股沉重、铅一般的重压。那不是酒瓶的重量，而是时间迫近、压向你那决定性会面的感觉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20445
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_795405d7:

    # "Is this still a good idea?"
    "这仍然是个好主意吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20447
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_7d3279ba:

    # "You push the doubt out of your mind, focusing on the practicalities. No sense in wasting the fruits of your misdeeds now."
    "你将疑虑抛之脑后，专注于实际事务。现在浪费这“不义之财”的成果毫无意义。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20457
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_75f8c1dc:

    # "It's quiet inside the officer's deck, the air noticeably fresher than elsewhere below. The space is divided up by a series of wooden screens, either side holding a flickering lantern, with a number of smaller doors marking the other individual officer's quarters."
    "军官舱内很安静，空气明显比下层其他地方清新。空间被一系列木制屏风分隔开来，两侧各挂着一盏摇曳的提灯，几扇较小的门标志着其他军官各自的舱室。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20459
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_7320dea2:

    # "Your mind wanders through how you came to all this."
    "你的思绪飘忽，回想着自己是如何走到这一步的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20461
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bc628f0f:

    # "You know you've grown a lot too in the last few days, considering you don't have to talk yourself up on the reason why anymore."
    "你知道自己这几天也成长了不少，毕竟你不再需要为那个理由给自己打气了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20463
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bc9c0384:

    # "Earlier was just a pep talk."
    "之前的那些，不过是打气的话罢了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20465
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_483eab30:

    # "Fortunately, being on a ship makes your journey a short one, though it does feel like a different world, treading lightly towards the officer's quarters."
    "幸运的是，在船上你的路程很短，尽管走向军官住舱时轻手轻脚，感觉像是踏入了另一个世界。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20467
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_db410b46:

    # "Plenty of lights, the reflection of candles against the ornate glass windows. And the fact that you could take a deep breath almost without the permeating smell that lingers almost everywhere else on the ship."
    "灯火通明，烛光映照在装饰华丽的玻璃窗上。而且，在这里你几乎可以深吸一口气，而不用闻到船上其他地方几乎无处不在的那种挥之不去的异味。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20469
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f67b33fa:

    # "What does anyone here know of hardship?"
    "这里的人，有谁知道什么叫艰苦？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20471
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a035d5af:

    # "You reach Arthur's door, greeted by the dense, pungent aroma of horse and tobacco. It's the one in the corner, gathering darkness around it. Almost conveniently so."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20473
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_8bb217b9:

    # "You certainly wouldn't suspect anything else with a nose like yours, but given what you now know... it makes perfect sense to use something else to mask the smell of booze."
    "以你这样的鼻子，你当然不会怀疑其他东西，但鉴于你现在所知道的……用别的东西来掩盖酒味，就完全说得通了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20475
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f606275c:

    # "The threshold before you brings one final pang of fear—gripping your heart and catching your breath. You gulp, and gulp again, feeling a tremor move through your limbs."
    "面前的门槛带来了最后一阵恐惧——紧攥你的心脏，让你屏住呼吸。你咽了口唾沫，又咽了一口，感到一阵颤抖传遍四肢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20477
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_120a037f:

    # "The booze in the bottle you clutch against your chest laps against the glass, as if crying out treachery."
    "你紧抱在胸前的酒瓶里，酒液拍打着玻璃，仿佛在哭喊着背叛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20479
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_42fa5b28:

    # "No one is around to listen."
    "周围无人听见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20481
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_7736a002:

    # "You swallow, finally burying the lump worming its way up your throat."
    "你咽下口水，终于将那蠕动着爬上喉咙的硬块压了下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20483
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_cdca52d2:

    # "What's the worst that's going to happen?"
    "最坏能发生什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20485
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_9141d49f:

    # "Attempting to bribe an officer? You shake your head, those nerves feeling a little bit silly. He's the one who'd left you with nothing to lose."
    "试图贿赂一名军官？你摇摇头，觉得那些紧张有点可笑。正是他让你落得一无所有、无所顾忌的境地。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20487
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_69fa0bbc:

    # "You knock on the door quickly but quietly, taking another deep breath. With the thick, heavy smell of smoke, you feel you'd just need a dash of sulfur to summon a devil."
    "你快速而轻声地敲了敲门，又深吸了一口气。那浓重呛人的烟味，让你觉得只需要再加点硫磺，就能召唤出魔鬼了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20489
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e70bd11e:

    # "Time to do a deal."
    "是时候做笔交易了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20496
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a3ab5f61:

    # "It feels like someone else reaches out and knocks on the door."
    "感觉像是别人伸出手，敲了敲门。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20500
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0e8db120:

    # "A sharp rap of knuckles on wood, loud, insistent, matching the frenzied beat of your heart."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20504
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a7834acf:

    # "It's only when you feel a streak of pain lance up from your hand that you register that it was you who just banged on the first officer's door."
    "直到你感到一阵刺痛从手上传来，你才意识到，刚才用力敲大副门的人，正是你自己。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20506
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_aa667070:

    # "An odd, serene moment of calm washes over you for a split second—the relief of feeling that your fate was now out of your hands—before the silence stretches out each passing second in agonizing detail."
    "一种奇异的、平静的安宁感瞬间席卷了你——那是命运已不由自己掌控的解脱感——随后，寂静将流逝的每一秒都拉长，细节清晰得令人痛苦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20508
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e7880ff7:

    # "You hear the sound of hooves beyond the door, hovering outside."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20510
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e20f7862:

    # "So you knock again, breaking the seal."
    "于是你又敲了一次，打破了沉寂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20518
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_fb75e434:

    # "The door swings open, and out looms the demon. At least, that is how it seems from the way the shadows play over the horse's long, angular face as he peers down at you, glaring spitefully."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20520
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4e2cdd27:

    # a "What are you doing here?"
    a "你在这儿干什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20522
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c7fa3346:

    # "He growls, blowing smoke in your face."
    "他低吼道，朝你脸上喷了一口烟。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20524
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_da7022c4:

    # "You make out the inside of his quarters behind him. Unlike the rest of the hallway, it's dark and gloomy."
    "你辨认出他身后的舱内景象。与走廊其他地方不同，那里黑暗而阴沉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20526
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_acef7c46:

    # "For a silly moment, you worry you've woken Arthur up from sleep, but the glowing embers of spent tobacco in his pipe, nestled on the messy desk behind him, tell otherwise. The candles, however, have long since burned down low."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20528
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_196f5a03:

    # a "What do you want?"
    a "你想干嘛？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20530
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6845e280:

    # "He grunts, narrowing his eyes."
    "他咕哝着，眯起了眼睛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20532
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bc8aad8d:

    # p "To talk."
    p "谈谈。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20536
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f626a537:

    # "You figure it's best to keep it short, at least for the moment. There are sharper ears on this ship than yours."
    "你觉得最好长话短说，至少眼下如此。这艘船上，有比你的耳朵更灵敏的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20538
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c1d635a5:

    # a "There's been enough of that."
    a "该说的都说够了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20543
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_42e353c7:

    # "He sighs, bringing a hand to his face, stepping back to close the door."
    "他叹了口气，用手抹了把脸，后退一步准备关门。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20551
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_230fb15c:

    # "Without thinking, you stick your left out quickly and block the door with your paw. The hinge gives a loud crack before shuddering to a stop."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20555
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_90c01fd0:

    # a "What do you think you're doing?"
    a "你以为你在干什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20557
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_07d41bb2:

    # p "I think you'd prefer to have this conversation in private."
    p "我想你更愿意私下进行这场谈话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20559
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_852b124e:

    # "You stare back at him, trying to spot any weakness. Instead, your eyes flicker back further into his room, spotting the empty bottle that had fallen off his desk, now rolling back and forth across the floor with the swell of the sea."
    "你回瞪着他，试图找出任何弱点。然而，你的目光却不由自主地瞟向他房间更深处，瞥见了从他书桌上掉落的空酒瓶，此刻正随着海浪的起伏在地板上滚来滚去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20561
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_627b8d15:

    # a "Have your senses entirely taken leave of you? Or have you forgotten how to behave with your superiors?"
    a "你的理智是完全离家出走了吗？还是说你已经忘了该如何与上级相处？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20563
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b5d9f25e:

    # p "No, of course not, sir. But I do think I have something that you might wish to consider."
    p "不，当然没有，长官。但我确实认为，我有些东西您或许愿意考虑一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20565
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_20db6637:

    # "You can't help but give a wry smile, smelling beneath everything else, the tell-tale hint of booze. There were more subtle things as well: the way his movements were sluggish, the slight wobble of his lip before he spoke."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20567
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e4eb5bb7:

    # p "I promise to go without a fuss once I've said my piece."
    p "我保证，说完我要说的话，我就安安静静地离开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20571
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0e1769f3:

    # a "Fine."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20573
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ee58e08b:

    # "He sighs, as if he'd rather do anything else than listen to you. Still, he pulls himself away from the door, pointing to a small wooden stool beside his desk. It doesn't look in the least comfortable, but at least it will keep you on your toes."
    "他叹了口气，仿佛他宁愿做任何事，也不愿听你说话。尽管如此，他还是从门边退开，指了指书桌旁的一个小木凳。那凳子看起来一点也不舒服，但至少能让你保持警觉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20575
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_43ec7abc:

    # p "Thank you, sir."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20588
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_75397c02:

    # "You don't forget your manners as you slip past him and sit down. But not without taking a good, indulgent look through your surroundings—eyes searching for any hint or scrap of information that might give you a useful edge."
    "你从他身边溜过去坐下时，没忘了礼节。但你还是趁机好好地、放纵地扫视了一下周围的环境——目光搜寻着任何可能给你带来有用优势的线索或信息碎片。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20590
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_8cbf87a6:

    # "Even with the 'sweetener' stashed under your shirt, this still is a negotiation."
    "即使有“甜头”藏在衬衫下，这仍然是一场谈判。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20592
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b2a934c4:

    # "Despite the luxury of a cabin, Arthur's quarters weren't half as fancy as you expected."
    "尽管拥有一个舱室是种奢侈，但亚瑟的房间远没有你想象中一半那么讲究。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20598
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_95e8906f:

    # "As he closes the door your eyes quickly adjust to the light. The small bed in the corner is still a luxury compared to slinging a hammock, but the messy and crumpled sheets differ from the prim image the horse gave off on deck."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20600
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_8c9cef8a:

    # "The dim lighting doesn't do you any favors. It's dark and gloomy, the moody lighting amplified by the burnt-out candles inside greasy lanterns."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20602
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_05b89ce9:

    # "It takes a few seconds for your eyes to adjust, gravitating towards the scattered papers across his desk. It's hard to tell, but they don't seem like the sort of neat, legible entries you'd expect in any sort of log."
    "你的眼睛花了几秒钟才适应过来，目光不由自主地被吸引到他书桌上散乱的文件上。很难看清，但它们似乎不像是你预期在任何航海日志中会看到的那种整洁、清晰的字迹。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20604
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_31791769:

    # "They're long and scrawling, judging by the messy strokes of ink running along the pages. But before you can get a better look the horse stands in front of you, arms folded as he looks down his nose at you."
    "从页面上潦草的墨迹来看，那些文字冗长而涂鸦。但还没等你看得更清楚，那匹马就站到了你面前，双臂交叉，用鼻孔朝下的姿态俯视着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20606
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_9aae7422:

    # a "What could possibly possess you to think that I'd listen to anything you have to say?"
    a "到底是什么让你觉得，我会听你任何要说的话？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20608
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6652cf7f:

    # "You take a long, deep breath, and force yourself to be brave."
    "你深深地吸了一口气，强迫自己勇敢起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20610
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e64cb2af:

    # "You've wanted to speak back to this asshole for a long time."
    "你想回敬这个混蛋已经很久了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20612
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2801e985:

    # "Now you've finally got the chance."
    "现在你终于有机会了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20614
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4c26e43b:

    # p "Well, that really depends on how you want this to go."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20618
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3d7140cc:

    # "Perhaps not the sharpest opening, but your remark succeeds in getting him to blink twice, probably expecting you to get on your knees and beg."
    "也许不是最犀利的开场白，但你的话成功地让他眨了两次眼，他大概以为你会跪下来求饶。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20620
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0f157e81:

    # a "I beg your pardon?"
    a "你说什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20622
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c2933913:

    # p "Well, I figured we'd said all that could be said when out on deck among the others..."
    p "嗯，我觉得在甲板上当着其他人的面，该说的我们都说了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:20624
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6e052965:

    # p "And since you've made it pretty clear you'd made your mind up, that rules out a more straightforward approach."
    p "既然您已经明确表示您主意已定，那就排除了更直接的方式。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20626
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_aa548b2c:

    # a "You're treading a very fine line-"
    a "你正在走一条非常危险的钢丝——"

# game/script day12.rpy:20628
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_98604861:

    # "He warns, flicking his ears back."
    "他警告道，耳朵向后一甩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20630
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d44634ec:

    # p "As are you."
    p "您也是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20634
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3f66bc04:

    # a "I could have you thrown off this ship right now for such insubordination-"
    a "就凭这种不服从，我现在就可以把你扔下船去——"

# game/script day12.rpy:20636
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_795927b6:

    # p "After you've already told everyone I was leaving? You've got nothing to threaten me with."
    p "在您已经告诉所有人我要离开之后？您没什么能威胁我的了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20638
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_cbf4a787:

    # p "Never mind how odd it would be to seemingly punish me again on top of it all."
    p "更不用说，在那一切之上再看似惩罚我一次，会有多奇怪。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20640
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_52edd0bf:

    # a "You have a lot yet to learn, Mr. [family_name]. Your word means nothing compared to mine."
    a "你要学的还多着呢，[姓氏]先生。你的话和我的相比，一文不值。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20642
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ba81669e:

    # p "Oh, I'm aware. But what about the rest of the crew? You think they'd take it well? Think they'll not notice one of their superiors acting erratically?"
    p "哦，我明白。但其他船员呢？您认为他们会坦然接受吗？认为他们不会注意到他们的一位上级行为反常吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20644
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c2fff7df:

    # a "As far as they care, you deserve to be thrown off this ship. Any half-decent sailor would know what could happen in a storm. But of course, someone like you wouldn't."
    a "在他们看来，你被扔下船是罪有应得。任何稍懂水性的水手都知道风暴中会发生什么。但你这种人当然不会明白。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20646
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_215605bb:

    # p "But you've already punished me for that."
    p "但你已经为此惩罚过我了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20650
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_237cf3bc:

    # "You pause, relishing the moment of confusion on his face."
    "你停顿了一下，品味着他脸上那瞬间的困惑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20652
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0b093057:

    # p "That's my point. Why would you need to go further when the matter has already been dealt with? You'd look like you're behaving oddly, and I doubt you wish to invite suspicion."
    p "这就是我的意思。既然事情已经处理了，何必再进一步？你会显得行为古怪，我怀疑你也不愿招来猜疑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20656
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_222584f9:

    # a "You're grasping at straws, and it's pathetic."
    a "你在做无谓的挣扎，真可悲。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20658
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_dee320a4:

    # p "Really? It's not like you've already made them wonder."
    p "是吗？可你已经让他们起疑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20662
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f043b1fd:

    # a "Not a soul on this ship doubts me."
    a "这船上没人会怀疑我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20664
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_73549efd:

    # a "You're a stray swept up from the last port. I'm the one they've served under for years."
    a "你不过是从上个港口捡来的流浪汉。而我，是他们效力多年的长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20666
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_076fff34:

    # "He snorts in contempt, going further."
    "他不屑地哼了一声，继续施压。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20668
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_edc58858:

    # a "You really are dumb enough that I must spell out the difference between us."
    a "你真是蠢到必须让我点明我们之间的差距。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20670
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_171c05e4:

    # "You realize in that moment, without the rest of the crew around to watch, he's not holding back. He glares at you as if the very sight might burn you away, like a piece of dirt, or some blemish on his record."
    "你此刻意识到，没有其他船员在场旁观，他不再克制。他瞪着你，那目光仿佛能将你烧成灰烬，就像一块污垢，或他履历上的某个污点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20672
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bc0b4c81:

    # "This is the fight. You've picked it, committed to it when you chose to do all those unsavory things to get to this point. To have something to fight back with."
    "这就是战斗。你挑起的，当你选择做那些龌龊事来到这一步时，就已投身其中。为了有反击的筹码。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20674
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a310908e:

    # "So you do it."
    "于是你说了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20683
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_51a57a3b:

    # p "And you are the addict."
    p "而你是个瘾君子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20689
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b5b9e6f7:

    # p "And you are the alcoholic."
    p "而你是个酒鬼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20691
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f089b829:

    # "It takes a moment for your ears to get used to that. The way you said it—all that anger, frustration, outrage. Bottled up and slung into those words, dripping with as much venom as you could muster."
    "你的耳朵花了一点时间才适应。你说话的方式——所有的愤怒、挫败、愤慨。积压已久，倾注于这些话语中，浸透了你所能调集的全部毒液。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20693
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6ed48ebd:

    # a "Excuse me?"
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20695
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a1f165f3:

    # "Arthur's ears are back, the horse looking like you'd just assaulted him."
    "亚瑟的耳朵向后撇去，这匹马看起来像刚被你袭击了一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20697
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b64c9368:

    # p "You heard."
    p "你听到了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20699
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_68894419:

    # "You double down."
    "你变本加厉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20701
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3dd7c975:

    # "And it feels so good."
    "这感觉真他妈痛快。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20703
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a5976e21:

    # p "It hardly took any time on a ship like this, with barely a moment of privacy, to find that out. I'd bet even the bilge rats know about you."
    p "在这样一艘几乎没有隐私的船上，发现这个没花多少时间。我敢打赌连底舱的老鼠都知道你的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20705
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b294368a:

    # "Oh, the look on his face is priceless."
    "哦，他脸上的表情真是无价之宝。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20707
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c7ad3916:

    # "Sensing the perceptible shift in power between you both, you decide to go further."
    "察觉到你们之间力量对比的明显变化，你决定更进一步。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20709
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ccb7cfb9:

    # p "I mean, you can try to cover the smell of it up with that pipe, but there's noses sharper than the both of ours here."
    p "我是说，你可以试着用烟斗掩盖那气味，但这儿有比我们俩更灵的鼻子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20711
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_82ab49a9:

    # p "How long until someone gets injured because of it?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20713
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_13316610:

    # p "If it hasn't already."
    p "如果还没发生的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20717
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_fdbffed1:

    # a "Who told you?!"
    a "谁告诉你的？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:20719
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e466bc30:

    # p "That doesn't matter."
    p "这不重要。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20721
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ee8dfa7a:

    # a "It doe- {w}I'll throw them off the ship too for stirring such slander!"
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20723
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a23f8f12:

    # a "You're insinuating nothing short of a mutiny—that I am unfit to command-"
    a "你这是在暗示一场哗变——暗示我不适合指挥——"

# game/script day12.rpy:20732
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ee72de2f:

    # "He steps up, grabbing you by the shirt and pushing you against the wall. The thud knocks the breath out of you for a moment, the wood creaking behind you." with vpunch
    "他一步上前，抓住你的衬衫，把你推到墙上。撞击让你一时喘不过气，身后的木板吱嘎作响。" with vpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:20734
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b93ec2d6:

    # a "All you've done is try to ruin me, ever since you stepped on this ship."
    a "自从你踏上这艘船，你所做的一切就是想毁了我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20736
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a7005efd:

    # "Despite the pain and fear surging through your body, something about those words stands out to you, catching your attention and focusing your mind on a brief moment of lucidity, before your senses sweep you under once again."
    "尽管疼痛和恐惧涌遍全身，但那些话里的某些东西引起了你的注意，让你在感官再次将你淹没之前，获得片刻清醒，集中了心神。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20738
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0567acb2:

    # a "Goading me, haunting me, looking so much like-"
    a "刺激我，纠缠我，长得那么像——"

# game/script day12.rpy:20740
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_11df5ec6:

    # "You gasp, hissing. Struggling against his grasp seems futile. He's so unbelievably strong."
    "你喘息着，嘶嘶作响。挣扎似乎徒劳无功。他强壮得令人难以置信。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20749
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_8d3ba1c4:

    # "You don't know if the snap behind you is from the wood, or you, but, somehow, you manage to slip free, nimbly stepping to the side and struggling to catch your breath."
    "你不知道身后的断裂声是来自木板，还是来自你自己，但不知怎的，你设法挣脱了，敏捷地闪到一边，挣扎着喘气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20751
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_7f3223e0:

    # p "I-"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20753
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e1fd986b:

    # p "I didn't come to ruin you-"
    p "我不是来毁掉你的——"

# game/script day12.rpy:20757
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2a8adafa:

    # p "I came to reach an agreement with you."
    p "我是来和你达成协议的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20759
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b6e63789:

    # p "A deal."
    p "一笔交易。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20761
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6611c814:

    # "He stops pushing towards you, his ears twitching, his arm pulled back and his hand clenched into a fist."
    "他停止了向你逼近，耳朵抽动着，手臂收回，手攥成了拳头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20763
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b1efca3f:

    # a "Lies."
    a "谎话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20765
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_67d5cd64:

    # a "You're lying.{w} You've got nothing to bargain with."
    a "你在撒谎。{w} 你没有任何谈判的筹码。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20767
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_5969744b:

    # p "You think I'd come here empty handed?"
    p "你以为我会空手而来？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20769
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_baf08a2d:

    # "His eyes seem to focus on you once more."
    "他的目光似乎再次聚焦在你身上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20776
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_29de4b67:

    # "Arthur pulls his arm away from you. Your legs wobble, and the rush of air back into your lungs almost makes you fall over, but you find something steely in you to hold on, and pull yourself upright."
    "亚瑟把手臂从你身上移开。你的双腿颤抖，空气冲回肺部几乎让你摔倒，但你发现自己体内有种钢铁般的东西支撑着，让你挺直了身子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20778
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bf4398ec:

    # "The horse seems half-impressed, actually, if you judge the tone of his snort well."
    "实际上，如果你判断得准他哼声的语调，这匹马似乎有半分刮目相看。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20780
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_458690cd:

    # a "Do you now?"
    a "是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20782
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b2c856c0:

    # p "Yes, sir."
    p "是的，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20784
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e648a86b:

    # "The words come from your mouth with sincerity, somehow."
    "不知怎的，这些话带着真诚从你口中说出。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20786
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c5c32e33:

    # "It's a surprise to you both."
    "这对你们双方都是个意外。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20788
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b7554556:

    # p "I know I'm a rubbish sailor, I admit that. If I was any good at it, I'd have spent my days working my tail off trying to impress you."
    p "我知道我是个糟糕的水手，我承认。如果我擅长这个，我早该拼命干活，努力给你留下好印象了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20790
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_794f509f:

    # p "But I've got other talents, and I'm nothing short of resourceful when things get tight-"
    p "但我有其他才能，而且在紧要关头，我足智多谋——"

# game/script day12.rpy:20794
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3ebe08a5:

    # a "You're more of a fool than I thought then, if you somehow think you can change my mind."
    a "如果你竟以为能改变我的主意，那你比我想的还要蠢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20796
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ef9a2abd:

    # "Arthur replies bitterly, ignoring how you choose to describe your dismissal."
    "亚瑟苦涩地回应，无视你对自己被解雇一事的描述方式。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20798
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_421346b5:

    # a "Or worse, some deluded fool."
    a "或者更糟，一个妄想狂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20800
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_869b444f:

    # a "There's no romance working the seas."
    a "海上生活毫无浪漫可言。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20802
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bd7beebe:

    # "He snaps with venom, stabbing at what he guesses is your true motive."
    "他恶毒地厉声说道，刺向他猜测的你的真实动机。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20804
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3aadd9f0:

    # a "At its worst, it's harsh and unforgiving, and she'll take away everything that you hold dear."
    a "最糟的时候，它严酷无情，会夺走你所珍视的一切。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20808
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6c3922c6:

    # a "I'm doing you, and everyone else a favor by keeping your incompetence clear of her."
    a "我把你的无能挡在海事之外，是在帮你，也是在帮所有人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20810
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c1caae90:

    # p "You may believe that."
    p "你可以那么相信。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20812
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_cee9dcbb:

    # p "Fine..."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20814
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e72f14c6:

    # p "But that doesn't mean that I will just give up and abandon them."
    p "但这不意味着我会就此放弃，抛弃他们。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20816
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c453fe27:

    # a "What would you even know of being forced to abandon those you hold dear?"
    a "被迫抛弃所爱之人是什么滋味，你又懂什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20818
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_1d9deed3:

    # a "Nothing."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20820
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d70197f6:

    # a "So do not try to lecture me. There have been dozens of new recruits just like you on this ship who left soon after, and no one will even notice you're gone, that's how short your stay is."
    a "所以别想教训我。这船上有过几十个像你一样的新手，很快就离开了，甚至没人会注意到你走了，你的停留就是这么短暂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20822
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_dc58e996:

    # "You take a deep breath, recovering your thoughts."
    "你深吸一口气，理清思绪。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20824
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ae56bc39:

    # "It's definitely not a good idea to push him too hard, so you change tack."
    "逼他太紧绝对不是好主意，所以你改变了策略。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20826
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_06e6e100:

    # "After all, regardless of whatever you may wish to do, at sea you must always ultimately sail with the wind."
    "毕竟，无论你想做什么，在海上，你最终必须顺应风向航行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20828
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_389b523c:

    # p "Can I speak honestly?{w} Man to man?"
    p "我能坦白说吗？{w} 男人对男人？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20832
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4e4fbefb:

    # a "It hardly stopped you a few minutes ago."
    a "几分钟前你可没停过嘴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20834
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b9352628:

    # "He snorts. You definitely deserve his scorn there."
    "他哼了一声。你确实活该被他鄙视。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20836
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_5fb6818e:

    # p "Right, but still."
    p "好吧，但还是要说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20840
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6afaacb4:

    # "You shrug, breathing out. The sound rattles in your chest, unsteady and erratic thanks to the shock and adrenaline."
    "你耸耸肩，呼出一口气。由于震惊和肾上腺素的作用，声音在你胸腔里颤抖，不稳且紊乱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20844
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f24cfa1c:

    # p "If I'm honest, what hurts most about my failure is not how you punished me. It was the look on Samuel's face as the storm worsened."
    p "老实说，我失败最让我难受的，不是你如何惩罚我。是风暴加剧时，塞缪尔脸上的表情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20848
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_16258ffe:

    # p "If I'm honest, what hurts most about my failure is not how you punished me. It was the look on Samuel's face as the storm worsened and he was directing the crew up in the sails."
    p "老实说，我失败最让我难受的，不是你如何惩罚我。是风暴加剧，他在指挥船员操作船帆时，塞缪尔脸上的表情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20850
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3b077de4:

    # p "I pissed him off. I'd let him down."
    p "我惹恼了他。我让他失望了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20852
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_dc2fa135:

    # p "He had every right to be..."
    p "他完全有理由……"

# game/script day12.rpy:20854
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b017de35:

    # p "But worst of all...{w} It scared him."
    p "但最糟的是……{w} 那吓到他了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20856
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_801f3ce6:

    # p "I was lucky that the crew managed to spring into action and that we missed the worst of it, but still... I felt like shit."
    p "幸好船员们迅速行动，我们躲过了最坏的情况，但是……我感觉糟透了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20858
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_645ad7af:

    # "You gulp, massaging your throat."
    "你咽了口唾沫，揉着喉咙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20862
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_be247ecb:

    # a "You don't know half of it."
    a "你连一半都不知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20864
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3759eb7f:

    # p "I understand, which is why it's none of my business whatever you do for relief."
    p "我理解，所以无论你用什么方式缓解，都不关我事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20868
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_7df87106:

    # "You reach under your shirt and pull out the bottle."
    "你把手伸进衬衫下，掏出那个瓶子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20870
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_18b42a95:

    # p "I was hoping that this might help cut a deal."
    p "我希望这个能帮我们达成交易。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20872
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_5bdc45fc:

    # a "Whoever put this idea in your head really needs a smack across the head."
    a "不管是谁给你出的这个主意，真该挨一记耳光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20874
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f73544fa:

    # p "I think I already collected their punishment from you earlier."
    p "我想我已经代他们受过你的惩罚了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20876
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_8a04072d:

    # "You crack your neck back, wincing. You'll definitely be feeling that in the morning."
    "你扭了扭脖子，疼得龇牙咧嘴。明天早上你肯定还会感觉到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20880
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d0d715df:

    # a "How did you come by this?"
    a "你怎么弄到这个的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20882
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_428e1ba0:

    # "Arthur takes the bottle from you, his fingers tapping the glass as he turns it over in his hands."
    "亚瑟从你手中接过瓶子，手指轻敲着玻璃，在手中翻来覆去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20888
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_75fb2e1b:

    # a "{i}Gevrey-Chambertin{/i}?"
    a "{i}热夫雷-香贝丹{/i}？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20890
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_78716626:

    # a "You're a farmer's boy, aren't you?"
    a "你是个农家小子，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20892
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_84d1225f:

    # a "How would someone of your means get your hands on this bottle?"
    a "凭你的本事，怎么可能搞到这瓶酒？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20894
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b7994f32:

    # p "I wasn't lying when I said I cared about people on this ship."
    p "我说过我在乎这船上的人，那不是谎话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20896
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_dddaf212:

    # "You decide to put it discreetly."
    "你决定说得委婉些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20898
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_814b151d:

    # p "But when I happened to confide in a well-placed friend of mine, he reciprocated in kind..."
    p "但当我碰巧向我一位有门路的朋友倾诉时，他投桃报李……"

# game/script day12.rpy:20902
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b98acd99:

    # a "I can only think of one place where you might have gotten hold of this."
    a "我只能想到一个地方你可能弄到这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20904
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_665a5e5b:

    # "Arthur narrows his eyes, stroking his chin."
    "亚瑟眯起眼睛，抚摸着下巴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20908
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b83a547a:

    # a "Our passenger. He strikes me as someone who might bring one of them along."
    a "我们的乘客。他给我的印象是会随身带上一瓶的那种人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20912
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a2639e0f:

    # a "Wasn't he the one you-...{w} You know."
    a "他不就是你——……{w} 你知道的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20914
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_10cca7e7:

    # p "Sir."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20916
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_389bc985:

    # a "First you fuck him, and now you rob him of one of the simple pleasures of man."
    a "你先上了他，现在又夺走他作为男人的一项简单乐趣。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20918
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_03545754:

    # a "Or did you take the opportunity to finally even things out and lift your tail for him?"
    a "或者你终于逮到机会扯平了，翘起尾巴让他上了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20920
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4348a68a:

    # a "Do I {i}actually{/i} want to know?"
    a "我{i}真的{/i}想知道吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20923
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b83a547a_1:

    # a "Our passenger. He strikes me as someone who might bring one of them along."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20925
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0920373d:

    # a "Did he ask for another duet in exchange for it?"
    a "他是不是要求再合唱一曲作为交换？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20927
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a213895d:

    # a "I dearly hope that none of the crew were within earshot to hear you two sing again..."
    a "我真希望当时没有船员在附近听到你们俩再次开唱……"

# game/script day12.rpy:20929
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_50b5e0af:

    # a "No wonder you've been tired."
    a "难怪你一直这么累。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20931
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_7310e340:

    # p "Sir..."
    p "长官……"

# game/script day12.rpy:20933
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_5cb73eef:

    # "You say it as a respectful warning."
    "你以一种带着敬意的警告口吻说道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20939
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e34a4775:

    # p "He simply gave it to me when I asked for help. Nothing of what you are implying is true."
    p "我求助时他直接给我的。你暗示的那些事一件都不是真的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20941
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_94eeedd9:

    # p "Technically, that is still my property. I haven't gone and given it to you now, have I?"
    p "严格来说，那仍然是我的财产。我还没把它送给你，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:20943
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_24fab804:

    # a "Don't push it. I've had enough trouble from you to last an entire voyage."
    a "别得寸进尺。你惹的麻烦够我受用整个航程了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20945
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_1145c6b4:

    # p "Consider the feeling mutual. And, well, if you find it to your liking, perhaps you should consider it as a peace offering..."
    p "彼此彼此。而且，嗯，如果你觉得这酒合你口味，或许该把它看作一份求和礼……"

# game/script day12.rpy:20949
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f3459407:

    # a "{i}Technically{/i}, this is bribery."
    a "{i}严格来说{/i}，这是贿赂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20953
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_948db322:

    # p "Really? I just consider it a more fitting apology. You know, something to draw a line under things. Start afresh, on the right paw- er, hoof."
    p "真的吗？我只当它是个更合适的道歉。你知道的，算是给事情画条线。重新开始，用正确的爪子——呃，蹄子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20955
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2e7d6d9a:

    # "Arthur takes a deep breath, chewing his lip as he weighs up your gift."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20959
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_94028bc4:

    # a "Fine. Perhaps you are talking some sense."
    a "好吧。或许你说得有点道理。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20961
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_8eb36721:

    # a "For once."
    a "就这一次。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20965
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_74d4069e:

    # p "It is your gift now."
    p "现在它是你的礼物了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20967
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_68fcb80c:

    # p "I'm just glad we could find a way to figure things out."
    p "我很高兴我们能找到解决问题的办法。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20969
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6b3a8422:

    # a "Let's be clear. This is an apology from you to me. If I hear one word from you about any of this, even if it be a whisper from the rest of the crew-"
    a "说清楚。这是你向我道歉。如果我听到你提这件事半个字，哪怕是船员间的悄悄话——"

# game/script day12.rpy:20971
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2d06ddbb:

    # p "Of course. My lips will stay sealed, Sir."
    p "当然。我的嘴会很严，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20976
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e1d2eff0:

    # "Arthur grunts, popping the cork open and giving the drink a deep sniff. He blinks twice, tilting his head as the vapors give him a satisfying kick."
    "亚瑟咕哝一声，拔开瓶塞，深深嗅了嗅酒香。他眨了两次眼，蒸汽带来的刺激感让他满意地歪了歪头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20983
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c8aa31af:

    # "You get up to leave, assuming that he'll wish to be left to his... evening, but instead he stamps a hoof and motions for you to sit."
    "你起身准备离开，以为他会想独自享受……这个夜晚，但他却跺了跺蹄子，示意你坐下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20987
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d28c1f42:

    # a "I didn't give you permission to leave yet. Besides..."
    a "我还没允许你离开。而且……"

# game/script day12.rpy:20994
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b78030a6:

    # "He gives a deep, weary sigh."
    "他发出一声深沉而疲惫的叹息。"

# game/script day12.rpy:20996
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3b04a24b:

    # a "As much as I hate to waste this on an unrefined palate, if this is to be binding, it'd be bad form not to share the first glass together."
    a "尽管我很讨厌把这好酒浪费在不识货的人身上，但如果这算是个约定，不一起喝第一杯可就失礼了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21002
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_080d1a4f:

    # "He turns about and reaches into his drawer, rummaging about inside and pulling out two rather neat looking glasses."
    "他转过身，把手伸进抽屉，在里面翻找一阵，拿出两个相当精致的杯子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21004
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_61d0309c:

    # "At first you assume they're some fancy crystal, but the look on the horse's face convinces you that they're not so."
    "起初你以为是什么高档水晶杯，但那匹马脸上的表情让你确信并非如此。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21008
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_95088a86:

    # "He fills both with a steady measure; however, he reserves the better pour for himself."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21014
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_46842bae:

    # "He grunts, handing you the glass. You guess it's roughly similar to your daily measure of rum, but it's quite something to see it all in one go like this, and not watered down at that."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21018
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e554b781:

    # "Without waiting, Arthur taps his glass against yours, toasting briefly as the liquid swirls about. He takes one sip, raising an eyebrow, before throwing the rest down his throat."
    "亚瑟不等你，就用他的杯子碰了碰你的，酒液晃动间简短致意。他抿了一口，挑起眉毛，然后把剩下的全灌进喉咙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21020
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6d97f289:

    # "You barely even touch your drink yourself, sipping away while enjoying the taste."
    "你自己几乎没怎么碰你的酒，只是小口啜饮，品味着滋味。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21022
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_db9145e9:

    # "It was easily the best wine you'd tasted—though your breadth of experience in the matter hardly reaches beyond a dozen glasses. Good thing you'd put it to good use..."
    "这无疑是你喝过的最好的酒——尽管你在这方面的经验也就十几杯的量。幸好你把它用在了正途……"

# game/script day12.rpy:21024
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d909dee1:

    # p "To smoother sailing, I guess."
    p "为了更顺利的航行，我猜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21026
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_34668849:

    # "You try to down the measure in similar fashion, but you can't match Arthur."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21028
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_328861f8:

    # a "You'll need to be able to drink like a sailor too, as well as work like one."
    a "你也得像水手一样能喝，就像你得像水手一样干活。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21035
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d184ed95:

    # "He takes the glass from you, gesturing for you to leave."
    "他从你手中拿走杯子，示意你离开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21042
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_8d7780ec:

    # a "Before you leave, Mr. [family_name]."
    a "在你离开之前，[姓氏]先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21046
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e0bb22d5:

    # a "If you ever call me {i}that{/i} again, I'll have you sent straight to the bottom of the ocean. Do you understand?"
    a "如果你再叫我{i}那个{/i}，我就把你直接扔到海底。明白吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21048
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_78817f4f:

    # a "I am well capable of handling my position with the necessary rigor, and I won't be having any Landsman think that they would know better."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21050
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e21d6e59:

    # a "If I am interested in your opinion, then I will ask for it. Until then, I am not interested in whatever inexperience spills from your lips."
    a "如果我对你的意见感兴趣，我会问。在那之前，我对你嘴里冒出的任何缺乏经验之谈都没兴趣。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21052
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4f31e811:

    # p "Of course, Sir."
    p "当然，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21054
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_da1c53f2:

    # a "Good. Now go get some rest, you'll no doubt need it."
    a "很好。现在去休息吧，你肯定需要。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21056
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_402cf167:

    # "You step out the door, eager to be out and away from him."
    "你走出门，迫不及待地想离他远点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21060
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_cb167f60:

    # "It's hard to tell whether you've succeeded, but it felt best not to push your luck any further and outright ask."
    "很难说你是否成功了，但感觉最好别再得寸进尺，直接问出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21062
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6be79161:

    # "And if this is a victory?{w} Well, then you'll take it. No questions asked."
    "如果这算是一场胜利？{w}好吧，那你就收下它。不问缘由。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21070
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a6c077bc:

    # a "A bottle of rum?"
    a "一瓶朗姆酒？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21072
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_02d3ddc8:

    # "Arthur looks between you and the bottle, frowning, unsure whether to laugh."
    "亚瑟看看你，又看看酒瓶，皱着眉头，不确定该不该笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21074
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f63492ea:

    # a "You're lucky that this doesn't look like one of the bottles we run on the ship—an additional charge of theft would not exactly help your cause."
    a "算你走运，这看起来不像我们船上供应的那种——再加一条盗窃罪对你可没好处。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21076
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d0d715df_1:

    # a "How did you come by this?"
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21078
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_dc52a31f:

    # "He asks, his eyes narrowing."
    "他眯起眼睛问道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21080
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b9423e1f:

    # p "I traded for it, if that's what you're worried about."
    p "我换来的，如果你担心的是这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21084
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_1d530a38:

    # a "Well, given you're already trying to bribe your way back aboard, who knows what dubious acts you'd stoop to. Perhaps it was theft afte-"
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21086
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_fb16021d:

    # p "It was a trade."
    p "是交换。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21088
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_644d9178:

    # "You repeat it again, trying to get Arthur to believe you."
    "你又重复了一遍，试图让亚瑟相信你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21092
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_249f9fba:

    # a "And what could you possibly have that'd persuade someone to part with this?"
    a "那你到底有什么东西能说服别人把这让给你？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21094
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2e8a9c26:

    # a "Not to mention that I hope you know it is not allowed for the crew to bring their own alcohol on board."
    a "更别提我希望你知道，船员私自带酒上船是不允许的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21096
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a52e6579:

    # p "Does it matter?"
    p "这重要吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21098
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bbeb9747:

    # a "It does. Suspicion of someone bringing something on board could very well be a reason to shake the crew down."
    a "重要。怀疑有人私带东西上船，很可能成为搜查全船的理由。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21100
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_7d84ef7a:

    # a "Drunkenness among the crew isn't an issue to take lightly."
    a "船员醉酒可不是能掉以轻心的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21102
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b7bd23fc:

    # a "It is for many the only thing that makes the days at sea bearable."
    a "对很多人来说，这是让海上日子能熬下去的唯一慰藉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21104
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2a9e6ead:

    # p "Well... It is not the only thing."
    p "嗯……倒也不是唯一。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21106
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6a5a7f9a:

    # "You mumble, uncomfortable with having to spell out what you exactly did for it."
    "你嘟囔着，很不情愿非得说清楚你究竟为此做了什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21108
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6d3dd229:

    # a "Now's not the time to be shy. Cutting a deal with me—that's something between me and you. But I could very well assume that you may have stolen this from one of the other officers-"
    a "现在可不是害羞的时候。和我谈条件——那是你我之间的事。但我完全可以假设你是从其他军官那儿偷来的——"

# game/script day12.rpy:21110
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2da07ee7:

    # p "I did not.{w} I, well... gave them pleasure."
    p "我没有。{w}我，那个……让他们快活了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21112
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0be2cd51:

    # a "Come on."
    a "快点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21114
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a05b732d:

    # p "I sucked him off."
    p "我给他口了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21119
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_1e057d66:

    # "Arthur smirks, sitting back down on his chair and slapping his thigh."
    "亚瑟讥笑着，坐回椅子上，拍了下大腿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21121
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_78e22090:

    # a "Well, would you listen to that! So it turns out you're not as useless as you appear to be and actually have some skills to you."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21125
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_568dbcd1:

    # a "First the passenger, and now you got on your knees for someone else?"
    a "先是那个乘客，现在你又跪下来伺候别人了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21127
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_14bb6154:

    # a "Were you looking for the harbor brothel and just took a wrong turn to end up on this ship?"
    a "你本来是要找港口妓院，结果走错路上了这艘船？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21129
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4470a955:

    # a "Should I worry that you'll try and get down on your knees for me if I find this not to my liking?"
    a "我是不是该担心，如果我对这酒不满意，你也会试着跪下来伺候我？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21132
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f0bccf7b:

    # a "{cps=5000}Should I worry that you'll try and get down on your knees for me if I find this not to my liking?{/cps}" nointeract
    a "{cps=5000}我是不是该担心，如果我对这酒不满意，你也会试着跪下来伺候我？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day12.rpy:21143
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c9c643dd:

    # "He laughs, swirling the contents of the bottle about."
    "他笑了，晃动着瓶里的酒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21147
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6cea7fa1:

    # "He stares at you and you try to avoid his gaze, trying to think about just about anything other than giving him pleasure."
    "他盯着你，你试图避开他的目光，努力想着任何事，除了取悦他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21149
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e1334a2c:

    # a "Well, at least you seem to have some lengths you won't stoop to."
    a "好吧，至少你似乎还有点底线，不会什么都干。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21151
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_748976b6:

    # "He snorts, seemingly having picked up your reply from body language alone."
    "他哼了一声，似乎仅从你的肢体语言就猜到了你的回答。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21155
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_24cd5452:

    # a "So, what, you think that giving me a bottle of rum will keep you aboard?"
    a "所以，怎么，你以为给我一瓶朗姆酒就能让你留在船上？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21157
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bd2b617b:

    # p "That's what I was hoping."
    p "我是这么希望的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21161
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_aa6b2ce0:

    # a "Seems a bit of a low price, don't you think?"
    a "这代价是不是有点低，你不觉得吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21163
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ab9b2ccd:

    # p "If it's not to your liking, then I'd rather have it back so I can drown my sorrows tonight."
    p "如果你不满意，那我宁愿拿回来，今晚好借酒浇愁。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21165
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bfa0519f:

    # p "Otherwise you'd be stealing from me."
    p "否则你就是从我这儿偷东西了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21167
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f7c591ca:

    # a "Did you not listen, lad? No matter what, you're not allowed to have this."
    a "你没听明白吗，小子？不管怎样，你都不能拥有这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21169
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ee41141a:

    # "He sighs, tapping the bottle."
    "他叹了口气，敲了敲瓶子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21173
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4de943b6:

    # a "But you could have done worse than rum, I suppose."
    a "不过，比起朗姆酒，你本可能做得更糟，我想。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21177
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e5fe09b1:

    # "The horse pulls the cork from the bottle and lifts the bottle to his lips, taking two long, loud gulps before putting it back down."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21179
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0ccc657d:

    # "When he breathes out, the air is heavy with the scent of the alcohol, his breath laced with it."
    "他呼气时，空气中弥漫着浓烈的酒气，他的呼吸也带着酒味。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21183
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3c3a0516:

    # a "You're lucky that I am feeling particularly generous right now... and that things have run dry for me."
    a "算你走运，我现在心情特别好……而且我的存货也喝光了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21185
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_75efbada:

    # "He grumbles, as if it's against his better judgment."
    "他发着牢骚，仿佛这违背了他更好的判断。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21187
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_33b910c2:

    # a "And it's not like you're worth any more than this, I reckon."
    a "而且我觉得，你也就值这个价了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21189
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_037925f6:

    # "You wince at the comment, but you do expect it at least, given how he'd been oblivious to any of your attempts to make things up."
    "这话让你畏缩了一下，但你至少也预料到了，毕竟他对你任何弥补的尝试都视而不见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21191
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_dd297be8:

    # p "Thank you for the second chance."
    p "谢谢您给我第二次机会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21193
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d72a2d73:

    # a "Well, I suppose you earned it."
    a "哼，我想是你自己挣来的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21199
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_24b26cdb:

    # "Arthur grumbles, putting away some of the papers on his desk. As he fills the drawers you hear the clink of glass further back inside, but your wait for a toast to seal your new understanding is futile."
    "亚瑟嘟囔着，收起桌上的一些文件。他往抽屉里放东西时，你听到深处传来玻璃的叮当声，但你等待的为达成新共识而碰杯的场面并未出现。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21204
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6792ce59:

    # a "If you screw up next time, not even this sweet nectar will save you."
    a "如果你下次再搞砸，就算是这种琼浆玉液也救不了你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21208
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6e5c7ac2:

    # "He lifts his hand and waves at the door, dismissing you."
    "他抬起手朝门挥了挥，打发你走。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21215
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ea9a3bca:

    # "You know better to take your leave rather than try and push him anymore, but it's hard to unpick the tangled mess of feelings worming through your gut."
    "你知趣地选择离开，而不是再试图逼迫他，但心中那团乱麻般的纠结情绪却难以化解。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21219
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d8fd077e:

    # "You push through the door, grateful to be back out into the rest of the ship, and air that's at least not laced with the smell of tobacco, horse, and booze."
    "你推门而出，庆幸自己回到了船上其他地方，至少那里的空气没有混杂着烟草、马匹和烈酒的味道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21221
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_119c4393:

    # "Hopefully, at least, Arthur will never bring up your other 'talents', given the circumstances around their discovery."
    "至少，希望亚瑟永远不会再提起你的其他“才能”，考虑到这些才能被发现时的情形。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21223
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_7768d7d7:

    # "And if you're quite honest, you hope that you'll never have to deal with this side of him ever again. The idea of him being influenced by just a bottle of alcohol doesn't sit well with you even if you have benefitted from it this time."
    "而且老实说，你希望再也不用面对他的这一面。想到他会被区区一瓶酒影响，即使这次你因此受益，也让你心里不太舒服。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21225
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_5ee1c01f:

    # "But... you know that sometimes, you just have to do what you have to do. This was one of those instances, you argue with yourself."
    "但是……你知道有时候，你就是得做必须做的事。你心里争辩着，这次就是那种情况。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21227
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_178a3157:

    # "And the feeling of relief is quite sweet, you have to admit."
    "而且，不得不承认，这种如释重负的感觉相当美妙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21229
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_1c2eda63:

    # "Thinking ahead to Morocco without fear, without anxiety, without that knot in your stomach."
    "想到前往摩洛哥时不再恐惧、不再焦虑、不再有那种胃里的纠结感。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21231
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_037902e2:

    # "It's quite nice."
    "这感觉真好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21233
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_fed59324:

    # "Perhaps you did make the right choice."
    "也许你确实做了正确的选择。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21239
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_1d367f00:

    # a "The only place you find this is in the surgeon's quarters."
    a "你只在船医的舱室里找到这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21241
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_8ebeccae:

    # "The horse's eyes narrow."
    "马的眼睛眯了起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21243
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_400a3db5:

    # a "And I doubt Rajeeyah would be so unprofessional to hand over her stock to someone like you."
    a "而且我怀疑拉吉雅不会这么不专业，把她的存货交给你这样的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21245
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2bd70ebc:

    # a "Seems like you were being more than just helpful out of the kindness of your heart."
    a "看来你不仅仅是出于好心才帮忙的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21247
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_8a7dc215:

    # "He keeps turning over the bottle in his hand, holding it towards the light to watch the leaves inside of it turn with the liquid."
    "他不停地把玩着手里的瓶子，举向灯光，看着里面的叶子随着液体转动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21249
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_fcb7a565:

    # "Definitely not artisanal, or appealing. But, beggars can't be choosers..."
    "肯定不是手工精酿，也不诱人。但是，乞丐没得挑……"

# game/script day12.rpy:21251
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_1e31e767:

    # "Arthur keeps you in suspense, examining the bottle longer than you'd think it should take."
    "亚瑟让你悬着心，检查瓶子的时间比你预想的要长得多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21253
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3898433e:

    # "As the seconds pass with only the sound of his slow, heavy breathing, you start to wonder."
    "时间一秒秒过去，只有他缓慢沉重的呼吸声，你开始疑惑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21255
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_50e4cfda:

    # "If he was going to toss you overboard for such thievery, surely he would have done something by now."
    "如果他打算因为这种偷窃行为把你扔下船，他现在肯定已经有所行动了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21257
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_9979a58c:

    # "Right?"
    "对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21262
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_65459141:

    # "You're pulled from your thoughts as the horse gives a loud, sharp shrug. He reaches up to the neck of the bottle and in a swift tug, pops the cork free."
    "马发出一声响亮而尖锐的鼻息，打断了你的思绪。他伸手抓住瓶颈，猛地一扯，拔出了软木塞。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21264
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c8a6e9c5:

    # "Without even sniffing it, the bottle is at his lips. Each gulp is audible."
    "他甚至没有闻一下，瓶子就送到了嘴边。每一口吞咽都清晰可闻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21266
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bef6a526:

    # "One."
    "一。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21268
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d2d50c6e:

    # "Two."
    "二。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21270
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2a08fc06:

    # "Three..."
    "三……"

# game/script day12.rpy:21274
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_66db7eaa:

    # "He stops at the fifth, smacking his lips and giving a long sigh before taking a deep breath."
    "他在第五口停下，咂了咂嘴，长叹一声，然后深吸了一口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21276
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_1210ead1:

    # "You know better than to ask him whether it tastes good. You could smell it in the air between you, never mind his breath..."
    "你很清楚不该问他味道好不好。你们之间的空气里都能闻到那味，更别提他的口气了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:21278
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_19aadc35:

    # a "You really went with the worst swill you could find... You're lucky to have caught me in such a drought."
    a "你还真找了最劣质的泔水来……算你走运，赶上我这么渴的时候。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21280
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_9d1f5ff4:

    # "He clenches his jaw, shaking his head."
    "他咬紧牙关，摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21282
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_94e8425f:

    # a "With everything that's been on since your arrival, things have been particularly taxing."
    a "自从你上船以来，各种事情接连不断，特别累人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21284
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_84a025b4:

    # a "Never mind that the next port might as well be dry..."
    a "更别提下一个港口可能也找不到酒了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:21288
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_38d9e4d1:

    # "He returns to his own silence, swishing the bottle about in his hand, staring down at it as if he could read something in the swirling leaves."
    "他又陷入了沉默，晃着手里的瓶子，低头盯着它，仿佛能从旋转的叶片中读出些什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21290
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0c01de33:

    # "Instead of fear, all you could really feel in this moment is a creeping sense of guilt."
    "此刻，你感觉不到恐惧，只有一股悄然蔓延的愧疚感。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21292
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_443be79a:

    # "So Arthur really does have a problem."
    "看来亚瑟真的有问题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21294
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_88278124:

    # "And here you are, feeding his demons."
    "而你却在这里，喂养他的心魔。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21296
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f38d2241:

    # "You try to ignore what that makes you, but you know the answer."
    "你试图忽略这让你成了什么样的人，但你知道答案。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21298
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d0ee1509:

    # "You can worry about such moral qualms when you're safe aboard again."
    "等你安全回到船上，再为这些道德顾虑操心吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21302
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b018dbc8:

    # p "Well, er... "
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21304
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c55fc488:

    # p "Glad to be of use to you."
    p "很高兴能对您有用。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21306
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d88b8bda:

    # a "Don't."
    a "别这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21308
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bd563322:

    # "Arthur glares at you."
    "亚瑟瞪着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21310
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ce9eb65b:

    # a "Just don't."
    a "就是别。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21312
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4e316cfe:

    # p "I'm not trying to be disrespectful."
    p "我不是想不尊重您。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21314
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bc525866:

    # "He snorts again, shaking his head."
    "他又哼了一声，摇摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21318
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a8c911c5:

    # a "I know how this kind of thing works."
    a "我知道这种事是怎么运作的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21320
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3c59d929:

    # a "I've been on enough ships to know—every vessel looks pristine and proper on the surface."
    a "我待过的船够多了，知道每艘船表面都光鲜体面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21322
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_404d33eb:

    # a "But take a moment to get a closer look, and you'll find the wood rotting..."
    a "但只要花点时间仔细看看，你就会发现木头在腐烂……"

# game/script day12.rpy:21324
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4fe018d3:

    # "Keeping quiet feels like the best approach for now."
    "眼下，保持沉默似乎是最好的办法。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21328
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_52ef00ae:

    # a "What do you want for this?"
    a "你想要什么报酬？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21332
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_82a94618:

    # "He sloshes the liquid about in the bottle again."
    "他又晃了晃瓶子里的液体。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21334
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_da7d9f5a:

    # p "Let me stay."
    p "让我留下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21336
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_8a5f599e:

    # p "That is all."
    p "就这些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21340
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b8236df5:

    # "That feels too much, so you follow up."
    "这感觉要价太高了，所以你补充道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21342
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_81acd2fb:

    # p "A little while longer, at least."
    p "至少，再待一小段时间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21344
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_7061375c:

    # a "You really don't know how to negotiate."
    a "你真不知道该怎么谈判。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21346
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_581cee08:

    # a "Picking something so suspicious—the whole point of a deal is to do the opposite."
    a "选这么可疑的条件——交易的关键恰恰相反。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21348
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a9187cd7:

    # p "What else could I want?"
    p "我还能想要什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21350
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_206a07de:

    # a "That's not my problem."
    a "那不是我的问题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21352
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ed6dc636:

    # "He takes another gulp."
    "他又喝了一大口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21354
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0574c4b2:

    # p "It isn't? You're the one drinking Rajeeyah's supplies."
    p "不是你的问题？喝拉吉雅补给的人可是你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21358
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6a25adb7:

    # "The horse points to his latched glass window."
    "马指了指他锁着的玻璃窗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21360
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_61d9353d:

    # a "The sea hides plenty of things."
    a "大海能藏匿很多东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21362
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_59b26529:

    # "He gestures that it would be an easy toss, and no one would be any wiser."
    "他示意那会是个轻松的投掷动作，而且没人会知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21366
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_fe0102ea:

    # p "Fine, but you did already punish me for the weather watch."
    p "好吧，但你已经因为瞭望天气的事惩罚过我了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21368
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_971a90e1:

    # p "Dismissing me too—people will begin to raise their suspicions."
    p "再把我赶走——人们会开始起疑心的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21370
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_968dba9b:

    # "Hopefully by now the booze was starting to mellow him out a little, but you weren't going to rely on the unknown strength of his constitution."
    "希望到现在酒精能让他稍微温和一点，但你并不打算依赖他那未知的酒量。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21372
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_655bbb4e:

    # p "It's making the crew start to talk."
    p "这让船员们开始议论了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21374
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3bc71409:

    # a "Careful."
    a "小心点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21376
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b516f75d:

    # a "That tongue has already gotten you in trouble."
    a "你这张嘴已经给你惹过麻烦了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21378
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_064f3b8e:

    # p "I'm just saying."
    p "我只是说说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21380
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_10071b95:

    # p "Tell the crew you thought it over."
    p "告诉船员你重新考虑过了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21382
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_40a8ade8:

    # p "Say that you just wanted to turn the screws on me."
    p "就说你只是想给我施压。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21384
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bc9f6517:

    # p "There's nothing wrong with changing your mind."
    p "改变主意没什么不对。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21388
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_595acf74:

    # a "That's what you want out of this deal. What am I going to get?"
    a "这就是你想从这笔交易里得到的。那我能得到什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21390
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_203fd330:

    # "A more uncontrolled laugh escapes his lips. Guess it's hitting him faster than you thought."
    "他嘴里迸发出一阵更不受控制的笑声。看来酒劲上得比你预想的快。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21392
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6f5bbb3a:

    # a "Clearly you haven't heard about the kind of deals that go on between sailors."
    a "显然你没听说过水手之间做的那种交易。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21394
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_92418fe2:

    # "You're not sure what he's exactly insinuating, but you really hope he's not talking about what Perce wanted to get out of you."
    "你不确定他到底在暗示什么，但你真的希望他指的不是珀斯想从你身上得到的东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21396
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_5642ab76:

    # p "Better work from me is what you are going to get."
    p "你能得到的是我更卖力的工作。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21398
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d3ea8fa9:

    # "You figure something more above board will speak to him."
    "你觉得更光明正大的条件或许能打动他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21400
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_be6b895f:

    # "You're not that desperate... right?"
    "你没那么走投无路吧……对吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21402
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_11447306:

    # "Is he?"
    "他是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21406
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_66e68ea3:

    # a "Do you really think that I believe that you'll suddenly become a skilled sailor?"
    a "你真以为我会相信你会突然变成一个熟练的水手？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21408
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3619e62b:

    # p "I'd never sailed on a ship before. It's hard to be better than landsman when ignorance is the starting point."
    p "我以前从没上过船。在无知是起点的情况下，很难比旱鸭子做得更好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21410
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_12fe57c8:

    # "You shrug."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21414
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_7a3fe265:

    # a "Your negotiating is as crap as your seamanship."
    a "你的谈判技巧和你的航海技术一样烂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21416
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c950a71d:

    # a "But at least you did something for me."
    a "但至少你为我做了点事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21418
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_08fccb17:

    # "He looks wistfully at the half-empty bottle, appearing loose and relaxed. He reaches for his pipe and brings it back to life, taking a few thoughtful puffs."
    "他怅然地望着半空的瓶子，显得松弛而放松。他伸手拿起烟斗，重新点燃，若有所思地吸了几口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21420
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0e1769f3_1:

    # a "Fine."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21422
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4ee865dc:

    # a "Because I'm feeling particularly generous today."
    a "因为我今天特别慷慨。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21424
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_39210596:

    # "He winces as he says it, ears twitching."
    "他说这话时皱了皱眉，耳朵抽动了一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21428
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ca398050:

    # a "I'll let you stay, but you'd better bloody remember it."
    a "我会让你留下，但你他妈最好记住这事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21430
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d92e3297:

    # "That relaxed look dissipates, and he seems harder than you ever remember."
    "那放松的神情消散了，他看起来比你记忆中任何时候都更严厉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21432
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_69da2419:

    # a "You mess up again and there will be no reprieve for you."
    a "你再搞砸，就没人能救你了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21434
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ffa12308:

    # a "Now go leave me in peace. I've humored your nonsense enough tonight."
    a "现在走吧，让我清静会儿。今晚我受够你的胡闹了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21442
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2ec18bcb:

    # "You take the initiative and make straight for the door faster than you can blink. In fact, you're beyond that door and halfway down the corridor before you even remember to breathe."
    "你主动起身，眨眼间就径直冲向门口。事实上，你甚至没来得及喘口气，就已经出了门，走到走廊一半了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21444
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_1116bfc7:

    # "You did it."
    "你做到了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21446
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e5e12210:

    # "Success makes you feel giddy, but so does being short of breath."
    "成功让你感到眩晕，但缺氧也一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21448
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_aa2687e1:

    # "It's only when you get back onto the deck, the cool, clear night air filling your lungs that you start to wonder."
    "直到你回到甲板上，凉爽清澈的夜空气充满肺部时，你才开始思考。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21450
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_cea3134f:

    # "You did it, but at what cost?"
    "你做到了，但代价是什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21474
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b3142439:

    # "The sense of time weighing down on you makes the growing night feel darker. Worse, the sense of time having run out."
    "时间的重压让你觉得渐深的夜色更加黑暗。更糟的是，那种时间已所剩无几的感觉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21478
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6b80d520:

    # "You sigh, leaning on the gunwale. The cool nightly breeze pulls at your fur, but you pay its tricks no heed."
    "你叹了口气，靠在船舷上。夜晚的凉风拉扯着你的毛发，但你无心理会它的把戏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21480
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a539a551:

    # "You're alone in your thoughts, on the deck, and in the task to come."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21484
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_41def506:

    # "Wondering if it was smart to drink away the bottle you shared with Wolf earlier..."
    "想着把早先和沃尔夫分享的那瓶酒喝光是否明智……"

# game/script day12.rpy:21486
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3719eff7:

    # "Can hardly change what's happened, however."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21488
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e4a05535:

    # "Glancing out across the wide, rolling waves, you make out the faint, distant ripple of silver—moonlight, catching the water close to the horizon."
    "放眼望去，辽阔起伏的波浪间，你辨认出远处微弱的银色涟漪——那是月光，洒落在靠近地平线的水面上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21490
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_5b66cad0:

    # "Even though you know it'll still be some time off, you strain your eyes, trying to spot the steady flicker of lights, signaling for the nearby shore. Sometime all too soon, your paws would feel the steady ground underfoot, and that would be the end of this."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21492
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_9893e3e2:

    # "Unless you can make tonight count."
    "除非你能让今晚变得有意义。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21494
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_26320bcc:

    # "You gulp, taking a deep breath of the salty breeze. It helps soothe the unsteady feeling in your gut, but a sharp cramp in your paw unsettles you. You pull it back, massaging your swollen pad—the weave of the rigging imprinted onto your palm."
    "你深吸一口气，咸涩的海风灌入喉咙。这稍稍平息了胃里的翻腾，但爪间突来的刺痛让你心神不宁。你缩回爪子揉搓肿胀的肉垫——缆绳的纹路已深深印入掌心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21496
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_5d97a3f8:

    # "There's a certain warped irony in your future that's not lost on you—the very thought that being back on terra firma could feel so uncertain."
    "你清楚意识到未来有种扭曲的讽刺——脚踏坚实大地竟会让你如此惶惑不安。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21498
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_99fb47ac:

    # "You try to gulp down the acrid tinge crawling up your gullet, doubling over the side of the ship as a precaution-"
    "你试图咽下涌上喉头的酸涩，为防万一俯身靠向船舷——"

# game/script day12.rpy:21500
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ff1d7f75:

    # "You retch—mostly dry, but the sensation still burns your throat."
    "你干呕起来——虽没吐出什么，灼烧感却撕裂着喉咙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21502
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_9d469299:

    # "Fuck."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21504
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_028acad0:

    # "You straighten up and grab a gulp of freshwater, trying to wash your final supper back down inside. Or failing that, at least freshen up your breath."
    "你直起身灌了口水，想把最后的晚餐压回肚里。若做不到，至少能漱净口中浊气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21506
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0aa6491f:

    # p "Come on."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21508
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f7928b37:

    # "You sniff, trying to keep a lid on things."
    "你抽抽鼻子，竭力维持镇定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21510
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2a74026f:

    # p "You need to do this."
    p "必须这么做。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21512
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_997a78dd:

    # "Not even need. You want to stay. That's why you've done all those things..."
    "不止是必须。你想留下。正因如此你才……"

# game/script day12.rpy:21514
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2973c783:

    # "Hopefully they'd count."
    "但愿那些努力能奏效。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21516
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_8367d238:

    # p "[name], come on."
    p "[姓名]，振作点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21518
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0eb1a415:

    # p "Don't be a coward."
    p "别当懦夫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21520
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_61f611c4:

    # "Saying the word to yourself sparks an ember of defiance."
    "这句自语点燃了反抗的火星。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21522
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_7bd7224b:

    # p "You'll hate yourself if you don't at least try."
    p "若不尝试，你必将痛恨自己。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21527
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4f3ee61f:

    # "You look out across the horizon, searching it for some sign at least. You can't say that you believe in all that sailor's superstition, but something, anything, that might spur your spirits further would be a welcome straw."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21529
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e657d708:

    # "The night stares back at you with its same, uncaring emptiness."
    "夜色以亘古的漠然回望着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21531
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b875af24:

    # p "Fine."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21536
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f7760891:

    # "You hiss, turning your back to the sea and stalking across the deck."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21538
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_de36c164:

    # "You never were going to hold yourself up to mercy—the sea's, or otherwise."
    "你从未指望过宽恕——无论是大海的，还是谁的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21544
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_93324f13:

    # "Jaw set, you make your way towards the officer's quarters at the stern of the ship, trying to stop your claws from catching between the planks."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21546
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_27f6f5d3:

    # "Anger, particularly a self-righteous one, warms your heart and lends you courage."
    "怒火——尤其是自以为是的怒火——温暖着心脏，赐予你勇气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21548
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_e7bb884f:

    # "You've been trying to pin down that damn horse for the entire day."
    "一整天你都在追踪那匹该死的马。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21553
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4003f542:

    # "Pushing to the front of the work. Swapping your rest with the other watch's work. Running your paws raw across the entire length of the ship—feeling like you were stretched from bow to stern."
    "抢着干最累的活。用休息时间换班值守。爪子磨破仍跑遍整艘船——感觉自己像被从船头扯到船尾。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21555
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4aaf3290:

    # "Arthur just wasn't looking."
    "亚瑟根本视而不见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21557
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_4bfcb67e:

    # "Or more accurately, he was just looking through you. "
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21559
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_045fe45d:

    # "So now you'll make him notice you."
    "所以现在你要让他看见你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21565
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2ca414f8:

    # "A last roll of the dice."
    "最后一次掷骰。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21567
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d98f8b64:

    # "A gamble, for an eleventh hour stay of execution..."
    "一场赌博，为了死刑前的暂缓令……"

# game/script day12.rpy:21569
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f2e3f1f3:

    # p "Nothing like necessity stepping on your tail to spur you into action."
    p "被逼到绝境最能催人行动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21577
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_9cf3f830:

    # "Stepping towards the quarterdeck, you trace the mizzenmast down into the deck, eyeing up the door that leads into the officers' cabins."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21579
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_fc8ca20f:

    # "The fiery beat of your heart begins to feel heavy and sluggish. That once sharp sense of smell of yours now just seems to drift from your senses altogether. All you can really do is feel this heavy, leaden weight in your chest—time pressing down, towards your fateful appointment."
    "炽热的心跳渐沉渐缓。曾敏锐的嗅觉似乎彻底消散。唯有胸口铅块般的重压切实可感——时间正推着你奔赴命定的会面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21585
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d873f28b:

    # "You push through the door, ignoring the few quiet silhouettes of the crew still on duty, steering the ship through the night."
    "你推门而入，无视值夜船员操控航船的静谧侧影。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21594
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a0cb04d2:

    # "It takes a moment for you to get your bearings inside, having previously not stepped inside the officer's cabins."
    "因从未踏足军官舱，你在室内愣神片刻才辨清方向。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21596
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2b91ef67:

    # "It's quiet, the air inside noticeably fresher than elsewhere below deck. The space is divided up by a series of wooden screens, either side holding a flickering lantern, with a number of smaller doors marking other officer's quarters."
    "这里很安静，空气比甲板下其他地方清新。木屏风隔出空间，两侧悬着摇曳的提灯，数扇小门标志着其他军官的舱室。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21598
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_aa8a7291:

    # "Even without the other's directions, you know which one belongs to Arthur. The one in the corner, gathering darkness around it."
    "无需他人指引，你也知道哪间属于亚瑟。角落那间，黑暗在四周沉淀。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21602
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_03d0593f:

    # "It felt like someone else reached out and knocked on the door."
    "敲门声响起时，你觉得像别人伸出的手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21604
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0e8db120_1:

    # "A sharp rap of knuckles on wood, loud, insistent, matching the frenzied beat of your heart."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21606
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a7834acf_1:

    # "It's only when you feel a streak of pain lance up from your hand that you register that it was you who just banged on the first officer's door."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21608
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_aa667070_1:

    # "An odd, serene moment of calm washes over you for a split second—the relief of feeling that your fate was now out of your hands—before the silence stretches out each passing second in agonizing detail."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21610
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3512255f:

    # "No answer."
    "没有回应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21612
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_87b35952:

    # p "Fuck."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21614
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_97bd38b5:

    # "You catch your mouth with your paw, hoping no one heard that."
    "你捂住嘴，但愿无人听见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21616
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_1699b51c:

    # "Please."
    "求你了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21620
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f90c2511:

    # "You bang your fist against the wooden boards again. Harder this time."
    "拳头再次砸向木板。更重。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21622
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d998733a:

    # p "Please."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21624
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_34bda207:

    # "How perverse it is that you're now actually desperate to see him."
    "多荒谬啊——此刻你竟如此渴望见到他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21626
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_10af902e:

    # "Still, no answer."
    "依然寂静。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21628
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ddbe32ac:

    # "You try again."
    "再试一次。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21632
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bef6a526_1:

    # "One."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21636
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c09309c7:

    # "Last."
    "最后。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21640
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f89febdc:

    # "Time."
    "一次。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21644
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_681c050d:

    # "There's a sound behind the door. A half-muffled sigh, followed by the thud of hooves on the boards."
    "门后传来声响。半压抑的叹息，接着是蹄踏木板的闷响。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21646
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2040aebe:

    # "It's too late to consider whether you've just gone and pissed him off more."
    "已来不及考虑是否更激怒了他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21653
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0e637921:

    # "The door's swung open. There he suddenly is, looming down at you."
    "门骤然洞开。他赫然现身，居高临下笼罩着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21655
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b60aec3e:

    # "The horse is even bigger than you remember. And the way he's hunched within the confines of the narrow frame, his long equine head angled right at you, even more intimidating."
    "这匹马比记忆中更庞大。他蜷在狭窄门框里的姿态，那长马头直指向你的角度，愈发令人窒息。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21657
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_5b56a50c:

    # "You focus only on him as he snorts, taking a deep breath."
    "当他喷息深呼吸时，你只聚焦于他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21659
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a6e295fb:

    # "Rank and protocol abandon you, words tumbling out of your mouth without much order."
    "军阶与礼节被抛却，语词无序地滚出嘴唇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21661
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_cf9b6b8f:

    # a "What is-"
    a "那个——"

# game/script day12.rpy:21663
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d82da46f:

    # p "I'm sorry but please can I speak with you-"
    p "对不起但能否请您——"

# game/script day12.rpy:21665
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_c61fe177:

    # "You close your eyes."
    "你闭上眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21667
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a1ae8693:

    # "Did you just sound like that?"
    "刚才那是你的声音？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21669
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_385c0b29:

    # "You bite your lip. You sound like a mewling kitten."
    "咬住嘴唇。你听起来像呜咽的幼猫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21671
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_9ccfae64:

    # "There's no answer as the silence stretches on, the only sound is his heavy, rumbling breathing."
    "沉默蔓延，唯有他沉重如雷的呼吸作响。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21673
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_5fb458f7:

    # p "Please, Sir."
    p "拜托了，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21675
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3cac4ab8:

    # "You manage to control things a bit better, getting those words out properly at least."
    "你勉强控制住声线，至少完整说出这句话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21679
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_d7b02575:

    # p "If you would let me speak with you."
    p "若您能容许我与您谈谈。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21681
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_dad4696d:

    # a "Most of the crew know better than to disturb an officer at night, and during their rest no less."
    a "多数船员都懂规矩——不在深夜，尤其不在军官休息时打扰。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21685
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_8040166b:

    # p "I'm sorry, Sir."
    p "我很抱歉，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21687
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_6220e0a6:

    # "You're sick of saying that word, but you really are. Both sorry, and calling him Sir."
    "你厌恶这个词，但此刻确实如此。既为道歉，也为称他长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21689
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b64560a4:

    # "He doesn't show you any hint of mercy either. He just stays there, watching, waiting for you to get on with it."
    "他未流露丝毫怜悯。只是停在那里，注视，等待你继续。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21691
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_abff26e7:

    # "Is he really so cruel to make you spit it all out? Make you beg to stay here, where everyone else could hear?"
    "非要如此残酷吗？逼你在众人可闻处乞求留下？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21693
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_94126911:

    # "As time passes, you only feel more certain that's what he wants, but you're determined not to humiliate yourself so easily."
    "时间流逝，你越发确信这正是他所愿，但决心不轻易屈服于羞辱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21695
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_0c41804d:

    # p "I think we both know I know hopelessly little about this ship."
    p "我想我们都清楚，我对这艘船几乎一无所知。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21697
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a6960793:

    # p "But I don't know what else to do."
    p "但我不知还能做什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21701
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_b0336763:

    # a "About?"
    a "关于什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21703
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_7298243a:

    # p "Tomorrow... the day after.{w} Whenever we arrive."
    p "明天……后天。{w}无论何时抵达。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21705
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_626a779c:

    # "You gulp. Saying more felt like you'd surrender what little composure you have left back."
    "你吞咽口水。多说一字都像要缴械投降。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21707
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3553207d:

    # p "I don't know what more you want."
    p "我不明白您还想要什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21711
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_64c82181:

    # "Arthur took a long, deep breath. He looks like he's about to shut the door in your face, before moving to the side, waving you in."
    "亚瑟深吸一口长气。他看起来打算当面摔门，却侧身摆手示意你进入。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21713
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a1e163c9:

    # a "I'm not having this conversation out here."
    a "我不想在此处谈。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21717
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_f3f2f527:

    # "It takes a moment for you to register that you in fact haven't rammed the final nail in your coffin, and the loud rap of his fingers to realize the horse is telling you to come inside."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21719
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_8fdfd222:

    # "At least you don't make a further fool of yourself by questioning his decision. Even if it feels like you are stepping inside the office with the devil, you can't let your chance to stay slip."
    "至少你没蠢到质疑他的决定。即便像踏入魔鬼的厅堂，也不能让留下的机会溜走。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21733
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_59fd472f:

    # "Arthur closes the door behind you, turning a key in the lock. He snorts when you glance over, dismissing your concern with a shake of his head."
    "亚瑟锁上门。当你瞥向锁孔时他喷息摇头，打消你的疑虑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21737
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_429b25eb:

    # a "I don't want to be disturbed further this evening. Neither, I think, do you."
    a "今夜我不想再被打扰。你也是，我想。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21744
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2da5aa59:

    # "He grunts, walking past you to hunch down over his desk, tidying away some papers that litter the drawers. The splatter of stray ink suggests that despite the fancy pen, he's not such an eloquent writer."
    "他咕哝着从你身旁走过，伏案整理散乱的文件。墨渍斑驳的纸张显示——尽管钢笔精美，他并非文采斐然的书写者。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21746
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_ad74a32f:

    # "You take some time to look about his quarters while you stand there waiting, fiddling with your fingers, tail coiling about itself behind you."
    "等待时你环顾舱室，手指无意识地绞动，尾巴在身后蜷成结。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21748
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_05326579:

    # "You don't know what to have expected, really, but for an officer's quarters, they were smaller and more cramped than you thought. Clearly with rank, the greatest luxury was some privacy, but after your time aboard such an existence feels cold and lonely."
    "不知曾期待什么，但作为军官舱，这里比想象中更狭小拥挤。显然军阶带来的最大奢侈仅是隐私，但在船上生活久了，这种存在只觉冰冷孤寂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21750
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_2a5ef2c5:

    # "Aside from the desk, there's a small single bed cramped against the wall. Judging by the chipped wooden board, it clearly wasn't big enough for him, or his hooves."
    "除书桌外，仅有一张贴墙窄床。从磨损的木板判断，根本容不下他的身躯或四蹄。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21752
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_a930f5cd:

    # "Other than that, there's a small cabinet housing his clothes and other personal effects, and a small window looking out into the darkness beyond."
    "另有个储物私物的小柜，以及一扇望向黑暗的舷窗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21754
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bc46d073:

    # "In some ways, it felt more like a cell."
    "某种程度上，这更像囚室。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21756
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_5e04e65c:

    # a "I admit, I wasn't expecting you to drum up the courage to come and speak to me alone."
    a "说实话，没料到你竟敢独自来找我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21760
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_57ef487f:

    # "He flicks an ear, turning around to face you. Even sitting down on his chair, his head still comes to the same height as you."
    "他抖抖耳朵转过身。即使坐着，头颅仍与你齐平。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21762
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_eeb1cd22:

    # p "I wasn't sure myself either."
    p "我自己也不确定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21764
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_1a12fe60:

    # "You gulp, licking your lips."
    "你咽口水，舔了舔嘴唇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21766
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_69a57ca3:

    # "Go on. Say it."
    "继续。说出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21800
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_c4020174:

    # p "I'll try to."
    p "我会尽力。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21802
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_565a0792:

    # "Everything you've rehearsed over and over in your head just goes blank."
    "脑海中排练过千万遍的台词瞬间空白。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21804
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_c54f373c:

    # p "Really... I'm terrified."
    p "其实……我很害怕。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21808
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_4bd28b6c:

    # a "Terrified?"
    a "害怕？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21810
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_f227df8d:

    # "He frowns, screwing up his eyes like he can't believe what you're going on about."
    "他皱眉眯眼，仿佛无法理解你的话语。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21812
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_b9d57732:

    # p "Of you."
    p "是对你的恐惧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21814
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_7cb15778:

    # a "Since I told you to leave?"
    a "从我让你离开时开始？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21816
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_4229dc8f:

    # p "Since I saw you on the docks."
    p "从在码头见到您那刻起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21818
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_5e3483e7:

    # a "I think you're going to have to explain."
    a "我想你需要解释清楚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21820
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_3ae108d5:

    # p "Well, I mean it when I say I really don't want to leave-"
    p "呃，我的意思是，我是真的不想离开——"

# game/script day12.rpy:21824
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_5e90de2a:

    # "Arthur shakes his head, sighing, cutting you off before you even get started."
    "亚瑟摇摇头，叹了口气，没等你开始就把你打断了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21826
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_1b034379:

    # a "I didn't ask you about what I already know."
    a "我没问你我早就知道的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21828
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_f0fee227:

    # "He sighs, wrapping his knuckles against the desk."
    "他叹了口气，用指节敲了敲桌子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21832
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_122a8a4c:

    # p "I, well... There is something else.{w} I know this may sound foolish, but..."
    p "我，那个……其实还有别的事。{w}我知道这可能听起来很蠢，但是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:21834
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_2763bc68:

    # p "I'm fairly handy with a needle. I could keep your uniform in good shape, if you'd allow it."
    p "我针线活还算拿手。如果您允许的话，我可以帮您打理好制服。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21836
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_c69873ec:

    # p "I know it's not much to offer, but it's all I have, sir."
    p "我知道这算不上什么，但这是我唯一能做的了，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21838
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_f1a7e108:

    # a "Don't be absurd, lad. There are enough tailors at every port we dock in; I won't be needing your services."
    a "别犯傻了，小子。我们停靠的每个港口都有足够的裁缝；我不需要你的服务。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21840
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_92c2d2bf:

    # a "Besides, I have no idea of your skill. The last thing I need is to step out looking like a fool because of some shoddy stitching."
    a "再说了，我也不知道你的手艺怎么样。我最不需要的就是因为蹩脚的针脚而走出去像个傻瓜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21842
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_28d946e4:

    # "He shakes his head, a trace of disappointment in you showing through."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21844
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_02b3be1c:

    # "So much for that plan..."
    "计划就这么泡汤了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:21846
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_6c5ac6ca:

    # a "Do you have any idea what it takes to run a ship like this? Any idea at all?"
    a "你知道运营这样一艘船需要什么吗？你到底知不知道？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21848
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_0b75f275:

    # "He gestures with his hand, inviting you to give your thoughts."
    "他做了个手势，示意你发表看法。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21852
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_88b2612a:

    # a "Do you think it's discipline?"
    a "你觉得是纪律？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21854
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_b762096c:

    # a "Camaraderie?"
    a "是袍泽之情？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21856
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_db39c300:

    # a "Grit?"
    a "还是坚韧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21860
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_b5f4f287:

    # a "Whichever you're thinking, you're wrong."
    a "不管你想到的是哪个，你都错了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21862
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_985a2f17:

    # a "It's all of those. A ship is a delicate state of balance, every element working well together with the other like we, and our vessel, are one living, breathing being."
    a "这些全都是。一艘船是一个精妙的平衡状态，每个部分都与其他部分协调运作，就像我们和我们的船是一个有生命的、会呼吸的整体。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21866
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_6c01140b:

    # "He nods, his eyes drilling into yours."
    "他点点头，目光紧紧盯着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21868
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_44a9689b:

    # a "So when one part of that throws everything out of balance, what should be done?"
    a "所以，当其中一个部分打破了这种平衡，该怎么办？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21870
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_29d26e37:

    # "You don't answer."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21872
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_7b6d2279:

    # p "I understand, Sir... I just... I wanted to give it one last shot."
    p "我明白，长官……我只是……想最后再争取一次。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21876
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_7729d08c:

    # "He flicks his ears again, turning his head to look at you from the side."
    "他又抖了抖耳朵，侧过头看着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21878
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_481873e2:

    # a "What do you think I was going to say?"
    a "你以为我要说什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21880
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_773ebecc:

    # "He snorts."
    "他哼了一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21882
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_27f91693:

    # p "Sorry, Sir."
    p "对不起，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21886
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_8dc0cbd5:

    # a "That was a rhetorical question."
    a "那是个反问句。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21888
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_c069c6fd:

    # "You bite your lips shut."
    "你咬紧嘴唇，不再说话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21890
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_7a897128:

    # a "Harmony, often, means difficult decisions."
    a "和谐，往往意味着艰难的决定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21892
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_a65f335f:

    # "He stays silent for a moment. Out of the corner of your eye, you spot his hoof nudge out of sight under the desk... an empty bottle of whiskey..."
    "他沉默了片刻。你用眼角的余光瞥见他的蹄子从桌子下面挪了出来……一个空威士忌酒瓶……"

# game/script day12.rpy:21894
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_76982cc5:

    # "Was he... drinking that before I arrived?"
    "他……在我来之前一直在喝那个吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21896
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_ed6be48e:

    # "You know better to divert your eyes away before he catches you looking, but now that you're aware of it, you think you can smell it in the air."
    "你最好在他发现你偷看之前移开视线，但现在你意识到了，你觉得空气中似乎都能闻到那股酒味。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21898
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_4e11927e:

    # a "You feel the weight of your mistake pressing down on you now, don't you, Mr. [family_name]?"
    a "你现在感觉到你错误的沉重压力了，不是吗，[姓氏]先生？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21900
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_d1358cda:

    # a "The gravity of it. What it could have meant."
    a "它的严重性。它可能意味着什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21902
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_106c443a:

    # "He turns to run his eyes up and down you."
    "他转过身，上下打量着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21904
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_8d26cf9e:

    # a "I can see that in the way you hold yourself. That tight knot in your back. That weight in your gut. That ache in your shoulders—like an invisible force trying to crush you."
    a "我能从你站立的姿势看出来。你后背紧绷的疙瘩。你胃里的沉重感。你肩膀的酸痛——就像有股无形的力量要把你压垮。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21906
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_21155921:

    # "He stiffens."
    "他身体僵了一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21910
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_6837989f:

    # a "You're feeling this now because you're thinking about saving your own skin. Imagine feeling this all the time, knowing every one of the souls on this ship rests on you making the right decisions-"
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21912
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_25eab9e1:

    # p "Sir, I've tried so hard to put things right-"
    p "长官，我已经非常努力去弥补了——"

# game/script day12.rpy:21914
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_88924873:

    # a "Being a leader means making difficult decisions, lad."
    a "做领导就意味着要做艰难的决定，小子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21916
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_5cdb1fed:

    # "Arthur spoke softly."
    "亚瑟轻声说道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21918
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_4f92c3d2:

    # a "Sometimes, that decision can be changing your mind."
    a "有时候，那个决定也可以是改变主意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21920
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_12244570:

    # "The ringing in your ears stops."
    "你耳中的嗡鸣停止了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21922
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_98720c2f:

    # p "Sir?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21926
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_8eaa2602:

    # a "When I caught you asleep on deck, you looked like the kind of landsman we get every so often. Hopping on from port to port, barely good enough to justify their rations before sending them on their way at the next port."
    a "当我发现你在甲板上睡着时，你看起来就像我们时不时会碰到的那种陆地佬。从一个港口跳到另一个港口，勉强够格混口饭吃，然后在下个港口就被打发走。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21930
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_67ff6ffd:

    # a "When I heard you were caught asleep on deck, you looked like the kind of landsman we get every so often. Hopping on from port to port, barely good enough to justify their rations before sending them on their way at the next port."
    a "当我听说你被抓到在甲板上睡觉时，你看起来就像我们时不时会碰到的那种陆地佬。从一个港口跳到另一个港口，勉强够格混口饭吃，然后在下个港口就被打发走。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21934
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_b93e9313:

    # a "I wanted to see if you had some discipline."
    a "我想看看你是否有纪律性。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21936
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_8184a200:

    # a "That sense of camaraderie pushing you to do right for your peers."
    a "是否有那种袍泽之情，能推动你为同僚做正确的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21938
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_b5df19f3:

    # a "The grit that'd show you'd still hold fast when things got tough."
    a "是否有那种坚韧，能在情况艰难时依然坚守。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21940
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_0af58dfc:

    # a "You said you wanted to stay aboard this ship. And instead of shrugging your shoulders, you set your teeth and went about it."
    a "你说你想留在这艘船上。你没有耸耸肩放弃，而是咬紧牙关去做了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21942
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_ee7ce64a:

    # p "As far as I know, Sir, I'm still leaving tomorrow."
    p "据我所知，长官，我明天还是要离开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21944
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_f6e6f638:

    # a "About the harmony of a ship..."
    a "关于船的和谐……"

# game/script day12.rpy:21946
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_93ec7910:

    # "He tuts, scolding you for not listening earlier."
    "他啧了一声，责备你之前没认真听。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21948
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_0cd4400d:

    # a "You have been making some impressions.{w} I won't say who, but it's not just one person who has noted your attitude these last few days."
    a "你确实给人留下了一些印象。{w}我不会说是谁，但不止一个人注意到了你最近几天的态度。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21950
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_fa4bf15b:

    # "He grunts, banging a hoof against the deck. You get the impression that he's not trying to be intimidating, but the struggle to move freely in his cramped quarters doesn't lend itself well for a bulky horse."
    "他咕哝了一声，用蹄子敲了敲甲板。你觉得他并非有意威慑，但在他狭窄的舱室里，这匹壮硕的马想自由活动并不容易。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21954
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_cfdaf6a4:

    # a "There are different types of sailor—beyond competent and the opposite. You understand that right?"
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21956
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_aad6b754:

    # p "If you're talking beyond ability."
    p "如果你指的是能力之外的东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21958
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_210c06eb:

    # a "Yes."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:21962
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_2d20492c:

    # "He nods with a snort, like he's impressed with your thinking."
    "他哼了一声点点头，似乎对你的想法有些赞许。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21964
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_40df732a:

    # a "I used to sail on a navy vessel, so I can say I've seen the measure of plenty of souls."
    a "我以前在海军舰船上服役过，所以我可以说我见识过不少人的分量。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21966
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_7792db82:

    # p "More than I can claim."
    p "比我能自称的要多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21968
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_00eddc17:

    # a "You're not here because flattery works on me."
    a "你在这里，不是因为我吃奉承那一套。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21970
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_f41d6f52:

    # "Arthur narrows his eyes, the pitch of his snort short and sharp. You bite your lip, figuring it the best to stop repeating things back to him and let him finish his lecture."
    "亚瑟眯起眼睛，鼻息短促而尖锐。你咬住嘴唇，觉得最好别再重复他的话，让他把训话讲完。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21972
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_e7e24e0f:

    # a "Some sailors are in it for the money. Others don't have a better place to be.{w} There's plenty of people like that—the sort that gets things done well enough, but only because that's the least hassle for them."
    a "有些水手是为了钱。其他人则是没有更好的去处。{w}这样的人很多——那种能把事情做得足够好的人，但仅仅是因为那样对他们来说最省事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21974
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_eb10ec58:

    # a "What do you think I was drawn to think, based on the impression you gave?"
    a "根据你给我的印象，你认为我当时是怎么想的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:21976
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_58ab8a1c:

    # "You hold your tongue, not wanting to irritate the horse further. But as the seconds go by, it becomes clear he probably wants a response from you this time."
    "你忍住不说话，不想进一步激怒这匹马。但几秒钟过去，很明显他这次可能想要你回应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21978
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_142c4744:

    # p "Er... probably worse than that."
    p "呃……可能比那更糟。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21982
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_bf63f1d5:

    # a "We can leave the actual thought to your imagination then."
    a "那么，具体想法就留给你想象吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21986
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_8d19eec5:

    # a "But you can appreciate that the measure you gave of yourself was not good."
    a "但你应该明白，你当时表现出的分量并不好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21988
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_038ddd83:

    # a "Thinking about the cohesion of the ship, you can see how that is a risk which could not be tolerated."
    a "考虑到船的凝聚力，你就能明白那是一种无法容忍的风险。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21990
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_c5250ec4:

    # p "Yes..."
    p "是啊……"

# game/script day12.rpy:21992
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_d8b49702:

    # "You lower your head and look at your feet. Even now, it feels like he's chewing out the very fight you have left. What even was the point of coming here? He's made up his mind."
    "你低下头看着自己的脚。即使到了现在，感觉他仍在把你仅剩的那点斗志都嚼碎了。来这里到底有什么意义？他已经下定决心了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21996
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_0eb6a15b:

    # a "But, the last few days have been interesting to observe. You do know it's not going to change my mind. Doing more work doesn't make up for what you did."
    a "但是，观察你最近几天还挺有意思的。你要知道这不会改变我的主意。多做工作并不能弥补你犯的错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:21998
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_8bf31c6c:

    # a "However."
    a "不过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22000
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_c0125ed0:

    # a "It does tell me that you are, in fact, as you have so often repeated, sorry."
    a "这确实告诉我，事实上，正如你反复强调的，你是感到抱歉的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22002
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_4bb1cfd4:

    # a "If you were just trying to coast, you wouldn't put in the extra effort. Better to wait it out and hop ship at the next port, and become someone else's problem."
    a "如果你只是想混日子，你就不会额外付出努力。不如等着时间过去，在下个港口换船，成为别人的麻烦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22004
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_4bff1554:

    # p "I mean, I am sorry. I know I fucked up, and I can't change that, but I can change things now-"
    p "我的意思是，我很抱歉。我知道我搞砸了，我无法改变过去，但我可以改变现在——"

# game/script day12.rpy:22006
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_aad86486:

    # a "Start by not swearing in front of an officer."
    a "先从不在军官面前说脏话开始。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22010
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_a884a65b:

    # a "Even if I'm allowing you to speak to me in private, I expect you to still behave properly."
    a "即使我允许你私下跟我说话，我也希望你举止得当。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22012
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_27f91693_1:

    # p "Sorry, Sir."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22016
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_9f823d5b:

    # "He shrugs and shakes his head, fiddling with his dip pen."
    "他耸耸肩，摇摇头，摆弄着他的蘸水笔。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22018
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_011dcd36:

    # a "Why did you come here? Really. What were you hoping to achieve?"
    a "你为什么来这里？说真的。你希望达到什么目的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22020
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_b4a51aba:

    # p "I wanted to ask you if you'd reconsider-"
    p "我想问您是否能重新考虑——"

# game/script day12.rpy:22022
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_75816027:

    # a "That's it?"
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22024
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_96114ea2:

    # "He laughs."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22028
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_ed60c08e:

    # a "You thought you'd just waltz into an officer's quarters and ask them?"
    a "你以为你就能这样大摇大摆走进军官舱室，直接开口问他？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22030
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_ff89cc7a:

    # a "Along with the enticing promise of your... sewing abilities?"
    a "再加上你那……缝纫技能的诱人承诺？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22032
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_5a3b6c05:

    # "You feel the heat of humiliation creeping across your cheeks with how dumb your idea sounds when he puts it like that."
    "听他这么一说，你的想法显得如此愚蠢，羞辱的热度悄悄爬上了你的脸颊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22036
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_57b0775b:

    # a "You thought you'd just waltz into an officer's quarters and ask them? No gifts, no promises, nothing?"
    a "你以为你就能这样大摇大摆走进军官舱室，直接开口问他？没礼物，没承诺，什么都没有？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22038
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_9f710700:

    # "He takes a sharp breath and nods."
    "他深吸一口气，点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22040
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_82d5c1e5:

    # a "Well, I thought you were naive before. This just confirms it."
    a "好吧，我之前就觉得你天真。这正好证实了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22042
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_e4802c87:

    # p "Would you prefer it if I were not? If I were dishonest, would that not undermine the very values you just spoke to me of?"
    p "如果我并非如此，您会更喜欢吗？如果我不诚实，那岂不是破坏您刚刚跟我说的那些价值观吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22046
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_d5ad0932:

    # p "And what could I even have on this ship that you don't already have, and more so?"
    p "而且，在这艘船上，我怎么可能有您没有的东西，更何况是更多？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22048
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_66100020:

    # "You gesture at his sleeping quarters. It's the height of luxury compared to your sleeping arrangements, not to mention, a quite literal breath of fresh air."
    "你指了指他的卧舱。和你睡觉的地方相比，这里堪称奢华至极，更别提，这里能呼吸到真正的新鲜空气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22050
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_9e606190:

    # "Every breath up here, free from the consequences of an entire crew sleeping below deck, is a blessing. You can even savor the salty tang to the sea breeze!"
    "在这里的每一次呼吸，都免于承受整个船员睡在甲板下的后果，是一种恩赐。你甚至能品尝到海风中的咸味！"

# game/script day12.rpy:22052
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_6e2f9087:

    # a "I suppose that's true."
    a "我想这倒是真的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22056
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_68db0586:

    # a "There are downsides to being resourceful, when it comes to a ship and its discipline."
    a "当涉及到一艘船及其纪律时，足智多谋也有其弊端。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22058
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_a70d7f65:

    # p "And I thought it would be the last thing you'd want, if I were to be causing you more problems."
    p "而且我想，如果我给您带来更多麻烦，那会是您最不想要的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22060
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_581eb494:

    # a "That is true, in a way."
    a "在某种程度上，这倒是真的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22062
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_7b4a67b5:

    # a "So, you have just come to plead your case?"
    a "所以，你只是来为自己求情的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22064
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_766c5e94:

    # p "Am I wasting your time?"
    p "我是在浪费您的时间吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22068
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_0c55c2e1:

    # "You figure it better to put it that way, but you don't want to waste your time either. Not if you need to spend it better saying goodbyes."
    "你觉得这样问更好，但你也不想浪费自己的时间。尤其是如果你需要把时间更好地用来告别的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22070
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_30fb253d:

    # a "Not quite."
    a "不完全是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22074
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_1e54642a:

    # a "I suppose I should put you out of your misery, at least a bit."
    a "我想我至少该让你少受点折磨。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22080
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_e82e77e6:

    # "The horse grunts, clearing his throat. He pulls open a drawer on his desk, grabbing something over the sound of clinking bottles."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22082
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_485fd6ba:

    # "You notice how his ears snap alert at the sound, flicking around at you. You divert your gaze, pretending to be lost in the luxury of such personal space an officer could afford."
    "你注意到他的耳朵随着声音立刻警觉起来，朝你这边抖了抖。你移开视线，假装沉醉于军官才能享有的这种私人空间的奢华中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22088
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_0a3c3019:

    # "You time things just right to turn back to see Arthur has pulled out a small ivory pipe, fingertips fiddling with the tobacco. A few moments later he's puffing away, filling his small quarters quickly with its pungent, tangy smoke."
    "你掐准时机转过头，看见亚瑟掏出一支小象牙烟斗，指尖正拨弄着烟草。片刻后他已吞云吐雾，辛辣刺鼻的烟雾迅速弥漫了他狭小的舱室。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22090
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_7cdc5468:

    # "You do your best to suppress a cough, but the acrid smell still scratches at your throat."
    "你竭力忍住咳嗽，但那股呛人的气味仍刮擦着你的喉咙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22092
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_bdca1c26:

    # a "A fair few of the other crew have taken the time to voice their own thoughts to me on the matter, privately."
    a "有不少船员已经私下找时间向我表达了他们对这件事的看法。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22094
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_444e8473:

    # a "You are still new here, and still I suppose, expected to have some charity."
    a "你毕竟初来乍到，我想，总该得到些宽待。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22096
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_f9ff0e5e:

    # a "I do not call it leniency by any means—you must bear the same punishment as anyone else, so do not expect some misguided apology. That would jeopardize the social contract here."
    a "这绝非姑息——你必须和其他人承担同样的惩罚，所以别指望什么糊涂的道歉。那会破坏船上的规矩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22098
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_52a8a8bf:

    # "You take the moment to nod, understanding that Arthur requires that acknowledgment."
    "你顺势点头，明白亚瑟需要这个表态。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22100
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_2efc5788:

    # a "Your saving grace is that you've decided to face such adversity by doubling your efforts.{w} Putting sweat in.{w} Showing your shipmates your bond with them."
    a "你的可取之处在于，你选择用加倍努力来面对逆境。{w} 挥洒汗水。{w} 向船友们证明你与他们的情谊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22102
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_44c2ba27:

    # a "You can say sorry and beg all you want to me, but hard graft's the apology your crew demanded from you."
    a "你大可以对我道歉哀求，但你的船员们要的赔罪是实打实的苦干。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22104
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_e56c5a30:

    # a "It is a good trait to see in a mariner, budding or no. It gives some confidence that, when things are tough, you'll find strength to do the right thing."
    a "这是水手身上可贵的气质，无论新手老手。这让人相信，当处境艰难时，你会找到力量做正确的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22106
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_f03c8007:

    # a "No matter how tired you are..."
    a "无论你多累……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22108
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_54c1c541:

    # "Arthur sighs, taking another draught from his pipe. You take a moment to recognize some of the patterns etched into the bone, scenes from naval life—the specifics of which still elude you."
    "亚瑟叹了口气，又吸了一口烟斗。你趁隙辨认出骨制烟斗上雕刻的某些图案，是海军生活的场景——具体细节你还看不太懂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22110
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_cd0a90e2:

    # p "What does that mean, sir?"
    p "这是什么意思，长官？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22112
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_b4002f28:

    # "You try your best to swallow your nerves, but your tail betrays you, coiling and twitching behind you as you wait for that final judgment."
    "你拼命压下紧张，但尾巴出卖了你，在你等待最终裁决时，它在身后蜷曲扭动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22116
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_51260d85:

    # a "When we make port next, you will be permitted to shore leave for the limited time it will take to resupply."
    a "下次靠港时，你可以在补给所需的有限时间内获准上岸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22118
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_025b4a2f:

    # a "And then you will be allowed to set foot back aboard this ship for the next leg of our journey."
    a "然后你将获准重新登船，继续下一段航程。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22120
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_12bdb9b0:

    # "The sound comes as a shock—heart skipping a beat as you try to recall what you'd just heard from the stern horse."
    "这话如惊雷炸响——你的心跳漏了一拍，努力回想刚才那匹严肃的马说了什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22122
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_da3b50c3:

    # "You're unsure if you heard him right—couldn't he have said it in simple terms?"
    "你不确定自己是否听清——他就不能说得简单点吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22126
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_37b0a352:

    # "But you don't want to seem ungrateful, so rather than wait to understand, you answer quickly."
    "但你不想显得不知感恩，于是不等完全理解，就赶紧回答。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22128
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_0b799ba0:

    # p "Thank you, sir. Thank you! I won't let you down-"
    p "谢谢长官。谢谢！我不会让您失望——"

# game/script day12.rpy:22130
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_d5200121:

    # a "Like I said, it's not just me. It's the rest of the crew."
    a "我说了，不止是我。是全体船员。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22132
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_215509af:

    # "He shrugs, shaking his head as if he suspects you've not learned your lesson at all."
    "他耸耸肩摇摇头，仿佛怀疑你根本没吸取教训。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22134
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_ef94b176:

    # p "I know, sir, it's just-"
    p "我知道，长官，只是——"

# game/script day12.rpy:22138
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_5eb37fbb:

    # a "I don't need to hear it, landsman."
    a "我不想听，旱鸭子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22140
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_3803d906:

    # "He rolls his eyes at the word, taking a deep puff of his pipe, as if landsman is too generous a term for your seafaring prowess."
    "他说这个词时翻了翻白眼，深深吸了一口烟斗，仿佛“旱鸭子”这个词对你的航海本事都算过誉了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22142
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_a397a5aa:

    # a "Just thank them by keeping your nose to the grindstone, and understand this-"
    a "埋头苦干就是感谢他们，并且记住——"

# game/script day12.rpy:22144
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_6ceeb7dc:

    # "He leans closer, blowing a thick cloud of smoke out from his nostrils. He seems almost like a devil—just add the hint of sulfur to the gesture..."
    "他倾身靠近，浓烟从鼻孔喷涌而出。他简直像个魔鬼——只差这个动作里添上硫磺味了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22146
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_5cd2464f:

    # a "None of what happened is forgotten. You are staying because you doubled your efforts, and showed me that you could be relied on, in some small part, to do more."
    a "发生过的事一件都没忘。你能留下，是因为你加倍努力，并且向我证明，至少在某些小事上，你是可以指望多做点的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22148
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_268fe53b:

    # a "If you slip back to old habits, or think that you're now safe."
    a "如果你故态复萌，或者以为现在安全了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22150
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_773ebecc_1:

    # "He snorts."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22152
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_285fe6ed:

    # a "There's always the next port to take your leave—or worse, if you jeopardize this ship again."
    a "总会有下一个港口让你走人——或者更糟，如果你再危及这艘船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22156
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_b2c856c0:

    # p "Yes, sir."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22158
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_1b22274e:

    # "His eyes widen."
    "他瞪大了眼睛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22160
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_d8ec332d:

    # p "I understand, sir."
    p "我明白，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22162
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_7354fc67:

    # a "Good, then you can see about leaving me in peace then. I'm sure you'd have other things you'd rather be doing with your scant spare time as of late."
    a "很好，那你可以让我清静了。我相信你最近少得可怜的闲暇时间，更愿意用来做别的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22164
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_5f3d6b5e:

    # "He affords a knowing chuckle, but you don't think to question him on it."
    "他会意地轻笑一声，但你没想过要追问。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22166
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_f7faad3c:

    # "It's probably not wise to question your good fortune, even if you want to hear that horse admit his own fault in it too."
    "质疑自己的好运恐怕不明智，即便你很想听那匹马承认他自己也有错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22168
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_d2fff5f7:

    # "Unlikely, but it would be satisfying."
    "不太可能，但那会让人痛快。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22170
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_c27eb5f0:

    # "And it would help dispel the feeling of still being on thin ice."
    "也能驱散那种如履薄冰的感觉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22172
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_df7556b2:

    # a "Is there anything else then, Mr. [family_name]?"
    a "还有别的事吗，[姓氏]先生？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22174
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_8c4c4255:

    # "You get the distinct feeling that you've overstayed your welcome."
    "你明显感到自己不受欢迎了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22180
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_6fed6330:

    # a "Don't go and repeat your mistake from your first dinner."
    a "别再犯你第一次晚餐时的错误。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22182
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_d70e2548:

    # "The horse grunts and shakes his head, batting a hand your way in a very clear gesture for you to leave."
    "那匹马哼了一声摇摇头，朝你挥手，明确示意你离开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22184
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_2cba8512:

    # p "Of course, sir, sorry sir."
    p "当然，长官，抱歉长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22186
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_01de369d:

    # "You give a polite, yet awkward bow, unsure what more to do or say when it comes to etiquette."
    "你礼貌而笨拙地鞠了一躬，不知在礼节上还能做什么或说什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22191
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_5efef7e2:

    # "So you make a quick retreat, pulling the door shut abruptly behind you. It's an unfamiliar and sticky joint, so you don't manage to pull it snug into the frame. Instead, it sticks, the wood creaking as it doesn't quite fit."
    "于是你迅速撤退，猛地带上了身后的门。这是个陌生又滞涩的合页，你没能把门严实地拉进门框。它卡住了，木头因不贴合而吱呀作响。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22193
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_601dcb13:

    # "Thinking of keeping your helpful reputation up, you take a closer look, trying to figure out if the frame needed Konrad's expert eye-"
    "想着维持你乐于助人的名声，你凑近细看，琢磨门框是否需要康拉德的专业眼光——"

# game/script day12.rpy:22195
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_5530c281:

    # "It's barely discernible over the general ambiance of the ship, but this close, you hear the loud clink of bottles, followed by the pulling of a rather stubborn cork."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22197
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_372d102d:

    # "You decide to leave quickly, figuring you could always ponder on the likely cause later."
    "你决定赶紧离开，想着总可以稍后再琢磨可能的原因。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22199
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_1a1ad823:

    # "With the door closed behind you, you can finally take a deep breath again. A breath that begins to dissipate some of your anxieties as well."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22201
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_e7d7c86e:

    # "About Morocco and your future."
    "关于摩洛哥和你的未来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22203
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_2ce849c8:

    # "Perhaps finally things are starting to tip into your favor."
    "或许事情终于开始朝对你有利的方向倾斜了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22214
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_a6c7cc77:

    # "You swallow hard and almost feel it catch in your throat."
    "你艰难地咽了口唾沫，几乎感觉它卡在喉咙里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22218
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_c1192aa4:

    # a "Well?{w} Are you getting to the point? If you don't, then I would ask you to leave my cabin."
    a "嗯？{w} 你到底有没有重点？如果没有，那就请你离开我的舱室。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22220
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_d4728c7b:

    # p "No-! I mean, yes, I am getting to it."
    p "不——！我是说，有，我正要说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22225
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_7c9e8bf6:

    # "The horse clears his throat and shifts in his chair. Without a word, he pulls open a drawer on his desk and reaches for something over the sound of clinking bottles."
    "那匹马清了清嗓子，在椅子上挪了挪身子。他一言不发地拉开桌子的抽屉，在叮当作响的瓶子声中摸索着什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22229
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_2631d1f6:

    # "He retrieves a small ivory pipe, methodically packing it with tobacco. The pungent, tangy smoke rises thickly into the air as he takes his first puff, filling the cramped quarters with its acrid odor."
    "他取出一支小象牙烟斗，有条不紊地填上烟草。辛辣刺鼻的烟雾随着他第一口吞吐浓重地升腾，呛人的气味充斥了狭窄的舱室。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22231
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_3e47a294:

    # "You do your best to suppress a cough as the smoke invades your throat."
    "当烟雾侵入喉咙时，你尽力忍住咳嗽。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22235
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_2f6e7ebb:

    # a "I didn't tell you to wait, did I? I am well capable of lighting a pipe and listening simultaneously."
    a "我没让你等着，对吧？我完全能一边点烟斗一边听你说话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22237
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_9c9cdefd:

    # p "Samuel, sir."
    p "塞缪尔，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22241
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_09622e88:

    # "Arthur sighs, his second draught spilling lazily from the corners of his mouth, curling leisurely as it rises into the air."
    "亚瑟叹了口气，第二口烟懒洋洋地从嘴角溢出，悠然盘旋着升入空中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22243
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_1dbaf060:

    # a "What about him?"
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22245
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_b48fa611:

    # a "Are you playing games with me?"
    a "你在跟我耍花样吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22247
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_c9c6b981:

    # "His words slither from his mouth."
    "他的话语从唇间滑出。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22249
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_5f85e9c5:

    # a "I'm not one for games, lad. Speak plainly."
    a "我不喜欢玩花样，小子。有话直说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22251
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_eca1153c:

    # p "No, sir!"
    p "不，长官！"

# game/script day12.rpy:22253
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_9ab9dc79:

    # p "Er, yes, I will, sir. Samuel... I know about him."
    p "呃，是，我会的，长官。塞缪尔……我知道他的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22255
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_43a144dc:

    # p "{i}Her{/i}, rather."
    p "{i}她{/i}，应该说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22257
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_0f157e81:

    # a "I beg your pardon?"
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22261
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_143fb289:

    # p "Hannah."
    p "Hannah。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22263
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_654a9d49:

    # "You watch his left brow arch slightly upward as he keeps his gaze locked on yours.{w} The urge to break eye contact grows with each passing moment."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22265
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_44f3f599:

    # a "And your point?"
    a "所以你的重点是什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22267
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_bfee0285:

    # p "I know you're aware, too."
    p "我知道你也清楚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22271
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_167bb522:

    # p "And it is plain to see that Samuel—Hannah..."
    p "而且显而易见，塞缪尔——汉娜……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22273
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_1369f06b:

    # p "She means something to you."
    p "她对你有特殊意义。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22275
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_7d9ffd0b:

    # p "It's... it's no secret that sailors are a superstitious lot. This crew is no different."
    p "这……水手迷信是公开的秘密。这艘船的船员也不例外。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22277
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_30ea65dd:

    # p "I don't have to remind you of the sayings-"
    p "我不必提醒你那些说法——"

# game/script day12.rpy:22279
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_18a211d7:

    # "You hate how quiet he is."
    "你讨厌他如此沉默。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22281
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_38e6384a:

    # p "Saying—about, um, women on ships. How they anger the gods of the sea."
    p "那些说法——关于，呃，船上的女人。说她们会惹怒海神。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22283
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_72b6dff0:

    # p "Rough waves. Violent gales. Storms..."
    p "巨浪。狂风。风暴……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22285
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_a42073ef:

    # p "It will be fresh in their minds, sir."
    p "这些他们还记忆犹新，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22287
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_04198407:

    # p "And they might look for a reason."
    p "他们可能会寻找原因。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22289
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_dd0aa341:

    # "You can't bring yourself to say it outright—to threaten him with revealing Samuel's secret. Instead, you watch, knowing that Arthur is no fool and can put two and two together."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22291
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_728dea03:

    # "You try your best to swallow your nerves, but your tail betrays you, coiling and twitching behind you as you wait."
    "你竭力压下紧张，但尾巴出卖了你，在你等待时在身后蜷曲扭动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22297
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_70e5e744:

    # "Arthur leans forward, closer than you'd like."
    "亚瑟向前倾身，近得让你不适。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22299
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_fb357974:

    # "He takes another long drag from the pipe and exhales slowly. Smoke billows from his nostrils and he almost appears like a devil—just add the stench of sulfur to the gesture..."
    "他又长长吸了一口烟斗，缓缓吐出。烟雾从鼻孔翻涌而出，他几乎像个魔鬼——只差这个动作里添上硫磺的恶臭……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22301
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_2d026566:

    # "The light of the oil lamp casts eerie shadows across his face, the rigid contours of his skull accentuated by the warm glow."
    "油灯的光在他脸上投下诡异的阴影，温暖的光晕凸显了他头骨硬朗的轮廓。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22303
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_113c23cf:

    # "Framed by the glow of hell itself..."
    "仿佛被地狱之火框住……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22305
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_e47855f0:

    # "You feel your chest rise with a deep breath as you wait tensely."
    "你感到胸口因深呼吸而起伏，紧张地等待着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22309
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_60feaec4:

    # "His lips part, the last plume of smoke curling lazily in the thick air."
    "他的嘴唇分开，最后一缕烟在浓重的空气中懒散地盘旋。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22311
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_da450c16:

    # "Then.{p}Two words."
    "然后。{p}两个字。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22313
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_80799543:

    # a "Very well."
    a "很好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22315
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_67aaa788:

    # "What?"
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22319
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_a761f70c:

    # "That's it?"
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22321
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_3e6c531a:

    # "No shouting?"
    "不大喊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22323
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_7cab9e02:

    # "No cursing?"
    "不咒骂？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22325
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_adf2d5a4:

    # "No threats?"
    "不威胁？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22327
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_9e41bea5:

    # a "If your demand is to remain aboard this ship in exchange for your silence on the delicate matter concerning {i}Mr. Samuel O'Connor{/i}, then perhaps we may yet be able to find common ground."
    a "如果你的要求是以对{i}塞缪尔·奥康纳先生{/i}相关的敏感事项保持沉默为条件，换取继续留在船上，那么我们或许还能找到共同点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22329
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_814172a7:

    # "You exhale sharply, realizing you're still holding your breath."
    "你猛地呼出一口气，意识到自己一直屏着呼吸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22331
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_ebaf1582:

    # p "I- that is... I am glad to hear. I would hate to put you or Samuel in that position, but since I was forced to, I had no other choice..."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22333
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_147df23b:

    # p "I appreciate that—for once—you understand me, sir."
    p "我很感激——总算有一次——您能理解我，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22339
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_1a3511eb:

    # "Arthur throws his head back and bellows a laugh, the chair creaking under his weight."
    "亚瑟仰头大笑，椅子在他的体重下吱呀作响。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22341
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_849840c8:

    # a "You've got guts, lad. I have to give you that."
    a "你有种，小子。这点我得承认。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22343
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_1fb327d8:

    # a "To knock on my door and demand {i}this{/i}. From someone of your rank?{w} There is many a Navy captain who'd envy the balls it took to do that."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22347
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_82e0650b:

    # a "I could... Well, I could ask you what punishment you prefer for your insolence."
    a "我可以……嗯，我可以问问你，对于你的无礼，你更喜欢哪种惩罚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22349
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_5a6cefa5:

    # a "Cutting your rations?"
    a "克扣你的口粮？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22351
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_5324e824:

    # a "Tying you to the mast?"
    a "把你绑在桅杆上？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22353
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_bc1bf8e8:

    # a "Flogging?"
    a "鞭刑？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22357
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_d0a1ddd8:

    # a "Perhaps having you repeat that dreadful barley song in front of the crew would do it."
    a "或许让你在全体船员面前再唱一遍那首难听的大麦歌也行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22359
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_9bb0fae7:

    # a "Though...{w} that would probably be more punishment for them than for you."
    a "不过……{w}那可能对他们来说比对你惩罚更重。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22363
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_a022a271:

    # a "But, I can see that this means a great deal to you. That much is undeniable."
    a "但是，我看得出这件事对你意义重大。这一点毋庸置疑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22369
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_0fff9212:

    # "Arthur reaches for his pipe again, taking a long, deliberate drag before sending the smoke toward the ceiling."
    "亚瑟再次伸手拿起烟斗，刻意地深吸一口，然后将烟雾吐向天花板。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22371
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_c4866bc4:

    # "You can hear his voice soften as he speaks."
    "你能听出他说话时声音柔和了下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22375
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_f5e459f1:

    # a "It seems this means as much to you as Samuel does to me."
    a "看来这件事对你的重要性，就像塞缪尔对我的重要性一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22377
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_f1797bed:

    # a "He...{w} I suppose I may speak plainly to you in return. She's an exceptional sailor—one of the best I've ever had the pleasure of working with. Alert. Skillful. Far beyond her years."
    a "他……{w}我想我也可以对你直言不讳。她是个出色的水手——是我有幸共事过的最优秀的水手之一。机警，熟练，远超她的年龄。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22381
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_e7a7aeb8:

    # a "Unfortunately for her, the naval world is an unyielding one. Steeped in a long and honored tradition, it rarely allows for the bending of its rules—even for someone like her."
    a "不幸的是，海军世界是个严苛的世界。它浸淫在悠久而光荣的传统中，很少允许规则被打破——即使是对她这样的人也不例外。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22383
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_0684b8af:

    # a "And so she remains an able seaman for the foreseeable future, since anything more would likely begin to draw too many questions."
    a "因此，在可预见的未来，她仍然只能是一名能干的水手，因为任何更高的职位都可能开始引来太多疑问。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22385
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_d4bf4318:

    # a "All the while some pampered, powdered midshipman gets his promotion to become an officer."
    a "而与此同时，某个娇生惯养、涂脂抹粉的海军候补少尉却获得了晋升，成为军官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22387
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_0be9cb2f:

    # a "That is just how it is...{w}And I don't think I have the strength to push against it."
    a "事情就是这样……{w}而且我觉得我没有力量去对抗它。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22389
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_e8575a68:

    # a "Even for her."
    a "即使是为了她。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22391
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_58cfeb4b:

    # a "I don't know if I'll ever see her get the recognition she deserves, but one can always hope."
    a "我不知道我是否能活着看到她得到应得的认可，但人总可以抱有希望。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22393
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_d8195c4b:

    # "You nod along."
    "你点头表示赞同。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22395
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_4e6dec3a:

    # p "I couldn't agree more, sir. She has been the best guide a newly appointed Landsman could hope for. I have no doubt that Julian and Wolf would tell you the same."
    p "我完全同意，长官。她是一位新任陆勤兵所能期望的最好的向导。我毫不怀疑朱利安和沃尔夫也会告诉您同样的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22397
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_94fea0ab:

    # "He waves your words off with one simple arc of his hand."
    "他简单地挥了一下手，打断了你的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22399
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_af11d624:

    # a "Which, by the looks of it, means she is worth just enough to be a useful bargaining chip."
    a "照此看来，这意味着她刚好够资格成为一枚有用的谈判筹码。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22401
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_f6ed344c:

    # a "How very thoughtful..."
    a "想得可真周到啊……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22405
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_48fd0f0e:

    # a "However, I am sure you had your reasons for why you made this choice."
    a "不过，我相信你做出这个选择自有你的理由。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22407
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_d465fb9e:

    # a "The matter at hand, then. Yes, you may stay."
    a "那么，眼前这件事。是的，你可以留下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22409
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_adb2b428:

    # a "Is that all you wanted?"
    a "这就是你想要的全部吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22411
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_ad2812b4:

    # "You hesitate, the suddenness of it all still takes you by surprise. After all the effort and all the stress over the last several days, it seems surreal to simply... get what you want."
    "你犹豫了，这一切来得太突然，让你措手不及。经过过去几天的所有努力和压力，就这样……得到了你想要的东西，感觉太不真实了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22413
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_4f5e6e46:

    # "After everything."
    "经历了这么多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22415
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_f95d12c7:

    # "Now all it takes is... {i}this?{/i}"
    "现在只需要……{i}这样？{/i}"

# game/script day12.rpy:22417
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_98435a84:

    # "The nagging thought creeps into your mind, the fear that you've overlooked something vital, that some crucial piece of this deal will only reveal itself after you've left the room."
    "一个烦人的念头悄悄钻进你的脑海，你害怕自己忽略了某个关键点，害怕这笔交易的某个关键部分只会在你离开房间后才显现出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22419
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_80f9e94e:

    # "But—no. You wanted to stay, and you've been allowed to stay."
    "但是——不。你想留下，而你也获准留下了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22426
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_bf875c04:

    # "You reach out to Arthur and offer your hand."
    "你向亚瑟伸出手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22428
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_774d45dd:

    # "He puts the pipe back between his lips and clasps your hand firmly, sealing the agreement between you."
    "他把烟斗放回唇间，紧紧握住你的手，确认了你们之间的协议。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22432
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_5b0a3fd2:

    # "His grip is just a little too tight, his eyes narrowing as he speaks."
    "他的握力有点过紧，说话时眯起了眼睛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22434
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_2420e753:

    # a "Utter a single word, Mr. [family_name], and you'd better possess an unshakable belief in your ability to swim."
    a "只要说出去一个字，[姓氏]先生，那你最好对自己游泳的能力有不可动摇的信念。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22436
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_f45106b4:

    # a "I hope I made myself clear."
    a "希望我说得够清楚了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22438
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_fd35bb99:

    # "You swallow and nod."
    "你咽了口唾沫，点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22440
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_b4908aaa:

    # p "Beyond a shadow of a doubt, sir."
    p "毫无疑问，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22444
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_ef85c08c:

    # a "Good."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22446
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_86e1d57e:

    # a "Then return to your duties. You wanted to stay, then make yourself useful."
    a "那就回去履行你的职责。你想留下，那就让自己派上用场。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22458
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_27fcb24b:

    # "He releases your hand, stands up and walks to the door, opening it for you."
    "他松开你的手，站起身走到门口，为你打开门。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22462
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_3e58e9c9:

    # a "As I said, I have other matters to attend to. I will inform the Captain that I have changed my recommendation regarding your dismissal."
    a "如我所说，我还有别的事要处理。我会通知船长，我已经改变了对你解雇的推荐意见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22464
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_48c15865:

    # "You step through the door, finally beginning to feel the tension in your body dissipate, and in its stead you feel the warm wave of relief."
    "你走出门，终于开始感觉到身体的紧张感逐渐消散，取而代之的是一股如释重负的暖流。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22466
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_752896f0:

    # p "Thank you again, sir. I truly appreciate that you were willing to listen and that we came to a reasonable compromise."
    p "再次感谢您，长官。我真心感谢您愿意倾听，并且我们达成了一个合理的妥协。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22468
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_da99733d:

    # p "Even if perhaps my method may have been unconventional."
    p "即使我的方法可能不太常规。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22472
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_e09845e9:

    # p "I just felt I was backed into a corner and needed to make sure I was heard."
    p "我只是觉得我被逼到了绝境，需要确保我的声音能被听到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22476
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_197d4339:

    # "Arthur gives a curt nod before turning back to his room and closing the door behind you."
    "亚瑟简短地点了点头，然后转身回到房间，在你身后关上了门。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22487
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_f410a221:

    # "You linger for a few moments, leaning against the wooden wall to take a few deep uninterrupted breaths."
    "你在门外逗留了片刻，倚着木墙，深深地、不受打扰地呼吸了几次。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22489
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_481dbdc3:

    # "Finally out of the lion's den."
    "终于离开虎穴了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22491
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_b60e2b8f:

    # "The smell of his pipe smoke still clings to your nose as you inhale, and gently let the breath escape through your lips again."
    "你吸气时，他的烟斗味还萦绕在你的鼻尖，然后你又轻轻地让气息从唇间呼出。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22493
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_81d1d4a7:

    # "Somehow it smells sweeter now."
    "不知怎的，现在闻起来竟有些甜了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22495
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_281931de:

    # "How quickly things can change."
    "事情的变化可真快啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22497
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_6fdf05a6:

    # p "I'm sorry, Samuel..."
    p "对不起，塞缪尔……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22499
translate Chinese day12_arthur_blackmail_with_samuel_658414dd:

    # "[He] would understand."
    "[他]会理解的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22514
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_72b91462:

    # p "You don't sound particularly worried."
    p "你听起来并不特别担心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22516
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_0ae6548d:

    # "You retort, trying to salvage things and pull back some of the initiative."
    "你反驳道，试图挽回局面，夺回一些主动权。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22520
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_2e34ac04:

    # a "And you seem less embarrassed than you actually sound."
    a "而你看上去，比你实际听起来要尴尬得多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22522
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_c8aeff6c:

    # p "I... Well. Surely it's none of your business what the rest of the crew gets up to."
    p "我……好吧。其他船员私下做什么，肯定不关你的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22524
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_38972cd4:

    # a "Depends entirely on the things they do get up to."
    a "这完全取决于他们私下到底做什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22528
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_ea5436c9:

    # a "Thievery and the like cannot be tolerated even when it happens only between crew, for example."
    a "例如，即使是船员之间发生的盗窃之类的事情，也不能容忍。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22532
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_ec26b868:

    # "Arthur seems to accept the drink, weighing it up in his hands while his gaze flickers about the cabin. Between you, the liquid, but for one fleeting moment below his waistline too."
    "亚瑟似乎接受了这杯酒，在手中掂量着，目光在船舱里游移。在你、酒液之间，甚至有那么一瞬间，落在了他腰线以下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22534
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_36697fcc:

    # p "I could... you know..."
    p "我可以……你知道的……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22538
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_70ffd027:

    # a "I know what?"
    a "知道什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22540
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_b600b0ca:

    # "You don't like the hesitation in his voice. You're after certainty."
    "你不喜欢他声音里的犹豫。你要的是确定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22542
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_fa2de31c:

    # p "Sweeten it further.{w} The deal, I mean."
    p "让它更甜一点。{w}我是说，这笔交易。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22544
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_78e8f241:

    # "Your own voice carries the same hesitation. Are you taking this too far? What if you do?"
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22546
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_9872d274:

    # "But, he seemed more amused than anything when you just told him about it. Telling him that you'd be ready to do it can't be that bad."
    "但是，你刚才告诉他时，他似乎更多的是觉得有趣。告诉他你愿意这么做，应该不会太糟。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22548
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_55a927b9:

    # "And if Arthur is, too... What would be the problem?"
    "而且如果亚瑟也……那会有什么问题呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22550
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_f6d8c3fa:

    # "Technically, you'd already resorted to sexual favors to give yourself a chance at staying aboard."
    "严格来说，你已经诉诸性贿赂来给自己争取留在船上的机会了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22552
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_15809dd6:

    # "You've got no high horse to get down off, after all."
    "毕竟，你也没什么道德高地可下了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22554
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_51ef9552:

    # p "Unless I'm not in trouble anymore."
    p "除非我已经没有麻烦了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22556
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_1a23aba0:

    # "He raises a brow as he regards you."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22558
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_0a907b0e:

    # a "Do you want to be?"
    a "你想有麻烦吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22560
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_eb0fcec5:

    # "He shoots back, followed by a slow, deep breath as he relaxes back into things."
    "他反问道，随后缓缓深吸一口气，放松下来，恢复了常态。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22562
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_b2f39255:

    # p "Not if I can help it, if you can believe that too."
    p "如果我能避免的话就不想，如果你也相信这一点的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22564
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_31af2927:

    # "You muse, taking a step back."
    "你沉思着，后退了一步。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22568
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_c57c2790:

    # a "Well, you can breathe a sigh then."
    a "那么，你可以松口气了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22572
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_e3a2a31d:

    # "He murmurs, taking another drink. You're starting to get used to the 'hearty' measures that he takes with every mouthful, no longer surprised that he doesn't smack his lips and sigh with every gulp."
    "他低声说，又喝了一口。你开始习惯他每一口都喝得那么“豪迈”，不再惊讶于他每吞一口都不咂嘴也不叹气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22574
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_e9d3a465:

    # a "As long as it doesn't break the rules, what you get up to off watch is not my concern."
    a "只要不违反规定，你非值勤时间做什么我不关心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22578
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_2e320be2:

    # a "Polishing someone off hasn't yet been added to the list of punishable offences."
    a "帮某人“擦枪”还没被列入可惩罚的罪行清单。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22580
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_5201a801:

    # "He whispers something to himself, but your ears are sharp enough to pick up the gist of it. Something about sailors having no qualms frequenting just about any brothel."
    "他低声自言自语，但你的耳朵足够敏锐，能听出大意。大概是说水手们对频繁光顾任何妓院都毫无顾忌之类的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22584
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_df2ff25b:

    # a "Though your little tumble with our passenger could be close. We have a duty to our passengers, you see."
    a "不过你和我们那位乘客的小小“滚床单”可能快接近底线了。你要知道，我们对乘客负有责任。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22588
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_9fe3f895:

    # p "I meant {i}our{/i} deal, sir."
    p "我指的是{i}我们{/i}的交易，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22590
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_b12755e1:

    # "You give an expectant pause, holding your tongue as you wait for Arthur's ears to flick towards you."
    "你停顿了一下，带着期待，缄口不言，等着亚瑟的耳朵转向你这边。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22592
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_1324aa0a:

    # p "How exactly are you finding it?"
    p "你觉得它到底怎么样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22594
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_88231851:

    # "You gesture to the drink, stepping closer and taking a sip from the measure he'd poured for you."
    "你指了指那杯酒，走近一些，从他为你倒的那份里抿了一口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22596
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_d7abd9ba:

    # "You've got to admit, it's not that bad, certainly better than the watered-down version you get with your rations."
    "你得承认，这还不赖，肯定比配给里兑水的那种好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22598
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_6f9bd355:

    # "It mellows your tongue, gently warming the rest of your body as the spirit begins to work its charms. He must surely feel it, too."
    "它柔润了你的舌头，随着酒劲开始发挥作用，温和地温暖了你的全身。他肯定也感觉到了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22602
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_3ca8009f:

    # a "I've tasted real slop on older ships."
    a "我在更老的船上尝过真正的劣酒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22604
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_50b56f49:

    # "Arthur wrinkles his face and you try to read it. Does he include your gift in that?"
    "亚瑟皱了皱脸，你试图解读他的表情。他把你的礼物也算在那里面了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22606
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_e0b95bf6:

    # "Did you misjudge the rum that badly?"
    "你对朗姆酒的判断有那么差吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22608
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_2ff27912:

    # "It tasted fine to you just now."
    "刚才你尝着明明挺好的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22610
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_e5885dd5:

    # p "I- I didn't realize it was that bad."
    p "我——我没意识到它那么差。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22612
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_e6e75233:

    # a "Why do you think I made such a face?"
    a "不然你以为我为什么做那种表情？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22616
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_d46e0702:

    # "Arthur snorts and shifts his weight onto one of the armrests of his chair."
    "亚瑟哼了一声，将身体重心移到椅子的一侧扶手上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22620
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_551b6d88:

    # a "I was thinking that you'd even fuck up making a deal."
    a "我刚才在想，你连做交易都能搞砸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22622
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_3208080c:

    # "He shakes his head, looking off into the mid distance. Eventually his eyes settle on the dark window panes of his cabin, as if the inky darkness swirling beyond held some invisible sway."
    "他摇摇头，目光望向远处。最后，他的目光落在他船舱漆黑的窗玻璃上，仿佛外面翻涌的墨色黑暗有着某种无形的力量。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22624
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_c31401b9:

    # "The moment proves a good one to size things up. Size him up and get an idea for what you'd be getting into."
    "这个时机正好可以用来掂量掂量。掂量掂量他，了解一下你将踏入的是怎样的境地。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22626
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_bb7a1237:

    # "Admittedly, you'd never found yourself eyeing him up, but now..."
    "诚然，你从未发现自己打量过他，但现在……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22628
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_e7a8826f:

    # "There was a sense of quietness to him, something thoughtful, even far-off. Like things reminded him of earlier days, perhaps when the world was simpler. Filled with less pessimism, more hope."
    "他身上有一种沉静的气质，一种深思熟虑，甚至有些遥远的感觉。仿佛某些事物让他想起了更早的时光，也许那时世界更简单。少一些悲观，多一些希望。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22630
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_606a24bb:

    # "It's certainly a surprise—you were expecting him to be some type of awful drunk. Grumpy, loud, or worse. Now it seemed like an invisible weight had been lifted from his shoulders, the ghosts banished back into the darkness."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22632
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_48bb1587:

    # "God. Perhaps it is the drink, but you even find him a bit attractive. Alluring in that sort of moody, but deep way."
    "天啊。也许是酒劲上来了，但你甚至觉得他有点吸引力。那种忧郁却深邃的感觉，很迷人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22634
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_7e882005:

    # p "I'm sorry sir, I didn't realize."
    p "对不起长官，我没意识到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22638
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_18295ba4:

    # "You sigh, giving a nervous half-chuckle."
    "你叹了口气，紧张地干笑了半声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22640
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_aad58219:

    # p "As I said, well-"
    p "就像我说的，好吧——"

# game/script day12.rpy:22642
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_bfa094a3:

    # "You try to swallow the lump in your throat, and the warm rush surging up deeper within you."
    "你试图咽下喉头的哽塞，以及体内深处涌起的温热冲动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22644
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_57fb07f5:

    # p "If it's not adequate well, as I said I would be ready to, maybe-"
    p "如果不够充分的话，嗯，正如我所说，我愿意，或许——"

# game/script day12.rpy:22646
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_5be058ce:

    # "Arthur turns his head away from the window slowly, eyes settling on you."
    "亚瑟缓缓将头从窗户那边转开，目光落在你身上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22648
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_8eb4db3c:

    # "Maybe it's the effect of the booze, but the calm confidence that he radiates gives you a little flutter."
    "也许是酒精的作用，但他散发出的那种沉静自信，让你心头微微一颤。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22650
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_e3863b32:

    # a "You can speak freely."
    a "你可以畅所欲言。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22652
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_46cbcce7:

    # "He waits a moment, before giving a further gentle prompt."
    "他等了一会儿，随后又温和地催促了一句。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22654
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_bdd4cad2:

    # a "None of this is official, after all."
    a "毕竟，这都不是正式场合。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22656
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_f3216e1c:

    # p "I'm aware."
    p "我知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22658
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_babbbcac:

    # "You swallow, trying to hold his gaze and not let your eyes betray you by dipping down, across his chest and towards the crux of the matter..."
    "你咽了口唾沫，努力迎着他的目光，不让自己的眼睛背叛你——不让它们垂下，扫过他的胸膛，飘向那关键之处……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22660
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_a647630e:

    # p "I'm well..."
    p "我很好……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22662
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_7bfb01ee:

    # "Go on. The rush of blood to your head seems to agree."
    "继续。涌上头部的热血似乎也赞同。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22664
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_1018fe00:

    # p "If you're wanting some pleasure, too-"
    p "如果你也想寻些乐子——"

# game/script day12.rpy:22666
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_8d99fa0a:

    # "You mumble something."
    "你含糊地嘟囔了一句。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22668
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_1d792f9d:

    # p "Purely to sweeten the deal."
    p "纯粹是为了让这笔交易更诱人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22670
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_ec3fb913:

    # "It's hard to believe you actually went and said that. But it's out there now, judging by the way his eyes widen and the low chuckle underneath his breath."
    "难以置信你居然真的去说了那句话。但话已出口，从他睁大的眼睛和那声低沉的轻笑来看，他显然听到了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22674
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_b867b9f9:

    # "Oh, he makes you squirm a little. Reaching for the bottle, pouring another measure. One for him, one for you, and taking a long, slow sip, as if savoring the moment."
    "哦，他让你有点坐立不安。他伸手拿起酒瓶，又倒了一份。一杯给他，一杯给你，然后长长地、慢慢地呷了一口，仿佛在品味这一刻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22676
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_1f8e38f0:

    # "It's hard to tell if he's playing a game, or just enjoying turning the screws on you."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22678
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_372c5a9e:

    # "You swallow, quelling your rising fear, and focus on studying the horse's features for clues. "
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22680
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_2fab8326:

    # "He hasn't told you to leave..."
    "他并没有叫你离开……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22682
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_6b2066f7:

    # "And at least the booze has made him relax a little..."
    "而且至少酒精让他放松了一些……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22684
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_35e3d62e:

    # "You remember in that moment the way Arthur grinned when you mentioned the nature of your acquisition..."
    "你那一刻想起了当你提到你获取（那东西）的性质时，亚瑟咧嘴笑的样子……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22686
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_e0fd93af:

    # "Hopefully you didn't misinterpret it."
    "但愿你没有误解那笑容的含义。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22688
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_fc97ffe0:

    # "You take a substantial, fortifying gulp of your drink. A warming spirit down your throat, loosening the tightness in your chest."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22690
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_e27375e9:

    # p "I'm sorry, sir."
    p "抱歉，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22692
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_3d5c0d4b:

    # "You stammer."
    "你结结巴巴地说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22694
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_e433b585:

    # p "Forgive me for being out of order-"
    p "请原谅我失礼了——"

# game/script day12.rpy:22698
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_48a4dda6:

    # a "Did I say that you were?"
    a "我说过你失礼了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22700
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_b105fa7f:

    # "His voice is deep, calm, smooth. Enough to hold you on the precipice between panic and relief."
    "他的声音低沉、平静、流畅。足以让你悬在恐慌与解脱之间的悬崖边上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22702
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_fbf00178:

    # "You take a moment to study the officer you'd just made an advance on, hoping the complications of rank have been swept away by his—your need."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22704
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_1a4815a4:

    # "You can't help but try to guess at what's going on behind those eyes—sizing you up, no doubt."
    "你忍不住试图猜测那双眼睛背后正在盘算什么——无疑是在掂量你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22706
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_075e4056:

    # "And, you admit, somewhere in the baser parts of your mind, you wouldn't mind seeing his thick, throbbing horsecock. You heard the stories about horses—who hasn't?"
    "而且，你承认，在你内心深处某个更原始的角落，你并不介意看看他那根粗壮、悸动的马屌。你听过关于马匹的传言——谁没听过呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22708
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_d6e8503e:

    # "His garments struggle to conceal it fully, even when he's just out on deck."
    "他的衣物甚至在他只是在甲板上时，都难以完全将其遮掩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22710
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_e9e29fc6:

    # p "You haven't exactly said. One way or the other."
    p "你并没有明确表态。是，或者不是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22714
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_5266098a:

    # "You break the silence, the horse's ears twitching like he'd forgotten you were there."
    "你打破了沉默，马匹的耳朵抽动了一下，好像他忘了你还在那儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22716
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_43190a8b:

    # a "You are serious about what you're offering?"
    a "你对你提出的（条件）是认真的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22718
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_4df5a028:

    # "He pauses, going very quiet."
    "他停顿了一下，变得非常安静。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22720
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_e3c261ec:

    # "In that moment your eyes give in, flicking down towards his groin. You nod almost instantly."
    "那一刻，你的眼睛投降了，向下瞥向他的胯部。你几乎立刻点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22722
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_f9129b94:

    # a "Hm."
    a "哼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22726
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_380bd13c:

    # a "I'd like to see you try."
    a "我倒想看看你怎么试。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22728
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_f56634a5:

    # "When your eyes drift up, away from his bulge that had just captivated your imagination, you're just as shocked to see him smiling."
    "当你的目光从他刚刚占据了你全部想象的鼓起部位向上移开时，你同样震惊地看到他脸上挂着微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22732
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_87ec8a08:

    # "You tilt your head and finish your measure. Half for courage. Half a hit to your pride."
    "你歪了歪头，喝完了你那份酒。一半为了壮胆。一半为了打击一下自尊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22734
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_f95a98b9:

    # "Arthur just watches, slipping into an expectant silence. The candles flickering low. The shadows, coming out to play."
    "亚瑟只是看着，陷入一种期待的沉默。烛火低垂摇曳。阴影，开始出来嬉戏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22741
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_780a73d4:

    # "You approach him with a cautious step, letting the liquid ease you into a hazy, pleasant buzz. An invisible sea surrounding you both, making all the world shrink away and conveniently, the considerations of rank and past conflict."
    "你小心翼翼地迈了一步靠近他，让酒精将你带入一种朦胧而愉悦的微醺状态。无形的海洋包围着你们俩，让整个世界都退去，顺便也带走了关于军衔和过往冲突的考量。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22745
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_621c669e:

    # a "It's a kind proposal, considering the amount you've polished off tonight."
    a "考虑到你今晚已经喝掉的量，这提议倒是挺体贴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22749
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_6e74d4eb:

    # "Arthur murmurs in half approval, noticing that you've made quite the dent in the bottle. But instead of confiscating your glass, he tops up your glass with a hearty measure, the drink splashing out over the rim."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22751
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_c5518508:

    # "Seems he's also quite under the influence, too."
    "看来他也醉得不轻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22755
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_5f1fe4e6:

    # a "Is this perhaps how it started with you and that fop?"
    a "你和那个花花公子的事，是不是也这么开始的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22757
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_9259df45:

    # p "Fop? Didn't you just say that I should be kind to our passenger."
    p "花花公子？你刚才不是说我应该对咱们的乘客客气点吗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22759
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_ed0e5fca:

    # "He laughs, no doubt aided by the alcohol."
    "他笑了，无疑有酒精的功劳。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22761
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_3b16c42c:

    # a "He ain't here, is he? So he's not going to hear it. {w}All proper he is, eh?"
    a "他又不在这儿，对吧？所以他听不见。{w}他可正派了，嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22765
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_2564c55e:

    # a "And ends up bedded by a landsman. Ah, what a story that was."
    a "结果却被一个旱鸭子给睡了。啊，那可真是个好故事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22767
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_0a5dd118:

    # a "Did he cry out your name while you spent yourself into him?"
    a "当你在他体内释放时，他有没有喊你的名字？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22771
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_6129fce2:

    # a "And ends up felt up by a landsman. Ah, what a story that was."
    a "结果却被一个旱鸭子给摸了。啊，那可真是个好故事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22773
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_1e98080a:

    # a "Hope the gentleman had a soft back end."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22775
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_df140bb8:

    # "Another soft chuckle escapes him."
    "他又发出一声轻柔的低笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22777
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_b243a9c2:

    # a "Did you spill something on his suit, or what did you do to have to make it up to him? I'm beginning to notice a pattern of you trying to solve all your problems this way."
    a "你是把什么东西洒在他西装上了，还是做了什么别的事需要补偿他？我开始发现你好像总想用这种方式解决所有问题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22779
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_66652ee1:

    # p "Nothing of the sort, sir."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22781
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_0b52a29e:

    # p "I just had my doubts that the bottle alone could satisfy."
    p "我只是怀疑光靠这瓶酒（或：光这样）就能满足。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22786
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_664753be:

    # p "I wasn't lying about it."
    p "我没撒谎。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22788
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_9bc5db19:

    # p "I did have my doubts that this alone could satisfy."
    p "我确实怀疑光靠这个（或：这样）就能满足。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22790
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_92d2610f:

    # "The big horse doesn't seem to take it the wrong way, even if you're too slow to realize you could offend him."
    "这匹大马似乎并没有往坏处想，即使你迟钝得没意识到可能会冒犯他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22794
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_20268082:

    # a "I'm more than twice your size. A bottle is nice, but are you sure you can fit a little more?"
    a "我的体型是你的两倍还多。一瓶酒是不错，但你确定你能承受更多一点吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22796
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_f3a78ce8:

    # p "That's certainly my hope."
    p "那正是我所希望的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22798
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_414867df:

    # "He grunts, his humor apparently turning harder with need."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:22804
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_2faade64:

    # "He leans forward, the fabric of his clothes straining. Even the shadows seem to be on side, the darkness enhancing his growing desire."
    "他向前倾身，衣服的布料绷紧了。连阴影似乎也站在他那边，黑暗更凸显了他不断增长的欲望。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22806
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_f9db4ecb:

    # a "You've probably learned already that boredom is quite the enemy between watches."
    a "你可能已经知道，在值勤间隙，无聊可是个大敌。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22808
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_7fd6e3db:

    # "He hesitates, going still."
    "他犹豫了，身体静止下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22812
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_0a731a77:

    # a "But the loneliness is worse."
    a "但孤独更糟。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22814
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_0572783b:

    # "You frown."
    "你皱起眉头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22816
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_90fe98e8:

    # p "Loneliness? I've barely managed to steal a moment to myself since I came aboard."
    p "孤独？自从我上船以来，几乎没偷到过属于自己的片刻时光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22818
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_45ecb852:

    # a "Not physical. Not in that way."
    a "不是身体上的。不是那种（空间上的）孤独。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22822
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_7be0e8b3:

    # "He gestures to the distance between you, barely a step apart."
    "他指了指你们之间的距离，不过一步之遥。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22824
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_76e11342:

    # a "More..."
    a "更像是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22826
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_5012d74d:

    # "He clenches his hand into a fist, and holds it against his heart."
    "他握紧拳头，抵在胸口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22828
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_f47b398a:

    # a "Sometimes... you feel..."
    a "有时候……你会觉得……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22830
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_d780519d:

    # "You take a deep breath and place your hand on his forearm, giving an encouraging squeeze."
    "你深吸一口气，将手放在他的前臂上，鼓励性地捏了捏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22832
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_25c6b997:

    # p "I think I get it."
    p "我想我明白。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22834
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_468e028f:

    # "You pause, unsure whether he'll continue."
    "你停顿了一下，不确定他是否会继续说下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22839
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_73488060:

    # "Instead, he shrugs the moment off and takes another drink."
    "相反，他耸耸肩摆脱了那个瞬间，又喝了一口酒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22841
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_e934cf7d:

    # "You do the same, letting whatever that moment was slip away."
    "你也照做了，让刚才那一刻无论是什么都悄然溜走。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22843
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_64f660bf:

    # "You didn't come here for that."
    "你来这儿不是为了那个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22845
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_2ed4211d:

    # p "Promise that this'll keep me aboard then?"
    p "那你能保证这样能让我留在船上吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:22849
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_245f9079:

    # "Your eyes flick down at his pent up state, persuading him to lean back in his chair. Once situated comfortably he gives you the silent nod you were after."
    "你的目光飞快地扫过他压抑的状态，说服他向后靠回椅子里。一旦坐舒服了，他给了你一个你一直期待的默许点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:22851
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_14e529df:

    # p "Let me show you I'm not an entirely useless sailor..."
    p "让我向你证明，我不是个完全没用的水手……"

# game/script day12.rpy:22855
translate Chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bj_075bec00:

    # "He grins, nostrils flaring, eager for what was to come."
