# game/script day12.rpy:23388
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_7d642ed0:

    # p "I remember first grasping their vastness when I was a boy—maybe twelve—out in the fields at night."
    p "我记得我第一次领会到它们的浩瀚是在我还是个男孩的时候——大概十二岁——夜晚在田野里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23392
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_d0d8afdb:

    # n "You worked the field at night?"
    n "你在夜晚干农活？"

# game/script day12.rpy:23394
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_66079751:

    # p "Feline eyesight."
    p "猫科动物的视力。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23398
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_83dffa0c:

    # n "Of course."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23400
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_a8b8301a:

    # "You glance at Arthur as you mention your presumed advantage, expecting a lecture or one of his sharp retorts. Instead, he meets your gaze evenly."
    "当你提及你假定的优势时，你瞥了亚瑟一眼，期待着一番说教或他尖锐的反驳。相反，他平静地迎上你的目光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23402
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_92159c13:

    # "You take it as an invitation to continue."
    "你把这当作是鼓励你继续说下去的邀请。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23404
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_b34285e3:

    # p "In any case, I don't know what stirred it, but one night, it hit me—this overwhelming realization of how immense the sky is. How small I was."
    p "无论如何，我不知道是什么触动了它，但有一天晚上，我突然意识到——一种压倒性的领悟，天空是多么浩瀚。我是多么渺小。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23406
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_0eb9aa7d:

    # p "Just a speck, even compared to the field I was lying in. Let alone the sky... or everything else."
    p "只是一个斑点，甚至相比我躺着的田野而言。更不用说天空……或一切其他事物了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23408
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_674bfce5:

    # p "I remember lying down with my back on the cool, damp soil, arms flung wide."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23410
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_61d4a373:

    # p "Nothing interrupting me. Just... {w}stillness. It was as if I could feel the breath of the night itself."
    p "没有任何打扰。只有……{w}寂静。仿佛我能感受到夜晚本身的呼吸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23414
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_da490a20:

    # "A speck..."
    "一个斑点……"

# game/script day12.rpy:23416
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_95b72521:

    # "Small...{p}Useless...{p}Just as Arthur assumes you to be."
    "渺小……{p}无用……{p}正如亚瑟认为你的那样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23418
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_ba0b1dcf:

    # "The horse seems lost in thought for a moment before his lips part again."
    "这匹马似乎沉思了片刻，然后再次开口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23420
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_00446c14:

    # a "That's quite the poetic thought, lad. I did not take you for being such a philosophical mind.{w} But what I meant was—are you mathematically inclined?"
    a "相当富有诗意的想法，小伙子。我没看出你还有如此哲思。{w}但我的意思是——你对数学有天赋吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:23423
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_667b7e10:

    # a "{cps=5000}That's quite the poetic thought, lad. I did not take you for being such a philosophical mind. But what I meant was—are you mathematically inclined?{/cps}" nointeract
    a "{cps=5000}相当富有诗意的想法，小伙子。我没看出你还有如此哲思。但我的意思是——你对数学有天赋吗？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day12.rpy:23429
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_6470de7a:

    # p "Well, I don't know if I'd be cut out for navigation, sir. But I did always prefer tasks that engaged the mind rather than the body. Numbers on a page seemed far more manageable than the soil under my hands."
    p "嗯，我不知道我是否适合航海，先生。但我确实一直更喜欢需要动脑而非体力的工作。纸上的数字似乎远比手中的泥土更容易掌控。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23431
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_5feae34d:

    # p "Though I assume keeping the books for a small homestead is leagues away from what is needed to guide a ship with confidence."
    p "不过我想，为一个小农庄记账，与自信地引导一艘船所需的能力相比，相差甚远。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23435
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_ab022e7b:

    # a "You would be correct in that assumption."
    a "你这个假设是正确的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23437
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_04d0ed5a:

    # n "Navigation has always seemed like such an elegant science. The idea that one can read the stars and know where they stand in the vastness of the world... It is remarkable."
    n "航海术一直像是一门优雅的科学。一个人可以通过阅读星星就知道自己在这广阔世界中的位置……这很了不起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23439
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_1daa123a:

    # n "Polaris is the star used for navigation at night, is it not?"
    n "北极星是夜间用于导航的星星，对吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:23443
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_edfb8ed9:

    # "Arthur nods, turning his gaze to the sky."
    "亚瑟点点头，将目光转向天空。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23447
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_92e6652e:

    # "He scans the stars for a moment before pointing toward a dark patch of clouds, barely visible against the night's backdrop."
    "他扫视星空片刻，然后指向一片黑暗的云层，在夜空背景下几乎看不见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23451
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_92f3284a:

    # a "Quite right. Polaris is the most well-known, but it's hardly the only fixed celestial body we use. There are dozens: Pollux, Antares, or the first star of Aries. In moments like this, when Polaris is hidden, we turn to one of them."
    a "很对。北极星是最著名的，但它远非我们使用的唯一固定天体。还有几十个：北河三、心宿二，或白羊座的第一颗星。在像现在这样北极星被遮挡的时刻，我们就转向它们中的一个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23453
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_02bd6a53:

    # a "I will keep it brief to not overwhelm the esteemed gentlemen with too many of the details. We calculate our position east or west using the local hour angle of a celestial body. Then, we use its declination, or latitude, to determine our position north or south."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23455
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_b7a3ab6f:

    # a "Of course, these calculations can also be done in reference to the sun, moon, or even planets. And to make the navigator's life easier, we're fortunate to have yearly published Nautical Almanacs and Ephemerides at hand."
    a "当然，这些计算也可以参照太阳、月亮甚至行星来进行。而且为了让航海者的生活更轻松，我们很幸运手头有每年出版的天文年历和星历表。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23457
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_e01b6e68:

    # a "These records detail the expected positions of celestial objects at any given time of the year."
    a "这些记录详细说明了天体在一年中任何特定时间的预期位置。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23459
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_5315af9a:

    # a "It's a truly ingenious system, refined over centuries by some of the greatest minds the world has ever known."
    a "这是一个真正巧妙的体系，由一些世界上已知的最伟大的头脑历经几个世纪完善而成。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23461
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_00fa5c16:

    # n "It does sound like it."
    n "听起来确实如此。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23463
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_df3bb1da:

    # "The painted dog looks more confused now than he did before."
    "这只非洲野狗现在看起来比之前更困惑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23467
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_18f44c66:

    # a "And the advancements continue. Just recently, our ship was equipped with a rather fine naval chronometer—despite my own reservations—an innovation that allows for remarkably precise timekeeping, even against the rigors of the open sea."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23469
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_1a9f1af7:

    # a "Theoretically, with it, we no longer need to rely so heavily on methods like using the moon to measure time."
    a "理论上，有了它，我们不再需要如此依赖像用月亮来测量时间这样的方法。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23471
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_511e3e2b:

    # a "Before this, chronometers were too delicate to endure the constant movement of a ship at sea. Precision is everything in our calculations, and without precise timekeeping, we may find ourselves in France instead."
    a "在此之前，计时器太脆弱，无法承受海上船只持续不断的运动。在我们的计算中，精确就是一切，如果没有精确的计时，我们可能会发现自己到了法国。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23475
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_d03da14b:

    # a "A most terrible fate, no doubt!"
    a "无疑是最可怕的命运！"

# game/script day12.rpy:23477
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_ddb0e20d:

    # "Nomax joins Arthur's laugh after a moment, more out of courtesy than anything else."
    "诺马克斯过了一会儿也加入了亚瑟的笑声，更多是出于礼貌而非其他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23481
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_50382575:

    # n "Quite, sir."
    n "确实如此，先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23488
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_89811cac:

    # p "Oh, um, well I don't know if I'd be cut out for navigation. I've always been more comfortable with the work I know—hauling crates, fixing fences, that sort of thing."
    p "哦，嗯，我不知道我是否适合航海。我一直更习惯我做熟的工作——搬运板条箱、修理栅栏，诸如此类。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23490
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_36eff5bb:

    # p "Which is probably why I've enjoyed my time as a deckhand as much as I did."
    p "这可能也是为什么我如此享受我作为水手的时光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23492
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_208d6d16:

    # p "I fear I would make a terrible navigator."
    p "我恐怕会成为一个糟糕的航海士。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23494
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_80799543:

    # a "Very well."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23498
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_e5b055aa:

    # "Arthur nods, turning his gaze to the stars."
    "亚瑟点点头，将目光转向星星。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23500
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_6def315f:

    # a "Knowing your capabilities is hardly a fault, though I've yet to see much of the physical prowess you speak of, Mr. [family_name]."
    a "了解自己的能力并非过错，尽管我还没怎么看到你所说的身体上的过人之处，[姓]先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23502
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_2d3a7270:

    # a "You still look rather uneasy up in the rigging. To the point where I considered keeping you confined to the deck instead."
    a "你在索具上看起来仍然相当不稳。以至于我曾考虑把你限制在甲板上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23504
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_771acbd2:

    # n "From what I understand, Mr. [family_name] is new to the ship, yes? In that case, I think his progress is quite admirable."
    n "据我所知，[姓]先生是船上的新人，对吗？那样的话，我认为他的进步相当令人钦佩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23506
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_c58d588a:

    # n "I do not believe I could manage his work myself."
    n "我觉得我自己可能无法胜任他的工作。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23508
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_4f8c2db5:

    # p "Your trust despite my shortcomings is appreciated, sir."
    p "先生，尽管我有诸多不足，您仍给予信任，我深表感激。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23512
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_c97e32ba:

    # a "{i}Trust{/i} may be a strong word, lad."
    a "{i}信任{/i}这个词可能有点重了，小子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23514
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_79a43eaf:

    # n "Mr. Hudson, have there been any notable advancements in navigation recently? I can only speak for my own field of study, of course, but there have been quite a few remarkable discoveries of late, and I wondered if the same applied here."
    n "哈德逊先生，最近航海学方面有什么显著的进展吗？当然，我只能就我自己研究的领域谈谈，近来确实有不少了不起的发现，所以我想知道这里是否也一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23518
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_3e9e9a77:

    # "Though hard to see in the dim light, you catch a faint smile tugging at Arthur's lips."
    "虽然光线昏暗难以看清，但你捕捉到亚瑟嘴角隐约浮现的一丝笑意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23520
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_c763a7ec:

    # "There's pride in that smile, quiet but unmistakable."
    "那笑容里带着骄傲，虽不张扬却清晰可辨。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23522
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_2bb7ebb5:

    # a "Indeed, there have been. Our ship, for example, now boasts a state-of-the-art naval chronometer."
    a "确实有。例如，我们的船现在配备了一台最先进的海军计时器。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23524
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_d23e4378:

    # a "Until recently, chronometers couldn't withstand the rigors of a ship at sea. And in navigation, precision is paramount—accurate timekeeping is crucial for calculating our accurate position."
    a "直到不久前，计时器还无法承受海上航行的严酷环境。而在航海中，精确性至关重要——准确计时对于计算我们的精确位置是必不可少的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23526
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_b97fa1d4:

    # a "It's an expensive device, but even against my expectations it has proven remarkably reliable so far, allowing us to chart our position east or west on Earth with far greater ease than before."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23530
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_209b12d6:

    # n "It must be fascinating to work in a field that merges centuries of tradition with the newest innovations."
    n "在一个融合了数百年传统与最新创新的领域工作，想必非常吸引人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23532
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_dca742d1:

    # n "I can only imagine. It seems that ever-increasing precision is something that permeates every field of study in our time."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23534
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_9d079ab4:

    # a "I am certain the Captain would be more than happy to show it to you. It is quite the magnificent device, and I am sure the gentleman would find it fascinating."
    a "我确信船长会非常乐意展示给您看。那是件相当了不起的设备，我相信这位先生也会觉得它很迷人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23538
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_2c3011c5:

    # n "Oh, that would be lovely indeed."
    n "哦，那确实太好了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23540
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_e2a6f1d6:

    # a "While it has served us well thus far, we still conduct regular calculations to ensure it doesn't err. One should never put blind faith in even the finest instruments, and the old ways done diligently have always gotten us where we needed to be."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23546
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_5e65c0b1:

    # "Nomax nods along attentively, clearly captivated by the lesson. His ears tilt slightly forward as he listens."
    "诺玛克斯专注地点头附和，显然被这番讲解吸引住了。他聆听时，耳朵微微向前倾斜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23548
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_84130320:

    # n "I will gladly welcome any advancement that makes this voyage safer."
    n "任何能让这次航行更安全的进步，我都欣然欢迎。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23552
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_3450bfa4:

    # a "The gentleman can rest assured—there is nothing to fear. The Captain and crew are most capable, and I would trust them with my life."
    a "先生请放心——没什么可担心的。船长和船员们都极为能干，我愿以性命相托。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23554
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_7316fd40:

    # n "I have yet to see anything to make me doubt those words, Mr. Hudson. Still, this gentleman was not born with his sea-legs, and any reassurance is a welcome balm to ease my worries."
    n "哈德逊先生，我至今还没看到任何让我怀疑这些话的事。不过，这位先生并非天生就适应海上生活，任何能宽慰人心的话，对于缓解我的忧虑都是受欢迎的安抚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23558
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_65d51b5e:

    # n "Speaking of advancements... Has there not been some recent experimentation with alternate methods of ship propulsion?"
    n "说到进步……最近不是有一些关于船舶推进替代方法的实验吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:23563
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_4fbf99d1:

    # "The painted dog brings a hand to his chin, rubbing thoughtfully before continuing."
    "那位花斑狗将一只手搭在下巴上，若有所思地摩挲着，然后继续说道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23565
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_ce40e9b3:

    # n "I believe I faintly recall a broadsheet mentioning some gentleman who presented a boat capable of moving purely through the power of steam."
    n "我隐约记得一份小报提到，有位绅士展示了一艘仅靠蒸汽动力就能行驶的船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23567
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_75abd40b:

    # n "Somehow..."
    n "不知怎么的……"

# game/script day12.rpy:23569
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_bd61eb8e:

    # n "Unfortunately the name of the good gent escapes me."
    n "可惜那位好心的绅士的名字我想不起来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23573
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_ea4fad16:

    # "Arthur's faint smile fades entirely, replaced by a stern, almost disapproving expression. He turns his head, giving a dismissive wave of his hand."
    "亚瑟那隐约的微笑完全消失了，取而代之的是一种严肃、近乎不赞成的表情。他转过头，不以为然地挥了挥手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23577
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_af32b05f:

    # a "I have heard the stories."
    a "我听说过那些传闻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23579
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_8b79e921:

    # a "A misplaced effort in my view. All they make is for nice toys, to dazzle dreamers, and separate them from their money."
    a "在我看来，那是用错了力气。他们造出来的不过是些漂亮的玩具，用来迷惑梦想家，并从他们口袋里掏钱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23581
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_54c4fbff:

    # a "They are novelties, nothing more. They're costly, fragile. If one small cog fails, the whole ship is useless."
    a "它们只是新奇玩意儿，仅此而已。又昂贵，又脆弱。只要一个小齿轮出故障，整艘船就废了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23583
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_3948dd48:

    # a "The wind has dutifully moved ships since time immemorial. And besides, sir—would you sleep comfortably knowing there's a blazing furnace sitting below deck, waiting for a stray spark to ignite it?"
    a "自远古以来，风就恪尽职守地推动着船只。而且，先生——如果知道甲板下有个熊熊燃烧的炉子，等着一点火星将其点燃，您还能睡得安稳吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:23585
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_52d69592:

    # a "Navy ships already have to deal with extensive precautions to minimize the chance of the magazine storage igniting and blowing up the ship. And they do not have to deal with an active fire of the magnitude needed to move a vessel of this size."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23589
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_86491876:

    # n "Now, when you put it like that..."
    n "嗯，听您这么一说……"

# game/script day12.rpy:23591
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_cb49b8e8:

    # a "No, I think what they {i}should{/i} be working on is a way to allow us to put out more sail, or build hulls that allow us to cut through the water with more ease."
    a "不，我认为他们{i}应该{/i}研究的是如何让我们能挂起更多帆，或者建造能更轻松破开水流的船体。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23595
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_1a4acf86:

    # n "I can certainly understand the reluctance. It is a world with change coming for us all. More visible for some than for others."
    n "我当然能理解这种不情愿。这是一个变化正在向我们所有人袭来的世界。对某些人来说，这变化比其他人更显而易见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23597
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_4612a3c7:

    # n "And for me, well, I am living the change right now."
    n "至于我，嗯，我现在就正经历着变化。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23599
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_d2c40ef8:

    # n "Ships.{w} Not the change I expected."
    n "船。{w} 不是我预想中的那种变化。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23609
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_f528c9ff:

    # "While the two are caught up in their conversation, you slowly drift toward the edge of the deck."
    "当两人沉浸于交谈时，你慢慢地向甲板边缘挪去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23611
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_nomax_1da99741:

    # "The gunwale is still damp beneath your palm, the wood cold and rough to the touch. Below, the faint outlines of waves slip by, as the ship glides steadily through the water, and you wait for your moment to hopefully pull one of them aside."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23631
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_abb9e682:

    # n "But if the two gentlemen would excuse me, it is growing rather late, and I believe it is best for me to retreat to my cabin."
    n "但如果两位先生允许的话，天色已晚，我想我最好回船舱休息了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23640
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_d6e7450b:

    # n "I greatly appreciate the time you have taken out of your undoubtedly busy schedule to explain the ship's operation, sir."
    n "先生，非常感谢您在百忙之中抽出时间讲解船舶的运作。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23642
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_d0c60734:

    # n "I will be sure to ask the Captain about the chronometer tomorrow, assuming I can catch him during a quiet hour."
    n "明天我一定会向船长请教计时器的事，前提是我能在他空闲时找到他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23649
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_fd06733e:

    # "You watch as the painted dog gives a courteous bow, including you in his goodbyes with a quick, polite nod."
    "你看着那位花斑狗礼貌地鞠躬告别，并迅速而礼貌地朝你点头致意，将你也包含在他的告别中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23655
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_bacc1df9:

    # "At least you won't have to risk appearing rude when asking to speak to Arthur."
    "至少，当你想和亚瑟说话时，不必冒着显得失礼的风险了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23666
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_55dd510a:

    # "As Nomax steps away, Arthur shifts, clearly intending to leave as well. You're not sure what compels you to reach out, but your hand catches his arm before you can think better of it."
    "诺玛克斯离开后，亚瑟动了动，显然也打算离开。你不确定是什么驱使你伸出手，但在你来得及细想之前，你的手已经抓住了他的胳膊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23668
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_2e913e30:

    # a "You may return to your duties, recr-"
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23670
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_bf7b8bc1:

    # p "Sir, before I do, may I have a moment to talk?"
    p "先生，在此之前，我能和您谈一会儿吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:23678
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_49ce9681:

    # "He turns to face you fully and you let go of his cuff, suddenly very aware of your boldness."
    "他完全转过身来面对你，你松开了他的袖口，突然强烈地意识到自己的大胆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23680
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_6e748018:

    # "You know you have to be careful in your position, no matter how much you want an explanation from him."
    "你知道在自己的位置上必须小心谨慎，无论你多么想从他那里得到一个解释。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23682
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_89d97367:

    # "After all, he is still the first mate."
    "毕竟，他仍然是副船长。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23688
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_274ad1ac:

    # a "We do not need to talk about it."
    a "我们不需要谈这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23690
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_11bdc346:

    # a "What happened in my cabin. Forget about it. It never happened."
    a "在我船舱里发生的事。忘了吧。就当从未发生过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23692
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c2362d40:

    # a "You're not the first sailor in history who performed acts like that and you won't be the last—and the less said about my lapse in judgment the better."
    a "你不是历史上第一个做出那种举动的船员，也不会是最后一个——至于我判断失误的事，提得越少越好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23694
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_91a3913a:

    # p "No, sir. That's not what I-"
    p "不，先生。我不是要——"

# game/script day12.rpy:23696
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_3fd60b34:

    # a "There is nothing to talk about, Mr. [family_name]. Return to your duties."
    a "没什么好谈的，[姓氏]先生。回去值勤。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23698
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_46d9ef85:

    # p "I just... I wanted to say that I appreciate you allowing me to come along and learn alongside the passenger."
    p "我只是……我想说，感谢您允许我随行，并与乘客一同学习。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23702
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_5795200a:

    # p "And it's no surprise you have such a wealth of knowledge, sir."
    p "而且，先生，您拥有如此丰富的知识，一点也不奇怪。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23706
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_0b5e09ef:

    # "For a moment, he doesn't respond. Turning to the gunwale, he places both hands on the damp wood, his gaze fixed on the dark expanse of ocean stretching endlessly beyond the ship."
    "有一会儿，他没有回应。他转向船舷，双手放在潮湿的木头上，目光凝视着船外那无边无际、延伸至远方的黑暗海面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23708
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_26c8c55e:

    # a ". . ."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23712
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_196f5a03:

    # a "What do you want?"
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23718
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_68883ae6:

    # a "You may join the others during the noon navigation lesson next Friday, if you're interested in furthering your learning."
    a "如果你有兴趣进一步学习，下周五中午的航海课你可以和其他人一起参加。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23720
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_a74e57a0:

    # a "But I doubt that's the reason you stopped me, is it?"
    a "但我怀疑这不是你拦住我的原因，对吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:23724
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_52a672bd:

    # a "I don't believe this is about furthering your education, recruit."
    a "我不认为这是为了继续深造，新兵。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23726
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_a811f11f:

    # a "You want to talk about something else."
    a "你想谈点别的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23728
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_12cd3a24:

    # p "Well..."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23730
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_feed9356:

    # "You feel that flicker of tension ripple through you—as familiar as it is unwelcome."
    "你感到那熟悉的、令人不快的紧张感再次掠过全身。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23732
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_5f9c89cb:

    # "The same tension you feel every time you have to face his unyielding demeanor."
    "那是每次不得不面对他那不容置辩的态度时，你都会感受到的同样的紧张。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23736
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_b251933f:

    # p "To be honest, sir. I don't quite know how to ask."
    p "老实说，先生。我不太知道该怎么问。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23740
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_1360db6e:

    # p "No, sir. I just don't quite know how to ask."
    p "不，先生。我只是不太知道该怎么问。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23744
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_2afb3008:

    # a "That's because there's nothing for you to ask."
    a "那是因为你没什么可问的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23749
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_6e8cb0fb:

    # a "As far as I'm concerned, the chapter is closed. All you need to know is that you've been allowed to remain aboard this ship."
    a "就我而言，这一章已经结束了。你只需要知道，你被允许继续留在这艘船上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23755
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_7895c958:

    # a "I've informed the Captain of my recommendation. He agreed with my assessment and reinstated you into the crew's planning. The quartermaster has been instructed to ensure your continued pay and provisions."
    a "我已将我的建议告知船长。他同意我的评估，并将你重新纳入船员的规划中。军需官已接到指示，确保你的薪水和补给照常发放。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23757
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_89ab3e0b:

    # a "That should be clear enough for you, or would you disagree?"
    a "这对你应该够清楚了吧，还是你有不同意见？"

# game/script day12.rpy:23759
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_13276512:

    # "You open your muzzle, but no sound comes out at first."
    "你张开嘴，但起初没有发出声音。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23761
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_300701d2:

    # p "I..."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23766
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_0a18d4c7:

    # "The heavy beat of your heart pounds loudly in your chest."
    "你胸口的心跳沉重而响亮。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23770
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_4d433c84:

    # p "I guess so, sir."
    p "我想是的，先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23772
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_52de88ce:

    # a "Then return to your duties. I have more important matters to attend to."
    a "那就回去值勤。我还有更重要的事要处理。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23784
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_84a82409:

    # "He turns away from you and you watch him meander toward the stern, his form disappearing into the shadows of the ship's wood, until even your sharp eyes can barely make him out as he enters the ship through the hatch."
    "他转身离开你，你看着他缓步走向船尾，身影逐渐消失在船木的阴影中，直到他通过舱口进入船舱，即使是你敏锐的双眼也几乎无法辨认出他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23789
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_09a507fc:

    # "For a moment, you just stand there, the wind tugging at your fur when you notice a strange faint blue glow hitting the sides of the mast."
    "有那么一会儿，你只是站在那里，风拉扯着你的毛发，这时你注意到桅杆侧面映着一道奇异的微弱蓝光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23797
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_97b2f272:

    # "You look around the deck of the ship but can't spot the source of it at first, until you notice that it's actually coming from beyond the ship."
    "你环顾船的甲板，起初找不到光源，直到你发现那光实际上来自船外。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23801
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_d3e8cd6e:

    # p "With all due respect, sir, I think I would disagree."
    p "恕我直言，先生，我想我会有不同看法。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23811
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_262f7918:

    # "There it was.{w} The skipping of a heartbeat."
    "来了。{w} 心跳漏了一拍。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23813
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_a88ade9e:

    # "Anxiety ratchets up within you as silence stretches between the two of you."
    "随着你们两人之间的沉默持续，焦虑在你心中加剧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23820
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_f42fb95c:

    # "You watch the dark shape of his chest rise in a deep breath, appearing as if it is bathed in a subtle, almost otherworldly seeming, blue glow."
    "你看到他黑暗的胸膛轮廓随着深呼吸而起伏，仿佛沐浴在一种微妙的、近乎超自然的蓝色光芒中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23822
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_3f436ee6:

    # "Summoning every ounce of restraint, you force your voice to remain soft, careful not to let it sound accusatory."
    "你调动起每一分克制力，迫使自己的声音保持轻柔，小心翼翼地不让它听起来像是指责。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23824
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_86462934:

    # p "Sir, I'm not trying to question your decisions. I simply...{w} I want to understand is all."
    p "先生，我不是要质疑您的决定。我只是……{w} 我只是想弄明白。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23828
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_aa1959d6:

    # p "I don't want you to think ill of me. To think of me as just a sailor who is around because of... because of {i}that{/i}. But beyond that I want to understand what caused me to end up in this situation in the first place."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23830
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_aeae3ef9:

    # p "I want to understand and do better in the future and prove myself as part of this crew—a crew that you can trust, just as you trust Samuel, Konrad, and the others."
    p "我想弄明白，并在未来做得更好，证明自己是这船员中的一员——一个您可以信任的船员，就像您信任塞缪尔、康拉德和其他人一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23833
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_953846fe:

    # p "So that I can do better in the future and prove myself as part of this crew—a crew that you can trust, just as you trust Samuel, Konrad, and the others."
    p "这样我就能在未来做得更好，证明自己是这船员中的一员——一个您可以信任的船员，就像您信任塞缪尔、康拉德和其他人一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23835
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_43970704:

    # p "Trust with your life.{w} As you said."
    p "以性命相托。{w} 正如您所说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23837
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_5e3cf706:

    # p "But even now—despite being allowed to stay—I can't help but feel I'm only being tolerated.{w} Sir."
    p "但即使是现在——尽管被允许留下——我还是忍不住觉得我只是被容忍着。{w} 先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23841
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_9fe84d75:

    # a "Does it come as a surprise that you'll need to earn respect again?"
    a "你需要重新赢得尊重，这让你感到意外吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:23843
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_1455efb0:

    # p "It does not, but then surely it is to everyone's advantage if I know what it was that made you-...{w} What {i}I{/i} did to almost be dismissed from this ship."
    p "并不意外，但如果我知道是什么让您——……{w} 知道{i}我{/i}做了什么差点被赶下船，那无疑对所有人都有好处。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23845
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_6cff1395:

    # a "You fell asleep during your-"
    a "你在值勤时睡着了——"

# game/script day12.rpy:23847
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_07aee34a:

    # p "Sir, that is by no means a punishment fitting for that offense, and you know that just as well."
    p "先生，那绝不是适合那种过错的惩罚，这一点您和我一样清楚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23858
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_2ae8d7b0:

    # a "It wasn't your first offense."
    a "那不是你第一次犯错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23860
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_75ea5278:

    # p "I didn't cause Samuel's injury, I-"
    p "我没有导致塞缪尔受伤，我——"

# game/script day12.rpy:23862
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_ae804f21:

    # a "Quite frankly I'm not concerned with the past in this matter, Mr. [family_name]. Nor should you be."
    a "坦率地说，[姓氏]先生，在这件事上我不关心过去。你也不应该关心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23864
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_5e3bb6dd:

    # a "If you can perform your duties to the standard required of you, then no one will have any complaints. As far as I'm concerned, that is all you need to know."
    a "如果你能按照要求的标准履行职责，那么就不会有人有怨言。就我而言，这就是你需要知道的全部。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23866
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_94e84c43:

    # p "But-"
    p "但是——"

# game/script day12.rpy:23870
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_b6032fd3:

    # a "This is not a matter up for discussion, Mr. [family_name]!" with vpunch
    a "这不是可以讨论的事，[姓氏]先生！" with vpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:23874
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_266d3d54:

    # "You swallow hard, the taste of reluctance bitter as you accept that pushing further would be a mistake."
    "你艰难地咽了口唾沫，不情愿的滋味苦涩难当，你明白再追问下去会是个错误。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23876
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_19aaa51f:

    # "He doesn't even look at you."
    "他甚至没有看你一眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23878
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_132b60d3:

    # "His gaze stays fixed on the dark sea. The blue glow appears to have strengthened by now, and you can see it shift across the firm features of his snout."
    "他的目光始终凝视着漆黑的海面。此刻那蓝色幽光似乎愈发强烈，你能看见光芒在他坚毅鼻吻的轮廓上流转。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23880
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_3e59e54a:

    # "You take a hesitant step toward the gunwale, the cold wood beneath your paw still wet from the earlier storm."
    "你迟疑地朝船舷迈了一步，爪下冰冷的木板仍因先前的暴风雨而潮湿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23899
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_9b9710d0:

    # "As you step closer to it, you realize the water beneath the ship is not the pitch black you expect it to be."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23901
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_4f852cb4:

    # "Instead, the sea glows—a soft, brilliant blue shimmer that follows the ship's bow, spreading outward like liquid light."
    "相反，大海在发光——一种柔和、耀眼的蓝色微光追随着船首，如液态光芒般向外蔓延。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23903
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_16b63f8a:

    # "The sight catches your breath. It looks almost like glowing mists, as though the ship itself were floating on clouds of light."
    "这景象令你屏息。它看起来几乎像发光的薄雾，仿佛整艘船正漂浮在光云之上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23905
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_6580acd0:

    # "You glance toward the stern, where the glow trails in her wake, fading slowly back into the dark. The waves ripple with it, their peaks glinting turquoise like snow-capped mountains."
    "你瞥向船尾，光芒在航迹中拖曳，缓缓消融于黑暗。波浪随之荡漾，浪峰闪烁着绿松石般的光泽，宛如覆雪的山峦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23909
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_951a5f8c:

    # "From the corner of your eye, you notice others gathering. One by one, the sailors gather to watch the spectacle just as you are."
    "眼角的余光让你注意到其他人正在聚集。水手们一个接一个聚拢过来，如同你一样注视着这奇景。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23911
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_548418cc:

    # "You hear the voices around you, ome filled with a hint of unease, whispering superstitions, while others just marvel at the sight."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23913
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c15fc298:

    # "You settle down where you are right now, crossing your arms over the gunwale to look out into the ocean."
    "你在原地安顿下来，双臂交叠搭在船舷上，眺望着海洋。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23915
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_46828cfe:

    # "Yet you struggle to feel the same sense of wonder as them."
    "然而你很难感受到与他们相同的惊奇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23917
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_f40a6c68:

    # "Too many thoughts swirl in your head."
    "太多思绪在你脑中盘旋。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23922
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_5fd2822f:

    # "Among the crew, yet feeling ever more solitary."
    "身处于船员之中，却感到愈发孤独。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23924
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c9fe5e05:

    # "Thinking about what's ahead."
    "思考着前路。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23926
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c6089666:

    # "Morocco.{w} Firm ground again, before then sailing further south."
    "摩洛哥。{w} 再次踏上坚实的土地，然后继续向南航行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23928
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_afc23323:

    # "Perhaps it'll do you good."
    "或许这对你有好处。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23930
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_9636ffc9:

    # "Warmth, you think. It'll be warm. You already feel it now—the sun pressing down through the salt-stained wind."
    "温暖，你想。会很温暖。你现在已经能感觉到——阳光穿透咸涩的海风灼灼压下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23932
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_a030f6dc:

    # "Dry, too. You heard people talk about the great desert in Northern Africa. Talking about it like it's a vast emptiness beyond anything your mind can really grasp."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23934
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_7efd66b2:

    # "Weeks, if not months of nothingness before you reach anything beyond it."
    "需要数周，甚至数月穿越那片荒芜，才能抵达彼岸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23936
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_cc808d64:

    # "It'll be a strange new place for you, no doubt."
    "对你而言，那无疑将是个陌生的新地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23941
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_0c2473b7:

    # "Suddenly a voice breaks through to you. {p}Samuel."
    "突然一个声音打断了你的思绪。 {p}塞缪尔。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23950
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_5fd7e08c:

    # "You look over your shoulder to find [him] perched among the crew in the shrouds."
    "你扭头望去，发现[他]正蹲在索具间的船员群里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23955
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_d2671d90:

    # "Noticing you, [he] slips down—effortless as always—and lands lightly at your side."
    "注意到你后，[他]滑了下来——一如既往地轻松自如——轻轻落在你身旁。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23960
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_b9afa881:

    # "Chipper as usual.{w} None the wiser."
    "像往常一样兴致勃勃。{w} 毫无察觉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23964
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_d5e13ad2:

    # s "Fucking hell, [name]. Seen anything like this before?"
    s "天啊，[名字]。以前见过这种景象吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:23966
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_cde92cc7:

    # p "No."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:23970
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c980ee6c:

    # s "Friend of mine says it's spirits, you know. Old sailors rising to the surface. Asking for offerings of rum, or seeing if there are sinners about that they'll drag straight to the bottom."
    s "我有个朋友说这是鬼魂，你知道的。老水手的亡魂浮上海面。要么讨要朗姆酒供奉，要么看看有没有罪人可供他们直接拖入海底。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23972
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_bb274242:

    # s "No idea if he's just talking bullshit, though."
    s "不过不知道他是不是在胡扯。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23974
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_8c50ac84:

    # s "He might."
    s "他可能真是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23976
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_48e4779a:

    # s "Usually does, really."
    s "说实话，他经常这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23978
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_69dfa885:

    # s "Funny guy. Terrible fisherman. He somehow managed to drop three fishing rods into the sea in one week."
    s "有趣的家伙。糟糕的渔夫。他居然能在一周内弄丢三根钓竿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23980
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_07b9b17d:

    # s "Since then, any fishing is off-limits for him. Wrestle the rod out of his hands if you must."
    s "自那以后，任何钓鱼活动都禁止他参与。必要时得把钓竿从他手里抢过来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23985
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_3b536dc0:

    # "[He] must have noticed because suddenly [his] hand is on your neck, squeezing playfully."
    "[他]一定察觉到了什么，因为突然间[他]的手搭上你的后颈，戏谑地捏了捏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23987
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_e72876e0:

    # s "Hey. What's wrong?"
    s "嘿。怎么了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:23989
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_3f85ffaa:

    # p "Nothing.{w} Just thinking, Sam."
    p "没事。{w} 只是在想事情，萨姆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23991
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_d08e0a2a:

    # p "You can go back to the others. I feel like I need a moment to myself."
    p "你可以回其他人那儿去。我想自己待一会儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23996
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_4d7a1715:

    # "The warmth of [his] touch vanishes from your neck"
    "[他]触碰带来的暖意从你颈间消失。"

# game/script day12.rpy:23998
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_bf5c93d6:

    # s "Oh...{w} Are you sure?"
    s "哦……{w} 你确定？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24000
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_57baada3:

    # s "Really? Nothing's wrong?"
    s "真的吗？没什么事？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24002
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_f768d046:

    # p "Nothing. It's just been a lot, and..."
    p "没有。只是最近事情太多，而且……"

# game/script day12.rpy:24004
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_094ef657:

    # p "You know how it can be..."
    p "你知道那种感觉……"

# game/script day12.rpy:24006
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_b528bb41:

    # s "I get you. Did it... did it go well with Arthur? I saw you two were talking."
    s "我懂你。和亚瑟……谈得顺利吗？我看到你们在说话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24015
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_273e74e6:

    # "You don't answer at first. Instead, you turn your face away, gaze falling into the glowing sea where the ship carves its slow, glowing scar through the night."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24017
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_a0cdf6ca:

    # p "Yeah."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24019
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_5e85681e:

    # p "It did."
    p "顺利。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24021
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_b64eb6a4:

    # s "Well... that's good, right?"
    s "嗯……那就好，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24023
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_a6b82da2:

    # s "So you're sticking around?"
    s "所以你会留下来？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24025
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_92c29ede:

    # "You nod stiffly."
    "你僵硬地点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24027
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_b50f8af3:

    # "For a moment the thought of confessing to Samuel flares inside of you like a spark, but you quickly push it to the back of your mind."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24029
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_a31acbcf:

    # "You can't."
    "你不能。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24031
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c87274eb:

    # "How would you even do it?"
    "你该怎么说出口？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24033
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_6b769ed8:

    # "\"Sorry Sam, I just had to use you to save my own hide.\""
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24035
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_1767f709:

    # "\"It was really convenient that I stumbled in on you two talking, or I would have been {i}really{/i} screwed.\""
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24037
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_4914da37:

    # "Yeah..."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24039
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c2512148:

    # "Great..."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24041
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c217afc1:

    # "Come on, keep it together, [name]."
    "好了，振作点，[名字]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24043
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_30f8d276:

    # "Just keep it a secret from [him]."
    "只要对[他]保密就好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24045
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_6caddb96:

    # "[He] doesn't have to know, and as long as [he] doesn't, it'll all be good."
    "[他]不必知道，只要[他]不知道，一切都会好的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24047
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_ec0f7538:

    # "Arthur left you no choice.{w} It's as simple as that."
    "亚瑟没给你选择余地。{w} 就这么简单。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24049
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_34f3b2ec:

    # "And as long as he keeps his word, you don't have to think about this."
    "只要他信守承诺，你就不必再想这件事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24051
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_eafceba0:

    # p "I'd really prefer to be alone, Sam..."
    p "我真的想一个人待着，萨姆……"

# game/script day12.rpy:24053
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_35641be0:

    # "You watch the light as it trails behind in the wake of the ship, stretching thinner and thinner before it disappears."
    "你注视着光芒在船尾航迹中拖曳，越来越细，直至消失。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24055
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_77a0d076:

    # "How long, you wonder, until it fades entirely?"
    "你想知道，还要多久它才会完全消散？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24061
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_240612da:

    # a "Isn't it beautiful?"
    a "很美，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24063
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_46ff06a4:

    # "You try to think of an answer, but the sight has stolen your voice. You can only stare, mesmerized by the ethereal glow spreading across the surface of the ocean."
    "你试图想出一个回答，但这景象夺走了你的声音。你只能凝视着，被那在海面铺展开来的空灵光芒所迷住。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24067
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_e415a5a7:

    # "The ship dips between the waves, sending a sudden burst of light from the bow. The water spray catches the glow, shimmering as it arcs through the air, but never quite high enough to reach you."
    "船身没入浪间，船首突然迸发出一片光芒。飞溅的水花捕捉到幽光，在空中划出弧线时闪烁微光，却始终够不到你所在的高度。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24069
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_faec4d34:

    # "Instead, you feel the cold wetness on your fingers and the salt-heavy air brushing your snout."
    "取而代之的，是你指尖感受到的冰冷湿意，以及拂过你鼻吻的、带着浓重咸味的空气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24071
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c9c42113:

    # p "What in the world...?"
    p "这到底是……？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24073
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_01742f5a:

    # p "What is happening? I've never seen anything like it."
    p "发生了什么？我从未见过这样的景象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24075
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_a2426674:

    # a "I've witnessed it before, as have many sailors before us.{w} But to tell you the truth, I don't know what it is."
    a "我以前见过，我们之前的许多水手也见过。{w} 但说实话，我也不知道这是什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24077
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_34d4a246:

    # a "On some nights, any disturbance seems to set the water aflame."
    a "在某些夜晚，任何扰动似乎都能让海水燃烧起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24086
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c3415ab1:

    # p "But... why?"
    p "但是……为什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24088
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_457cbc38:

    # a "I couldn't say, lad.{w} Magic? The devil? The spirits of sailors lost at sea? Perhaps King Neptune himself."
    a "我说不上来，小子。{w} 魔法？恶魔？葬身大海的水手亡魂？或许是海神尼普顿本人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24090
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_e55719dc:

    # a "Who can know for sure..."
    a "谁能确知呢……"

# game/script day12.rpy:24094
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_40b783b8:

    # a "Despite millennia of trying to conquer her, the sea still hides myriads of mysteries from us foolish mariners."
    a "尽管千百年来我们试图征服她，大海依然向我们这些愚蠢的水手隐藏着无数奥秘。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24099
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_9ca26d53:

    # a "Like the stars above, we can observe her waves and marvel at their beauty, but we may never know what truly stirs them in the depths below."
    a "就像头顶的星辰，我们可以观察她的波浪并惊叹其美丽，却可能永远无法知晓在深不可测的海底，究竟是什么真正搅动了它们。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24105
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_968f944d:

    # "Others of the crew begin to notice the glow, and soon, rugged hands join yours on the gunwale. One by one, the sailors gather to watch the spectacle just as you are."
    "其他船员也开始注意到光芒，很快，粗糙的手掌也像你一样搭上了船舷。水手们一个接一个聚拢过来，如同你一样注视着这奇景。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24107
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_1010fb44:

    # sailmullein "Sir, should we adjust course?!"
    sailmullein "长官，我们需要调整航向吗？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:24109
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_3b52d42c:

    # "You catch the hints of unease in some voices, hushed concerns about superstitions tied to the glowing waters."
    "你捕捉到一些声音里隐约的不安，关于发光海水所关联迷信传言的低声忧虑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24113
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_ea0c8788:

    # a "Did you hear anyone call for it, Mullein?"
    a "你听到有人要求调整航向吗，毛蕊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24115
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_35e33346:

    # sailmullein "No, sir."
    sailmullein "不会的，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24117
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_91822a74:

    # a "There's your answer."
    a "这就是你的答案。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24119
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_609e1c4a:

    # sailmullein "But... Sir-"
    sailmullein "但是……长官——"

# game/script day12.rpy:24123
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_75f9c1e8:

    # a "If you're so desperate for an order, tell the men to calm themselves."
    a "如果你这么迫切地需要命令，那就去让大家冷静下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24125
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_bc16d5bf:

    # sailmullein "Yessir."
    sailmullein "是，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24130
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_f6f53c8e:

    # "Those more intrigued than startled appear to search for a better vantage point and find their places up in the shrouds."
    "那些更多是好奇而非惊吓的人似乎想寻找更好的观察点，纷纷在索具上找到了位置。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24134
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_2a4c7b37:

    # "You watch sailors cling to the lines as the ship leans leeward, some of them are framed by the moon high up in the sky, its bright shine illuminating the edges of the clouds in a faint greenish tint."
    "你看着水手们在船身倾向背风面时紧抓缆绳，其中一些人的身影被高悬天空的明月勾勒出来，明亮的月光给云层边缘染上一抹淡淡的绿色。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24138
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_8a4c8707:

    # "Just then, a deep, shuddering creak rolls through the ship. It's nothing unusual—ships are alive with sounds like these—but at this moment, the noise sends a cold shiver down your spine and bristles your fur in response."
    "就在这时，一声低沉、震颤的嘎吱声滚过船体。这并不稀奇——船只本就充满了此类声响——但在这一刻，这声音让你脊背发凉，毛发也随之竖起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24140
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_838d342c:

    # p "We are safe... right?"
    p "我们是安全的……对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24142
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_79820b0f:

    # "Arthur returns a confident—if brief—nod."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24146
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_69f71a78:

    # a "As I said, lad, it's not the first time I've passed through burning seas like these. If it were a bad omen, I wouldn't be standing here now, would I?"
    a "如我所说，小子，这已不是我第一次穿越这样的“燃烧之海”了。如果这是凶兆，我现在也不会站在这里了，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24148
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_b34fc7aa:

    # a "Nor have I found any mention in naval reports that suggest otherwise. If my word is not enough to help ease your mind."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24150
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c66ae76e:

    # a "Though... they always attribute {i}some{/i} meaning to it."
    a "不过……他们总是给这现象赋予{i}某种{/i}意义。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24160
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_9bf35507:

    # "A blanket of silence falls over the deck—not a nervous one, but a quiet born of awe."
    "一片寂静笼罩了甲板——并非紧张的寂静，而是源于敬畏的宁静。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24162
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_b93548cb:

    # "The glow stretches further and further, until it seems the entire sea is draped in a soft, radiant blue, like fresh moonlit snow. You take a slow, deep breath, the calm coming from your first mate finally steadying you as well."
    "光芒蔓延得越来越远，直到仿佛整片大海都披上了一层柔和、明亮的蓝色，如同月光照耀下的新雪。你缓慢地深吸一口气，大副带来的平静终于也让你稳定下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24164
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_3332309f:

    # "Whatever this is, if it isn't dangerous, then perhaps you can let yourself enjoy it."
    "无论这是什么，只要没有危险，或许你可以允许自己享受它。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24166
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_5d45b4a5:

    # "If that heavy feeling in your stomach will allow it."
    "如果胃里那种沉甸甸的感觉允许的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24168
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_6ebb29ce:

    # "A harsher wave strikes the ship, and sends cold, glowing spray across your face. The wind bites as the moisture evaporates, leaving an uncomfortable chill in its wake."
    "一个更猛烈的浪头拍击船身，冰冷、发光的飞沫溅上你的脸庞。水分蒸发时寒风刺骨，留下一阵令人不适的寒意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24170
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_dc74f6c0:

    # "Leaning over the gunwale, you peer closer to the ship's side, where the strongest light radiates. The waves in her wake seem almost sculpted, casting long ridges of glowing peaks that stretch into the distance."
    "你俯身靠在船舷上，更近地窥视船侧光芒最盛之处。航迹中的波浪仿佛经过雕琢，投射出发光的浪峰长脊，向远方延伸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24174
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c5c830e9:

    # a "[name]?"
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24183
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_241b4708:

    # "Your ears snap to attention, and you straighten reflexively, pushing yourself upright."
    "你的耳朵猛地竖起，你反射性地挺直身体，将自己撑正。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24185
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_235911e9:

    # a "You did nothing wrong, lad."
    a "你没做错什么，小子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24187
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_3d07da6f:

    # "He hesitates, his voice dipping slightly, as though searching for words."
    "他犹豫了，声音略微低沉，仿佛在斟酌词句。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24189
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_17879350:

    # a "I was... {w}I saw that you..."
    a "我当时……{w}我看到你……"

# game/script day12.rpy:24191
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_98720c2f:

    # p "Sir?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24195
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_2cc49360:

    # a "...Forget it."
    a "……算了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24197
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_26c8c55e_1:

    # a ". . ."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24199
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_8ec81c12:

    # "You glance up at the First Mate, with what must have been a dumbfounded expression. He exhales deeply, shifting his weight from one leg to the other."
    "你抬头望向大副，脸上想必是一副茫然失措的表情。他深深呼出一口气，将重心从一条腿换到另一条腿上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24201
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_3f913939:

    # a "That is what you wanted to hear, wasn't it?"
    a "这就是你想听到的，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24203
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_a3ca44e9:

    # a "That I know it wasn't you who snapped the line that injured Samuel."
    a "我知道弄伤塞缪尔的那根缆绳不是你弄断的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24207
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_0026fe60:

    # a "Not noticing the crane in port... you're not someone used to working at sea or the docks. It happens."
    a "没注意到港口那台起重机……你不是惯于在海上或码头工作的人。这种事难免发生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24209
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_fd1bc3f5:

    # "You're stumped for words, the mental wounds of him lashing out against anything you say still feel too fresh to fully process his words at this moment."
    "你一时语塞，他先前对你任何言语都厉声斥责所造成的心理创伤仍历历在目，此刻你尚无法完全消化他的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24213
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_98720c2f_1:

    # p "Sir?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24217
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_32fb53c2:

    # a "Hm?"
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24219
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_38e6be1b:

    # p "My choice of words earlier might have been a bit too harsh. I felt pushed into a corner and, well, I wanted to apologize for it."
    p "我刚才的措辞可能有点过于严厉了。我当时感觉被逼到了墙角，嗯，我想为此道歉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24221
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_f3eec2b2:

    # "He doesn't respond."
    "他没有回应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24223
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_6e5504b8:

    # p "We all have our vices, and I'm sure there are reasons behind each of them. I should have held my tongue."
    p "我们都有自己的毛病，而且我相信每个毛病背后都有原因。我本该管住自己的嘴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24225
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_7392c4f8:

    # p "So, um, I'm sorry."
    p "所以，呃，对不起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24227
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_0bc9459a:

    # "You hear his drawn-out exhale as he turns to you."
    "你听到他一声长叹，同时转向你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24231
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_62200625:

    # a "And you did nothing wrong, lad.{w} That's what you want to hear, isn't it?"
    a "而且你没做错什么，小子。{w}这就是你想听到的，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24233
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_69d46e3c:

    # p "I did accuse you."
    p "我确实指责过你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24235
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_b75fe870:

    # a "I'm not talking about today. I'm talking about Samuel's injury, the crane back in port and all those things."
    a "我不是在说今天的事。我指的是塞缪尔的伤，港口那台起重机，所有那些事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24237
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_d984232d:

    # a "You did nothing wrong there."
    a "在那件事上，你没做错什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24241
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c5c830e9_1:

    # a "[name]?"
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24250
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_241b4708_1:

    # "Your ears snap to attention, and you straighten reflexively, pushing yourself upright."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24252
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_62b57c1d:

    # a "Have you thanked him yet?"
    a "你感谢过他了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24254
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_59241a5c:

    # p "Not yet, sir. I've had to take a little breather.{w} But I plan to."
    p "还没有，长官。我得先缓口气。{w}但我打算去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24256
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_bdea9751:

    # a "Samuel is too nice for his own good."
    a "塞缪尔就是人太好了，好得过头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24258
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_2612f755:

    # a "Just imagine the guts it took to stand up for you. Some landsman who hasn't even made it to his second week."
    a "想想看，为你出头需要多大的勇气。你不过是个还没干满两周的旱鸭子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24260
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_0cbbe712:

    # a "He could have simply ignored it. It would be the easy way. You'd be gone in a few days and he could continue as if nothing ever happened."
    a "他本可以置之不理。那才省事。过几天你就走了，他可以当什么都没发生过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24262
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_60664983:

    # a "But he confronted me."
    a "但他却来质问我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24266
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_12731c10:

    # "He barks in a brief laugh."
    "他短促地干笑一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24268
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_21b51a89:

    # p "I will no doubt make sure to thank him, sir. He truly is something else."
    p "我一定会去好好感谢他的，长官。他确实与众不同。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24270
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_738e8cdf:

    # a "Ain't he just."
    a "可不是嘛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24274
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_9e96727b:

    # a "And... you did nothing wrong, lad.{w} That's what you want to hear, isn't it?"
    a "还有……你没做错什么，小子。{w}这就是你想听到的，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24276
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_a6a65ad4:

    # a "Samuel's injury, the crane back in port and all those things."
    a "塞缪尔的伤，港口那台起重机，所有那些事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24278
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_d984232d_1:

    # a "You did nothing wrong there."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24280
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_8cf1bea8:

    # p "Yet I screwed up earlier today. I wouldn't call that 'nothing,' sir."
    p "可我今天早些时候搞砸了。我不会把那叫做‘没事’，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24282
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_d44954ea:

    # a "I'd hope you don't think so little of me—or the Captain, for that matter—to believe we'd assign you as the only watchman."
    a "我希望你别把我看得——或者把船长也看得——那么不堪，以为我们会只安排你一个人值夜班。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24286
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_1aa08174:

    # a "The other useless idiot happened to not be at his post either. He figured, with a spry and eager landsman sharing his watch—and someone with good vision at night to boot—he could take it easy and spend most of his time inside playing dice."
    a "另一个没用的白痴碰巧也没在岗。他想着，既然有个手脚麻利、干劲十足的旱鸭子和他一起值班——而且还是个夜视能力好的——他就可以偷懒，大部分时间待在舱里玩骰子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24288
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_0c8f3051:

    # "You blink up at him in disbelief."
    "你难以置信地眨着眼睛看他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24290
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_ed28f33f:

    # a "Don't look at me like a kitten who's lost her toy under the bed. He wasn't spared punishment, if that's what you're wondering."
    a "别用那种丢了床底下玩具的小猫似的眼神看我。他也没逃过惩罚，如果你是在想这个的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24292
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_3aa4fab6:

    # "A surge of self-awareness washes over you, and you quickly look back out at the ocean."
    "一阵自我认知涌上心头，你迅速转回头看向大海。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24294
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_fd21dffa:

    # a "Of course, this doesn't excuse the fact that you did, in fact, fall asleep."
    a "当然，这并不能为你确实睡着了的事实开脱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24296
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_5ba264e3:

    # a "For better or worse, it's one of the more lenient offenses—otherwise, we'd soon have no sailors left at all."
    a "不管好坏，这算是比较轻微的过失之一——否则，我们很快就要没水手可用了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24298
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_523693b8:

    # a "But rest assured that I won't be so lenient if it happens again. Understood?{w} For your own sake."
    a "但放心，如果再发生，我不会这么宽容了。明白吗？{w}为了你自己好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24300
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_0aa5ad26:

    # p "Yes, sir. Understood."
    p "是，长官。明白。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24304
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_26d0f0d5:

    # a "Good. I know that you're an ambitious lad, more than most who start where you are. And the eyesight you felines possess is too valuable to waste on a slovenly sailor."
    a "很好。我知道你是个有雄心的小伙子，比大多数从你这个位置起步的人都强。而且你们猫族拥有的视力太宝贵了，不能浪费在一个邋遢的水手身上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24306
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_3927ddfe:

    # a "You'll need discipline to match your ambition and perhaps you'll make something out of yourself yet."
    a "你需要有与雄心相匹配的纪律，或许你将来真能有所成就。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24310
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_db2b47d5:

    # a "There. Are you happy with that?"
    a "好了。这下你满意了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24312
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_db2a4893:

    # p "I think so..."
    p "我想是的……"

# game/script day12.rpy:24314
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_43810ab7:

    # "A sudden gust of wind whips across the deck, ruffling your fur and blowing strands across your eyes. You swipe your paw through it to clear your vision again as you two fall back into a minute long silence."
    "一阵疾风扫过甲板，吹乱了你的毛发，几缕发丝遮住了眼睛。你用爪子拨开它们，重新看清眼前，两人又陷入了一阵短暂的沉默。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24329
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_e2d26e11:

    # a "Lad, that feeling you described earlier—when you were lying in the field at night, staring at the stars."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24331
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_15779d51:

    # a "My first captain that I served under would call moments like the one you experienced {i}'Dhyana'.{/i}"
    a "我跟随的第一任船长，会把像你经历的那种时刻称为{i}“禅那”。{/i}"

# game/script day12.rpy:24333
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_075db3c6:

    # a "Fool that I am, I never read the texts he got the term from. I was too preoccupied learning from his ability as a mariner to spend my time with anything else—but I hope I understood him correctly."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24335
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_0678d37d:

    # a "He described it as a moment that allows us to gather ourselves, to return, and be aware of the essence of what we are.{w} Even if only briefly."
    a "他描述说，那是一个让我们能够凝聚心神、回归本真、意识到自我本质的时刻。{w}哪怕只是短暂一瞬。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24337
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_46becbed:

    # a "As if, for that moment, the barrier between us and the world breaks away."
    a "仿佛就在那一刻，我们与世界之间的隔阂消失了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24339
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_53255114:

    # a "For him, it didn't happen under a starry sky. He felt it when standing on deck, just before engaging the enemy.{p}It gave him strength—allowed him to stand unshaken, even amidst the crashing of worlds."
    a "对他来说，那种感觉并非出现在星空下。他是站在甲板上，即将与敌人交战前感受到的。{p}这给了他力量——让他在天崩地裂中也岿然不动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24341
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_5512bb2b:

    # a "A gifted Captain... that he was."
    a "一位天赋异禀的船长……他确实是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24343
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_520ac3ee:

    # "You notice a subtle introspective shift in his tone, before he seems to rein it back in with his next words."
    "你注意到他语气中有一丝不易察觉的内省转变，但紧接着他似乎用下一句话将其收敛了回去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24345
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_19470faf:

    # a "Perhaps because of it.{w} Perhaps it guided his decisions in some way."
    a "或许正因如此。{w}或许这在某种程度上指引了他的决策。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24347
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_f27c0941:

    # p "Who was the Captain, if I may ask, sir?"
    p "那位船长是谁，如果我可以问的话，长官？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24349
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_ed2514c3:

    # a "Hawke."
    a "霍克。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24351
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_f7bf494b:

    # a "Sir Edward Hawke."
    a "爱德华·霍克爵士。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24353
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_0c1c5ded:

    # "His expression brightens slightly as the name crosses his lips."
    "这个名字从他唇间吐出时，他的表情微微一亮。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24355
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_72f22c2f:

    # a "Before your time, lad. You can stop pretending to look like you know who he is."
    a "你那时候还没出生呢，小子。不用再装出一副知道他是谁的样子了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24357
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_398e6b08:

    # a "Back then, I learned under him as a fresh-faced young stallion assigned as a midshipman to {i}HMS Royal George.{/i}"
    a "那时候，我还是个初出茅庐的年轻小马，被分配到{i}皇家乔治号{/i}上担任海军候补少尉，在他手下学习。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24359
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_aa309d98:

    # a "She was the largest ship in the world at the time—100 guns to her name. She was beauty itself manifested in a vessel."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24361
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_3b4a9c19:

    # a "You can probably imagine how it felt to first set a hoof aboard it."
    a "你大概能想象第一次踏上那艘船是什么感觉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24363
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_b069a0a6:

    # p "I think I can, sir."
    p "我想我能，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24365
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_489fc879:

    # a "I'm not sure if I actually drew a lucky lot or not. It was wartime, and I found myself aboard during the battle at Quiberon Bay."
    a "我不确定自己当时是不是真的抽到了上上签。那是战争时期，我发现自己登上了参加基伯龙湾海战的船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24367
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_311ac210:

    # a "A decisive engagement, however it was one that could have gone south just as easily. But shaped by Hawke's brilliance at every turn we lived to see another day."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24369
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_87953858:

    # a "I still remember it vividly. Despite violent weather and uncharted waters, he ordered us to pursue the French ships into the bay."
    a "我至今记忆犹新。尽管天气恶劣，水域陌生，他仍命令我们追击法国舰船进入海湾。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24371
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_b40a7721:

    # a "The shoals and jagged rocks could've split any hull wide open, and we had no maps to guide us. But Hawke gave the command and used the very ships we were chasing as his guide."
    a "浅滩和嶙峋的礁石足以撕裂任何船体，而我们没有海图指引。但霍克下达了命令，并以我们正在追击的敌舰本身作为我们的向导。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24373
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_5b309545:

    # a "Our master urged caution, pointing out the shore on our lee."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24375
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_f07b7d23:

    # a "Hawke adjusted his hat and stood tall among the rest of the crew, saying only: {i}'You've done your duty, sir. Now lay me alongside the Soleil Royal.'{/i}"
    a "霍克正了正帽子，在船员中挺身而立，只说了句：{i}“您已尽到职责了，先生。现在，让我靠近‘皇家太阳号’。”{/i}"

# game/script day12.rpy:24377
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_11bffff0:

    # p "And no one raised any concerns?"
    p "就没人提出任何异议吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24379
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_9bc7b219:

    # a "The way he said it... there wasn't an ounce of doubt in his voice. Don't get me wrong, it wasn't bravado or recklessness—it was certainty. Even as the wind screamed and I had to hold on to my cap, he stood there firmly rooted like a mast. I'd never seen anything like it."
    a "他说话的方式……声音里没有一丝犹豫。别误会，那不是虚张声势或鲁莽——那是确信。即使狂风呼啸，我得紧紧抓住帽子，他也像桅杆一样稳稳地站在那里。我从未见过那样的景象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24381
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_fd3de293:

    # a "Did I like the idea?{w} Of course not, but I trusted him with my life."
    a "我喜欢这个主意吗？{w}当然不，但我把性命托付给了他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24383
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_a548b62d:

    # p "What happened then?"
    p "后来怎么样了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24385
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_b648b60c:

    # "A reminiscent smile spreads across Arthur's face, his eyes losing themselves in the distant night."
    "亚瑟脸上浮现出回忆的微笑，眼神迷失在远方的夜色中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24387
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_7ce79237:

    # a "Recounting the whole battle would leave us still standing here by midday, lad. But we got what we wanted. We ran the {i}Soleil Royal{/i} aground and set her ablaze, along with several other ships."
    a "要细说整场战役的话，咱俩得在这儿站到中午了，小子。但我们达成了目标。我们让{i}皇家太阳号{/i}搁浅并点燃了她，还有其他几艘船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24389
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_a8c5baf6:

    # a "I had to replace one of the gunners. One of the guns I was commanding was thrown out of commission due to an injury to our loader."
    a "我不得不顶替了一名炮手。我指挥的一门炮因为装填手受伤而无法使用了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24391
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_4a8f0e59:

    # a "Not my finest hour, we were slower than everyone else around us. But we landed our shots during what was a difficult engagement."
    a "那不是我表现最好的时候，我们比周围所有人都慢。但在一场艰苦的战斗中，我们还是命中了目标。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24393
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_af7273c3:

    # a "Sent them back home with their tails tucked between their legs."
    a "打得他们夹着尾巴逃回了家。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24395
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_be61a2e3:

    # a "We felt it at the time, and it indeed bore true. It was a victory that crushed any notion of a French invasion and allowed us to blockade their harbors until the war's end."
    a "我们当时就感觉到了，后来也证明的确如此。这是一场粉碎了法国任何入侵念头的胜利，让我们得以封锁他们的港口直到战争结束。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24397
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_895e1d1e:

    # "As Arthur speaks of Sir Edward, you can't help but feel a twinge of envy. The thought of standing on a deck, unshaken amidst chaos, commanding men who trusted you with their lives."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24399
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_db254fa4:

    # "Though you've felt anything but certain during your stay aboard..."
    "尽管你在这船上的日子里，感受最多的就是不确定……"

# game/script day12.rpy:24401
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_bf112e3b:

    # "Perhaps you are getting ahead of yourself—given that you haven't even made it through your second week aboard."
    "或许你有点想得太远了——毕竟你连第二周都还没熬过去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24403
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_40672ca4:

    # "Or perhaps you will always be the landsman struggling to keep pace."
    "又或许，你永远都会是那个拼命追赶的旱鸭子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24405
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_ce97e58d:

    # a "That day..."
    a "那天……"

# game/script day12.rpy:24407
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_6892900c:

    # a "It changed me.{w} Don't get me wrong—I thought I'd end up a navy lad as long as I can remember. My father managed to secure my position as a midshipman on the {i}Royal George{/i} in the first place, wanting me to learn under Sir Edward."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24409
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_b30897b9:

    # a "Before that, it was just duty. Something expected of me. But after Quiberon Bay? It became more than that. I saw what it meant to command—not just to give orders, but to inspire men to follow you."
    a "在那之前，那只是职责。是我被期望去做的事。但基伯龙湾之后？它变得不止如此了。我看到了指挥的意义——不仅仅是发号施令，更是激励人们追随你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24411
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_34d54fe6:

    # a "After that day?{w} I {i}wanted{/i} it."
    a "那天之后？{w}我{i}渴望{/i}它。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24413
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_21569963:

    # a "Edward...{w} Sir Edward became more of a father to me than my own. Not in the familial sense, but in the eyes of a young stallion as a guide for the man I wanted to be."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24415
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_002584a4:

    # a "The man who would teach me everything I know."
    a "那个教会我所知一切的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24417
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_fc17d51d:

    # a "I still catch myself asking what he would do, especially when the decision feels impossible. I suppose that's the mark of a great leader—the way they linger in your mind, long after they've gone."
    a "我至今仍会不自觉地想他会怎么做，尤其是在感到抉择艰难的时候。我想，这就是伟大领袖的标志——即使在他们离去之后，也依然长久地萦绕在你心头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24419
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_21789899:

    # p "Gone? Is he not with us anymore?"
    p "离去？他不在了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24421
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_26c8c55e_2:

    # a ". . ."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24423
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_e07bb09a:

    # "You hold your tongue for a moment, lowering your eyes to the waves again."
    "你一时语塞，再次垂下眼帘看向海浪。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24425
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_9ed7541d:

    # p "I'm very sorry to hear, sir."
    p "听到这个我很难过，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24427
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_65032ecc:

    # p "For what little it is worth coming from me, I think he sounds like a truly magnificent captain, sir."
    p "虽然我的话微不足道，但我觉得他听起来是位真正了不起的船长，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24429
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_5197d948:

    # p "Worthy of admiration."
    p "值得钦佩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24431
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_e50abf4c:

    # p "How long did you serve under him?"
    p "您在他手下服役了多久？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24433
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_b8a50237:

    # a "Until his retirement from active duty in...{w} I believe 1763. I was glued to every step, and every word of his until then. He was the one who penned my recommendation to take the Lieutenant's exam."
    a "直到他退役……{w}我想是1763年。在那之前，我如影随形地跟着他的每一步，听着他的每一句话。正是他亲笔为我写了推荐信，让我参加上尉资格考试。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24435
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_29c7ddad:

    # a "Even after that, we stayed in touch during his political career and I always had his ear when I needed his advice."
    a "即使在那之后，在他从政期间我们也保持着联系，每当我需要建议时，他总会倾听。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24437
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_9521a2db:

    # p "It must have been an honor to learn from someone like him."
    p "能向那样的人学习，一定是莫大的荣幸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24439
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_90cb37db:

    # p "Though I am certain that many of the crew feel the same way about you, sir."
    p "不过我相信，船上许多船员对您也是同样的感觉，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24441
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_002e6553:

    # "He lets out a single barking laugh, apparently not agreeing with your assessment."
    "他发出一声短促的干笑，显然不同意你的评价。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24443
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_7c64e57b:

    # a "Spare me the flattery, Mr. [family_name]."
    a "省省你的恭维吧，[姓]先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24445
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_f740fab3:

    # a "I'm not even a tenth of the man Sir Edward was."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24447
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_05cb4a1a:

    # a "I had the chance... I did."
    a "我曾经有过机会……确实有过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24449
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_1882399a:

    # a "The day I passed the exam I became one of the youngest Lieutenants in the service. Really, I did my best to leave them with no choice but to pass me by surpassing every other applicant."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24451
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_01a82cf7:

    # a "I didn't want to leave them the option to turn me down just because I was considered too young."
    a "我不想给他们仅仅因为我被认为太年轻而拒绝我的机会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24453
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_4c403c7e:

    # "Arthur shakes his head, glancing at the gathered crew, before looking back at you."
    "亚瑟摇了摇头，瞥了一眼聚集的船员，然后重新看向你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24464
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_f41f4bdc:

    # a "But excuse my little excursion into cobwebbed memories. I'm sure they must bore you to no end."
    a "不过，请原谅我这番对尘封记忆的叨扰。我敢肯定它们一定让你无聊透顶。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24466
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_530e7466:

    # p "Bore me? Anything but, sir."
    p "无聊？恰恰相反，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24468
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_5e92764d:

    # p "It sounds like it was a fascinating path to get to where you are right now.{w} I just wish we had started off on a better note."
    p "听起来，您走到今天这一步，经历了一条相当精彩的道路。我只是希望我们一开始能有个更好的开端。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24470
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_99e40f4a:

    # a "Fascinating indeed..."
    a "确实精彩……"

# game/script day12.rpy:24474
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_2213425e:

    # p "You can't imagine just how much more excited I would have been joining this ship if I had known about the experience my officer possesses."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24476
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_48926c6f:

    # p "Perhaps on a calm day you can tell me more about it all?"
    p "或许等风平浪静的时候，您能多给我讲讲这些事？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24478
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_f2569c84:

    # p "Either way, I hope that we can put our differences aside, sir."
    p "无论如何，我希望我们能抛开分歧，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24482
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_f4e3c4be:

    # "He turns towards the stern and you hear his heavy hoofed step settle onto the wood, his arms neatly folded behind his back."
    "他转向船尾，你听到他沉重的蹄子踏在木头上，双臂整齐地背在身后。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24484
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_ecd5da2c:

    # "But he stops in his tracks before taking another step and looks back over his shoulder."
    "但他停下脚步，在迈出下一步之前，回头望了一眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24488
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_a013bb2f:

    # a "Well, I did not waste my time delving into old memories, at least."
    a "好吧，至少我这次沉浸于旧日回忆，不算浪费时间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24490
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_2c792856:

    # a "You know, Mr. [family_name], you remind me of-..."
    a "你知道吗，[姓]先生，你让我想起……"

# game/script day12.rpy:24492
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_061e5381:

    # p "Yes?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24494
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_aeca2ff7:

    # "He shakes his head."
    "他摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24496
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_92f01365:

    # a "Nevermind."
    a "算了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24500
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_971d5ae3:

    # a "Take in the sight for a while longer, lad."
    a "再多看一会儿风景吧，小伙子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24502
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_77ddcf34:

    # a "I doubt even half the crew would make it up the mast—distracted like this."
    a "我怀疑有一半的船员都爬不上桅杆——像现在这样心不在焉的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24504
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_087ce13d:

    # a "And I'm not planning to risk that, so we'll stay our hands until we pass through these burning seas unless it is absolutely necessary."
    a "我也不打算冒这个险，所以除非绝对必要，否则在穿过这片火海之前，我们按兵不动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24506
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_046884db:

    # a "But..."
    a ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24508
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c589b660:

    # "He pauses and looks up into the sails above to study their state and the weather."
    "他停顿了一下，抬头看向上方的船帆，审视着它们的状况和天气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24510
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_2ee9d4ae:

    # a "...I doubt it'll be needed."
    a "……我觉得应该用不着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24512
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_7aba3136:

    # a "And, [name]..."
    a "还有，[名字]……"

# game/script day12.rpy:24514
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_3c4031a4:

    # p "Yes, sir?"
    p "是，长官？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24516
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_23fa45e7:

    # a "Welcome back aboard."
    a "欢迎回到船上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24526
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c9437b0f:

    # "You watch as he strides toward the stern, his form disappearing into the shadows of the ship's wood, until even your sharp eyes can barely make him out as he enters the ship through the hatch."
    "你看着他大步走向船尾，身影消失在船木的阴影中，直到他通过舱口进入船舱，连你敏锐的眼睛也几乎分辨不出他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24528
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_072ecf82:

    # "For a moment, you just stand there, the wind tugging at your fur and the glow of the sea stretching endlessly around you."
    "有那么一会儿，你只是站在那里，风拉扯着你的皮毛，海面的光芒在你周围无尽延伸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24530
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_c556c5a9:

    # "If they hadn't already, things are finally sinking in, and you let out a relaxed breath. The first truly calm breath in days."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24532
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_406bd888:

    # "Morocco."
    "摩洛哥。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24534
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_arthur_81143eb3:

    # "Perhaps getting some firm ground under your paws will do you well."
    "或许脚下能踏着坚实的土地对你有好处。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24542
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_3b916006:

    # "Arthur's ardor for the topic of sailing is undeniable."
    "亚瑟对航海话题的热情是毋庸置疑的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24544
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_784002d6:

    # "Even from a slight distance, and even through his austere demeanour, you can tell there's something deeper than passion in his words."
    "即使隔着一段距离，即使透过他严肃的举止，你也能听出他话语中蕴含着比热情更深沉的东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24553
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_d07dd4e3:

    # "He isn't afraid of voicing his opinions on the correct way of traversing the oceans. He wields his experience like a shield—a defense against the currents of the modern world."
    "他并不惧怕表达自己对正确航海方式的见解。他将自己的经验当作盾牌——抵御现代世界潮流冲击的防御。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24555
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_93438e18:

    # "You can tell the painted dog's eyes are starting to drift—the look of someone who's mentally moving on from the current conversation."
    "你看得出那只彩绘犬（Nomax）的目光开始飘移——那是一种心思已从当前对话中抽离的神情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24559
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_b9e295c2:

    # "But you can also tell they're drifting in your direction."
    "但你也看得出，那目光正飘向你的方向。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24561
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_f2d61c2c:

    # "He's not going to say it, and you know it. {w}He wants to spend some time with you, but he wants you to take the lead. {w}So you make him wait. {w}Just a little longer. {w}For the fun of it."
    "他不会说出来的，你知道。他想和你待一会儿，但他想让你来主导。所以你让他等着。就再等一会儿。为了好玩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24565
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_1da7cf1e:

    # "He's not going to be awake for much longer, you feel. But you are, and after reflecting on it, you decide you'd enjoy having him around."
    "你觉得他不会清醒太久了。但你很清醒，而且思忖之后，你决定有他在身边你会很愉快。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24575
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_7cc83a0c:

    # "You finally step over there and cut in."
    "你终于走了过去，插话道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24577
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_44c2fa4e:

    # p "Excuse me... {w}A ship sailing by steam alone? No sails?"
    p "打扰一下……一艘船仅靠蒸汽航行？不用帆？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24581
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_7aa41b4a:

    # n "Exactly. At least that is the gist of what I read—the details escape me, I have to admit."
    n "正是。至少我读到的概要如此——细节记不清了，我得承认。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24583
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_debb497b:

    # n "But the theory is well tested. The experiments bear fruit."
    n "但这个理论经过了充分验证。实验已经取得了成果。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24585
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_d3b3a102:

    # p "Why, that... that sounds incredible! Are you sure you can't recall more?"
    p "哎呀，那……那听起来太不可思议了！你确定想不起更多了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24589
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_35b72cb6:

    # "Arthur snorts. One excited landlubber discussing matters he knows nothing about would be easily persuaded by experience."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24591
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_8d46b295:

    # "Two, however, is a hostile crowd. And you think you know him well enough at this point to know that he is not in the business of swaying the masses."
    "但两个人，就成了一个充满敌意的群体。而且你觉得此时你已经足够了解他，知道他并不热衷于说服大众。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24593
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_40d906be:

    # a "I've seen my fair share of fads across the waves. And even if it takes hold, it won't last past the first open sea disaster that inevitably strikes."
    a "我在海上见过不少一时流行的风潮。即使它能站住脚，也熬不过第一场不可避免的、发生在开阔海域的灾难。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24595
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_1de90b32:

    # a "We didn't sail this way for millennia because it was easy. We did it because it {i}works{/i}."
    a "我们几千年来这样航行，不是因为它容易。而是因为它管用。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24599
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_6dd00ab0:

    # a "Thank you for the conversation, Mr. Nomax. If you'll excuse me, I have some final duties to attend to before the day is officially over."
    a "谢谢你的交谈，诺马克斯先生。失陪了，在一天正式结束前，我还有些最后的职责要处理。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24601
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_48b94d0b:

    # "He tips his head to the painted dog, though he does not extend you the same courtesy."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24603
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_546b0da7:

    # a "Mr. [family_name]."
    a "[family_name]先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24614
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_17a88928:

    # "The coldness still strikes you, even though it's what makes the most sense. He does have an appearance to maintain."
    "那份冷淡依然让你感到刺痛，尽管这最合乎情理。他确实需要维持形象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24616
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_44bfd839:

    # "You blurt out a \"Yessir\". The painted dog returns generic pleasantries, and you both end up watching Arthur marching his way out of the conversation."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24621
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_1a26324b:

    # n "So... A sudden interest in the properties of overheated water, was it?"
    n "那么……突然对过热水的性质产生了兴趣，是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24634
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_89b8911d:

    # p "Sorry, I just needed an excuse. I'm not particularly interested in steam ships."
    p "抱歉，我只是需要一个借口。我对蒸汽船不是特别感兴趣。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24636
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_06d99805:

    # p "I was just thinking on my feet. Finding a way to make him leave."
    p "我只是急中生智。找个办法让他离开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24638
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_795e4269:

    # p "Wasn't particularly feeling his company. Not tonight."
    p "不是特别喜欢有他作伴。至少今晚不。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24640
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_e83cdf59:

    # n "I figured as much. He strikes me as an individual best taken in small doses."
    n "我大概猜到了。他给我的印象是，最好少量接触。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24644
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_e90651cd:

    # "{i}Believe me{/i}, Mr. Nomax, there was nothing small about the dose of him you took."
    "相信我，诺马克斯先生，你刚才接触的“剂量”可一点也不小。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24646
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_39a02dfa:

    # "You refrain from voicing that particular thought, however."
    "不过，你忍住了，没有说出这个具体的想法。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24650
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_4e03ce27:

    # n "Though I guess subtlety is no strength of yours."
    n "不过我想，含蓄委婉并非你的强项。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24654
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_627dbb6e:

    # n "Uh, no offense."
    n "呃，无意冒犯。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24656
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_92376eb3:

    # p "None taken. We're here, we're chatting, I'd say I achieved my goal."
    p "没关系。我们在这儿，我们在聊天，我想我达到了目的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24658
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_31a00fbc:

    # n "I have to say I am slightly surprised, but you did strike me as a very curious fellow."
    n "我得说我有点惊讶，但你确实给我留下了非常好奇的印象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24662
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_a894bfd6:

    # n "I mean...{w} No, that makes you sound like one of my specimens. You understand what I meant there."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24666
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_5f910d3a:

    # p "Don't worry, I don't particularly care. About the steam thing, I mean."
    p "别担心，我不是特别在意。我是说，关于蒸汽那件事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24668
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_2a85feea:

    # p "You're full of surprises. Although... it figures you'd be an expert in engineering as well."
    p "你真是充满惊喜。虽然……你同时也是个工程学专家，这倒也说得通。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24677
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_f85aba3f:

    # p "A little white lie to serve a noble purpose."
    p "一个服务于高尚目的的小小善意谎言。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24681
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_aed62f8f:

    # n "Oh? And what purpose might you be talking about?"
    n "哦？你说的可能是什么目的呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24685
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_fd9a2055:

    # p "Just to spend some time together. I have to say, your company is... quite entertaining."
    p "只是想一起待一会儿。我得说，有你作伴……相当有趣。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24689
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_f79e0609:

    # "The painted dog blushes faintly, looking away. You idly wonder how often he thinks about it in his spare time."
    "彩绘犬微微脸红，移开了视线。你漫不经心地想，他在闲暇时会多想这件事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24693
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_d591f562:

    # "Maybe he thinks about Julian. Or maybe the both of you."
    "也许他在想朱利安。或者也许在想你们俩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24695
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_06628140:

    # "A sly grin makes its way on your face."
    "一丝狡黠的笑容浮现在你脸上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24697
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ab1cb733:

    # p "Well... We find ourselves together again, then. I have to say, the pleasure is... reciprocated."
    p "那么……看来我们又在一起了。我得说，这份愉快……是相互的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24702
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_2757c3a9:

    # p "Hoped to get you to myself. I enjoy our short chats a lot."
    p "希望能和你独处。我非常享受我们短暂的聊天。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24706
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_4f44721a:

    # "The painted dog smiles softly."
    "彩绘犬温柔地笑了笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24708
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_e17430b5:

    # n "The appreciation is reciprocated. You're quite the interesting fellow."
    n "这份欣赏是相互的。你是个相当有趣的家伙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24712
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_6b9eabb5:

    # n "And I admit sailing isn't an interest of mine. Neither is engineering, frankly."
    n "而且我承认，航海不是我的兴趣。坦率地说，工程学也不是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24714
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_d5507536:

    # p "But it figures you'd be an expert in that as well."
    p "不过你同时也是个工程学专家，这倒也说得通。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24718
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_93b8ee0e:

    # n "Oh, I have some knowledge of the basics from a few books that have kept me company on quiet spring evenings, but not much more beyond that."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24720
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_7af085ca:

    # n "I am a scholar of flora, after all."
    n "毕竟，我是一名植物学学者。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24725
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_8cfeb135:

    # p "And an enjoyer of... French?{w} No, Latin? Did you study in Rome?"
    p "还是……法语？不，拉丁语？你在罗马学习过？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24727
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ca849128:

    # "He snickers softly."
    "他轻声窃笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24729
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_be1f7a7d:

    # n "I know I am lucky, but not so lucky as to explore my field in Italy. Although I have to admit I dream of it at times."
    n "我知道我很幸运，但还没幸运到能在意大利探索我的领域。尽管我得承认，我有时会梦想如此。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24733
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_9d4de8d1:

    # n "The Grand Tour is a bit unfashionable by now, but still beloved by many. Those who can afford it, however, sit a fair few rungs above me on society's ladder."
    n "欧洲大陆游学如今有点过时了，但仍然深受许多人喜爱。然而，那些负担得起的人，在社会阶梯上比我高出好几个等级。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24735
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_5cba169c:

    # n "The patronage I fell under allowed me all the material for research I could want, but... travels and field expeditions have never been part of it. These are exceptional circumstances."
    n "我所受的资助提供了我所需的所有研究材料，但是……旅行和野外考察从来不是其中的一部分。这次是特殊情况。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24746
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_44e7cac1:

    # "As he talks, the two of you walk your way to the side of the ship, waves and stars provide the backdrop to his European musings."
    "他说话时，你们俩走到了船舷边，海浪与星空为他关于欧洲的遐想提供了背景。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24748
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_64111d21:

    # n "As much as I may look the part, there are still many layers of aristocracy above me. {w}And, as you might be able to tell, my traveling experience is rather limited."
    n "尽管我看起来可能像那么回事，但在我之上还有许多层的贵族。而且，你可能也看得出来，我的旅行经验相当有限。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24750
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_2071be8a:

    # n "Up until now, I suppose."
    n "我想，直到现在都是如此。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24754
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_87c34926:

    # n "Rome, though... {w}Maybe I will visit one day, once I am old, if fortune assists, and if I may make it off this ship in one piece."
    n "不过，罗马……也许有一天我会去拜访，等我老了，如果运气眷顾，如果我能完好无损地离开这艘船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24758
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_04a7c74c:

    # n "So many incredible painters and sculptors roamed its streets—it beckons to anyone who shares even a shred of interest in the arts."
    n "那么多不可思议的画家和雕塑家曾漫步于它的街头——它对任何对艺术怀有一丝兴趣的人都有吸引力。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24760
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_559d737d:

    # n "But to most, the eternal city is just a distant fancy."
    n "但对大多数人来说，这座永恒之城只是一个遥远的幻想。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24764
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_2e59f7c2:

    # n "Unless one plans to join the ranks of the Catholic Church, I suppose. But I doubt I would be welcomed with open arms."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24767
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_20a15cdf:

    # p "You? Probably not. I heard they are taking their celibacy seriously, something that I don't think is your strong suit."
    p "你？大概不会。我听说他们对待独身誓言很认真，而我觉得那并非你的强项。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24769
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_847a1deb:

    # n "Julian. That lizard gent."
    n "朱利安。那位蜥蜴绅士。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24771
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_11bd6b3c:

    # p "What about him?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24773
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ab5b2dcd:

    # n "You know him well, don't you?"
    n "你很了解他，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24775
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ea24fde3:

    # p "Not sure if I'd call it knowing him well, but we started at the same time when we left port. So I guess I know him about as well as anyone can on this ship. Why?"
    p "不确定是否称得上很了解，但我们离港时是同时开始的。所以我想，我对他的了解大概和这艘船上的任何人一样。怎么了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24777
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_90c6b391:

    # n "He visited earlier. After the storm began."
    n "他早些时候来过。风暴开始之后。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24779
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_76c66a8b:

    # n "Said you'd be alright with it."
    n "他说你对此没意见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24781
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_b41f7b69:

    # p "I was."
    p "我是没意见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24783
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_9e61d11c:

    # p "You're not my property. You can do whatever you want to do."
    p "你不是我的所有物。你想做什么都可以。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24785
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_1b7cecc5:

    # p "Hope you two enjoyed yourselves."
    p "希望你们俩玩得开心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24787
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_e8f31588:

    # "He meets your eyes briefly before quickly pulling away."
    "他短暂地与你的目光相遇，随即迅速移开视线。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24789
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_2f515809:

    # "They sure did."
    "他们确实如此。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24793
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_09479989:

    # "He remains there, pensive, elbows resting on the slightly wet gunwale."
    "他仍待在那里，若有所思，胳膊肘搁在微湿的船舷上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24795
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_20a8f995:

    # "The night is getting more and more humid. It probably won't be long before the thought of a roof above your head becomes entrancingly appealing."
    "夜晚越来越潮湿。或许要不了多久，头顶有片屋顶遮风挡雨的念头就会变得极具诱惑力。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24797
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_b2ff27db:

    # "Maybe moving the conversation to Nomax's cabin would be best. Calm, warmer, more intimate. Perfect for a chat."
    "也许把谈话挪到诺马克斯的船舱里是最好的选择。安静、更暖和、也更私密。非常适合聊天。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24801
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_f4d66fb1:

    # "And a more comfortable environment for inquiring about the life drawing you asked for back then."
    "而且，对于询问你当时要的人体素描来说，也是个更舒适的环境。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24803
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_c4aebec9:

    # "On the other hand... it is a beautiful night."
    "另一方面……这是个美丽的夜晚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24805
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_9f63cccd:

    # "The ocean below and a sea of stars above. Waves lazily rolling underneath the ship. The universe opening before you both might be worth the very minor discomfort."
    "下方是海洋，上方是星海。波浪在船下慵懒地起伏。在你俩面前展开的宇宙，或许值得忍受那点微不足道的不适。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24829
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_383596fa:

    # "This kind of serenity is rare in your profession. You may not be an experienced sailor, but you know by now that you should take advantage of it any chance you get."
    "这种宁静在你的职业中实属罕见。你可能不是经验丰富的水手，但你现在也该知道，应该抓住任何可以利用它的机会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24831
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_456a95c5:

    # p "For someone who hates travels as much as you say, you did seem to appreciate it in your chat with Arthur. {w}The first half of it, at least."
    p "对于一个像你说的那样讨厌旅行的人来说，你在和亚瑟聊天时似乎还挺欣赏的。{w}至少前半段是这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24835
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_5997a536:

    # n "Traveling is not the issue... ships are. The ocean is."
    n "问题不在于旅行……在于船。在于海洋。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24837
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_bbf31b80:

    # n "Though it has gotten better. I suppose I might have just needed some time to get used to it."
    n "不过已经好些了。我想我可能只是需要些时间来适应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24839
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_c7f85f74:

    # n "And the ocean {i}can{/i} be a ghastly thing, but there is something to it, I admit."
    n "而且海洋{i}确实{/i}可能是种可怕的东西，但我承认，它自有其魅力。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24843
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_c419d77f:

    # n "I can't deny I want nothing more in life than peace, good books and the occasional conversations."
    n "我不能否认，我一生所求不过是安宁、好书和偶尔的交谈。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24845
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_a2c2ff45:

    # n "On nights like these, however, the waves reflecting the moon and stars above do come alive."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24847
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_beb0c33d:

    # n "One could swear they shine by their own light."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24849
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_ad02de09:

    # "Romantic, you think. But appropriate."
    "你觉得这很浪漫。但也恰如其分。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24859
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_4f798423:

    # "You look down into the sea below, illuminated by the reflection of the lights above."
    "你低头看向下方的海面，那里被上方灯光（星光/月光）的倒影照亮。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24861
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_d4737491:

    # "The waves sparkle in the moonlight. As time goes by, you realize you can distinguish more and more details, foam, rising water, the wake of the ship across the sea."
    "波浪在月光下闪闪发光。随着时间流逝，你意识到你能分辨出越来越多的细节：泡沫、涌起的水流、船只划过海面留下的尾迹。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24863
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_10ac589a:

    # "Must be the weather clearing even further, you think.{w} Until..."
    "一定是天气又放晴了些，你想。{w}直到……"

# game/script day12.rpy:24870
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_ac7a8e04:

    # "Until you realize it's pure blue light, with no bright dots or pale white discs."
    "直到你意识到那是纯粹的蓝光，没有明亮的光点或苍白的白色圆盘。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24872
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_6acef200:

    # p "What in the world..."
    p "这到底……"

# game/script day12.rpy:24874
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_81e7a86a:

    # "The fur on the back of your head bristles. The waves are glowing."
    "你后颈的毛发都竖了起来。波浪在发光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24876
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_214537df:

    # "As each splash of water hits the hull, it rebounds with an otherworldly blue tinge the likes of which you've never seen before."
    "每一片水花拍击船体时，都会带着一种你前所未见的、超凡脱俗的蓝色光泽反弹开来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24878
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_3d0c24e7:

    # "It's beautiful. It paints the deck in a dim, ethereal light, leaving a trail of brilliant color marking the passing of your ship."
    "美极了。它用一种朦胧、空灵的光辉涂抹着甲板，留下一道绚烂的色彩轨迹，标记着你船只的经过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24880
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_2c745e3f:

    # "Voices rise from behind. {w}One sailor calls another, then those two call two more. {w}Four become eight, eight become sixteen."
    "声音从身后传来。{w}一个水手叫另一个，然后那两个又叫来两个。{w}四个变成八个，八个变成十六个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24882
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_37701b88:

    # "Soon, a crowd has formed along the length of the ship. Entranced. Nobody able can tear their eyes off the sight around you."
    "很快，沿着船身形成了一群人。他们入迷了。没人能把目光从你周围的景象上移开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24884
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_3bdcfc73:

    # "Some are confused. Some are enthused. Some, repeating old sailors' tales, are afraid."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24893
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_3b8d7e8f:

    # "The look on the painted dog's face, however, is anything but."
    "然而，那只花斑狗脸上的表情，却绝非如此。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24895
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_d6555f29:

    # n "Gods, I...{w} Surely it can't-"
    n "天哪，我……{w}这肯定不可能是——"

# game/script day12.rpy:24897
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_d8970c8b:

    # n "I never thought I would be able to experience this."
    n "我从没想过我能亲眼见到这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24902
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_3cbc45c9:

    # "It's not fear. It's awe, the fire in your lineaments that follows an almost religious revelation. Even for the normally composed academic, it's impossible to hide."
    "那不是恐惧。那是敬畏，是近乎宗教启示后你面容上燃起的火焰。即使对于这位通常沉静的学者来说，也无法隐藏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24904
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_b197c423:

    # p "This... what is this?"
    p "这……这是什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24906
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_c6878c33:

    # n "This is, ah... I know this. I read about this in a book, years ago."
    n "这是，啊……我知道这个。我多年前在一本书里读到过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24908
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_56f19afe:

    # n "It's rare, but not unknown. I have seen it described, and I have read it explained but... {w}Oh, I should calm down. I should really calm down."
    n "这很罕见，但并非不为人知。我见过对它的描述，也读过对它的解释，但是……{w}哦，我得冷静下来。我真的得冷静下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24912
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_d36095f8:

    # n "{i}Employment for the Microscope{/i}, part two I think—by Henry Baker. First published in 1764. {w}I cannot believe it. I... I cannot believe I have the luck to witness it first-hand."
    n "{i}《显微镜的用途》{/i}，我想是第二部分——亨利·贝克著。首次出版于1764年。{w}我简直不敢相信。我……我无法相信我竟有幸亲眼目睹。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24914
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_be7e4028:

    # "There's a pause, then the painted dog seems to snap back to reality—or at the very least, to a plane of existence slightly closer to the ground."
    "停顿了一下，然后花斑狗似乎猛地回到了现实——或者至少，回到了一个稍微更接地气的存在层面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24919
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_6ec61936:

    # "He adjusts his clothes, wiping his glasses clean, clearing his throat somewhat more loudly than required."
    "他整理了一下衣服，擦干净眼镜，清了清嗓子，声音比必要的稍大了些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24921
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_edd39e48:

    # "He's trying his best to regain his calm and collected appearance."
    "他正尽力恢复他冷静镇定的外表。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24923
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_82538a86:

    # "But as he turns your way, he can't hide the glint behind his pupils."
    "但当他转向你这边时，他无法隐藏瞳孔背后的光芒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24927
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_550dd5c6:

    # n "I apologize, this is... a very fortuitous circumstance. {w}Would you care to hear an explanation of this phenomenon?"
    n "我道歉，这是……一个非常幸运的境遇。{w}你愿意听听对这个现象的解释吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:24929
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_8f5fab30:

    # "There's a light in his eyes that matches the shining below in spirit, if not in practice."
    "他眼中有一种光芒，在精神上与下方闪耀的光辉相呼应，即使形式上不同。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24931
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_d216958c:

    # "He's overjoyed. The effort to maintain a proper facade is evident, but he can't help but want to share the reason why."
    "他欣喜若狂。努力维持得体表象的意图很明显，但他忍不住想分享其中的缘由。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24935
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_44f768f4:

    # "And you're curious as well."
    "而你也很好奇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24937
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_5418ebf0:

    # "The sailors around the two of you are spellbound. You hear them talking in hushed tones about possible explanations, superstitions, old stories of ghosts set loose at sea."
    "你们俩周围的水手们都着了迷。你听见他们低声谈论着可能的解释、迷信、以及海上幽灵被释放的古老故事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24939
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_83966c57:

    # "They have never seen anything like it. And, for once, you have the opportunity of knowing more about the sea than they do."
    "他们从未见过这样的景象。而且，这一次，你有了比他们更了解海洋的机会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24942
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_a729ecaf:

    # "But with the sailors all enraptured by the spectacle, you're struck by an idea. {w}A risky, albeit rewarding, idea."
    "但随着水手们都沉醉于这奇观，你突然有了个主意。{w}一个虽有风险，但回报丰厚的主意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24961
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_ffaa4653:

    # p "I'd be more than happy to."
    p "我非常乐意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24965
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_b8b5862f:

    # "A large smile paves its way across the painted dog's face."
    "一个大大的笑容在花斑狗脸上绽开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24987
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_e352ca63:

    # n "I acquired {i}Employment for the Microscope{/i} as a manual of sorts, but became absorbed by its descriptions of experiments and incredibly minute life-forms."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:24989
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_dd5b22c1:

    # n "This phenomenon, this luminescence... It is rare, but not as much as people might think. There are many accounts of it, some very well documented."
    n "这种现象，这种发光现象……它很罕见，但并没有人们想的那么罕见。有很多关于它的记载，有些记录得非常详尽。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24991
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_d6413eee:

    # n "It is no surprise that more enterprising scholars than I have sought to test it."
    n "难怪比我更有进取心的学者们曾试图验证它。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24993
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_4e5378de:

    # "His brain has now been set in motion. Archives of his mind are all opening their secrets to you."
    "他的大脑现在已开始运转。他脑海中的档案库正将它们的秘密向你敞开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24995
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_0b45ca11:

    # n "Baker recounts a few of them, from literature and correspondence. Most are somewhat clinical, but one of them always struck me as... a little poetic, so to speak."
    n "贝克引用了其中一些，来自文献和信件。大多数都有些学究气，但其中有一个总是让我觉得……怎么说呢，有点诗意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24997
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_27fd92a9:

    # n "I may have read that passage a few more times than needed."
    n "我可能把那一段多读了几遍。"

# game/script day12.rpy:24999
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_d8e93946:

    # "Nomax clears his throat, his voice taking on the tone of a professor at a lecture hall. {w}At least, that's what you assume a professor at a lecture hall would sound like."
    "诺马克斯清了清嗓子，声音带上了讲堂里教授般的语调。{w}至少，你猜想讲堂里的教授就是这种声音。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25001
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_d14036a6:

    # n "Baker tells of a scholar in Chioggia, a doctor Vianelli if I am not mistaken, who studied the same shining happening in the local lakes."
    n "贝克讲述了一位在基奥贾的学者，如果我没记错的话，是一位维阿内利医生，他研究当地湖泊中发生的同样发光现象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25003
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_447314d4:

    # n "He supposed it to be tied to plant habitats and stormy weather."
    n "他推测这与植物栖息地和暴风雨天气有关。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25005
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_cab9d53a:

    # n "He scraped seaweed off the lake floor in an area known for it, then scraped the seaweed itself onto a piece of paper and observed the tiny animals left on it."
    n "他在一个以这种现象闻名的区域，从湖底刮下海藻，然后把海藻本身刮到一张纸上，观察留在上面的微小动物。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25007
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_73906884:

    # n "To quote, {i}\"unfolding the Paper, and viewing this luminous Body attentively, he found it far less than a small Hair, extremely delicate and tender, and of a deep yellow Colour.\"{/i}"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25009
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_126371d7:

    # p "You really can just recite his work on demand?"
    p "你真的能随口背诵他的作品？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25011
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_0f8febea:

    # n "Mayhaps.{w} When I mentioned I read it a few more times than needed... Well, that meant that by now I may or may not be able to recite it to you."
    n "也许吧。{w}当我提到我多读了几遍时……嗯，那意思是到现在，我或许能给你背出来也说不定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25013
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_b5922e7f:

    # p "I won't even ask how you got to that point."
    p "我甚至不想问你是怎么做到的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25015
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_14057b73:

    # n "A lot of time on my hands, and I found it fascinating. It is hardly a crime, is it?"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25017
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_85a924bd:

    # p "It's not, it's very... you."
    p "不，这很……像你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25019
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_c4052737:

    # n "If I may continue?..."
    n "如果我可以继续？……"

# game/script day12.rpy:25021
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_ff446ac1:

    # p "You may."
    p "可以。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25023
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_c2330ef9:

    # n "{i}\"And by the Help of a Microscope he discovered it to be a living Animalcule, of a curious and singular Structure...\"{/i}"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25025
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_5d2d38ed:

    # n "{i}\"... And could not enough admire the Splendour of its Light.\"{/i}"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25027
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_4a46010f:

    # n "Imagine it. Light in the palm of your hand. Thousands if not millions of tiny little creatures, invisible to the naked eye."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25029
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_e9d72470:

    # n "All that life is shining brightly in our wake. {w}Our passage upon the waves, marked by the invisible sprites that live in it."
    n "所有这些生命在我们的尾迹中闪闪发光。{w}我们在波浪上的航行，由居住其中的无形精灵标记着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25031
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_3eca94ab:

    # p "Wait. This is... insects? A swarm of glowing insects?"
    p "等等。这是……昆虫？一群发光的昆虫？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25033
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_9d65863a:

    # "The painted dog chuckles softly."
    "花斑狗轻轻地笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25035
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_e703628b:

    # n "Is that weird?"
    n "这很奇怪吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25037
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_f9251ccc:

    # p "I mean... not unbelievable, I suppose. But I'd never have thought about glowing insects."
    p "我是说……并非不可信，我想。但我从没想过会是发光的昆虫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25039
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_31b81a2d:

    # n "Really? Would it not be the first explanation that springs to mind?"
    n "真的吗？这难道不是最先跃入脑海的解释吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25041
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_4d245e8f:

    # p "Well, it feels... just not the first thing I'd think of."
    p "嗯，感觉……这不是我首先会想到的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25043
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_5a936980:

    # p "A big bunch of bugs emitting light, it strikes me as a little unbelievable."
    p "一大群虫子发光，这让我觉得有点难以置信。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25045
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_14e37ad6:

    # n "Have you never seen a firefly?"
    n "你从没见过萤火虫吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25047
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_9c2aa349:

    # p "I, uh..."
    p "我，呃……"

# game/script day12.rpy:25049
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_4493a306:

    # "Of course you've seen fireflies. You've lived on a farm for pretty much your entire life. Summer nights were filled with them."
    "你当然见过萤火虫。你几乎一生都住在农场里。夏夜到处都是它们。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25051
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_c54d5cef:

    # p "I've seen fireflies, yeah."
    p "我见过萤火虫，是的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25053
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_7adc84df:

    # n "Fireflies, this phenomenon... It emerges from the same principle. The method was already known."
    n "萤火虫，这种现象……源于相同的原理。方法早已为人所知。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25055
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_2e840c77:

    # n "We just didn't know where to look. And now we do."
    n "我们只是不知道去哪里寻找。而现在我们知道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25057
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_0a274683:

    # "You can tell the painted dog has no intention of belittling you."
    "你能看出花斑狗并没有贬低你的意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25059
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_fc602e43:

    # "His eyes are bound to the luminous waves. Any thought he shares isn't malicious, just... unfiltered."
    "他的目光锁定在发光的波浪上。他分享的任何想法都没有恶意，只是……未经修饰。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25061
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_d9bf5a59:

    # n "And... All of it is in that book. The passage I recited is even interspersed with impeccable drawings of them in minute detail."
    n "而且……所有这些都在那本书里。我背诵的那段甚至穿插着它们无可挑剔、细致入微的插图。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25063
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_93b37886:

    # n "A description of what he saw under the microscope follows, but I'll skip ahead instead."
    n "接下来是对他在显微镜下所见之物的描述，但我还是跳过去吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25065
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_e424bd87:

    # n "I feel it might ruin the magic."
    n "我觉得那可能会破坏这份魔力。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25067
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_5a16b877:

    # "His voice takes on the warm and joyful recitative tone of a scholar in his element."
    "他的声音恢复了学者在本行领域那种温暖而愉悦的吟诵语调。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25069
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_b7a525de:

    # n "{i}\"Vianelli observes, that these glittering Sea Water Insects are entirely luminous, whereas the Glow-worm emits Light only from a Part about the Tail.\"{/i}"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25071
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_b8409c50:

    # n "{i}\"And, moreover, that when at rest they do not shine at all, though they send forth a producious Brightness as soon as their little Bodies become agitated.\"{/i}"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25073
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_3842c7c7:

    # n "{i}\"Hence he accounts for the Fisherments foretelling a Tempest from an extraordinary glittering of the Sea and Lakes...\"{/i}"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25075
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_86069cbe:

    # n "{i}\"These Animalcules as he supposes being disturbed and put in Motion at the Approach of such a Change.\"{/i}"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25077
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_a2747b1d:

    # "The waves slosh idly in the wake of your vessel, burning blue light into the night."
    "波浪在你船只的尾迹中慵懒地拍打，将蓝色的光芒烙印在夜色中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25079
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_598fe846:

    # p "It's hard to believe something so calm could be the sign of an incoming storm."
    p "很难相信如此平静的景象会是暴风雨来临的预兆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25081
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_2bbeb31f:

    # p "Or maybe it's lingering from the one we just passed. It doesn't have to be an omen, necessarily."
    p "或许这只是我们刚经历的那场风暴的余波。它不一定非得是个征兆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25083
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_b8536b68:

    # n "Oh, worry not, there is no need for a storm. The passage of our ship is enough to stir the spirit of these little fairies of the sea."
    n "哦，别担心，不需要有暴风雨。单是我们船只的经过，就足以搅动这些海中精灵的活力了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25085
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_18a6eb60:

    # n "Vianelli tested this theory. {w}He simply took a small boat to the local waters and dipped his own arm in, stirring light and water with a gesture."
    n "维亚内利验证过这个理论。{w}他仅仅是划一艘小船到当地水域，将自己的手臂浸入水中，一个手势便搅起了光芒与水花。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25087
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_6490fb2e:

    # n "It must have been magical. What I would give to do the same."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25089
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_listen_e359a2f7:

    # "Sadly, there are still several feet of ship between his paw and the blue-tinged waters below."
    "可惜，他的爪子与下方泛着蓝光的水面之间，还隔着好几英尺的船体。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25113
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_ffaa4653:

    # p "I'd be more than happy to."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25117
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_b8b5862f:

    # "A large smile paves its way across the painted dog's face."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25137
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_e352ca63:

    # n "I acquired {i}Employment for the Microscope{/i} as a manual of sorts, but became absorbed by its descriptions of experiments and incredibly minute life-forms."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25139
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_1cd9a663:

    # "His voice is soft, excited, full of the joy of a scholar who found an eager audience."
    "他的声音轻柔、兴奋，充满了学者找到热心听众的喜悦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25141
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_030d5eb9:

    # "And suddenly stopped when you reach for a handful of his backside!"
    "而当你伸手去抓他臀部一把时，他的声音戛然而止！"

# game/script day12.rpy:25155
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_28624abf:

    # n "Ah... What are you..."
    n "啊……你这是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:25157
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_eeb25d1c:

    # "You whisper in his ear, inconspicuously."
    "你在他耳边低语，不动声色。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25159
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_cc0fe942:

    # p "Oh, keep going. This is all very fascinating stuff."
    p "哦，继续讲啊。这些都太迷人了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25161
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_6023712b:

    # "The painted dog blushes, his eyes darting around the crowd that's gathered on this side of the ship."
    "彩绘犬脸红了，目光飞快地扫视着聚集在船这一侧的人群。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25163
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_044ac870:

    # p "Don't worry about the others. Everyone's spellbound, nobody is paying attention to us."
    p "别管其他人。大家都入迷了，没人注意我们。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25165
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_c61a389e:

    # p "Unless, of course, you were to go unexpectedly quiet."
    p "当然，除非你突然不出声了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25167
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_33977f93:

    # p "So, please..."
    p "所以，请……"

# game/script day12.rpy:25171
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_33c5a8bd:

    # "A squeeze, followed by a suppressed whimper."
    "一次揉捏，随之是一声压抑的呜咽。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25173
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_db340a11:

    # p "... do continue."
    p "……继续讲。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25175
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_e6958e42:

    # "His breath is heavy, trembling."
    "他的呼吸沉重，颤抖着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25177
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_d3242768:

    # n "This phenomenon, ah, this luminescence... It is rare, but not as much as people might think. There are, uh, many accounts of it, some very well documented."
    n "这种现象，啊，这种发光……很罕见，但没人们想的那么罕见。有，呃，很多记载，有些记录得非常详尽。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25179
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_c4e3f68f:

    # "You knead. It's soft, not tensing up at all."
    "你揉捏着。那里很柔软，完全没有绷紧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25181
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_99a2fc46:

    # n "Baker recounts a few of them, from l-letters. I, uh, I think I can recite one or two."
    n "贝克从信、信件中引述了一些。我，呃，我想我能背出一两段。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25183
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_d425b1e4:

    # "You can feel the muscles of his tail wanting to move, but being forced to relax by his sense of modesty."
    "你能感觉到他尾巴的肌肉想要摆动，却被他的羞耻心强迫着放松下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25185
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_296523bf:

    # n "There was this scholar, a, ah... doctor Vianelli I think. He studied the same shining happening in the local lakes."
    n "有这么一位学者，一，啊……我想是维亚内利医生。他研究了当地湖泊里同样的发光现象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25190
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_df062e12:

    # "You shift your fingers between his cheeks, a thin piece of fabric blocking the way to what he knows is your obvious goal."
    "你的手指在他臀瓣间移动，一层薄薄的布料阻挡着你通往他心知肚明的明显目标。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25192
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_d8d0b96e:

    # "The crew is spellbound. Eyes and sometimes mouths wide open, staring at the glimmering blue lights crashing against the ship and being left in its wake."
    "船员们都入迷了。眼睛、有时嘴巴都张得大大的，盯着撞击船体、又被抛在船尾后闪着蓝光的亮点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25196
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_057d08c4:

    # "Nobody is paying you any mind."
    "没人留意你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25198
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_d5bc26fb:

    # n "V-Vianelli, he thought that, uh... He did some testing and took a boat, and a bucket of water from the lake..."
    n "维-维亚内利，他认为，呃……他做了一些测试，划了条船，从湖里打了一桶水……"

# game/script day12.rpy:25200
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_1ebfc91d:

    # "Your hand moves from his behind to his side, making its way past his hip..."
    "你的手从他的身后移到他身侧，经过他的髋部……"

# game/script day12.rpy:25202
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_1e24c1c6:

    # n "And... the book was about a m-microscope, right? He looked at the water, obviously..."
    n "而……那本书是关于显、显微镜的，对吧？他观察了水，显然……"

# game/script day12.rpy:25207
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_42eba91d:

    # "... to right above his crotch."
    "……正好移到了他的胯部上方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25209
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_b6473b48:

    # n "At the... at the light. He saw..."
    n "在……在光下。他看到……"

# game/script day12.rpy:25213
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_b965e92d:

    # "Nomax briefly bites his lip, before reining his teeth in. A short loss of control, immediately regained."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25215
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_b2ee1538:

    # n "I-imagine it. M-millions of tiny little creatures, invisible to the naked eye."
    n "想-想象一下。数、数百万微小的生物，肉眼看不见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25228
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_8bd3246f:

    # p "I can imagine it, all right."
    p "我能想象，当然能。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25230
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_d3f3d479:

    # "The painted dog's explanation doesn't sound believable to you. It barely sounds coherent, in fact."
    "彩绘犬的解释在你听来并不可信。事实上，几乎语无伦次。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25232
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_41a9815f:

    # "And you have no intention of letting him focus."
    "而你无意让他集中精神。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25236
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_1fdae9ef:

    # "You run your fingers up and down, feeling his sheath through his clothes."
    "你的手指上下摩挲，隔着衣物感受着他的阴茎鞘。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25238
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_209b3257:

    # "The oohs and aahs of the crowd, some mumbled attempts at searching for explanations."
    "人群的“哦哦”、“啊啊”声，一些低声咕哝着试图寻找解释。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25242
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_e1516ef2:

    # "The painted dog's crotch trembles under your fingertips, his organ a toy for you to play with."
    "彩绘犬的胯部在你的指尖下颤抖，他的器官成了你手中的玩物。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25248
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_4b2044f9:

    # "By now, you know his body well enough to perfectly imagine how it's reacting."
    "到现在，你已经足够熟悉他的身体，能完美地想象出它是如何反应的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25251
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_20141d6a:

    # "You can remember his body well enough to imagine how it's reacting"
    "你足够清楚地记得他的身体，足以想象它是如何反应的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25253
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_4989d4a1:

    # p "Please... continue."
    p "请……继续。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25255
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_f75bf843:

    # "His blushing is impossible to deny, but at the same time, invisible in the dim blue light that surrounds you."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25257
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_addee2b4:

    # "His eyes are bound to the luminous waves. His body, to your capable hand."
    "他的眼睛被发光的波浪所束缚。他的身体，则被你灵巧的手所掌控。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25259
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_bcb4229d:

    # n "All... All of it is in that book. There are drawings too. They are... very good."
    n "所、所有……所有细节都在那本书里。还有插图。它们……非常好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25261
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_c9a80dd2:

    # p "Very good, mm-hmm."
    p "非常好，嗯哼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25269
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_0807390b:

    # "You cup his crotch with your paw. The tip of his cock trembles through the cloth, pushing another inch outwards."
    "你用爪子罩住他的胯部。他龟头的尖端隔着布料颤抖，又向外顶出了一英寸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25271
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_45819f19:

    # "Nomax closes his eyes, grasping at memories more slippery than eels."
    "诺马克斯闭上眼睛，努力抓住比鳗鱼还滑溜的记忆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25273
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_ee2cc1cc:

    # n "{i}Hence he accounts for the Fisherments foretelling a Tempest from an extraordinary gl-glittering of the Sea and Lakes...{/i}"
    n "{i}因此他解释了渔民如何从海洋与湖泊异乎寻常的闪、闪光中预知风暴……{/i}"

# game/script day12.rpy:25275
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_99b9d3fe:

    # "Nothing of what he's saying makes any sense to you. You know you'll have forgotten it by morning."
    "他所说的一切对你而言都毫无意义。你知道到了早上你就会忘掉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25277
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_3ad682f2:

    # "But you won't forget his throbbing under your paw."
    "但你不会忘记他在你爪下的悸动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25279
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_8da70f69:

    # n "{i}These Animalcules as he supposes being disturbed and put in Motion at the Approach of...{w} such a Change.{/i}"
    n "{i}这些微生物，据他推测，在……{w}这种变化来临之际受到扰动并开始运动。{/i}"

# game/script day12.rpy:25281
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_77d6e5ff:

    # "His head turns, as he whispers in your ear."
    "他转过头，在你耳边低语。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25283
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_f459cddb:

    # "His voice is low, and for you only."
    "他的声音很低，只给你听。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25285
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_541d40af:

    # n "A-are you going to make me, ah... R-right inside my..."
    n "你-你是要让我，啊……就、就在我的……里面……"

# game/script day12.rpy:25287
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_84874566:

    # p "I could if I wanted to."
    p "如果我想的话，我可以。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25289
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_b6800d32:

    # "You squeeze gently. A few more pushes and it might even poke out from behind his expensive sash."
    "你轻轻一握。再顶几下，它甚至可能从他昂贵的腰封后面戳出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25291
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_52a894e7:

    # p "But... that would be stupid, wouldn't it?"
    p "但是……那样会很蠢，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25295
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_d237cf75:

    # "A rub. {w}The painted dog suppresses a moan, but barely."
    "一次摩擦。{w}彩绘犬压抑住一声呻吟，但几乎没压住。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25297
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_b678ba8a:

    # n "Y-yes... extremely stupid."
    n "是-是的……极其愚蠢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25301
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_280ae98d:

    # "He's at his limit."
    "他到了极限。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25303
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_8dbd63ca:

    # "And that's exactly where you want to keep him."
    "而这正是你想让他保持的状态。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25305
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_235a7d5d:

    # p "Thank you for the explanation."
    p "谢谢你的讲解。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25310
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_88d09f12:

    # "You withdraw your paw, easing the pressure on his member and sense of modesty."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25312
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_a72cd111:

    # "The painted dog jolts, his breath heavy."
    "彩绘犬猛地一颤，呼吸沉重。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25328
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_f2426ea7:

    # "It takes a few minutes of him recalling how to breathe before he calms down. {w}You let him."
    "他花了几分钟才回想起如何呼吸，然后平静下来。{w}你任由他调整。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25330
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_9491754d:

    # "In all that time, his eyes don't stray from the electric waves once."
    "在整个过程中，他的目光一次也没有离开过那些电光般的波浪。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25334
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_4ee20ca1:

    # n "L-look down there..."
    n "看-看下面……"

# game/script day12.rpy:25341
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_108389a7:

    # n "The passage of our ship is enough to... To make it happen."
    n "我们船只的经过就足以……足以让它发生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25343
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_6f89cab3:

    # "Another breath. He's almost entirely composed now. {w}Or, perhaps, just excellent at pretending to be."
    "又吸了一口气。他现在几乎完全镇定了。{w}或者，也许只是非常擅长假装镇定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25345
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_2d7dcb8b:

    # n "Vianelli tested his theory. He... {w}simply took a small boat to the local waters and dipped his own arm in, stirring light and water with a gesture."
    n "维亚内利验证了他的理论。他……{w}仅仅是划一艘小船到当地水域，将自己的手臂浸入水中，一个手势便搅起了光芒与水花。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25347
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_684f1697:

    # n "It must have been magical. What I would give to do the same..."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25349
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_moonlight_grab_e359a2f7:

    # "Sadly, there are still several feet of ship between his paw and the blue-tinged waters below."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25355
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_1e05c852:

    # p "You know... This reminds me you still owe me a promise, I think."
    p "你知道……这让我想起，我想你还欠我一个承诺。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25359
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_565c35bc:

    # "His ears flatten as he struggles to follow your train of thought."
    "他的耳朵耷拉下来，努力跟上你的思路。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25361
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_13270046:

    # n "Come again?"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25363
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_fb62dbd7:

    # p "Not to rush the creative process or appear impatient, but... We did talk about you sketching something for me? As a gift?"
    p "不是要催创作过程或显得没耐心，但是……我们确实谈过你为我画幅素描？作为礼物？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25365
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_6f5e4057:

    # p "Back when I visited on the second day after our departure from port."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25367
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_e0ed55af:

    # "His face and demeanor are polite, but you can see confusion in his gaze."
    "他的表情和举止彬彬有礼，但你能看到他目光中的困惑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25369
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_60a1cd41:

    # p "Of yourself."
    p "画你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25371
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_f52c5993:

    # p "Any progress on that?"
    p "有什么进展吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25373
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_21eb1c09:

    # n "Drawing?"
    n "画？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25377
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_adf917fa:

    # "Mental connections finally begin to communicate with each other. A spark triggers behind his eyes."
    "大脑里的连接终于开始互相沟通。他眼中闪过一丝火花。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25379
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_7f1ce8cf:

    # n "Ah, yes, the drawing! Right, uhm-"
    n "啊，对，那幅画！对了，嗯——"

# game/script day12.rpy:25381
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_a379728a:

    # p "You actually made one?"
    p "你真画了一幅？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25385
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_6c833b38:

    # "You're not quite sure why you sound so surprised."
    "你不太确定自己为何听起来如此惊讶。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25387
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_1e97accc:

    # n "Well-"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25389
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_73e92c42:

    # "Was it truly so shocking he'd keep his word?"
    "他信守诺言真的那么令人震惊吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25391
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_114cadb2:

    # "Though now you're second-guessing—had it been a proper promise? Did he say he'd do it?"
    "虽然现在你有些怀疑——那算是个正式的承诺吗？他说过他会画吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25393
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_1f74cda7:

    # "You don't quite remember it yourself."
    "你自己也记不太清了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25397
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_7ef3b08a:

    # n "I... may have. I was not sure about showing it."
    n "我……可能画了。我不太确定要不要拿出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25399
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_a5f44592:

    # n "I thought about starting over-"
    n "我考虑过重画——"

# game/script day12.rpy:25401
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_3cd4ae38:

    # "You feel that sentence wasn't supposed to end where it did. You suspect he'd hoped you'd forget."
    "你觉得那句话本不该在那里结束。你怀疑他曾希望你忘记这件事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25403
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_88534e2c:

    # p "How come? Not satisfied with it?"
    p "怎么了？不满意？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25405
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_990f285d:

    # n "No, that is not quite it. I..."
    n "不，不完全是那样。我……"

# game/script day12.rpy:25407
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b6387d32:

    # p "Well, spit it out then."
    p "好吧，那就说出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25409
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_cc440364:

    # p "Did you accidentally eat it for breakfast?{w} Used it for kindling?{w} Why are you so tongue-tied all of a sudden?"
    p "你不小心把它当早餐吃了？{w}当引火柴烧了？{w}你怎么突然变得结结巴巴的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25413
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_03b5d2ea:

    # n "It is..."
    n "它是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:25419
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_1d703e81:

    # "He leans closer, keeping his voice low, gesturing for you to come near."
    "他凑得更近，压低声音，示意你也靠近。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25421
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b14ed3da:

    # "You oblige, eyebrow raised."
    "你顺从了，挑起眉毛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25423
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_58355168:

    # n "I do not think out here is the right place to show it."
    n "我认为这里不是展示它的合适地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25425
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_13938a9e:

    # "His voice is calm, but he can't hide a light trembling."
    "他的声音平静，但无法隐藏一丝轻微的颤抖。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25427
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_e928f98a:

    # "Your lips twitch into a subtle grin."
    "你的嘴角抽搐，露出一抹不易察觉的坏笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25429
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2448e48f:

    # p "Oh, it's not?{w}... Sounds {i}exciting.{/i}"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25431
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5ad11439:

    # p "You have my attention."
    p "你成功引起了我的注意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25433
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b2620a66:

    # "You requested a nude, that much you remember, and judging by his fidgeting he might have actually drawn one. Now you're certain that he had banked on your forgetfulness."
    "你记得自己要求过一幅裸体画，而从他坐立不安的样子判断，他可能真的画了。现在你确信，他原本指望你会忘记这件事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25435
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_3a3ae8d3:

    # "Or perhaps he's simply that shy about his art."
    "又或者，他只是对自己的作品感到如此羞涩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25439
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_fecde77c:

    # "You whisper back in his ear."
    "你凑近他耳边低声回应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25443
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_9a89c6f6:

    # p "Your cabin then. No audience there."
    p "那就去你的船舱。那里没有观众。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25445
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_a7027678:

    # "The painted dog jolts, standing up straight."
    "彩绘狗猛地一惊，站直了身子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25447
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_8123e8de:

    # n "Er, right. Of course."
    n "呃，对。当然。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25454
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_131b0b59:

    # "But by the time he replies, you're already striding toward the hatch. No need to wait for his agreement."
    "但在他回答之前，你已经大步走向舱口。没必要等他的同意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25456
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_6678a4a4:

    # "His reluctant footsteps follow in tow behind you."
    "他不情愿的脚步声跟在你身后。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25459
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d8237e87:

    # p "That's no problem. You don't have to bring it up here."
    p "这不成问题。你不必把它拿到这里来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25461
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_93e6ee25:

    # n "Well, if you really want to see it then we could... head to my cabin?"
    n "嗯，如果你真想看的话，我们可以……去我的船舱？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25463
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_e67a640b:

    # p "I'm dying to see it. Let's get a move on then!"
    p "我迫不及待想看了。那我们快走吧！"

# game/script day12.rpy:25470
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_8afc4070:

    # "The painted dog leads you into the bowels of the ship, sneaking a furtive look every once in a while, worried about potential witnesses."
    "彩绘狗领着你进入船舱深处，时不时偷偷瞥一眼，担心可能有目击者。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25472
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_9e1bc01b:

    # "He'd make for a terrible thief, you think as you follow him back to the small room where he hides his secrets from the world."
    "他可真当不了好贼，你一边跟着他回到那个他向世界隐藏秘密的小房间，一边这么想着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25478
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d786683d:

    # "With a push, you open the door and welcome him into his own room. His tail flicks nervously as he passes—you let your gaze linger."
    "你推开门，把他迎进他自己的房间。他经过时尾巴紧张地甩动——你让目光多停留了片刻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25487
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_3d02ab37:

    # "At this point you're past caring if he notices your interest. In fact, you deliberately take an extra second before you meet his eyes."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25494
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_e0cad443:

    # n "Something on my trousers? Did I spill something?"
    n "我裤子上有什么东西吗？我洒了什么吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25496
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b4343adb:

    # n "I hope not! I don't have enough water to clean it currently."
    n "希望没有！我现在可没有足够的水来清洗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25498
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_a89131ec:

    # "He cranes his neck to look over his own shoulder. {w}You groan under your breath. Surely he cannot be {i}that{/i} clueless."
    "他伸长脖子回头查看自己的肩膀。{w}你在心里呻吟。他总不至于{i}那么{/i}迟钝吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25500
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_e99e1054:

    # p "Just admiring the view."
    p "只是欣赏风景。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25504
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5868ae9b:

    # n "Oh..."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25506
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_bb2cf764:

    # n "..."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25510
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_c6cff25b:

    # p "... You look good."
    p "……你看起来不错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25514
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_f948530f:

    # "The door groans as you shove it closed, warped wood grinding in the frame as you try to make sure it won't slide open on its own a second time."
    "门在你用力关上时发出呻吟，变形的木头在门框里摩擦，你想确保它不会自己再滑开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25516
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_78f748c6:

    # p "How would you say it? You have a way with words.{w} {i}Exquisite,{/i} actually."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25521
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_8d8e1c9d:

    # "He pushes the door open, welcoming you into his room with a genteel wave of his hand. An invitation that you happily accept."
    "他推开门，优雅地挥手请你进入他的房间。你欣然接受了这个邀请。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25530
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_0292d4b2:

    # "The scent of faint perfume fills your nose. Citrus and sandalwood, you'd guess."
    "淡淡的香水味萦绕鼻尖。你猜是柑橘和檀香。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25532
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_dbd7b2e7:

    # "An aroma that is... actually pleasant? A rare sensation these days."
    "这香气……竟然令人愉悦？这在近来可是难得的感受。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25538
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_8437acfc:

    # "He wrestles the stubborn door closed, well experienced with the temperamental thing by now."
    "他与那扇倔强的门搏斗着把它关好，如今对这喜怒无常的家伙已是经验丰富。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25545
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_81bbe677:

    # "Then he turns to you."
    "然后他转向你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25547
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_9e83f6e0:

    # n "Erm, so. The drawing, right?"
    n "呃，那么。那幅画，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25549
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d90f9699:

    # p "Of course, that's why we came here. Why, did you have something else in mind?"
    p "当然，这就是我们来这儿的原因。怎么，你心里在想别的事？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25553
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_7c657f09:

    # n "No.{w} The drawing, yes! Where did I-.."
    n "没有。{w}是那幅画，对！我把它放哪了——"

# game/script day12.rpy:25558
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_8c4addc0:

    # "He looks lost and flustered as he scans his cabin for... well, truth be told, you don't really know what. He travels light, with not much in the way of luggage."
    "他扫视着自己的船舱，显得迷茫而慌乱……好吧，说实话，你也不知道他在找什么。他行李轻简，没什么家当。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25560
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_54eb49ad:

    # "It's either in his traveler's chest or somewhere among the items on the desk."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25565
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_caf07018:

    # p "Try the sketchbook on the table?"
    p "试试桌上的素描本？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25567
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_71f8d9cc:

    # n "Hm?{w} Oh, no no. Separate sheet! Didn't want it in the, you know-"
    n "嗯？{w}哦，不不。是单独的一张纸！不想把它放在，你知道的——"

# game/script day12.rpy:25575
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2af0b1f0:

    # "You lean over to get a closer look. In between the pages of the sketchbook winks a loose sheet of paper."
    "你俯身凑近细看。素描本的书页间，夹着一张松散的纸片在向你眨眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25577
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d5964c86:

    # p "There is a sheet in the sketchbook."
    p "素描本里有一张纸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25583
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_23aa6f04:

    # n "-main journal. Oh, is there?!"
    n "——主画册里。哦，是吗？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:25587
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_264d4eef:

    # n "Right! Yes, yes! That's where I put it, so that I would remember to...{w} put it away."
    n "对！是的，是的！我就是放在那儿，好提醒自己……{w}把它收好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25593
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_fe015e9c:

    # "The painted dog walks up to the table. If he's blushing, he's doing a surprisingly good job hiding it."
    "彩绘狗走到桌边。如果他在脸红，那他掩饰得真是出奇地好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25597
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2a6735e6:

    # "He snatches the sketchbook from among the various items and protectively holds it with both hands to his chest."
    "他从各种物品中一把抓过素描本，双手保护性地抱在胸前。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25602
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2278cf14:

    # n "You... still want it? Even though-"
    n "你……还想看吗？尽管——"

# game/script day12.rpy:25604
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_1702fbc2:

    # p "{i}Especially{/i} because. Out with it."
    p "{i}正因为{/i}如此。拿出来吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25606
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_413c81eb:

    # p "It's just a drawing, relax. It can't be that bad."
    p "只是一幅画而已，放轻松。不可能那么糟。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25608
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_c3673e39:

    # n "It is not proper. That's why."
    n "它不合礼数。所以我才……"

# game/script day12.rpy:25610
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_a5cd2d27:

    # p "So? That's exactly what I asked for."
    p "所以呢？这正是我要求的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25614
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_469b0358:

    # "He opens the book, his eyes fixed on it, carefully avoiding crossing yours."
    "他翻开本子，目光紧盯着它，小心翼翼地避免与你对视。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25616
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_04b44982:

    # "He studies the sheet of paper for a few seconds, before holding it by a corner and handing it over to you."
    "他端详了那张纸几秒钟，然后捏着一角递给你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25634
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_acd3b15d:

    # "Oh, it's a drawing alright!"
    "哦，这确实是一幅画！"

# game/script day12.rpy:25636
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_7e54c2bd:

    # "And what a drawing it is."
    "而且是一幅怎样的画啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25638
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5a473db0:

    # "You don't pay any attention to the face on the paper. Your gaze is immediately captured... a little further down the page."
    "你根本没注意纸上画的脸。你的目光立刻被吸引到了……页面稍往下一点的地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25640
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_67b5ce7b:

    # "You dig into your memory. What exactly did you ask him to draw, again?"
    "你努力回忆。你到底让他画了什么来着？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25642
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_14932776:

    # "A sultry nude, wasn't it?"
    "一幅撩人的裸体画，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25644
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_7f2164fa:

    # "You'd expected tasteful nudes—draped fabrics, artful shadows, subtle ambiguity. Not... well, something almost reminiscent of anatomical charts."
    "你期待的是雅致的裸体——垂坠的织物，巧妙的阴影，微妙的含蓄。而不是……嗯，某种几乎让人联想到解剖图的东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25646
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_6a9136d6:

    # "Everything rendered in precise detail.{w} Every.{w} Single.{w} Inch."
    "每一处都以精确的细节呈现。{w}每一处。{w}每一寸。{w}皆是如此。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25648
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_8fcc296c:

    # "Not that you'd ever complain about that."
    "倒不是说你会对此抱怨什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25650
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5e309c54:

    # "And neither would your body, you think, as suddenly your pants feel surprisingly restrictive."
    "你的身体也不会，你这么想着，突然觉得裤子紧得令人惊讶。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25652
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_957b0548:

    # p "You went a lot further than I expected you to go."
    p "你画得比我预想的要深入得多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25654
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_9ea6dcff:

    # p "Especially considering it's you."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25656
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_0ad55114:

    # n "Perhaps a little..."
    n "或许有点……"

# game/script day12.rpy:25658
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_a063e306:

    # p "Dated June 8th. That's the day immediately after our little chat. You must have been beyond eager to get going on it."
    p "日期是6月8日。那是我们简短谈话后的第二天。你一定迫不及待要开始画它了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25660
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_9a330248:

    # "No answer. His ears burn crimson as he looks the other way."
    "没有回答。他扭过头去，耳朵烧得通红。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25662
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_312c1e30:

    # "You trace a finger on the pencil lines where tail meets thigh, willing the sketch to shift position."
    "你的手指描摹着铅笔线条，那是尾巴与大腿相接处，心里盼着草图能变换姿势。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25664
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d487bc5d:

    # "Without success, to your great disappointment."
    "未能如愿，你深感失望。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25666
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_fa876622:

    # n "Do you like it?"
    n "你喜欢吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25668
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_c1fc8a24:

    # p "Like it? It's even better than I imagined."
    p "喜欢？它甚至比我想象的还要好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25670
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_f1d95842:

    # "A subtle smile manages to break through his flustered expression."
    "一丝微弱的笑意终于突破了他慌乱的表情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25672
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_8098abef:

    # "For a moment you just enjoy how he looks. A rushed sound of footsteps from above fills the cabin, but whatever is happening on deck feels a world apart."
    "有那么一刻，你只是享受着他此刻的模样。上方传来一阵急促的脚步声，充满了船舱，但甲板上无论发生什么都感觉与这里相隔万里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25677
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_cb719eb1:

    # "You pull his cuff, tumbling onto the thin mattress with him right next to you."
    "你拉住他的袖口，和他一起跌倒在薄薄的床垫上，他就躺在你身旁。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25679
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_a33dbe6d:

    # p "Come here. Tell me more about it."
    p "过来。多跟我讲讲它。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25684
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_437a286f:

    # "You sit down on the mattress, inviting him to join in with a pat of your paw."
    "你在床垫上坐下，用爪子拍了拍，邀请他加入。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25688
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_cfab38d5:

    # "He turns and fusses with his coat tail as he sits down."
    "他转身坐下，同时摆弄着自己的燕尾服下摆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25690
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5b01f98c:

    # "The scent of his perfume intensifies. This close, indoors, you recognize a hint of jasmine as well.."
    "他的香水味变得更浓了。靠得这么近，在室内，你还辨认出一丝茉莉的香气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25694
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_10a06c17:

    # n "Tell you about it?"
    n "跟你讲讲它？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25696
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_92b673ee:

    # p "Well, how did you even make it? I faintly remember you mentioning that you didn't have a mirror."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25698
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2428846b:

    # n "Oh, I asked the captain. One of the gentlemen had a hand mirror they were able to lend me."
    n "哦，我问了船长。有位绅士有一面手镜可以借给我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25700
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_bb48fedb:

    # n "For my botanical studies, of course. I did not tell them about this."
    n "当然，是为了我的植物学研究。我没跟他们提这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25702
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_6fddd354:

    # "You chuckle."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25704
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d4e2b25a:

    # p "I figured as much."
    p "我就猜到是这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25706
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_bd296c1d:

    # p "And then you picked a subject so {i}very ungentlemanly.{/i} So very eager. I can imagine how excited you must have been."
    p "然后你选了一个{i}非常不绅士的{/i}主题。如此急切。我能想象你当时有多兴奋。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25708
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_41cedbc0:

    # n "Well, it was purely-"
    n "这个，那纯粹是——"

# game/script day12.rpy:25716
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_9e5298bd:

    # "His justification dies as your palm lands high on his inner thigh."
    "你的手掌落在他大腿内侧高处，打断了他的辩解。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25721
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d68f517d:

    # "You escalate swiftly, bringing your hand right to his crotch, fingers molding around the swell beneath his trousers."
    "你迅速升级动作，把手直接探向他的胯下，手指隔着裤子握住了那隆起的形状。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25723
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_695e4e95:

    # "Muscles tense and his thighs squeeze your hand between them."
    "肌肉绷紧，他的大腿将你的手夹在中间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25725
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_e83949fd:

    # p "But... I like your ungentlemanly side."
    p "但是……我喜欢你不绅士的这一面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25727
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_1fdae9ef:

    # "You run your fingers up and down, feeling his sheath through his clothes."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25729
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_f4da70bd:

    # "The painted dog's body trembles under your fingertips, a toy for you to play with."
    "彩绘狗的身体在你的指尖下颤抖，像一件供你玩耍的玩具。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25731
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_71e5970c:

    # p "You know what I like most about the drawing?"
    p "你知道我最喜欢这幅画的哪一点吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25733
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_45f2a1ff:

    # n "Mhm?"
    n "嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25737
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_053d796c:

    # "He bites his lips, unable to get out a proper word."
    "他咬着嘴唇，说不出一个完整的词。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25739
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2a916c54:

    # "But as you do, you find it impossible to ignore that the footsteps have increased in number and urgency."
    "但就在这时，你发现无法忽视脚步声变得更多、更急促了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25746
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_4960a242:

    # "You shift your attention to the door."
    "你将注意力转向门。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25748
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2031943c:

    # "It's still closed, luckily, but now that you noticed it, you realize there's a commotion inside the ship as well."
    "幸好它还关着，但现在你注意到了，你意识到船内也有一阵骚动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25750
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_81132513:

    # "Is something going on?"
    "发生什么事了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25758
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_a95edf37:

    # "You feel Nomax throb in your palm. {w}You return your attention to him and find his eyes locked into yours, almost supplicating."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25760
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_0782f8b4:

    # n "What... What do you like most about the drawing?"
    n "你……你最喜欢这幅画的哪一点？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25770
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5c46dff8:

    # p "I like your expression."
    p "我喜欢你的表情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25774
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5a0d976e:

    # p "Peeking at me with just one eye, and even that is barely open. The subtle smile."
    p "只用一只眼睛偷看我，甚至那只眼睛也几乎没睁开。那微妙的笑容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25776
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_8b703676:

    # p "It makes you look strangely adorable here."
    p "这让画中的你看起来有种奇特的可爱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25780
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_fb390373:

    # n "Strangely? So you think I am not adorable usually?"
    n "奇特？所以你觉得我平时不可爱吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25782
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2b7d5aa1:

    # p "Refined I'd call you."
    p "我会称你为优雅。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25784
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_6935edf9:

    # p "Awkwardly refined."
    p "略带笨拙的优雅。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25786
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_9b565ee1:

    # p "Maybe that is adorable, actually."
    p "也许这其实挺可爱的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25790
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_285c703a:

    # "You flash him a genuine smile."
    "你对他露出一个真诚的微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25792
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_cd4be1c8:

    # p "Thank you for making this. I can keep it, right?"
    p "谢谢你画了这个。我可以留着它，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25794
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_f8f48fd8:

    # n "I guess so. I made it for you, so I can hardly ask for it back, can I?"
    n "我想是的。我是为你画的，所以很难开口要回来，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25796
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_08b37a2e:

    # p "You could."
    p "你可以的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25798
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_f9e42298:

    # n "Would you even give it back?"
    n "你甚至愿意还回来吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25800
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_316211c2:

    # "He asks through a chuckle, assuming the answer already."
    "他轻笑着问道，心里早已认定了答案。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25802
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_c7580003:

    # p "Now that, I'm not so sure about."
    p "这个嘛，我就不太确定了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25804
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_1cf008df:

    # p "Probably not, I really like it. It'd be hard to part with it now that I know what I'd be missing."
    p "大概不会，我真的很喜欢它。现在知道会失去什么，就很难割舍了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25812
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2ac75ada:

    # "Nomax eases his legs apart, letting your hand slip away. He gets up from the bed and searches through the items on the table."
    "诺马克斯分开了双腿，让你的手滑落。他从床上起身，在桌上的物品中翻找。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25814
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_e5dce751:

    # n "Just... make sure that nobody sees it, alright?"
    n "只是……确保没人看到它，好吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25816
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5b76d02c:

    # n "That's all I ask for."
    n "我别无所求。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25818
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_eadf1258:

    # "It's clearly the main thing his mind is concerned about. But you can still see the stiffness in his pants as he bends over, searching."
    "这显然是他心里主要担心的事。但当他弯下腰翻找时，你仍能看到他裤子里绷紧的轮廓。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25820
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_dd1dc9a4:

    # p "I'll make sure of that."
    p "我会确保这一点的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25822
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_4c49b7ca:

    # n "Have I got something to put it in... hmmm... You know, so that you don't run around the deck flashing my bits to everyone."
    n "我有没有什么东西可以把它装起来……嗯……你知道的，这样你就不会在甲板上跑来跑去，把我的‘部件’亮给所有人看。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25824
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_f5cac384:

    # "The temptation of replying with a snarky quip about his non-drawn bits poking out is strong, but you think it best to get this worry out of the way first."
    "想用一句关于他未画出的‘部件’正戳出来的尖刻俏皮话来回应，这种诱惑很强烈，但你认为最好先消除他的这份担忧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25826
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_4d653ac1:

    # "You scan the room to see if you spot anything that would fit the bill, though nothing springs out at you."
    "你扫视房间，看看是否有符合要求的东西，但没有什么立刻映入眼帘。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25830
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_655fc4ac:

    # p "I can just hide it, don't worry."
    p "我可以直接把它藏起来，别担心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25835
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_e337cf26:

    # p "I've hidden full bottles of alcohol before. This is child's play."
    p "我以前藏过整瓶的酒。这简直是小儿科。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25839
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_3ae3c2c4:

    # p "It's just a sheet of paper. I'll tuck it under my shirt and nobody will be any wiser."
    p "只是一张纸。我会把它塞在衬衫下面，没人会知道的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25844
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_446160e3:

    # "The painted dog stops, considering the available options."
    "彩绘狗停了下来，考虑着可行的选项。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25846
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b4ffae19:

    # n "Hmm... That should be good enough, I would thi-"
    n "嗯……那样应该够好了，我想——"

# game/script day12.rpy:25855
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_bc08f557:

    # "Suddenly, a loud rattle causes the door to vibrate."
    "突然，一阵响亮的咔嗒声让门震动起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25857
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_07389651:

    # n "Ah, Biscuits!"
    n "啊，饼干！"

# game/script day12.rpy:25859
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_0cfc8d6b:

    # "Nomax startles. Your own head snaps to the door immediately, and you quickly pull the drawing to your chest in case someone comes barging in."
    "诺马克斯吓了一跳。你自己的头也立刻转向门口，并迅速将画作拉到胸前，以防有人闯进来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25863
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_f55b92f6:

    # p "This part."
    p "这部分。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25870
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_bfebfdc4:

    # "You playfully squeeze his bulge with your paw. The painted dog suppresses a whimper."
    "你顽皮地用爪子捏了捏他裤裆的隆起。彩绘狗强忍住一声呜咽。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25872
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_7c859b68:

    # p "Almost hidden, but not quite. And it looks like you put extra effort into them."
    p "几乎被遮住了，但又不完全。看起来你在这部分额外下了功夫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25876
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_9d8ae70f:

    # n "I... may have."
    n "我……可能是有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25878
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_4fc51eb6:

    # p "See? It's fun to imagine you trying to get your own balls to look right."
    p "看吧？想象你努力想把自己的蛋蛋画得好看，这很有趣。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25880
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_30ef3b4d:

    # p "Looking back and forth between the mirror and the drawing."
    p "在镜子和画作之间来回看。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25884
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d4960fc0:

    # "You let your hand roam upwards, lifting his sash in the process, until it doesn't hold his pants in place anymore."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25886
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_8b24da1e:

    # "You guide two fingers underneath the rim of it and pull away enough to allow you a view underneath. {w}Not much is visible in the dim light, but what little is there is most certainly a treat."
    "你将两根手指引导到裤腰边缘下方，拉开足够让你看到里面的空间。{w}昏暗的光线下能看到的并不多，但仅有的那一点绝对是一种享受。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25888
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_c76ddb39:

    # "A hint of slickened red pokes out from the tip of his sheath, the rest below fading into darkness."
    "一抹湿润的红色从他的包皮尖端探出，其余部分则隐没在黑暗中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25890
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_f377751f:

    # "The same shade of red is painted across his cheeks when you look up at him."
    "当你抬头看他时，同样的红色染遍了他的脸颊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25892
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_74f808eb:

    # p "Looks accurate to me."
    p "我觉得画得很准确。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25894
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_36a323c4:

    # "His snout dips down in your periphery as he takes a look himself."
    "他的口鼻在你的余光中低下，他自己也看了一眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25896
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_fe609dc0:

    # p "You think we got some time?"
    p "你觉得我们还有时间吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25900
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_4bbcf9b8:

    # n "Time for what?"
    n "时间做什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25904
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b7b6fe69:

    # p "Make you cum, of course."
    p "当然是让你射出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25906
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_91e06e8d:

    # "The painted dog stares at you, his mouth hanging open slightly. You wait."
    "彩绘狗盯着你，嘴巴微微张开。你等待着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25908
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_6404ec4c:

    # "You expect an answer from him."
    "你期待着他的回答。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25917
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_c8c2f76f:

    # "And get a sudden sharp rattle of the walls in response."
    "却得到墙壁突然尖锐的咔嗒声作为回应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25919
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_00f589cd:

    # p "Ah, fuck!"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25921
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d3e37238:

    # "In an instant, you snap your head to the entrance and pull your hands back to your own person."
    "一瞬间，你将头猛地转向入口，并将双手收回自己身上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25927
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_47810be5:

    # "You think about it for a moment before coming to a conclusion."
    "你想了一会儿，然后得出了结论。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25931
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2428b3a5:

    # p "Your ass. Easily."
    p "你的屁股。毫无疑问。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25935
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_69ac3162:

    # p "Too many good memories of how it felt when I got to have my way with you."
    p "太多关于我随心所欲地对待你时，那种感觉的美好回忆了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25937
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b6cc84f6:

    # p "The moans, the whimpers, the way your paw shuddered when you came."
    p "那些呻吟，那些呜咽，你高潮时爪子颤抖的样子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25942
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_e2940907:

    # "He can't suppress a whine, much to your delight, as your paw underscores each sentence with a playful squeeze."
    "他无法抑制一声呜咽，这让你非常高兴，因为你的爪子用顽皮的挤压强调着每一句话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25944
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_205f404b:

    # p "And I've been thinking about pinning you down again."
    p "而且我一直在想再次把你按倒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25948
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_22e17bb0:

    # p "I just want to push you back and tell you to move aside your tail."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25950
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_cb4e51db:

    # p "All the things I could do to you."
    p "所有我能对你做的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25954
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_1c1a8015:

    # p "Pin you down. Feel you squeeze around me."
    p "把你按倒。感受你紧紧包裹着我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25957
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_92c12317:

    # "But you're the one squeezing, as his bulge gets more and more intimate with your paw."
    "但挤压的是你，因为他的隆起与你的爪子越来越亲密。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25959
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_af3814a1:

    # p "Perhaps I should, don't you think?"
    p "也许我应该这么做，你不觉得吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:25964
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b2f82e0d:

    # "You lay the drawing to the edge to free your other hand, pushing him back until he sinks down onto his bed."
    "你把画放到一边，腾出另一只手，将他向后推，直到他跌坐在床上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25966
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_8e925f4e:

    # "Wide-open eyes look back up at your domineering smirk."
    "睁大的眼睛回望着你霸道的坏笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25968
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_04f8377e:

    # "You let your weight settle onto his shoulder, pinning him in place while your fingers start to more thoroughly massage him through his pants."
    "你将身体的重量压在他的肩膀上，把他固定在原地，同时你的手指开始隔着裤子更彻底地按摩他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25970
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b0edd8a7:

    # "Up your hand goes to his sash and you tug it out of the way with a few hasty pulls. With the rim of his pants now out in the open, you are more than eager to get underneath them."
    "你的手向上移到他的腰带，匆忙几下把它扯到一边。现在他的裤腰暴露在外，你迫不及待地想探入其中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25972
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b21292e3:

    # "You expect the soft touch of a sheath."
    "你期待着触碰到柔软的包皮。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25981
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_c8c2f76f_1:

    # "And get a sudden sharp rattle of the walls in response."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25983
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_00f589cd_1:

    # p "Ah, fuck!"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25985
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_4a7081e9:

    # "In an instant, you snap your attention to the door and pull your hands back to your own person, sitting up straight on the bed."
    "一瞬间，你将注意力猛地转向门口，并将双手收回自己身上，在床上坐直。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25988
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_c3a7118e:

    # "The wooden walls around you shudder once again." with hpunch
    "周围的木墙再次震动。" with hpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:25990
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_fd37f261:

    # "A door."
    "一扇门。"

# game/script day12.rpy:25992
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_6f7b4ccc:

    # "A door was slammed shut somewhere on the ship, you realize.{w} Again."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:25994
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b9258f76:

    # "You take a moment to listen. With your focus on the environment, you notice several hurried steps going by the door, adding to the cacophony of footsteps echoing through the planks above."
    "你花了一点时间倾听。将注意力集中在环境上，你注意到门外有几声匆忙的脚步声经过，加入了上方甲板回荡的脚步声的嘈杂中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26001
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_4ed095e1:

    # p "What is going on?"
    p "发生什么事了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26004
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_0a8c6e86:

    # "Nomax quickly adjusts his pants and sash."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26006
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_70db9bf7:

    # n "I-I do not know."
    n "我-我不知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26008
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2f1929e5:

    # "His voice is breathy and carries a vulnerable tremble."
    "他的声音带着喘息和一丝脆弱的颤抖。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26012
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d54031e2:

    # n "Are... Are we being attacked by pirates?!"
    n "我们……我们是被海盗袭击了吗？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:26014
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_9d08310d:

    # p "Pirates? {w}Don't be ridiculous."
    p "海盗？{w}别犯傻了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26016
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_9c022dd9:

    # p "You've spent too much time reading your books."
    p "你花太多时间看你的书了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26018
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_ae68042f:

    # n "Well, what makes you so sure that there are no pirates?"
    n "那么，是什么让你这么确定没有海盗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26020
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_88c6a526:

    # n "Do you even know what a pirate attack sounds like?"
    n "你甚至知道海盗袭击听起来是什么样吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26022
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5b30a28b:

    # "You visibly roll your eyes, despite him having a point."
    "你明显地翻了个白眼，尽管他说得有道理。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26024
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d9b2021e:

    # "But it's all bravado. You have no idea what it could be."
    "但这都是虚张声势。你根本不知道可能是什么情况。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26026
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_10995708:

    # "Did you miss a call for all hands on deck?"
    "你是不是错过了全员甲板集合的命令？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26028
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2dd8a499:

    # "You don't think so. But you're not confident."
    "你不这么认为。但你并不确定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26032
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_a016bb75:

    # p "Not just because of, you know, the obvious. I like that too, very much, but I've never gotten a drawing like this before."
    p "不仅仅是因为，你知道的，那个明显的原因。我也很喜欢那个，非常喜欢，但我以前从未收到过这样的画作。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26034
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_05bf0c13:

    # p "Well... I have never known anyone who was as good of an artist as you, truth be told."
    p "嗯……说实话，我从未认识过像你这样优秀的画家。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26036
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_3f244724:

    # p "Can I really keep it?"
    p "我真的可以留着它吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26045
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5cd66222:

    # n "Why, of course. Though under one condition, if you do not mind."
    n "哦，当然。不过有一个条件，如果你不介意的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26047
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b0af816c:

    # n "I would appreciate you not showing it around. It is probably no mystery as to why."
    n "我希望你不要把它到处展示。原因大概不言而喻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26049
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_dafc7756:

    # "He scratches the back of his neck and lets out a subdued laugh."
    "他挠了挠后颈，发出一声克制的笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26053
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_8af92370:

    # p "Nobody?"
    p "任何人都不行？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26057
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_dc49fa96:

    # n "Nobody, please."
    n "拜托，任何人都不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26059
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_3dc50054:

    # p "I've talked with Julian about your art, and he really wanted to see some of it."
    p "我和朱利安聊过你的画，他真的很想看看一些作品。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26063
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_33584fe9:

    # n "It is an intimate drawing, [name]. I was barely comfortable enough to show it to you, so I do not think I am comfortable with Julian seeing it."
    n "这是一幅私密的画作，[name]。我把它展示给你看就已经很不自在了，所以我想我不会愿意让朱利安看到它。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26066
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_8af92370_1:

    # p "Nobody?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26070
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_dc49fa96_1:

    # n "Nobody, please."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26072
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_35451cc3:

    # p "Not even Julian? I've talked with him about possibly getting a drawing made by you, and he really wanted to see it when I do."
    p "连朱利安也不行？我和他聊过可能找你画一幅画的事，他真的很想在我拿到时看看。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26076
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d8bf158d:

    # n "It is an intimate drawing, [name]..."
    n "这是一幅私密的画作，[name]……"

# game/script day12.rpy:26080
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_55db7ece:

    # p "And you lifted his tail for him. It's hardly anything he hasn't seen yet.{w} Seen {i}and more.{/i}"
    p "而且你还帮他抬起了尾巴。这几乎算不上是他没见过的东西。{w}没见过{/i}才怪。{/i}"

# game/script day12.rpy:26082
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_9760a79f:

    # "He sighs. For a few seconds he says nothing, just staring at you."
    "他叹了口气。有几秒钟他什么也没说，只是盯着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26084
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_7222dc00:

    # n "Only Julian."
    n "只有朱利安。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26086
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d130541e:

    # p "Only Julian."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26090
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_e310c620:

    # p "I will keep it to myself, of course."
    p "我当然会自己保管。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26092
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_f532fb1d:

    # n "I appreciate it immensely."
    n "我对此万分感激。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26094
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_7bc5b0b2:

    # "The painted dog, now reassured, seems to relax."
    "彩绘狗现在放心了，似乎放松了下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26106
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5a94cc02:

    # "You look at the drawing again. {w}Now that the... first impact has faded, you find yourself more and more appreciative of the artistry."
    "你再次看向那幅画。{w}当最初的冲击感逐渐消退后，你发现自己越来越欣赏其中的艺术造诣。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26108
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_60b9b5c6:

    # "It takes a while for your eyes to see the details beyond the subject. One detail didn't register at first, but it's taking up your attention now."
    "你的目光花了些时间才注意到主体之外的细节。有一个细节起初并未被察觉，但现在正牢牢吸引着你的注意力。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26110
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_a968c391:

    # "A single pencil. You realize Nomax laid down lines and shadows and fur patterns with the same tool, holding it in different positions depending on its purpose."
    "一支铅笔。你意识到诺马克斯是用同一支工具勾勒线条、铺陈阴影、描绘毛发的纹理，只是根据不同的用途变换握笔姿势。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26112
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_29bccf46:

    # "The pointy end for details, flat against the page for shadows, same but harder for the fur. No... shadows also have subtler strokes, suggesting rather than depicting. It all just comes together in the end."
    "用笔尖刻画细节，用笔侧平涂阴影，同样的笔法但更用力地描绘毛发。不……阴影部分也有更细腻的笔触，意在暗示而非直接描绘。最终，一切完美地融合在一起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26114
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2a1e3c17:

    # "You wonder how many years it takes to master all the ways to use a pencil."
    "你想知道，要掌握运用铅笔的所有技巧，需要多少年的功力。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26116
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_862ffc49:

    # p "It's beautiful."
    p "真美。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26118
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_fd9e1f4a:

    # n "Thank you. I do think it came out rather well."
    n "谢谢。我也觉得这幅画完成得相当不错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26127
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_dcce3402:

    # "You look at the painted dog, then back at the drawing. {w}Then back at the painted dog."
    "你看了看那只彩绘狗，又回头看向画作。{w}接着再次看向那只彩绘狗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26131
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_c88124c7:

    # "He raises an eyebrow. {w}Then he realizes what you're picturing and blushes."
    "他挑起一边眉毛。{w}然后他明白了你脑海中的画面，脸一下子红了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26133
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_e70744e6:

    # n "Oh, um..."
    n "哦，嗯……"

# game/script day12.rpy:26135
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_682ec538:

    # p "Oh, sorry. It's just... It's a lovely self-portrait, I was thinking."
    p "哦，抱歉。我只是……我在想，这是一幅很可爱的自画像。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26137
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_ee7ff821:

    # p "Extremely faithful."
    p "极其逼真。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26139
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_1b827fb2:

    # "The rush of steps grows louder, but neither of you pays any attention to it."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26143
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_3380c99f:

    # "Nomax is looking away."
    "诺马克斯移开了视线。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26145
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_cd431f8d:

    # n "Well, I... thank you."
    n "嗯，我……谢谢你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26147
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_e9b68baf:

    # n "I borrowed a mirror from an officer. I decided working from reference was the best approach. {w}I wanted to make sure it was as precise as possible."
    n "我从一位军官那里借了面镜子。我决定以实物参照是最好的方法。{w}我想确保它尽可能精确。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26149
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_96516c2c:

    # "As soon as the words leave his lips, his blushing intensifies significantly."
    "话一出口，他的脸红得更厉害了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26151
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_6057ef2f:

    # "He didn't want to leave anything to the imagination."
    "他不想留下任何想象的余地。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26153
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_12cd3a24:

    # p "Well..."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26161
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_37dd9816:

    # "You lean in, the bed creaking below you."
    "你倾身向前，身下的床吱呀作响。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26163
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_6b9c54bc:

    # "The hints of jasmine in his perfume are even more noticeable from up close. They mix with sandalwood and other notes you don't recognize."
    "靠近后，他香水中的茉莉花香更加明显。它与檀香木以及其他你无法辨认的香调混合在一起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26167
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_f109d8a7:

    # "Nomax turns, his eyes locked into yours."
    "诺马克斯转过身，目光与你的交汇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26169
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5c240d1c:

    # p "I'll make sure to only look at it when I'm alone. It's a treasure."
    p "我保证只在独处时看它。这是一件珍宝。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26173
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_c8b6554b:

    # "At this distance, his voice is low and soft, whispering, reverberating across the chest with more intent than volume."
    "在这个距离，他的声音低沉而轻柔，近乎耳语，比起音量，更带着一种意图，在胸腔间回荡。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26175
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_3ab10109:

    # n "This makes me glad..."
    n "这让我很高兴……"

# game/script day12.rpy:26177
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_23856efd:

    # "You inch your paw closer, touching his with a fingertip."
    "你将爪子挪近些，用指尖碰了碰他的爪子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26179
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_414a2d45:

    # "You don't hold it. {w}You let him choose if he wants to reciprocate."
    "你没有握住它。{w}你让他选择是否想要回应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26181
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5059be15:

    # "A few seconds pass, as you wait for his choice."
    "几秒钟过去了，你在等待他的选择。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26183
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_697973e9:

    # "His paw raises from the bed..."
    "他的爪子从床上抬起……"

# game/script day12.rpy:26188
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_bf2c9997:

    # "... and is stopped in its tracks by the walls rattling violently around you."
    "……却被你们周围墙壁剧烈的震动给打断了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26190
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_07389651_1:

    # n "Ah, Biscuits!"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26192
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_baa6657c:

    # "A door. The cabin's door? {w}You instinctively bring the drawing to your chest, hiding it from any prying eyes that might suddenly appear."
    "门。船舱的门？{w}你本能地将画作护在胸前，以防任何可能突然出现的窥探目光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26199
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5d1a8adf:

    # "You turn your attention to it, springing off the bed, but the rattling isn't caused by someone trying to break in."
    "你将注意力转向门，从床上弹起，但那震动并非有人试图破门而入。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26201
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_4173d4c2:

    # "Other doors are being slammed closed... or open, around the ship."
    "船上的其他门正被猛地关上……或打开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26208
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_7a7b0514:

    # p "What's happening?"
    p "发生什么事了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26210
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_70db9bf7_1:

    # n "I-I do not know."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26212
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_25e3df14:

    # "The painted dog stands from the bed as well. His voice is breathy and carries a vulnerable tremble."
    "彩绘狗也从床上站了起来。他的声音带着喘息和一丝脆弱的颤抖。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26214
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d54031e2_1:

    # n "Are... Are we being attacked by pirates?!"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26216
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_52f32001:

    # p "Pirates? {w}No, I don't think so."
    p "海盗？{w}不，我觉得不是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26218
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_122d64dc:

    # p "This isn't a cheap novel, pirates are extremely rare."
    p "这不是廉价小说，海盗极其罕见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26220
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_8a4ab9e6:

    # p "And it doesn't sound like people are gearing up for a battle."
    p "而且听起来也不像人们在准备战斗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26224
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_ae68042f_1:

    # n "Well, what makes you so sure that there are no pirates?"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26226
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_88c6a526_1:

    # n "Do you even know what a pirate attack sounds like?"
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26228
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5b30a28b_1:

    # "You visibly roll your eyes, despite him having a point."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26230
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d9b2021e_1:

    # "But it's all bravado. You have no idea what it could be."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26232
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_10995708_1:

    # "Did you miss a call for all hands on deck?"
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26234
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2dd8a499_1:

    # "You don't think so. But you're not confident."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26244
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_aeb68958:

    # "You walk up to the door, putting your ear to it."
    "你走到门边，把耳朵贴上去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26246
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_7a96be44:

    # "You can't parse anything through the noise coming from the other side. Steps, doors, muffled frantic words and shouts. Whatever is happening, it seems to have thrown everything into chaos."
    "透过另一侧的嘈杂声，你无法分辨出任何具体内容。脚步声、门声、模糊而急促的话语和喊叫。无论发生了什么，似乎一切都陷入了混乱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26248
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b94993e0:

    # "You take one last look at the drawing and store it in the inside of your shirt. Hopefully it will be protected enough."
    "你最后看了一眼画作，把它塞进衬衫内侧。希望这样足够保护它。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26255
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_033c1935:

    # "You place your paw on the handle and look back at the painted dog."
    "你将爪子放在门把手上，回头看向彩绘狗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26257
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_e7b25ad0:

    # "He adjusts his clothes and glasses, then nods. You're not the only one putting on a brave face."
    "他整理了一下衣服和眼镜，然后点了点头。你并非唯一一个强装镇定的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26261
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_21ecf5c9:

    # "The whiplash shook him, but he's doing a great job at hiding it. \"Let's go\", his eyes say. Whatever is on the other side, panic or punishment, we must face it with our heads held up high."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26263
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_fc4bb020:

    # "You nod back in response."
    "你也点头回应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26271
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_eef115fb:

    # "You pull the door open and step outside."
    "你拉开门，走了出去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26278
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_f4447b0a:

    # "Right into the path of another sailor! {w}Sending him straight into the opposite wall."
    "正好撞上另一个水手！{w}把他直接撞到了对面的墙上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26287
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_25b0c54e:

    # sailmullein "Neptune's ass..!"
    sailmullein "海神波塞冬的屁股啊……！"

# game/script day12.rpy:26289
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_df0a9518:

    # "The sailor, who'd been running past your door, is now leaning against the wooden wall, holding his muzzle in his hands."
    "那个正跑过你门口的水手，此刻正靠在木墙上，双手捂着自己的口鼻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26291
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_4ec865df:

    # sailmullein "God's blood, boy, watch what you're doing! Rats, my nose..."
    sailmullein "老天爷，小子，看着点路！该死的，我的鼻子……"

# game/script day12.rpy:26297
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_a6b4b685:

    # "As he steadies himself, cursing in ways you weren't even aware existed, you mumble a confused apology."
    "他稳住身形，用你闻所未闻的方式咒骂着，你则含糊地道歉，一脸困惑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26299
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_82e12994:

    # p "I'm sorry, I... what.. {w}What's going on?"
    p "对不起，我……什么……{w}发生什么事了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26301
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_d02c6300:

    # sailmullein "You don't know? Where have you been all this time?!"
    sailmullein "你不知道？你这段时间都去哪儿了？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:26303
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5080e18a:

    # "You help the sailor. He looks at you funny while massaging his face."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26305
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_029b13e7:

    # sailmullein "The waves are glowing, boy! Glowing!"
    sailmullein "海浪在发光，小子！发光！"

# game/script day12.rpy:26307
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_20f27340:

    # p "... What?"
    p "……什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26309
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_0c029013:

    # sailmullein "Glowing! It's like Davy Jones' farts just caught fire or something! The sea is shining blue!"
    sailmullein "发光！就像戴维·琼斯的屁着火了一样！大海在闪着蓝光！"

# game/script day12.rpy:26311
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_c11d6b25:

    # sailmullein "Whole crew is standing there dumbfounded!"
    sailmullein "全船的人都傻站在那儿！"

# game/script day12.rpy:26315
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_887f7760:

    # "He shoves you aside, resuming his path towards the inner parts of the ship."
    "他把你推开，继续朝船的内部跑去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26317
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_ec77630a:

    # p "Wait! Where are you going?"
    p "等等！你要去哪儿？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26319
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_63e3ca4c:

    # sailmullein "I'm getting as far away from the deck as I can! And if you're smart you'll do the same!"
    sailmullein "我要离甲板越远越好！你要是聪明就跟我一样！"

# game/script day12.rpy:26321
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_afaa20c0:

    # sailmullein "Nothing good can come of this!"
    sailmullein "这绝对没好事！"

# game/script day12.rpy:26327
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_27a1a569:

    # "You see him vanish into the stairwell, uninterested in confirming whether you're following his advice or not."
    "你看着他消失在楼梯井里，他并不在意你是否听从了他的建议。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26329
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_9627f39a:

    # p "What in the-"
    p "这到底——"

# game/script day12.rpy:26333
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_f9ffda2d:

    # "You jump, as Nomax suddenly—and unexpectedly—grabs your arm with vigor."
    "你吓了一跳，因为诺马克斯突然——并且出人意料地——用力抓住了你的胳膊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26340
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b586f816:

    # n "[name], quick! We need to get to the deck, now!"
    n "[姓名]，快！我们得去甲板，现在！"

# game/script day12.rpy:26342
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_53304ae1:

    # p "A-are you sure that-"
    p "你-你确定——"

# game/script day12.rpy:26344
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_9ec37997:

    # n "Yes, I am! There is no time to dawdle, go!"
    n "是的，我确定！没时间磨蹭了，走！"

# game/script day12.rpy:26351
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_902a4609:

    # "He pulls you along with him."
    "他拉着你一起跑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26363
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_32d58e0e:

    # "Once you get to the deck, you find the crew pushing itself against the gunwale."
    "一到甲板，你就发现船员们都挤在船舷边。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26365
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_92903208:

    # "You rub your eyes. Everything is tinged in a weird blue-ish light, painting the ship in unusual and ethereal colors."
    "你揉了揉眼睛。一切都笼罩在一种诡异的蓝光中，给船只染上了不同寻常、超凡脱俗的色彩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26367
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_5f7c9d68:

    # "But you don't have time to grapple with this mystery, as Nomax shoves you between the sailors and right on the edge of the deck."
    "但你没时间琢磨这个谜团，因为诺马克斯把你推到了水手们中间，就在甲板边缘。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26369
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2084d0dc:

    # n "Look!"
    n "看！"

# game/script day12.rpy:26378
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_88d09572:

    # "You gaze at the pitch black oceans below."
    "你凝视着下方漆黑的海面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26380
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_722bcbdd:

    # "Except they're not black. {w}They're blue.{w} And glowing."
    "但它们并不黑。{w}它们是蓝色的。{w}并且发着光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26385
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_7e298c2d:

    # "It's mesmerizing. As each wave crashes against the hull, it charges with some kind of glowing energy, shining and burning before returning its phantom light to the dark waters."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26387
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_eaca5b9c:

    # "You stand there, with all the other sailors. Nobody dares to utter a word."
    "你和其他水手一起站在那里。没有人敢说一句话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26389
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_207d125e:

    # "Nomax is as enraptured as the rest of the present crew."
    "诺马克斯和在场其他船员一样，完全被迷住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26391
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_2930765d:

    # n "Ah, look... It is already starting to fade."
    n "啊，看……它已经开始消退了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26393
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_cfa50b53:

    # "With his face now illuminated by the sporadic flashes of blue, you realize that his behavior wasn't fear, or bravery, or anything of the sort."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26395
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_48f7fe90:

    # "The painted dog was more excited than you'd ever seen him be."
    "这只彩绘狗比你见过的任何时候都要兴奋。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26397
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_08ac5e62:

    # n "We only managed to catch the tail end of it, I fear."
    n "恐怕我们只赶上了尾声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26399
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_06800771:

    # p "Nomax, what... what is it? Should we be worried?"
    p "诺马克斯，这……这是什么？我们该担心吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26401
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_994b12eb:

    # "He smiles."
    "他笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26403
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_b6dc74e8:

    # n "No, not at all. In fact, we should count ourselves lucky."
    n "不，完全不用。事实上，我们应该觉得自己很幸运。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26405
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_c73fb6c5:

    # n "It is a well documented phenomenon, one I have encountered in my studies before. A rarity, but not an oddity."
    n "这是一种有充分记载的现象，我之前在研究中遇到过。很罕见，但并非怪事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26407
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_9ee28a29:

    # n "And one whose climax we seem to have missed..."
    n "而且我们似乎错过了它的高潮阶段……"

# game/script day12.rpy:26409
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_lifedrawing_8534ca42:

    # ". . ."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26416
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_1170db6e:

    # "The painted dog sighs, though not with the sound of sadness."
    "彩绘狗叹了口气，但并非带着悲伤。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26418
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_b4c049d2:

    # n "But... I am happy. I have witnessed something that I had only imagined through books before now."
    n "但是……我很高兴。我亲眼目睹了此前只在书中想象过的东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26420
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_5a91078d:

    # n "This makes me luckier than most of my peers. {w}Maybe venturing toward the unknown is a better fate than I feared."
    n "这让我比大多数同行都要幸运。{w}也许，走向未知，是比我曾担心的更好的命运。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26424
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_ef81df04:

    # n "And I can count myself immensely lucky to have shared this moment with someone like you."
    n "而且，能与你这样的人共享这一刻，我感到无比幸运。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26426
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_0ff74098:

    # "You smile."
    "你笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26428
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_3737863d:

    # p "Likewise, often uncertainty will provide us the greatest value, I suppose."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26432
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_4ab9d233:

    # p "And while tenting those trousers of yours."
    p "尤其是在让你那裤子撑起帐篷的时候。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26436
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_992a8268:

    # "You grin cheekily as his blush renews across his cheeks."
    "你顽皮地咧嘴一笑，看着他脸上重新泛起红晕。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26438
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_d16e9617:

    # p "All jokes aside though, I understand. Often uncertainty will provide us the greatest value, I suppose."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26440
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_817c57ff:

    # p "Thank you for letting me... you know."
    p "谢谢你让我……你知道的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26442
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_52efc5b4:

    # p "I enjoyed making you struggle a bit."
    p "我很享受让你有点为难的感觉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26444
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_89fe7c39:

    # n "... Struggle a lot.{w} You are awful."
    n "……非常为难。{w}你真坏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26446
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_20e1dd5f:

    # n "Right out here..."
    n "就在这里……"

# game/script day12.rpy:26448
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_da2e6832:

    # p "I just know what's good."
    p "我只是知道什么才是好的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26450
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_a0645871:

    # "You let your eyes wander to the sea again."
    "你的目光再次游移到海面上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26452
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_e4d66fda:

    # "Do you though? You can't be certain. But then again who ever can be."
    "你确定吗？你无法肯定。但话说回来，又有谁能肯定呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26457
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_6a995541:

    # "You nod. There's value in taking joy from the uncertain and scary, you think."
    "你点了点头。你认为，从不确定和可怕的事物中寻找乐趣，自有其价值。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26459
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_8e97763a:

    # "A future unknown is a possibility. It doesn't have to necessarily turn out for the worse."
    "未知的未来意味着可能性。它不一定就会走向糟糕的结局。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26461
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_ac4ce522:

    # "The sea, you think, is the ultimate example of that. Vast stretches of unknown in all directions."
    "你觉得，大海就是这一点的终极例证。四面八方都是广袤无垠的未知。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26463
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_b3dcc649:

    # "People and places and professions you know nothing about. New things every day, newer things on the horizon."
    "你不了解的人、地方和职业。每天都有新事物，地平线上还有更新奇的东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26465
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_dce205d6:

    # "Equal parts scary and romantic, both not for the faint of heart. Which you are not, you think. And, perhaps, Nomax might not be either."
    "既令人恐惧又充满浪漫色彩，两者都不是胆小者所能承受的。而你觉得自己并非胆小之人。或许，诺马克斯也不是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26467
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_6236af71:

    # "This is all theoretical, you think. But you'll have a chance of putting it to practice soon."
    "你觉得这一切都只是理论。但你很快就有机会将其付诸实践了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26469
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_406bd888:

    # "Morocco."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26471
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_2c1bdd97:

    # "The spectacle is starting to subside. Slowly, the waves return to their usual pitch blackness, and the color that followed in the wake of your stern is nothing but a fading memory."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26473
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_f00cb5ac:

    # "The wish to capture it forever is strong."
    "想要永远捕捉这一刻的愿望非常强烈。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26475
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_79374747:

    # "The memories will have to suffice."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26477
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_1ab33833:

    # "Awe fades. Magic drains from the air, and the audience is returned to the planet they were ripped from."
    "敬畏感在消退。魔力从空气中流失，观众们也被拉回到了他们原本所处的现实世界。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26479
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_4b0bd7e0:

    # "A few sailors find their voices again. You hear a half-mumbled prayer. Someone talks about evil spirits."
    "一些水手重新找回了声音。你听到一句含混不清的祷告。有人在谈论邪灵。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26481
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_f19eb026:

    # "The crowd, enraptured no more, is getting restless."
    "人群不再着迷，开始变得焦躁不安。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26483
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_e54f9fc8:

    # "Perhaps nervous."
    "或许是紧张。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26487
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_228e3b68:

    # n "Well..."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26489
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_6217e223:

    # "The painted dog looks around at the sailors surrounding you."
    "那只彩绘狗环顾了一下围在你身边的水手们。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26491
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_59bc3b40:

    # "The lack of explanation for what's happening is having an effect on the crew. The tension isn't palpable, but awe has fully faded."
    "对正在发生的事情缺乏解释，正在对船员们产生影响。紧张气氛虽不明显，但敬畏感已完全消散。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26493
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_0e684112:

    # "Neither of you know what happens {i}after{/i} a group of people have witnessed something seemingly impossible."
    "你们俩都不知道，在一群人目睹了看似不可能的事情{i}之后{/i}会发生什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26497
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_d260c14a:

    # n "Maybe I should... Spread the word about it? I fear we might be-"
    n "也许我应该……把这事传开？我担心我们可能会——"

# game/script day12.rpy:26502
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_b56615b8:

    # "But before he can voice any worry, a call from the bow end of the ship interrupts his train of thought."
    "但还没等他把担忧说出口，船头传来的一声呼喊打断了他的思绪。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26512
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_69c2c729:

    # s "Well then, everyone! Good supper and a show, what luck!"
    s "好了，各位！美餐一顿还有表演看，真是走运！"

# game/script day12.rpy:26516
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_841adc82:

    # "Samuel drops down from the shrouds, a confident grin on [his] face. {w}[He] claps the back of [his] paw, mimicking an aristocrat after a particularly fine theatrical performance."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26518
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_3d5a23ea:

    # s "What luck, nay, what blessing! Truly, the wonders of the open sea are infinite."
    s "真是走运，不，简直是天赐的福气！确实，广阔大海的奇观是无穷无尽的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26526
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_b722f05e:

    # "You're confused. Up until a few moments ago, [he] was fully absorbed by the spectacle as well. Now [he]'s... mocking it?"
    "你感到困惑。就在片刻之前，他也完全沉浸在那奇景之中。现在他却……在嘲笑它？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26528
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_98793d72:

    # s "Oh, the fortune of being on a ship witnessing such incredible sights! Truly, this story shall make all ladies in port throw themselves at my feet!"
    s "哦，能在船上目睹如此不可思议的景象，真是幸运！真的，这个故事会让港口所有的女士都拜倒在我脚下！"

# game/script day12.rpy:26530
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_5e7d4cd3:

    # s "They oh so love the tales of us Jack Tars, don't they?"
    s "她们可喜欢听我们这些水手的故事了，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26532
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_092eef6d:

    # "A few sailors have taken their eyes off [him], mumbling. Embarrassed. Pretending they weren't emotionally involved in the first place. {w}And then it clicks."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26534
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_4dff05ab:

    # "Robbing the moment of its importance—and in doing so, lowering the anxiety it created. Nipping any tension in the bud."
    "他在消解这个时刻的重要性——从而降低它引发的焦虑。将任何紧张情绪扼杀在萌芽状态。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26536
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_588d34ca:

    # s "Anyone else here... Enraptured? Struck with awe? Anyone got more fancy words I could use?{w} Come on, I see we're among theater-loving gentlemen here."
    s "这里还有谁……着迷了？被震撼到了？还有谁有更花哨的词儿能让我用用？{w}得了吧，我看在座的各位都是热爱戏剧的绅士嘛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26538
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_7eab5484:

    # s "A ship full of perfumed fops! A first, eh?"
    s "一船涂脂抹粉的花花公子！头一回见，嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26540
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_16b8cb94:

    # "Silence."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26542
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_03535115:

    # "Samuel grins cheekily"
    "塞缪尔厚着脸皮咧嘴一笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26544
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_ed6dccac:

    # s "Good.{w} I shouldn't have to remind you that we're still on a ship, and you're still paid to act like tars."
    s "很好。{w}我不必提醒你们，我们还在船上，你们拿了钱就该像个水手的样子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26546
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_d7fd629d:

    # s "Go on and get your asses moving! Everyone back to their duties. You can write your loved ones if you're so desperate to get carried away about a bit of light."
    s "赶紧动起来！都回到各自的岗位上去。要是你们实在忍不住想为一丁点亮光神魂颠倒，那就去给你们心爱的人写信吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26548
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_42450a97:

    # "A few more mumbles and some dragging of feet, but the act has its intended effect. Nobody wanted to be the one who was taken in by it."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26550
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_fabf2e6b:

    # "Not now."
    "至少现在不想。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26552
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_e8d08a2a:

    # "Not after Samuel's little show."
    "至少在塞缪尔这番小小的表演之后不想。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26554
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_20295b3f:

    # "Shuffling all over the place, people stop being frozen and start moving."
    "到处响起窸窸窣窣的脚步声，人们不再僵立不动，开始行动起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26563
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_53f28f8e:

    # n "I believe it would be best for me to retreat to my cabin. It has been a long day... and night."
    n "我想我最好还是回船舱去。今天……还有今晚，都太漫长了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26565
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_6e2d9aa8:

    # p "Already?"
    p "这就回去了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26567
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_05156a63:

    # n "Already?!{w} It is well past midnight! Another two hours or so and the sun is coming out again..."
    n "这就回去了？！{w}早就过午夜了！再过两个小时左右，太阳又要出来了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:26569
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_616fff53:

    # n "No, no. I need to get some rest."
    n "不，不。我需要休息一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26571
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_807bbce5:

    # n "I truly appreciated your company this night though."
    n "不过，今晚真的很感谢有你作伴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26573
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_247920c0:

    # p "My pleasure. See you for the next once-in-a-lifetime scientific phenomenon, then?"
    p "我的荣幸。那么，下次再一起见证千载难逢的科学现象？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26578
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_53bfba3f:

    # "Nomax chuckles."
    "诺马克斯轻声笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26580
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_9bf00540:

    # n "Earlier than that, I would hope."
    n "我希望，在那之前就能见面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26585
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_e4f2a490:

    # "With a nod and a final warm smile, the painted dog bows out of your evening."
    "他点了点头，最后报以温暖的微笑，这只彩绘狗退出了你的夜晚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26589
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_86c13730:

    # "You stand there for a while longer, watching his shape disappear towards the other side of the ship."
    "你在那里多站了一会儿，看着他的身影消失在船的另一侧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26591
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_45ff3d46:

    # "Even after he's gone you keep looking for a few seconds longer before tearing your attention away."
    "即使在他离开后，你又多看了几秒，才将注意力移开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26593
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_7e1114f3:

    # "The crew around you slowly begin to pick up their work again. Arthur among them, leaning on the gunwale as if trying to spot land."
    "你周围的船员们慢慢开始重新投入工作。亚瑟也在其中，他靠在船舷上，仿佛在试图寻找陆地。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26595
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_b1fc28b7:

    # "Whatever duties he mentioned having left, they've apparently been temporarily forgotten."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26597
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_7baf1f73:

    # "You realize he's been standing there, looking at the glowing waves just like everyone else.{w} But not alongside everyone else."
    "你意识到他一直站在那里，和其他人一样看着发光的海浪。{w}但并没有和其他人站在一起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26599
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_d513331a:

    # "Being the first mate might be a pretty lonely affair."
    "当大副可能是一件相当孤独的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26601
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_a66352cc:

    # "Or he is simply trying to stretch the moment. To be able to appreciate the magic of the sea, while forgetting the frantic pace and endless duties of an ever changing world."
    "或者他只是想延长这一刻。为了能欣赏大海的魔力，同时忘却这个瞬息万变的世界那疯狂的节奏和无尽的职责。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26603
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_1c9e3e1a:

    # "Staring beauty in the eye and finding himself alone in the experience."
    "凝视着眼前的美景，却发现这体验中只有自己一人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26605
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_693f9863:

    # "But you may be wrong."
    "但你可能错了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26607
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_6763eb65:

    # "Perhaps he is busy?"
    "也许他正忙着呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26609
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_e4a0d065:

    # "Perhaps calculating the course of the next day with the help of the stars?"
    "也许正借助星星计算第二天的航线？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26611
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_4efda30f:

    # "But... if things were that way, he'd be looking above."
    "但是……如果真是那样，他应该往上看。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26613
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_5d2be63f:

    # "Not below..."
    "而不是往下看……"

# game/script day12.rpy:26615
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_nomax_ending_8534ca42:

    # ". . ."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26651
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_9042eec7:

    # "Now that the {i}Conway{/i} is out of the storm, the clear skies and calm seas have put the crew in a better mood. The sense of relieved tension is palpable."
    "既然{i}Conway{/i}已经驶离了风暴，晴朗的天空和平静的海面让船员们心情好了不少。那种如释重负的感觉清晰可感。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26653
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1ae346dc:

    # "Even still, and with port drawing near, you want to make sure that you've earned your place on the ship. You carry yourself through your watch with as much diligence as you can muster."
    "即便如此，随着港口临近，你仍想确保自己在这艘船上赢得了立足之地。你值勤时，尽可能地保持着勤勉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26655
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_f7959c01:

    # "The same, you think to yourself, cannot be said for some of the others. They're not lackadaisical, to be sure—but they're also clearly working with one eye on the prospect of safe harbor."
    "你暗自思忖，有些人恐怕就不能这么说了。他们当然并非懒散——但他们显然也在一边工作，一边惦记着安全港口的前景。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26668
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_f1bcee97:

    # "Perce is checking the lines with another sailor. He sees you, giving you a brief wink and a lick to his muzzle that has you flinching. Fortunately, the jackal is more focused on his companion."
    "珀斯正在和另一名水手检查绳索。他看到了你，对你快速地眨了眨眼，又舔了舔自己的口鼻，让你不由得一缩。幸好，这只胡狼更专注于他的同伴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26670
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_2c66794b:

    # "The topic of discussion does not, you're quite certain, involve trimming the {i}Conway{/i}."
    "你相当确定，他们讨论的话题与修剪{i}Conway{/i}无关。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26674
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_72930a97:

    # "Perce, one of the more experienced sailors, is working on one of the lines with another sailor. He bends down to check the tension on one of the blocks, but you can tell the topic of discussion is not trimming the {i}Conway{/i}."
    "珀斯，作为经验较丰富的水手之一，正和另一名水手一起处理一条绳索。他弯下腰检查一个滑轮的张力，但你能看出来讨论的话题不是修剪{i}Conway{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26676
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_4d9d31a7:

    # sailmussel "{alpha=0.8}...you could, I bet! We could be the first to plant a flag.{/alpha}"
    sailmussel "{alpha=0.8}……我敢打赌，你能行！我们可以成为第一个插旗的人。{/alpha}"

# game/script day12.rpy:26678
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_a2b106b1:

    # pb "{alpha=0.7}Another star? Cor blimey. Are you daft?{/alpha}"
    pb "{alpha=0.7}另一颗星星？我的天。你疯了吗？{/alpha}"

# game/script day12.rpy:26680
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_8d97b5f0:

    # sailmussel "{alpha=0.7}Well- I mean. In an aerostat, like.{/alpha}"
    sailmussel "{alpha=0.7}嗯——我是说。比如，用个航空器什么的。{/alpha}"

# game/script day12.rpy:26682
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_066d491e:

    # pb "{alpha=0.7}A what?{/alpha}"
    pb "{alpha=0.7}一个什么？{/alpha}"

# game/script day12.rpy:26684
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1d5327f5:

    # sailmussel "{alpha=0.7}A balloon. They had that one in France, few years back.{/alpha}"
    sailmussel "{alpha=0.7}气球。几年前法国人就有那玩意儿了。{/alpha}"

# game/script day12.rpy:26686
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_0b5f36e7:

    # pb "{alpha=0.7}Even still. They're fuckin' {i}miles{/i} away, mate.{/alpha}"
    pb "{alpha=0.7}即便如此。它们他妈的有{i}几英里{/i}远呢，伙计。{/alpha}"

# game/script day12.rpy:26688
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_d7a918c2:

    # sailmussel "{alpha=0.7}Aye...{/alpha}"
    sailmussel "{alpha=0.7}是啊……{/alpha}"

# game/script day12.rpy:26690
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_75bb8e7a:

    # pb "{alpha=0.7}At least a hundred thousand leagues. Take you {i}months{/i}.{/alpha}"
    pb "{alpha=0.7}至少十万里格。得花{i}好几个月{/i}。{/alpha}"

# game/script day12.rpy:26699
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_68b0fba7:

    # "You smile to yourself as their conversation fades out of earshot."
    "他们的谈话声渐渐远去，听不清了，你暗自笑了笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26701
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_efbf57cb:

    # "You think you saw a drawing of that balloon, in a broadsheet from the next town over. A huge egg-shaped contraption, decorated with images of the sun."
    "你记得好像在邻镇的报纸上见过那个气球的图画。一个巨大的蛋形装置，装饰着太阳的图案。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26709
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_3ebe0b49:

    # "As you recall, it only had room for two or three people. You can scarcely imagine needing to spend months on something like that. Two weeks on the {i}Conway{/i}, and you're more than ready to stretch your legs in Morocco."
    "据你回忆，那玩意儿只能容纳两三个人。你几乎无法想象要在那样的东西上待好几个月。在{i}Conway{/i}上才两个星期，你就已经迫不及待想在摩洛哥下船活动腿脚了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26711
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_6e920f41:

    # "Still, you can't help but wonder what it would be like. The stars tonight are crisp—countless sharp points of light, cold and delicate. You're sure Perce is right: they must be thousands of miles away."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26713
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_fbfd8f25:

    # "But when you tilt your head back, staring upwards, it's almost as if you could simply let go of the railing and be among them."
    "但当你仰起头，凝视上方时，仿佛只要松开栏杆，就能置身于群星之中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26715
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_81431b79:

    # "You pull yourself out of it—there must be only a few minutes left in the watch. This is no time to be shirking your duties. What if Arthur were to catch sight of you?"
    "你把自己拉回现实——值勤时间可能只剩几分钟了。现在可不是偷懒的时候。要是被亚瑟看见怎么办？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26722
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_2315659f:

    # "You're able to keep your mind from wandering until the bell rings. The sailors who relieve you are prompt."
    "你努力让自己不分心，直到钟声响起。来接替你班的水手很准时。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26733
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_3bd59908:

    # "Your mind is racing too much to consider sleep, even given the brief opportunity. Instead, you find yourself freshly taken aback by the stars above you."
    "即使有这短暂的闲暇，你的思绪也过于纷乱，无法考虑睡觉。相反，你发现自己又一次被头顶的星空震撼了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26735
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_24fb31e9:

    # "You're not the only one. A few other off-duty sailors are gathered, here and there. Wolf and Rajeeyah don't seem to be talking, as such, but they are standing together."
    "你不是唯一一个。其他一些下了班的水手也三三两两地聚在一起。沃尔夫和拉吉娅似乎并没有在交谈，但他们站在一起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26739
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_08b26310:

    # "You're mindful of his warning, but... on the other hand, you're going to have to speak at {i}some{/i} point."
    "你记得他的警告，但是……另一方面，你{i}迟早{/i}得和他说话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26749
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1f0e2d91:

    # "You make your way over. Rajeeyah is the first to notice you."
    "你走了过去。拉吉娅首先注意到了你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26751
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_72fa5e79:

    # r "Ah, [name]. Hello."
    r "啊，[名字]。你好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26753
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_be496959:

    # p "Hello. I hope you don't mind the company."
    p "你好。希望你不介意我加入。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26759
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_cfcfa536:

    # r "Not at all!"
    r "一点也不！"

# game/script day12.rpy:26763
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1608f03d:

    # r "No, I don't suppose so."
    r "不，我想不会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26769
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_660db441:

    # "Wolf, for his part, does not outwardly react. On the one hand, that's typical for him. On the other, you're definitely cautious, after what happened earlier."
    "至于沃尔夫，他表面上没什么反应。一方面，这对他来说很典型。另一方面，鉴于之前发生的事，你无疑很谨慎。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26771
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_636dc7c1:

    # r "We were just taking in the view. It has been a long few days."
    r "我们只是在欣赏风景。这几天太漫长了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26773
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_0d52ada0:

    # "You don't bother pressing for an answer from him."
    "你没有费心去追问他的回答。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26782
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1b8455b2:

    # "Wolf, for his part, does not outwardly react."
    "沃尔夫，就他而言，表面上没有任何反应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26784
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1932856b:

    # p "And you? Not sleeping before your next watch, either?"
    p "你呢？也不在下次值勤前睡一会儿？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26786
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_91eca7d1:

    # w "No.{w} Looking forward to it. I've come to like the midwatch."
    w "不了。{w}我期待着值勤呢。我开始喜欢上半夜那班岗了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26788
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_67df44c9:

    # p "Because it's quieter?"
    p "因为更安静？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26792
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_58f92a6f:

    # "Wolf bares his teeth in a thin smirk. By now, you're familiar enough with him to guess the answer."
    "沃尔夫咧开嘴，露出一个淡淡的、似笑非笑的表情。到现在，你已经足够了解他，能猜到答案了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26794
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_625f305a:

    # w "Fewer people who feel the need to bother me."
    w "觉得有必要打扰我的人更少。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26805
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_d22ac617:

    # r "I'm quiet. That makes me good company."
    r "我很安静。这让我成为不错的同伴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26807
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_d5826611:

    # "She gives you a smile that is significantly friendlier than Wolf's."
    "她给了你一个微笑，比沃尔夫的友好得多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26809
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_b750e20b:

    # r "You weren't bothering us, in any case. We were just quietly taking in the view."
    r "不管怎样，你并没有打扰我们。我们只是在静静地欣赏风景。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26815
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_cfcbf3ae:

    # r "How are you? Also just off watch, I suppose."
    r "你还好吗？应该也是刚下哨吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26817
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_2fdf3a54:

    # p "Yes. It was calm. I'm glad we're out of the weather, and looking forward to seeing Morocco."
    p "是啊。风平浪静。很高兴我们摆脱了坏天气，也期待看到摩洛哥。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26819
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_a890425d:

    # p "And... enjoying the night sky. I was told stories of the constellations, growing up, but there's something about seeing them so... crisply."
    p "还有……欣赏夜空。我小时候听过关于星座的故事，但亲眼看到它们如此……清晰，感觉还是不一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26821
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_d1ea5443:

    # p "It makes me realize I must not have been paying attention all that well. I only recognize a few."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26823
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_83759f91:

    # r "The rest are hidden."
    r "其他的都藏起来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26825
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1b640dae:

    # p "What?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26827
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_cc80ef07:

    # r "The stars are different down here. Some constellations you grew up with almost never appear. Some will be new to you."
    r "这里的星星不一样。有些你从小熟悉的星座几乎从不出现。有些对你来说会是全新的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26829
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_b9217fba:

    # p "Oh. I guess I didn't really know that."
    p "哦。我之前还真不知道这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26831
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_24df19f1:

    # r "Your first time so far from home.{w} You, Mr. Hvidt? You've been this far south?"
    r "你是第一次离家这么远吧。你呢，维特先生？你到过这么南边的地方吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26837
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_8dcb7498:

    # "He looks quickly in her direction, and shakes his head."
    "他迅速朝她的方向看了一眼，摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26839
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_4309ad3a:

    # w "No."
    w ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26841
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_7e11b92a:

    # r "How far have you been?"
    r "那你到过多远的地方？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26843
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_6111a711:

    # w "I don't know."
    w ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26849
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_f25eb92b:

    # "The cheetah seems to have realized immediately both that something has changed about Wolf... and {i}why{/i}. She looks between the two of you, although her concern is visible only to you."
    "猎豹似乎立刻就意识到，沃尔夫身上有些变化……以及这变化的{i}原因{/i}。她在你们两人之间看了看，不过她的担忧只有你能察觉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26851
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1c929cd4:

    # r "Is something the matter? With you and [name], Wolf?"
    r "出什么事了吗？你和[name]，沃尔夫？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26853
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_09b6e006:

    # r "Well... let me ask more directly. Something {i}is{/i} the matter, obviously. Is it something I should know about?"
    r "好吧……让我问得更直接点。显然，是{i}有{/i}什么事。是我应该知道的事吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26855
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_4309ad3a_1:

    # w "No."
    w ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26857
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_922745ef:

    # "Wolf says it at the same time as you begin to say \"we- ,\" and Rajeeyah turns her attention to you, expectantly."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26859
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e73758ea:

    # p "We got in an argument."
    p "我们吵了一架。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26863
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_be506648:

    # r "Oh. Should I leave, then? Let you two... brawl, or however it is you feel like making up?"
    r "哦。那我该离开吗？让你们俩……打一架，或者随便你们想怎么和好？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26867
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_d53adfb2:

    # w "That will not be necessary."
    w "没那个必要。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26873
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_ae9b8024:

    # "He pushes himself back from the railing, and you catch a brief glimpse of his scowl as he starts to make his own departure."
    "他身子从栏杆上撑开，在他转身离去时，你瞥见他脸上短暂的怒容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26887
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_fea7a371:

    # p "Wolf. I just wanted to say I'm sorry. You were right."
    p "沃尔夫。我只是想说对不起。你是对的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26891
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_c76bf4ef:

    # "He stops, and half-turns back towards you."
    "他停下脚步，半转过身来对着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26895
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_eb1ce03d:

    # w "\"Right?\""
    w ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26897
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_77310687:

    # p "We... ah, I found him under one of the boats, you see? Earlier. When it was raining. And I... made fun of him for it."
    p "我们……啊，我发现他在其中一艘小船下面，明白吗？早些时候。下雨那会儿。然后我……就为这个取笑了他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26905
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_c24dc8ef:

    # "You offer the explanation towards Rajeeyah, instead of Wolf, trying to put the pieces of a credible story together in your mind."
    "你是向拉吉娅，而不是向沃尔夫解释，同时在脑子里拼凑一个可信的故事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26907
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_a554fcb6:

    # r "\"Made fun of him?\""
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26909
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_2af8f77c:

    # p "He was... I mean, he did look very ridiculous. His fur was soaking. We're all soaking, but... you know how he is, when he growls."
    p "他当时……我是说，他看起来确实很滑稽。他的毛都湿透了。我们都湿透了，但是……你知道他低吼时是什么样子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26913
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_3e6e9f76:

    # "It's easier than you would've thought to come up with something. And Wolf, for his part, seems to have realized that, too. When you describe his appearance, the glare in his eyes has, at least, only the ordinary amount of scorn."
    "编造点东西比你想象的要容易。而沃尔夫，他那边似乎也意识到了这一点。当你描述他的样子时，他眼中的怒视，至少，只是平常那种轻蔑的程度。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26915
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_aa276acf:

    # p "He was {i}trying{/i} to get me to understand that it was worth it, for one's peace of mind."
    p "他当时{i}试图{/i}让我明白，为了内心的平静，这是值得的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26917
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_eba0e22e:

    # r "Being wet?"
    r "淋湿？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26925
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_0a11dcb5:

    # p "Being alone. Everyone has been so... stressed. It was a good idea. I shouldn't have mocked him—you. I shouldn't have made fun of you, Wolf. I'm sorry."
    p "独处。大家最近都太……紧张了。这是个好主意。我不该嘲笑他——你。我不该取笑你，沃尔夫。对不起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26927
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_159a2a37:

    # r "This is... this is because you got in an argument about taking shelter under one of the ship's boats?"
    r "这……这就是因为你们为了在船上的小艇下躲雨而吵了一架？"

# game/script day12.rpy:26929
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_4309ad3a_2:

    # w "No."
    w ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26931
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_c84b65b7:

    # "Rajeeyah now, if anything, looks even more confused."
    "拉吉娅现在，如果有什么变化的话，看起来更加困惑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26933
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_3a5a2e4b:

    # w "It's because he was being an annoying shit about it."
    w "那是因为他在这事上表现得像个烦人的混蛋。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26935
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_07f2113d:

    # w "I swear, between him and Julian... I need to learn a trade that would give {i}me{/i} my own room."
    w "我发誓，有他和朱利安在……我得学门手艺，好让{i}我{/i}能有自己的房间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26939
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e67df918:

    # r "I did study medicine and anatomy for reasons beyond a desire for privacy, you know, Wolf."
    r "我学医和解剖学，可不只是为了有个私人空间，你知道的，沃尔夫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26941
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_635551f7:

    # w "But it helps."
    w "但有帮助。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26943
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_90a90e3e:

    # p "I know I'm a bother, Wolf. I'm sorry for that, too. I want to be... I know I'm not a sailor yet. But I want to be one. Like you, or Samuel."
    p "我知道我是个麻烦，沃尔夫。这个我也很抱歉。我想成为……我知道我还不是个水手。但我想成为。像你，或者塞缪尔那样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26945
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1800dba2:

    # "He doesn't even grace you with a single sound made."
    "他甚至懒得给你发出一点声音。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26949
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_24c38567:

    # p "I guess I should listen more..."
    p "我想我应该多听听……"

# game/script day12.rpy:26951
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_9d5ff1ed:

    # w "You should.{w} To someone else. I do not accept your apology."
    w "你是应该。{w}去听别人说。我不接受你的道歉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26959
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_dd61f681:

    # "He snarls and stalks off. Even after he's out of earshot, Rajeeyah remains quiet, her eyes tracking him just as yours do. At length, she sighs."
    "他咆哮着大步走开了。即使他已经走远听不见了，拉吉娅仍然沉默着，她的目光和你一样追随着他。最后，她叹了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26961
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_fb6859d5:

    # r "Hm..."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26963
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_ea229c31:

    # r "Is this what you two had an argument over?"
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:26967
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_6d94514c:

    # p "It... well... no, it wasn't."
    p "这……嗯……不，不是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26977
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e994193a:

    # "Given what happened earlier, you know it's a bad idea to try and stop him, no matter how much you want to."
    "鉴于之前发生的事，你知道试图阻止他不是个好主意，无论你多想这么做。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26979
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_fe3e0340:

    # r "It must have been some argument."
    r "那一定是一场很严重的争吵。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26981
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_b78c234c:

    # p "It wasn't."
    p "不是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:26996
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_15894e4c:

    # p "Wolf... about earlier. I don't know what happened, but-"
    p "沃尔夫……关于之前的事。我不知道发生了什么，但是——"

# game/script day12.rpy:27000
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_310683ec:

    # w "Drop it."
    w "别提了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27002
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1ad678ed:

    # p "You can't keep shutting people out."
    p "你不能总是把别人拒之门外。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27004
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_2ae1c3b8:

    # r "Wolf?"
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27006
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_3f08d489:

    # "He sets his jaw firmly, his muzzle tense. He looks towards the ship's doctor, instead of you."
    "他下巴绷紧，口鼻部肌肉紧张。他没有看你，而是看向了船医。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27008
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_dbd80611:

    # w "Do you want more work?"
    w "你想找更多活干？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27010
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_89a047b0:

    # "His eyes flick in your direction, long enough for both you and Rajeeyah to catch your meaning. Wolf shakes his head, hunches his shoulders, and mutters:"
    "他的目光朝你的方向瞥了一下，时间长得足以让你和拉吉娅都明白你的意思。沃尔夫摇摇头，耸起肩膀，咕哝道："

# game/script day12.rpy:27012
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_6a4a6e6c:

    # w "I didn't think so."
    w "我猜也是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27020
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_d6ba6e7f:

    # "With that, he stalks off. Even after he's out of earshot, Rajeeyah remains quiet. At length, she sighs."
    "说完，他大步走开了。即使他已经走远听不见了，拉吉娅仍然沉默着。最后，她叹了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27022
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_62f0a773:

    # r "Dare I ask what kind of argument this was?"
    r "我敢问这是什么样的争吵吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27024
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_b78c234c_1:

    # p "It wasn't."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27030
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_3dc8e264:

    # "The cheetah tilts her head, her expression curious."
    "猎豹歪着头，表情好奇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27032
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_adbfff40:

    # r "Wasn't..."
    r "不是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:27034
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e5185697:

    # p "Wasn't an argument. I mean, it wasn't really."
    p "不是吵架。我是说，不完全是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27036
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_bb732610:

    # "You struggle to find a way to put it into words."
    "你努力寻找合适的措辞。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27038
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_4263754a:

    # p "We spent a lot of time talking. About him, actually. His life before this ship, I mean. Suddenly, he..."
    p "我们谈了很久。其实是关于他。我是说，他上这艘船之前的生活。突然，他……"

# game/script day12.rpy:27042
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_59a48c53:

    # r "Stopped talking?"
    r "不说话了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27044
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_a2579871:

    # p "Yelled at me. Told me to never speak to him again."
    p "冲我大喊。叫我再也别跟他说话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27046
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_ef2ce2d7:

    # "She must have picked up on something in your tone—the difficulty with which you manage to get out the words."
    "她一定从你的语气里察觉到了什么——你说出这些话时的艰难。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27048
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_12381010:

    # "Not everything, you're sure. There's no way to convey exactly what it felt like. Your absolute certainty that, in that moment, he would actually have hurt you."
    "你确信不是全部。那种感觉无法确切传达。你当时绝对肯定，在那一刻，他真的会伤害你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27052
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_34c95e5b:

    # "But it's close enough. The doctor nods."
    "但也差不多了。医生点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27055
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_25541c6e:

    # r "Mr. [family_name]?"
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27057
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_0d19ac59:

    # p "He told me to leave, and to never speak to him again. So I did."
    p "他叫我走开，再也别跟他说话。所以我就走了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27059
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_f325dad5:

    # r "I see."
    r "我明白了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27071
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_4309ad3a_3:

    # w "No."
    w ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27073
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_4bd2378b:

    # p "How far south have you been?"
    p "你到过多南的地方？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27079
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_6fd79976:

    # w "You know, if I wanted to tell my life story, I could be a bard. Or you could ask Julian, if you want to hear someone talk about themselves."
    w "听着，如果我想讲我的生平故事，我早去当吟游诗人了。或者你可以去问朱利安，如果你想听人谈论他们自己的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27081
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_541eff80:

    # r "I'm sure he was just curious."
    r "我肯定他只是好奇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27085
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1c770d3b:

    # w "I'm sure."
    w "我肯定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27087
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_a43d8248:

    # r "It's not an unreasonable question, you know. And it can be important, as the ship's doctor."
    r "你知道，这不是个不合理的问题。而且作为船医，这可能是很重要的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27091
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e3481d94:

    # "Wolf grunts."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27093
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_f120994a:

    # w "Europe. As far south as the Mediterranean. Not Africa."
    w "欧洲。最南到地中海。不是非洲。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27095
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_4787405a:

    # p "So you get to see... what {i}are{/i} the new stars, doctor?"
    p "所以你也看到了……那些{i}是{/i}什么新星星，医生？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27101
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_a15a3732:

    # w "None of your business."
    w "不关你的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27103
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_0a513c31:

    # p "You know, if you spent less time trying to be mysterious, people would leave you alone more."
    p "你知道吗，如果你少花点时间故作神秘，人们反而会更少打扰你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27105
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e8403125:

    # w "I doubt it."
    w ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27107
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_15d47f6f:

    # r "It's not an unreasonable question, actually, Mr. Hvidt. And it can be important, as the ship's doctor."
    r "实际上，这不是个不合理的问题，维特先生。而且作为船医，这可能是很重要的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27111
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e3481d94_1:

    # "Wolf grunts."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27113
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_6830d6de:

    # w "Fine. Europe. As far south as the Mediterranean. Not Africa."
    w "好吧。欧洲。最南到地中海。不是非洲。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27115
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_47ab1958:

    # p "So the stars are new to you, too?"
    p "所以这些星星对你来说也是新的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27117
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_d44cbb07:

    # w "I guess."
    w ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27119
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_f28467eb:

    # p "Which are they, anyway?"
    p "它们到底是什么星座？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27125
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_a15a3732_1:

    # w "None of your business."
    w ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27127
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_3bffd90a:

    # p "I'm just curious. That's all."
    p "我只是好奇。仅此而已。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27129
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_efc3a57f:

    # w "Good for you. It's none of your business."
    w "那很好。不关你的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27131
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1bb4137d:

    # "You shake your head and decide to leave Wolf to his standoffish tendencies. If he wants to be unpleasant, who are you to stop him?"
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27135
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_9e39d3b6:

    # p "Never mind. What, um... what {i}are{/i} these new stars, doctor?"
    p "算了。那个，嗯……这些{i}是{/i}什么新星星，医生？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27143
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_92dbb512:

    # r "I'm not an astronomer, you understand. But... there—do you see that? That should be the southwest, if I'm not mistaken."
    r "我不是天文学家，你明白的。但是……那儿——你看到了吗？如果我没弄错的话，那应该是西南方向。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27145
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_8b598f35:

    # "Her arm is held nearly level, pointing just over the horizon. Her clawed finger traces a curled shape in the night sky."
    "她的手臂几乎水平伸出，指向地平线上方。她带爪的手指在夜空中勾勒出一个弯曲的形状。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27147
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e310a4fd:

    # r "Those stars, right there. What does it look like to you?"
    r "那些星星，就在那儿。你觉得它像什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27149
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_8db22f85:

    # p "Like a fishhook?"
    p "像鱼钩？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27153
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_d6d2f364:

    # r "The tail of a scorpion. The bright star to the west is its head. There, at the tip, is {i}al-Shawla{/i}: the sting."
    r "蝎子的尾巴。西边那颗亮星是它的头。那儿，尖端上，是{i}al-Shawla{/i}：毒刺。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27157
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_8a1a365e:

    # r "I was told, once, by a talkative scholar, that it's one of the oldest constellations. But you cannot see it from London or Paris."
    r "有一次，一位健谈的学者告诉我，这是最古老的星座之一。但从伦敦或巴黎是看不到的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27159
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_12dd147e:

    # r "Only from places closer to home."
    r "只有在更靠近家乡的地方才能看到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27167
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_0d3dfc91:

    # r "I had the opposite experience, when I left my studies for Europe. One day I realized that it had been months since I'd seen it."
    r "我的经历正好相反，当我离开家乡去欧洲求学时。有一天我意识到，我已经好几个月没看到它了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27169
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_eea231ac:

    # r "And then, a fellow scholar explained that I couldn't. Not ever."
    r "然后，一位同窗学者解释说，我看不到了。永远看不到了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27171
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_6d9bc1ac:

    # p "Were the stars important to you? Where I'm from... you can see them of course. But not like this... I suppose it must've been the smoke from the chimneys and the cooking fires, keeping us from being able to see the sky."
    p "星星对你很重要吗？在我家乡……当然也能看到星星。但不是这样……我想一定是烟囱和炊火的烟雾，让我们看不清天空。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27173
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_af005273:

    # p "But on some nights you can get a good view of them when out in the field."
    p "但有些夜晚，在野外能看到很美的星空。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27181
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_04d65336:

    # w "Such an unfortunate trade-off for warm food and shelter."
    w "为了温暖的食物和住所，付出这样的代价真是不幸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27184
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_8d9da8a4:

    # w "{cps=5000}Such an unfortunate trade-off for warm food and shelter.{/cps}" nointeract
    w "{cps=5000}为了温暖的食物和住所，付出这样的代价真是不幸。{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day12.rpy:27190
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_4113f76d:

    # w "No. But you act like it's a big loss."
    w "不。但你的表现好像那是个巨大的损失。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27192
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_859e2a21:

    # p "You don't think so? Come on, Wolf. Tell me you're not in awe of all this, right now."
    p "你不这么认为？得了吧，沃尔夫。告诉我你现在对这一切并不感到惊叹，对吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27194
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_8a5eaa52:

    # w "I'm not. I'm warm enough, and I'm full. Leave it."
    w "我没有。我很暖和，也吃饱了。别提了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27206
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_995ab522:

    # "You suspect it is not worth probing Wolf's own experience on the topic."
    "你怀疑探究沃尔夫自己在这方面的经历并不值得。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27214
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_55f6b4b2:

    # p "Whatever. Anyway, Rajeeyah—in Morocco, was it not like that? I..."
    p "随便吧。总之，拉吉娅——在摩洛哥，不是那样的吗？我……"

# game/script day12.rpy:27220
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_56ece0aa:

    # "When you trail off, Rajeeyah laughs."
    "当你话音渐弱时，拉吉娅笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27222
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_335ee666:

    # r "You're not certain if we've invented chimneys or hot food in Morocco?"
    r "你不确定我们摩洛哥人是否发明了烟囱或热食？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27224
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_f85d14e2:

    # p "That wasn't what I meant!"
    p "我不是那个意思！"

# game/script day12.rpy:27226
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_8ef9a3cc:

    # "It was, of course, what you were about to imply, unintentionally. Rajeeyah can read plenty in your sheepish expression. Her smile widens."
    "当然，这恰恰是你无意中想要暗示的。拉吉娅能从你尴尬的表情中读出很多信息。她的笑容扩大了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27228
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_cb5bccf5:

    # r "You'll learn what a proper city looks like soon enough, [name]."
    r "你很快就会知道一个真正的城市是什么样子了，[名字]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27234
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_19fcb7b1:

    # r "What?"
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27236
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_b7cb1c2b:

    # p "Nothing. I'm trying to picture what it's like. What it's going to be like, I mean."
    p "没什么。我只是在想象那会是什么样子。我的意思是，将会是什么样子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27240
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_2731a509:

    # r "Safi, where I grew up, is—was—the biggest port in Morocco. Imagine those smoke-shrouded stars, glimpsed only in the space between buildings."
    r "萨菲，我长大的地方，是——曾经是——摩洛哥最大的港口。想象一下那些被烟雾笼罩的星星，只能在建筑物之间的缝隙中瞥见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27242
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_60978f55:

    # "She lifts an arm, framing a gap of empty sky between the {i}Conway{/i}'s sails by way of comparison."
    "号船帆之间的空隙来比拟那片空旷的天空。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27244
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_bf48ebb6:

    # p "So your first time was at sea, too?"
    p "所以你的第一次（看星星）也是在海上？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27250
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_50c960c5:

    # r "No. It was in the desert. The Maghreb. You can be as far from cities and campfires there as you can be at sea."
    r "不。是在沙漠里。马格里布。在那里，你可以远离城市和篝火，就像在海上一样遥远。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27254
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_32f8b295:

    # r "But it was a... revelation, yes. The stars can be better with company."
    r "但那确实是一次……启示，是的。有同伴相伴，星空会更美。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27256
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_d153275f:

    # "She smiles wistfully at the recollection."
    "回忆让她露出了惆怅的微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27265
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_9e1bb054:

    # p "It was with-"
    p "是和——"

# game/script day12.rpy:27273
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_45cb8e81:

    # "You catch yourself. Rajeeyah sees you glance towards Wolf, who seems to be listening only distractedly. She shrugs."
    "你及时打住。拉吉娅看到你瞥了一眼沃尔夫，他似乎只是心不在焉地听着。她耸了耸肩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27281
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_ed19a5ac:

    # r "With Arezki, yes. He said he had something to show me. We were in the desert, and he was trying to avoid any caravans or... patrols."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27285
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_cdc1f8e6:

    # r "We thought we'd heard something, so we made our way off the caravan track and into the sands."
    r "我们以为听到了什么动静，所以就离开了商道，走进了沙地。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27297
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_3453b112:

    # r "I suppose it was obvious enough, wasn't it? My... partner, Arezki. We were traveling together, at the time. One night, after we'd made camp, we decided to go for a walk."
    r "我想这够明显的了，不是吗？我的……伴侣，阿雷兹基。那时我们正一起旅行。一天晚上，扎营后，我们决定去散散步。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27301
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_2256ed82:

    # r "A friend."
    r "一个朋友。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27305
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1f0e6794:

    # "You hear Wolf snort. Rajeeyah's lip curls, by the faintest amount."
    "你听到沃尔夫哼了一声。拉吉娅的嘴唇微微撇了一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27307
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1be9232c:

    # r "Others make a point of trying to have those, Mr. Hvidt."
    r "其他人可是费尽心思想要交到朋友呢，维特先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27311
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_3429a0ac:

    # r "In any case. We were in a caravan. One night, when it had stopped, we walked out—far beyond the camp."
    r "总之。我们在一个商队里。一天晚上，商队停下时，我们走了出去——远远地离开了营地。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27319
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_0670b073:

    # r "Arezki, yes. My partner. I suppose I wasn't being very subtle, hm? He said he'd wanted to show me something. It turned out to be a bit of a journey, and..."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27321
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_c91dae1d:

    # r "Well, in any case, we had found ourselves in the desert. And... we were trying to avoid {i}being{/i} found, so... we left the track and wound up quite far from it."
    r "嗯，总之，我们发现自己身处沙漠。而且……我们试图避免被发现，所以……我们离开了商道，结果走得相当远。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27325
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_87c6d90b:

    # r "My partner, yes. Was I being too obvious with that? We were traveling through the desert in a caravan."
    r "我的伴侣，是的。我是不是太明显了？我们当时正跟着商队穿越沙漠。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27329
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_0fd7598b:

    # r "I was with a friend, in a caravan. One night, when the caravan had stopped, we walked far out beyond the camp."
    r "我和一个朋友在一起，在一个商队里。一天晚上，商队停下时，我们走到远离营地的地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27333
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_54354c87:

    # r "I'd been staring at my feet—trying to keep my balance in the sand. My friend stopped me. We were at the top of a dune. He pointed upwards."
    r "我当时一直盯着脚下——试图在沙地上保持平衡。我的朋友叫住了我。我们在一座沙丘顶上。他向上指了指。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27335
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_bab94977:

    # "She takes a deep breath; her shoulders rise and fall with a contented sigh. Her smile is fond, and distant."
    "她深吸一口气；肩膀随着一声满足的叹息起伏。她的微笑充满了温情，又有些遥远。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27337
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_ced4f628:

    # r "There was no moon, just the stars. I would see... sometimes, when I was running errands for my father, I'd pass by the jewelers selling stones in the bazaar, and I would see their wares on display..."
    r "没有月亮，只有星星。我有时……为父亲跑腿时，会经过集市上卖宝石的珠宝商，看到他们陈列的货物……"

# game/script day12.rpy:27339
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_6e5c5c10:

    # r "That's what I thought about. As if it was a bazaar of the most spectacular gemstones, and we were the only customers."
    r "我当时想到的就是那个。仿佛那是一个陈列着最壮观宝石的集市，而我们是唯一的顾客。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27341
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e63a137b:

    # w "And then he told you that your eyes were even prettier..."
    w "然后他告诉你，你的眼睛更漂亮……"

# game/script day12.rpy:27345
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_78a310f6:

    # "She shoots him a look, although his back is to her and he can't see it."
    "她瞪了他一眼，尽管他背对着她，看不见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27347
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_72f34978:

    # r "No, Wolf."
    r "不，沃尔夫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27351
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_7c09ce4b:

    # w "He told you it would be easier to see them on your back?"
    w "他告诉你，躺在你背上更容易看到它们？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27353
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_277645fb:

    # p "Wolf!"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27357
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_3b6ae89e:

    # w "Sorry. See? I'm bad with stories."
    w "抱歉。看到了吧？我不擅长讲故事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27359
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_4169d292:

    # w "This is why people should stop asking."
    w "这就是为什么人们不该再问了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27361
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_7f6ca6d9:

    # p "It's not even {i}your{/i} story."
    p "这甚至不是你的故事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27363
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_ddd9d2ab:

    # "Rajeeyah flexes her fingers, and it occurs to you that a surgeon would be a singularly worrying opponent, indeed. Even without a scalpel."
    "拉吉娅活动了一下手指，你突然想到，一个外科医生确实会是个特别令人担忧的对手。即使没有手术刀。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27367
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e11155bc:

    # r "It's fine. I'm used to dealing with sailors, by now."
    r "没关系。到现在，我已经习惯和水手打交道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27374
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_4c6773c6:

    # w "Just trying to hurry the story along."
    w "只是想加快故事的进度。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27376
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_02fc7198:

    # p "She might have to sew you up one day, Wolf. You could try being less... you."
    p "她可能有一天得给你缝针，沃尔夫。你可以试着别那么……像你自己。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27378
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_5783c284:

    # w "I've tried. I'm always me."
    w "我试过。我总是我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27382
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e12629c0:

    # r "Charming."
    r "真有魅力。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27386
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_7ce5d48b:

    # "You figure it would be best to keep things from escalating. Rajeeyah's story wasn't finished, after all."
    "你觉得最好避免事态升级。毕竟，拉吉娅的故事还没讲完。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27388
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_422bd7f4:

    # p "What did he want to show you?"
    p "他想给你看什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27392
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_a49e5f12:

    # r "Ah. He'd... buried something. We found it, eventually. A little chest... a bolt of silk, some coins, and a bracelet. The rest was to sell. The bracelet was for me."
    r "啊。他……埋了些东西。我们最终找到了。一个小箱子……一匹丝绸，一些硬币，还有一个手镯。其他的都是要卖的。手镯是给我的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27394
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_fe738f04:

    # p "A nice bracelet?"
    p "一个漂亮的手镯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27398
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_c0bc09a0:

    # r "Nice enough. It was silver, with a few small gems. Diamond, I think, or white sapphire."
    r "足够漂亮。是银的，镶着几颗小宝石。我想是钻石，或是白色蓝宝石。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27402
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_dd27dd48:

    # w "Not nice enough to keep."
    w "还没漂亮到值得保留。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27404
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1b640dae_1:

    # p "What?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27406
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_b13ac3d0:

    # "Wolf gestures towards the cheetah, speaking to you briefly before turning his attention to the doctor."
    "沃尔夫朝猎豹做了个手势，对你简短地说了一句，然后把注意力转向了医生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27408
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_23fec70e:

    # w "Not wearing it, is she? You're always wearing the same pieces, anyway. Left the collection at home, I suppose."
    w "没戴着，是吧？反正你总是戴着那几件首饰。我想，是把收藏品留在家里了吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27412
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_d2494448:

    # r "I left home with what I had on me. That's what I have left to remember Morocco by. The bracelet didn't make it to Safi."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27414
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e84bc219:

    # p "Something happened? To you?"
    p "发生了什么事？对你？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27418
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_7d909db3:

    # r "A soldier stopped me, a few leagues outside the city—a woman, traveling alone, raises suspicions. He told me the bracelet had been reported stolen from a North African bey."
    r "在离城几里格的地方，一个士兵拦住了我——一个女人，独自旅行，会引起怀疑。他告诉我，那个手镯被报告是从一个北非贝伊那里偷来的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27420
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_b65a9ce0:

    # p "From the bay itself? Like buried treasure?"
    p "从海湾本身？像埋藏的宝藏？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27422
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_f8a38983:

    # r "Bey. It's a royal title, used by the Ottomans even at the fringes of their empire. Consider him... a prince, if you like? The soldier asked where I'd gotten it from—if, perhaps, it came from one of the desert folk, the Amazigh."
    r "贝伊。那是一个王室头衔，即使在帝国边缘，奥斯曼人也用这个称呼。把他想成……一个王子，如果你愿意的话？士兵问我从哪里得到的——是不是可能来自某个沙漠民族，阿马齐格人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27424
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_adbcde7e:

    # p "Arezki."
    p "阿雷兹基。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27426
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_bec3b4af:

    # r "Yes."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27428
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_635081d6:

    # p "What did you tell him?"
    p "你怎么告诉他的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27430
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_8452f33b:

    # r "That I had stumbled across it in the desert, off a busy caravan track."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27434
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_6ad00dc7:

    # w "I'm surprised a woman of your standing would lie like that."
    w "我很惊讶像你这样身份的女人会那样撒谎。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27436
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_3462b512:

    # r "Well. That was the truth, Mr. Hvidt."
    r "嗯。那是事实，维特先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27438
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_ae9f9b95:

    # "Wolf doesn't seem especially convinced."
    "沃尔夫似乎并不特别信服。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27442
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_5f35d603:

    # w "And did {i}he{/i} believe you?"
    w "那他相信你了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27444
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_f20a74f9:

    # r "I don't know. He let me go. He had it off my wrist, at that point."
    r "我不知道。他放我走了。那时他已经把手镯从我手腕上取下来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27448
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_a577669d:

    # w "And he kept it for himself. You know that, right?"
    w "然后他自己留下了。你知道的，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27450
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e0a18fc3:

    # r "Yes. Of course."
    r "是的。当然。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27452
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_56e45e2d:

    # p "Did you know it was stolen?"
    p "你知道它是被偷来的吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27454
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_79e1faed:

    # r "By whom—the soldier? Arezki? The bey?"
    r "被谁——那个士兵？阿雷兹基？贝伊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27456
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_a03ee53b:

    # p "The prince stole it?"
    p "王子偷的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27458
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_9418f53d:

    # r "I doubt the mine belonged to him originally. I doubt the miners presented him with the silver as a gift. Don't you? His swords were sharper than theirs."
    r "我怀疑矿场最初是属于他的。我怀疑矿工是把白银作为礼物献给他的。你不这么认为吗？他的剑比他们的更锋利。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27462
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e85c6397:

    # "Wolf, you notice, had his muzzle partway open, readying himself to speak. But his expression, now, has changed."
    "你注意到，沃尔夫微微张着嘴，准备说话。但他现在的表情已经变了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27464
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_1ef01a05:

    # w "And—Arezki? Arezki's sword was even sharper, then?"
    w "那——阿雷兹基呢？那么阿雷兹基的剑更锋利？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27468
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_02667a63:

    # r "Perhaps. If you believe the soldier. If you've a mind to criticize me, Mr. Hvidt, trust me: I've seen what the empire's swords can do. I won't lose sleep over an insult to the bey."
    r "也许吧。如果你相信那个士兵的话。如果你想批评我，维特先生，相信我：我见识过帝国之剑能做到什么。我不会因为冒犯了贝伊而失眠。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27471
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e2cb3064:

    # w "He must've been very talented, this Arezki."
    w "他一定非常有本事，这个阿雷兹基。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27473
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_a024c3a7:

    # r "How would you put it? That's 'none of your business,' Mr. Hvidt. I doubt the soldier much cared. He had the bracelet off my wrist by then."
    r "，维特先生。我怀疑那个士兵并不太在乎。那时他已经把手镯从我手腕上取下来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27477
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_a577669d_1:

    # w "And he kept it for himself. You know that, right?"
    w ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27481
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_e0a18fc3_1:

    # r "Yes. Of course."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27485
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_9c2b6402:

    # w "Hmm."
    w "嗯。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27487
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_b82d74b4:

    # "He seems to be sizing the cheetah up anew. For her part, Rajeeyah is doing the same: staring at him, daring him to say something else."
    "他似乎重新在打量猎豹。而拉吉娅也在做同样的事：盯着他，激他再说点什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27489
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_b1953699:

    # w "I... did not expect that ending to the story."
    w "我……没料到故事会是这个结局。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27491
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_6cad9de5:

    # r "Sorry it wasn't as salacious as you'd hoped."
    r "抱歉，没你希望的那么香艳。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27495
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_7dcf718e:

    # w "What?"
    w ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27497
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_d70c7a1a:

    # r "My clothes stayed on."
    r "我的衣服一直穿着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27501
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_d8828861:

    # "Wolf shakes his head—perhaps slightly chagrinned."
    "沃尔夫摇了摇头——或许略带懊恼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27503
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_49f09a62:

    # w "I didn't mean that."
    w "我不是那个意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27505
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_d9a9061a:

    # w "It was just... a surprise."
    w "只是……有点意外。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27509
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_15d6fc17:

    # w "What were we—[name], what were you talking about?"
    w "我们刚才在——[名字]，你们刚才在说什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27513
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_6c499600:

    # "You sense a desire to change the subject, abrupt enough that it takes you a moment."
    "你感觉到一种想要改变话题的渴望，如此突然，让你愣了一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27515
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_8ecc7891:

    # p "Er. The stars. Mostly."
    p "呃。星星。主要是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27521
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_bcb75eef:

    # p "Wolf is... like that, apparently."
    p "沃尔夫……就是那样，显然。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27523
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_ab28a7ee:

    # "Not that you're good at making excuses for him."
    "并不是说你很擅长为他找借口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27529
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_591e520b:

    # r "Right. What were we talking about?"
    r "对。我们刚才在说什么来着？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27531
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_ca1bdb06:

    # p "The stars."
    p "星星。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27537
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_5d6847ac:

    # r "No, it was in the desert. You can be as far from cities and campfires there as you can be at sea."
    r "不，是在沙漠里。在那里，你可以远离城市和篝火，就像在海上一样遥远。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27539
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_76c25993:

    # r "I stood at the top of a dune and looked out at the stars, and—the Milky Way, you call it? It was magnificent."
    r "我站在沙丘顶上，眺望星空，还有——你们称之为银河？真是壮丽非凡。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27541
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_cc60b8bf:

    # p "Like this? Tonight?"
    p "像这样？今晚？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27543
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_wolf_d9a060df:

    # r "Like this, yes."
    r "像这样，是的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27550
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_9966575b:

    # p "They seem so close. I wonder if we're much closer to them here?"
    p "它们看起来好近。我在想，是不是我们在这里离它们近得多？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27554
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_7dcf718e:

    # w "What?"
    w ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27556
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_941fecaf:

    # p "I heard Perce saying that they're quite far. A hundred thousand leagues, I think."
    p "我听见珀斯说它们非常遥远。我想是十万里格吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27562
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_73ae705d:

    # r "No."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27564
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_93be50a0:

    # p "No?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27568
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_2d51628b:

    # r "They're billions of leagues away."
    r "它们有几十亿里格远。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27572
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_3bc593c3:

    # w "It can't be that many."
    w "不可能那么多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27574
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_d7576c9f:

    # r "It can."
    r "就是那么多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27581
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_c2c621ea:

    # p "You said you weren't an astronomer."
    p "你说过你不是天文学家。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27583
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_39108624:

    # r "I'm not. But I do have a learned friend."
    r "我不是。但我确实有位博学的朋友。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27587
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_1699cf48:

    # p "How can you be certain?"
    p "你怎么能确定？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27591
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_c8469f9e:

    # n "No, she is right."
    n "不，她是对的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27603
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_86ed9cd7:

    # "You turn to see that the painted dog has joined you. He seems to have become quite comfortable on the deck."
    "你转过身，看到那只彩绘犬（指狼）已来到你们身边。他在甲板上似乎已相当自在了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27605
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_78c0bc7c:

    # r "Mr. Nomax. Good evening."
    r "诺马克斯先生。晚上好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27617
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_ca2b65f1:

    # n "Good evening. I am just... strolling. Working through my thoughts. You are right, though. Scientists have proven it."
    n "晚上好。我只是……散散步。理理思绪。不过，你是对的。科学家已经证明了这一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27619
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_72f0fd77:

    # p "Proven..."
    p "证明了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:27623
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_e4811280:

    # n "The stars, [name]!"
    n "是星星，[姓名]！"

# game/script day12.rpy:27627
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_0c5276a7:

    # n "The stars. Or, that is, the nature of the stars."
    n "星星。或者说，星星的本质。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27629
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_9ac159ab:

    # n "Scientists have proven that each star is exactly identical to our own sun in size and brightness, differing only in their distance from our planet."
    n "科学家已经证明，每颗星星在大小和亮度上都与我们的太阳完全相同，唯一的区别在于它们距离我们星球的距离。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27631
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_5f9708fb:

    # n "Knowing that, one can compare the extent by which the light from the sun must be reduced until it is equivalent to what we consider a star. Obviously, the stars are quite feeble—we cannot see by them, for one."
    n "知道了这一点，就可以比较太阳光需要减弱到什么程度，才能等同于我们眼中的星光。显然，星星非常微弱——比如，我们无法借助它们的光看清东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27635
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_2de6edcf:

    # n "Er. Most of us cannot."
    n "呃。我们大多数人是不能。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27637
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_2d4cf373:

    # n "So if the light is reduced a factor of ten, the star must be ten times more distant. One hundredth as bright, a hundred times further away. Therefore, by mathematical extrapolation, we know the stars are—indeed—at least one million billion miles away."
    n "所以，如果光线减弱到十分之一，那么那颗星星的距离就必须是十倍远。亮度是百分之一，距离就是一百倍远。因此，通过数学外推法，我们知道星星——确实——至少在一百万亿英里之外。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27641
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_17d79c61:

    # "He has been explaining this—or trying to—with excited gesticulations, indicating the distances in question by spreading and narrowing his paws."
    "他一直在解释这个——或者说试图解释——激动地比划着，用爪子张开和收拢来示意所讨论的距离。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27643
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_6a9f275f:

    # n "Do you follow?"
    n "你们跟得上吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27645
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_867c2d02:

    # r "Somewhat."
    r "大概吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27647
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_cde92cc7:

    # p "No."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27651
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_9c578f83:

    # n "Ah, well... well. I did not either, when it was explained to me. I sat with the good gent for hours until it stuck... But he kept going on and on about the exact calculations, which just became numbers upon numbers and made it impossible to follow."
    n "啊，好吧……嗯。别人给我解释时，我也没懂。我和那位好心的先生坐了好几个小时才弄明白……但他不停地讲那些精确计算，结果变成了一堆数字摞数字，根本没法跟上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27653
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_f1949e74:

    # n "He even wanted me to get a chalkboard. As if I have something like that just sitting about in the dining room..."
    n "他甚至想让我弄块黑板。好像我餐厅里就放着那种东西似的……"

# game/script day12.rpy:27655
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_707e8261:

    # n "Once I got him to finally cut it down to the basics we were making headway—uh—{w}Anyway. Sorry. I trailed off there. The {i}important{/i} thing is, yes, the doctor is quite right. They're very far away."
    n ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27661
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_0b75dd3f:

    # "Nomax realizes, from your expressions, that you are not quite up to following the explanation. You, at least, enjoy his enthusiasm; when he leaves to continue his \"stroll,\" you watch the wag of his tail with a smile."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27663
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_0c6a811a:

    # "Wolf, of course, has a different take."
    "当然，狼有不同的看法。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27673
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_7205921f:

    # w "The important thing is, Perce is an idiot."
    w "重要的是，珀斯是个白痴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27675
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_ae6bf3a0:

    # p "He and another sailor. They talked about using an aerostat to reach them. A hot air balloon."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27677
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_1b1a472a:

    # w "Why didn't you say that?"
    w "你当时怎么不说？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27679
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_bd5a3713:

    # p "I don't know. It's what they're called. He said it would take months, but I think..."
    p "我不知道。它们就叫这个。他说要花几个月，但我觉得……"

# game/script day12.rpy:27683
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_340a4e3f:

    # r "Years, yes. Many, many years."
    r "几年，没错。很多很多年。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27691
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_787b4f3f:

    # w "Ugh."
    w "呃。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27700
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_f82eae4a:

    # p "Perhaps we could finish teaching you how to play your fife by then."
    p "也许到那时，我们就能教完你怎么吹短笛了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27704
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_6f724ece:

    # w "{i}Years{/i}? I'd throw myself overboard and take my chances with the fall."
    w "{i}几年{/i}？那我宁愿跳海，赌一把摔下去会怎样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27708
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_8def8bf3:

    # p "It might not be all bad. Perhaps by then Julian and you will have made progress with that fife."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27712
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_6f724ece_1:

    # w "{i}Years{/i}? I'd throw myself overboard and take my chances with the fall."
    w ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27716
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_8c31da62:

    # p "Maybe this is distance enough. Every time the bell rings—every minute, whether I'm asleep or not—I'm the furthest I've ever been from home."
    p "也许这距离已经够远了。每次钟声响起——每一分钟，无论我睡着与否——我都离家乡前所未有的遥远。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27720
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_4cd6765f:

    # p "I guess you are, too, Wolf."
    p "我想你也是，狼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27722
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_10c72e8c:

    # "Wolf remains subdued."
    "狼依然情绪低落。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27724
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_ab20b605:

    # w "No. Home is... whatever home is, it's not a place you can go back to."
    w "不。家是……无论家是什么，那都不是一个你能回去的地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27726
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_b0725bf8:

    # p "Will you be able to enjoy Mogador, do you think?"
    p "你觉得你能享受摩加多尔吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27730
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_03287fb8:

    # w "As much as any harbor."
    w "跟任何港口一样吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27732
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_efb9cf90:

    # p "It'll be something new, though. For both of us. Really, for everyone but you, Rajeeyah."
    p "不过，那会是新事物。对我们俩都是。真的，除了你，拉吉娅。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27736
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_1b062c8f:

    # p "I suppose Wolf is, too. Really, everyone but you, Rajeeyah."
    p "我想狼也是。真的，除了你，拉吉娅。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27744
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_b05f6659:

    # r "Don't be so sure."
    r "别那么肯定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27746
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_382b0ab2:

    # p "Oh?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27750
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_5a62fd01:

    # r "I expect that I will find it... changed. You could consider that, as well. What if you returned to a place where you spoke the same language, and walked the same streets, but everything was... ever so slightly different."
    r "我预料会发现它……变了样。你也可以想想这个。如果你回到一个你说着同样语言、走着同样街道的地方，但一切都……变得有那么一点点不同。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27752
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_87dc351e:

    # r "Is that better or worse?"
    r "那样更好还是更糟？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27754
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_75af4cf4:

    # p "I... don't know."
    p "我……不知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27760
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_06a758c1:

    # r "I suppose we'll compare experiences. Now that you'll be staying aboard... once we leave, you can tell me how you found it."
    r "我想我们可以交流一下经历。既然你要留在船上……等我们离开后，你可以告诉我你觉得那里怎么样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27766
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_fb8595cf:

    # r "Maybe it will be... useful... to see how you find it, Mr. [family_name]."
    r "也许看看[姓氏]先生你觉得如何，会……有用处……"

# game/script day12.rpy:27776
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_3f2f6ca5:

    # p "To be honest, though... it's my first time in a foreign port. And it's quite a different one, I'm sure. We could try to stay together."
    p "不过说实话……这是我第一次到外国港口。而且我敢肯定，这地方很不一样。我们可以试着待在一起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27780
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_c2a30d12:

    # r "Is that so?"
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27782
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_6bb4c162:

    # p "Well, you'll have things to do in port, won't you? I've helped you with your cabin."
    p "嗯，你在港口会有事要做，对吧？我已经帮你整理过船舱了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27786
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_816f10de:

    # "And, you don't add, it's hard to imagine a better guide than someone who speaks the language and knows the local customs. As bad as putting your foot in your mouth on the {i}Conway{/i} has been, it would be far worse if it landed you in a Moroccan jail."
    "而且，你没说出口的是，很难想象还有比一个会说当地语言、了解当地风俗的人更好的向导了。在{i}Conway{/i}上说错话已经够糟了，但如果因此让你进了摩洛哥的监狱，那可就糟多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27788
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_7d9fe0a1:

    # "Of course, Rajeeyah knows this, too. Her smile tells you plenty about that."
    "当然，拉吉娅也明白这一点。她的微笑充分说明了这一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27792
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_c10cc029:

    # r "And, in exchange, I keep you from getting into trouble?"
    r "那么，作为交换，我帮你避免惹上麻烦？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27794
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_7c43efc7:

    # p "I don't plan on getting into trouble! You could teach me a few words of Moroccan, though, right?"
    p "我可没打算惹麻烦！不过，你能教我几句摩洛哥语，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27798
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_2a192db5:

    # r "Arabic."
    r "阿拉伯语。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27800
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_fcd67f2b:

    # "The cheetah is still considering your offer. Notably, however, she has not rejected it out of hand. And she's still smiling."
    "猎豹仍在考虑你的提议。不过值得注意的是，她并没有立刻拒绝。而且她还在微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27802
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_909b36e0:

    # r "I'll speak to Arthur. You and Mr. Hvidt might have plenty to do on the ship, but he probably wouldn't mind sparing you for my tasks if it meant keeping an experienced sailor around to help with the ship."
    r "我会和亚瑟谈谈。你和维特先生在船上可能有很多事要做，但如果这意味着能有个经验丰富的水手帮忙照看船只，他大概不会介意让你来帮我完成任务。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27808
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_4b00e69c:

    # p "I could help you. Right? You'll have things you need to get done in port—supplies to pick up and so on?"
    p "我可以帮你。对吧？你在港口肯定有事要做——比如采购补给品之类的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27814
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_8d664ea9:

    # r "That's true, [name]. I suppose I wouldn't turn down the help. I'm sure Arthur might have other duties for you while we're in port, but I'll... suggest it, at least. You'd be willing to give up the excitement of the harbor?"
    r "没错，[姓名]。我想我不会拒绝帮忙的。我敢肯定我们在港口时，亚瑟可能还会给你安排其他任务，但我会……至少提一下。你愿意放弃港口的那些热闹吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27818
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_e8e8f46b:

    # p "I think so. I still do have a lot to make up for..."
    p "我想是的。毕竟我还有很多事要弥补……"

# game/script day12.rpy:27822
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_6f432dde:

    # p "Yes, ma'am. And... honestly, I'm sure Arthur would prefer that, too."
    p "是的，女士。而且……说实话，我相信亚瑟也会更希望这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27827
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_e78dde23:

    # r "I appreciate the offer, I guess, but I'm not sure that's really a good idea. Most of what I'll be doing is handling delicate medicinal ingredients. The negotiations might take some time."
    r "我很感激你的提议，但我不确定那真的是个好主意。我要做的大部分事情都是处理精密的药材。谈判可能会花些时间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27829
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_d97767e8:

    # w "And are boring, probably."
    w "而且很可能很无聊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27839
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_a61ca5cf:

    # r "Well... if you're that eager to make a good first impression, I can speak to Arthur. But I imagine he'll have other things for you to do."
    r "好吧……如果你那么渴望留下好印象，我可以和亚瑟说说。但我想他会有其他事情安排给你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27845
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_ed2d7265:

    # r "Just don't embarrass yourself too much. You'll keep him out of trouble, won't you, Mr. Hvidt?"
    r "只要别让自己太丢脸就行。你会看着他别惹麻烦的，对吧，维特先生？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27849
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_4309ad3a:

    # w "No."
    w ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27853
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_c21aae4f:

    # w "I wouldn't mind coming out of Mogador with someone {i}else{/i} as the topic of everyone's interest."
    w "我可不想离开摩加多尔时，成为大家津津乐道的{i}另一个{/i}话题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27857
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_b4fd89c4:

    # p "I'll try. But, honestly, from what Sam and the others say, I'm... expecting we won't stray far from the harbor."
    p "我尽量。但说实话，从萨姆和其他人说的来看，我……估计我们不会离港口太远。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27861
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_a549c7ad:

    # w "Of course not. That's why the bars are there."
    w "当然不会。所以那些酒吧才在那儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27863
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_8d0b2b40:

    # p "To keep sailors like us occupied?"
    p "为了让我们这样的水手有事可做？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27867
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_1efa261e:

    # r "To keep you contained."
    r "为了把你们圈在那儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27869
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_d56e8852:

    # p "For?"
    p "为什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27873
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_765fb44c:

    # r "For when it's time to set sail and you can't be found. So the ship's officers know where to send the men with the leashes and lashes."
    r "为了起航时，找不到你们人在哪儿。这样船上的长官就知道该派谁拿着绳索和鞭子去哪个地方找人了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27875
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_56d97db1:

    # r "And, yes, it keeps you from disturbing the locals."
    r "而且，没错，也免得你们打扰当地人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27882
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_cd8ad70d:

    # s "Oi!"
    s "喂！"

# game/script day12.rpy:27894
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_9a9ad232:

    # "Your attention is summoned by a surprised shout from the {i}Conway{/i}'s bow. Your heart begins to race, but as far as you can tell, there's no emergency."
    "你的注意力被{i}Conway{/i}船头传来的一声惊呼吸引。你的心开始怦怦直跳，但据你所知，并没有紧急情况发生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27896
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_56ba8fe6:

    # "The sails are set. Nobody is rushing to help an injured sailor. But..."
    "帆已张好。没有人跑去救助受伤的水手。但是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:27907
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_ad745e9a:

    # p "Is the water... brighter than usual?"
    p "这海水……是不是比平时亮？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27912
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_957938c1:

    # w "No. I thought you could see in the dark."
    w "不是吧。我以为你能在黑暗中视物。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27916
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_f0a184c2:

    # r "He can. So can I."
    r "他能。我也能。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27918
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_11bc8fc4:

    # "Rajeeyah's voice is soft, and you look to see that the cheetah, too, is straining to see clearly. Her head has tilted slightly to the side."
    "拉吉娅的声音很轻柔，你转头看到那只猎豹也在努力看清。她的头微微歪向一侧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27920
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_bf7ce33c:

    # r "I think he's right, Mr. Hvidt."
    r "我想他说得对，维特先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27927
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_16ef8523:

    # "Indeed, you're certain of it now. The water has taken on a faint blue tinge. It's like nothing you've ever seen before. A few seconds later, a curious grunt from the wolf marks his own realization."
    "确实，你现在确信了。海水泛起了淡淡的蓝色光泽。这是你从未见过的景象。几秒钟后，狼发出的一声好奇的咕哝，标志着他自己也意识到了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27929
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_255fafc3:

    # "At least the reaction of the others is heartening: nobody seems to be panicking. Like you, they're looking curiously at the water, craning their heads to get a better look."
    "至少其他人的反应令人欣慰：似乎没人惊慌。和你一样，他们都好奇地看着海水，伸长脖子想看得更清楚些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27931
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_d73b8762:

    # p "What in the world is it?{w} Wolf?"
    p "这到底是什么东西？{w} 狼？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27935
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_aeca2ff7:

    # "He shakes his head."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27937
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_d6110bf2:

    # w "I don't know. I don't see any fish."
    w "我不知道。我没看到鱼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27941
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_76ce4d05:

    # r "No, it's not fish. It's true that some creatures glow, for some reason. We saw it in jellyfish, once. But this is the water itself."
    r "不，不是鱼。确实有些生物会发光，出于某种原因。我们曾在水母身上见过。但这是海水本身在发光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27943
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_06534591:

    # p "It's not dangerous, is it?"
    p "这不危险吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27945
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_4487541f:

    # r "I don't believe so."
    r "我认为不危险。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27959
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_07cca623:

    # "She looks around, as if reassuring herself of her conclusion."
    "她环顾四周，仿佛在确认自己的结论。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27961
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_8831f000:

    # r "We're not tacking or steering away from it, at least."
    r "至少我们没有改变航向或避开它。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27963
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_aa83f30e:

    # "As the {i}Conway{/i} sails onward, the glow is only becoming more brilliant. Most of the crew could read by it now, you're certain—not just you, with your keen vision."
    "随着{i}Conway{/i}继续航行，那片荧光变得愈发耀眼。你现在确信——不只是你，凭着敏锐的视力——大多数船员都能借着这光阅读了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27965
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_da61b45c:

    # "You hold out your arm, to catch a bit of spray. The water is still bracingly cold."
    "你伸出手臂，接住一点飞溅的水花。海水依然冰冷刺骨。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27967
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_3680d757:

    # p "I wonder if this is a good omen."
    p "我在想，这是否是个好兆头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27969
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_a889520b:

    # "Neither of them answers. Rajeeyah is the picture of poise, with the light flashing in her eyes as the ship's bow splits the waves. Wolf gives no outward sign—but he is looking at the water, having not returned to absently staring at the horizon."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27971
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_b6484938:

    # p "You've never seen this before, Wolf?"
    p "你以前从未见过这个，沃尔夫？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27973
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_b1600cb1:

    # w "Trollwood."
    w "巨魔森林。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27975
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_f4043c8f:

    # p "Come again?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27977
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_6d065805:

    # w "The glow of rotting trees. They use it to mark paths, sometimes, for travelers."
    w "腐烂树木发出的光。他们有时用它为旅人标记路径。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27979
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_078c5a26:

    # p "Oh..."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:27981
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_1fbf9b8e:

    # "You'd never heard of anything like that before."
    "你以前从未听说过类似的事情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27983
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_e46a33ee:

    # p "And that happens with ships, too?"
    p "船也会这样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27985
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_a6db8c32:

    # w "How would I know? Apparently, it does."
    w "我怎么会知道？显然，会的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27987
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_d880a82c:

    # p "It must be a good omen, then."
    p "那这一定是个好兆头了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27991
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_2f87ab86:

    # r "Do you believe in that?"
    r "你相信那个吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:27993
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_5146dd2f:

    # p "I'm... not certain."
    p "我……不确定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27995
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_4fa0a484:

    # "But you'd like to. Watching the gleaming water part before you, and the ship sailing headlong into ethereal glow, you'd like to believe in good omens more than anything."
    "但你想相信。看着闪闪发光的水在你面前分开，船一头扎进这空灵的辉光中，你比什么都更愿意相信好兆头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27997
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_46a969b0:

    # "The previous two weeks at sea have been nothing like what you expected. The previous {i}day{/i} has been nothing like what you'd expected. You can only guess at what will come."
    "海上度过的前两周与你预期的完全不同。之前的{i}一天{/i}也与你预期的完全不同。你只能猜测接下来会发生什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:27999
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_33075a89:

    # "There is a sudden warmth on your shoulder. A glance shows Rajeeyah's paw resting on it—and that she is looking past you, to the spray from the bow and the promise of everything beyond it."
    "你的肩头突然感到一阵暖意。一瞥之下，是拉吉娅的爪子搭在上面——而她正越过你，望向船首激起的浪花以及浪花之外所预示的一切。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28001
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_19533188:

    # r "{i}Qad raje'at al-bayt{i}."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28003
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_e1a327fe:

    # "Eerie cerulean light glints in the cheetah's sharp, clear eyes."
    "诡异的蔚蓝色光芒在这只猎豹锐利清澈的眼中闪烁。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28005
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_f17bad3e:

    # r "I am home."
    r "我到家了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28011
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_7aee5441:

    # "Wolf looks at you from the corner of his eye. You can tell that he's trying to say something—or to keep from saying it. Something curt, no doubt. Asking if you'll ever quiet down enough to enjoy the moment."
    "沃尔夫用眼角余光看了你一眼。你能看出他想说点什么——或者是在忍住不说。无疑是些生硬的话。问你是否能安静下来好好享受这一刻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28013
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_199ba7fe:

    # w "If you like. Sure."
    w "随你喜欢。当然。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28017
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_23574832:

    # w "You and your omens. Maybe you {i}are{/i} a sailor."
    w "你和你的兆头。也许你{i}确实{/i}是个水手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28019
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_96fc0632:

    # "With that, he turns back to the glinting, dancing light thrown off as the {i}Conway{/i} sails onward. The ship's wake, spreading behind you, is a gleaming foam—as if some fantastic dream, slowly fading, has left its mark on the waking world."
    "说完，他转身继续看向{i}Conway{/i}前行时抛洒出的闪烁、跃动的光芒。船尾航迹在你身后铺开，是一片闪亮的泡沫——仿佛某个奇异的梦，正缓缓消散，却在清醒的世界留下了印记。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28023
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_63da0e8c:

    # "Beyond the glow lies Mogador. Beyond that... you can't say for certain. Perhaps none of you can. You can only appreciate what the moment has brought you. Wolf takes a deep breath; nods, and speaks, to no one in particular."
    "光芒之外是莫加多尔。那之外……你说不准。也许你们谁也说不准。你只能感激此刻带给你的东西。沃尔夫深吸一口气；点了点头，开口说道，并非特别针对谁。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28025
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_10a3253a:

    # w "A good omen."
    w "一个好兆头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28029
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_728fd556:

    # "Beyond the glow lies Mogador. Beyond that... you can't say for certain. Perhaps none of you can. You can only appreciate what the moment has brought you. Perhaps Wolf is right. Then again..."
    "光芒之外是莫加多尔。那之外……你说不准。也许你们谁也说不准。你只能感激此刻带给你的东西。也许沃尔夫是对的。不过……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28031
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_wolf_rajeeyah_post_9d538ac1:

    # p "I've been called worse things."
    p "比这更难听的称呼我都听过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28052
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_68342cc7:

    # "You sigh heavily, and take Wolf's place at the railing. You're probably imagining it, but you tell yourself the wood is still warm from his grip. Rajeeyah joins you, staring down into the dark water around the ship."
    "你重重叹了口气，接替沃尔夫的位置靠在栏杆上。你很可能是在想象，但你告诉自己，木头还残留着他握过的余温。拉吉娅来到你身边，低头凝视着船周围幽暗的海水。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28054
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_94a37195:

    # p "I don't know what I did. I keep asking myself that."
    p "我不知道我做了什么。我一直在问自己这个问题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28058
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_d5702820:

    # r "Do you imagine that, with others, Wolf is one of the ship's most noteworthy conversationalists?"
    r "你是不是觉得，和别人相比，沃尔夫是船上最值得注意的交谈者之一？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28060
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_02a129c7:

    # p "Well, no. But I... I thought we were... close."
    p "嗯，不是。但我……我以为我们……很亲近。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28064
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_caf4dac4:

    # r "You probably are. I don't think Wolf opens up to many people."
    r "你们很可能确实亲近。我不认为沃尔夫会对很多人敞开心扉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28066
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_f9fe6031:

    # p "He's done opening up to me."
    p "他已经对我关上了心扉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28073
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_4aa084d5:

    # "The ship's doctor puts her hand on yours, giving it a gentle pat."
    "船医把她的手放在你的手上，轻轻拍了拍。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28075
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_5ab2a1fd:

    # r "I doubt that. Trust me, [name], if Wolf has made any friends on the {i}Conway...{/i}"
    r "我对此表示怀疑。相信我，[姓名]，如果沃尔夫在{i}Conway{/i}上交过任何朋友……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28077
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_a61b701b:

    # "You wish you could believe that."
    "你希望自己能相信这一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28081
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_615db640:

    # r "I think you're likely closer to him than anyone else, to be honest."
    r "说实话，我认为你很可能比任何人都更接近他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28083
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_6ea66ed6:

    # p "I don't know what to make of it."
    p "我不知道该如何理解这件事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28085
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_fffe6933:

    # r "He just needs some time. And space."
    r "他只是需要一些时间。还有空间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28087
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_9248ec36:

    # p "Something... happened to him, I think."
    p "我想……他身上发生过一些事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28091
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_519a1793:

    # r "Probably. Ships... take people like that."
    r "很可能。船……就是这样带走人的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28093
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_db0fc17c:

    # "It took the cheetah longer than usual to finish her thought—and, you sense, there's something in that lengthy pause."
    "这只猎豹花的时间比平时更长才把话说完——而且，你感觉到，在那段漫长的停顿中另有深意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28095
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_1a6d18e6:

    # p "People like what?"
    p "什么样的人？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28097
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_5712a379:

    # "She is quietly contemplative once more, and breaks the silence with a sigh, and a question that catches you off-guard."
    "她又陷入了安静的沉思，用一声叹息打破了沉默，并问了一个让你措手不及的问题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28101
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_bb51833d:

    # r "Do you know anything of fish, [name]?"
    r "你对鱼了解多少，[姓名]？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28103
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_173afd9a:

    # p "Er... yes, I suppose."
    p "呃……是的，我想我了解一些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28107
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_309763d9:

    # r "I've operated on my share of sailors. None of them had gills, nor fins. We're not meant to be at sea... not our bodies, at least."
    r "我医治过不少水手。他们都没有鳃，也没有鳍。我们本不该在海上……至少我们的身体不适合。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28109
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_db6e12cc:

    # r "So, who is it that belongs even less on land than they do here?{w} People who aren't meant to till the soil or work a loom or any of the other things that make a village, and make them a villager."
    r "那么，是谁比他们更不适合待在陆地上呢？{w}是那些本不该耕地、织布或做其他任何构成村庄、并使他们成为村民的事情的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28113
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_74f5cf6e:

    # r "People who... who are looking for something they don't know they can't find. People who are running from something."
    r "是那些……在寻找他们不知道自己找不到的东西的人。是那些在逃避某些东西的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28121
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_5ac0c71b:

    # r "Me? Running from something, of course. Born a cheetah, after all."
    r "我？当然是逃避某些东西的那种。毕竟，生来就是猎豹。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28123
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_7f740faa:

    # "Despite her smile, she clearly meant this seriously."
    "尽管她微笑着，但显然这话是认真的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28127
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_bcdcbc0f:

    # p "From the law? Something your lover did?"
    p "逃避法律？还是你的爱人做了什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28131
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_363e9edb:

    # p "From... the law? I doubt that."
    p "逃避……法律？我对此表示怀疑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28135
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_674d68ea:

    # r "No, nothing that direct. Running from who I was meant to become. I could be a villager... I think. But I've yet to find the right village."
    r "不，没那么直接。逃避我注定要成为的样子。我可以做个村民……我想。但我还没找到合适的村庄。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28139
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_4e050bab:

    # r "I don't know. This is your first voyage. In twenty years, if you haven't settled down, find me and we'll talk."
    r "我不知道。这是你的第一次航行。二十年后，如果你还没安定下来，来找我，我们再谈。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28145
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_966486c3:

    # r "I doubt that. He doesn't exactly seem a criminal, does he?"
    r "我对此表示怀疑。他看起来不像是罪犯，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28147
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_b0d36721:

    # p "Are you that certain about that?..."
    p "你对此就那么肯定吗？……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28149
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_e7bf3abc:

    # r "There are other types of things to run from, and other types of people who run."
    r "有各种各样的东西需要逃避，也有各种各样的人在逃避。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28151
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_cbc27c17:

    # p "And Wolf is..."
    p "而沃尔夫是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28155
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_5e3fc1e7:

    # r "My second voyage as a ship's surgeon, I treated two men who'd been in a duel. One of them was young. Your age, perhaps? He was calm about it, or putting on a brave face.{w} A good patient. Perhaps a little sheepish. He was the one who'd started it—his first time."
    r "我第二次担任船医的航行中，治疗过两个决斗受伤的人。其中一个很年轻。大概和你年纪相仿？他很平静，或者说，故作勇敢。{w}一个好病人。也许有点难为情。是他挑起的——那是他第一次决斗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28157
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_24125c1e:

    # "Even though she's avoided giving you a direct answer, you try to listen carefully, to see where the story is going."
    "即使她避开了直接回答你，你还是努力仔细倾听，想看看这个故事会引向何处。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28159
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_f10ad7c1:

    # r "The other, older man, he was... less calm. Dueling is illegal, of course, even though he was judged to be less the one at fault. The captain ordered them both put ashore at the next port."
    r "另一个年纪较大的男人，他……就没那么平静了。决斗当然是违法的，尽管他被判过错较轻。船长下令在下一个港口将他们俩都赶下船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28161
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_e0143af6:

    # r "He kept telling me how foolish it was. I had to listen, because I was treating him, but, of course, I couldn't get him out of the brig."
    r "他一直告诉我这有多愚蠢。我不得不听，因为我在给他治疗，但当然，我没办法把他从禁闭室里弄出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28163
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_636506ef:

    # r "I don't think he cared about that. He just wanted to talk. Eventually I learned that he'd been in duels before, when he was younger. He'd jumped on a boat to make a new start for himself. Eventually, he'd given up that old life altogether."
    r "我觉得他不在乎那个。他只是想说话。最终我了解到，他年轻时也曾参与过决斗。他跳上一艘船，想为自己开创新的生活。最终，他完全放弃了那种旧生活。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28165
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_5e67de2c:

    # r "But they were friends, and I suppose... I suppose you have to be good friends with someone to be able to goad them into an idiotic decision like that, don't you?"
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28167
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_967f4b61:

    # p "There was no reason for it?"
    p "没有任何理由吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28171
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_8a031c01:

    # "The doctor makes a disgusted face, shaking her head."
    "医生做了个厌恶的表情，摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28175
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_f29774e3:

    # r "There never is. We were headed for Jamaica. One of the two had accused the other of stealing the money they'd set aside for rum when we made port."
    r "从来都没有理由。我们当时正前往牙买加。两人中的一个指控另一个偷了他们为靠港后买朗姆酒攒下的钱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28177
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_e035b66d:

    # r "It wasn't {i}about{/i} rum, of course; I'm sure it had been building for weeks. Who knows how many voyages..."
    r "当然，这和{i}朗姆酒{/i}无关；我敢肯定矛盾已经累积了好几周。谁知道是多少次航行……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28179
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_0a3400cc:

    # p "It just... got out of hand? Wolf and I are not-"
    p "只是……失控了？沃尔夫和我不是——"

# game/script day12.rpy:28181
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_8765dd32:

    # r "Let me finish."
    r "让我说完。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28183
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_e88a0767:

    # p "Sorry."
    p "抱歉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28185
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_61703cb1:

    # r "Last year, we were back in Kingstown. I saw him, outside a tavern, and he recognized me, so we spoke a little.{w} Banalities.{w} The weather.{w} He asked about sailing, and I answered, and then he... stopped talking."
    r "去年，我们回到了金斯敦。我在一家酒馆外看见了他，他认出了我，所以我们聊了一会儿。{w}都是些老生常谈。{w}天气。{w}他问了航海的事，我回答了，然后他……不说话了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28187
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_cddbb436:

    # r "I asked him—I'm sure the way you did: \"what's the matter?\""
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28193
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_9fa71c20:

    # r "After a fashion. It had trapped him in Jamaica, after all. He was consumed, I think, by things that had happened. Maybe that was just one more."
    r "在某种程度上是的。毕竟，那件事把他困在了牙买加。我想，他被发生过的事情吞噬了。也许那只是其中一件。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28199
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_db95c99a:

    # r "No. He didn't have to. I could see it in his eyes. Someone came from the tavern and helped him off. They told me: \"he's just like that, sometimes.\""
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28203
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_db7efff3:

    # r "Imagine a tear in your coat—one that left you bare to the wind and driving rain. What would you do?"
    r "想象一下你外套上有个破洞——一个让你暴露在寒风冷雨中的破洞。你会怎么做？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28205
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_3e5ad080:

    # p "Well... patch it, I suppose, right? Needle and thread..."
    p "嗯……我想，把它补上，对吧？针和线……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28207
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_40c6b992:

    # r "My thought, exactly. I'm a surgeon, after all.{w} But sometimes, there are things in one's past that cannot be mended—certainly, they cannot be mended by others. Eventually, you would learn to keep that side from being exposed."
    r "我也是这么想的。毕竟，我是个外科医生。{w}但有时候，一个人的过去有些东西是无法修补的——当然，它们无法由他人修补。最终，你会学会不让那一面暴露出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28209
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_ef9b7a6b:

    # r "Or maybe, you'd cover it with something else."
    r "或者，也许你会用别的东西盖住它。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28211
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_4c1a34ea:

    # p "Something that kept it hidden from other people."
    p "某种能把它隐藏起来，不让别人看到的东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28215
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_ab7af4f7:

    # "Rajeeyah nods, and falls quiet, her ears twitching now and then to the creak of the rigging."
    "拉吉娅点点头，安静下来，她的耳朵不时随着索具的吱嘎声抽动一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28221
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_325a1aa5:

    # p "I don't want to be the... the wind plucking at Wolf's coat."
    p "我不想成为……吹动沃尔夫外套的风。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28223
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_d1d4940d:

    # r "I know. Wolf knows, too, I'm sure."
    r "我知道。沃尔夫也知道，我肯定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28229
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_af73a437:

    # p "Thank you for your advice. I guess... if you don't mind me saying... that sounds like a story you've also been carrying for a while."
    p "谢谢你的建议。我想……如果你不介意我这么说……那听起来像是一个你也背负了许久的故事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28231
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_bcb94c20:

    # r "Perhaps it is, yes."
    r "也许是的，没错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28233
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_3fa52995:

    # p "You've listened to me, I..."
    p "你听我说了这么多，我……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28237
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_1c73de31:

    # "The doctor laughs, a gentle sound that barely carries above the lapping waves."
    "医生笑了，那轻柔的声音几乎被拍岸的浪声淹没。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28239
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_fd7204eb:

    # r "You desire too much to help, [name]."
    r "你太想帮助别人了，[姓名]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28241
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_e02fd477:

    # p "I'm only doing what you would do."
    p "我只是在做你会做的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28245
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_2f89398d:

    # r "Mm."
    r "唔。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28247
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_e31774ae:

    # p "If you don't want to talk..."
    p "如果你不想谈……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28249
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_1c42a0fc:

    # r "There is not as much to talk about as it seems. I think about the old man, because he reminds me of a lesson I should've learned—thought I had learned. The one I just told you."
    r "事情并没有看起来那么多可谈的。我想到那个老人，因为他提醒了我一个我本该学会——我以为我已经学会了的教训。就是我刚刚告诉你的那个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28251
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_81ecb1f6:

    # p "The past can't be mended?"
    p "过去无法修补？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28253
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_a59c6d9e:

    # r "{i}People{/i} cannot be mended. Your desire to help them doesn't always change how much they can be helped. That goes for you, too."
    r "{i}人{/i}是无法修补的。你想要帮助他们的愿望，并不总能改变他们能被帮助的程度。这一点对你也适用。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28255
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_09b967e3:

    # r "Not that you want to {i}fix{/i} Wolf..."
    r "并不是说你想要{i}纠正{/i}沃尔夫……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28257
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_bb0e06fe:

    # p "I don't, no."
    p "不，我没有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28259
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_fdbfb110:

    # r "He'll come around. Perhaps the old sailor will, too. It's not my place."
    r "他会回心转意的。也许那位老水手也会。这不是我该管的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28264
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_2522b22a:

    # p "What about his friend? The one who started the duel."
    p "那他那位朋友呢？挑起决斗的那个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28269
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_8dc15aa8:

    # "Rajeeyah doesn't answer, and the question hangs for long enough that you realize there must be more to the story."
    "拉吉娅没有回答，这个问题悬在空中，持续了足够长的时间，让你意识到这背后肯定还有更多故事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28271
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_7bca876a:

    # p "Was it someone you knew? Was it Arthur?"
    p "是你认识的人吗？是亚瑟吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28275
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_73ae705d:

    # r "No."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28277
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_8b6d5087:

    # p "Wolf?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28279
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_73ae705d_1:

    # r "No."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28281
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_57953fe8:

    # r "His condition turned, and there was nothing I could do. He died the day before we made port."
    r "他的病情恶化了，我无能为力。就在我们靠岸的前一天，他去世了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28283
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_9bd0516e:

    # p "Oh. Oh, I'm sorry."
    p "噢。噢，我很遗憾。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28287
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_c39037de:

    # r "My first duel, as well, after a fashion. As I said: a lesson I should've learned.{w} His name was Louis Gough, he was from Liverpool, and the ship's quartermaster found the money he'd stolen hidden in the false bottom of a mug he used."
    r "从某种意义上说，那也是我的第一次决斗。就像我说的：一个我本该吸取的教训。{w}他叫路易斯·高夫，来自利物浦，船上的军需官在他用的一个杯子的假底里，找到了他偷藏的钱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28289
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_7bb7ea87:

    # p "I'm sorry."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28291
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_6aa4cb6f:

    # "It's the only thing you can think to say."
    "这是你唯一能想到要说的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28295
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_8f02bf3a:

    # r "I haven't lost many, at least."
    r "至少，我没失去过多少人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28297
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_441cba31:

    # r "I try..."
    r "我尽力了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28301
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_165cbc8f:

    # "She sighs, staring out into the distance. After a few minutes, you hear a quiet shout from the direction of the {i}Conway{/i}'s bow. Rajeeyah tenses, and leans forward curiously."
    "她叹了口气，凝视着远方。几分钟后，你听到从{i}Conway{/i}船头方向传来一声轻轻的呼喊。拉吉娅身体一紧，好奇地向前倾身。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28303
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_37de91af:

    # r "Oh, will you look at that..."
    r "噢，快看那儿……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28305
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_61210acb:

    # p "What is- oh!"
    p "那是——噢！"

# game/script day12.rpy:28309
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_a762386e:

    # "At first, you might have imagined it. But no: the {i}Conway{/i} dips into the swell of a wave, and the water brightens, a blue glow that fades slowly enough to be unmistakable."
    "起初，你可能以为是错觉。但不是：{i}Conway{/i}沉入一个浪谷，海水亮了起来，一片蓝色的光芒缓慢地褪去，清晰无疑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28311
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_e3760715:

    # p "Is the water glowing?"
    p "海水在发光？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28313
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_bec3b4af:

    # r "Yes."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28315
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_8e6d3a45:

    # p "Why? Is it..."
    p "为什么？难道是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28317
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_3a17271b:

    # "You feel more than a little silly asking the question—realizing as you open your mouth how, once again, you're surely establishing yourself as a newcomer to the ways of a ship. But it can't be helped."
    "问出这个问题让你感觉有点傻——话一出口你就意识到，这无疑又一次确立了你作为船上新手的身份。但没办法。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28319
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_f5c926ea:

    # p "Is it magic?"
    p "是魔法吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28321
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_87965ed0:

    # r "I don't think so, Mr. [family_name]. Something in the water."
    r "我不这么认为，[姓]先生。是水里的什么东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28323
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_f5097229:

    # p "In Morocco?"
    p "在摩洛哥？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28325
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_23766517:

    # r "I've seen this in the Caribbean, too. It's harmless."
    r ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28327
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_afdffd8f:

    # p "But beautiful..."
    p "但是很美……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28341
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_68e4041e:

    # "You can see brighter ocean still, ahead of the {i}Conway{/i}'s bowsprit. Soon the ship is in its midst, cutting a brilliantly glowing line through the gentle waves."
    "你可以看到，在{i}Conway{/i}的船首斜桅前方，还有更明亮的海洋。很快，船就驶入了其中，在轻柔的波浪中划出一道璀璨的光带。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28343
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_c73d3afd:

    # "Between the expanse of glittering crystal above you, and the luminous sea, you feel your sense of place: a speck among other specks, teeming like ants on a raft of wood and iron and sail, in a universe of immense and unnameable wonder."
    "头顶是浩瀚闪烁的星空，脚下是发光的海洋，你感到了自己的位置：如同蚁群中的一只蚂蚁，挤在由木头、铁器和风帆构成的木筏上，置身于一个巨大而难以名状的奇观宇宙中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28345
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_8625c566:

    # "At first you are overwhelmed by how tiny it makes you feel. Then, by how privileged you are to be experiencing it. You grin, baring your fangs to the cool spray kicked up by the {i}Conway{/i}'s passage."
    "起初，你被这种渺小感所淹没。接着，又被自己能体验这一切的幸运感所淹没。你咧嘴笑了，对着{i}Conway{/i}航行激起的凉爽水花，露出了你的尖牙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28347
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_2d6665d4:

    # "{i}I'm a sailor{/i}, you think. This is the life you've chosen, and if that means you're not meant to be a villager—as Rajeeyah puts it—so what? This {i}is{/i} your village."
    "{i}我是一名水手{/i}，你想。这就是你选择的生活，如果这意味着你不该做个村民——就像拉吉娅说的那样——那又如何？这{i}就是{/i}你的村庄。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28349
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_c324a1ff:

    # "You think about how skeptical Perce was: \"A hundred thousand leagues, at least!\" The {i}Conway{/i} would seem even more diminutive, at that scale; more insignificant. And yet..."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28351
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_988977df:

    # "Yet, you think, you would sail every one of those leagues. You've already made a respectable start. You cast a look around, enjoying the sight of the ship and its crew at work."
    "然而，你想，你会航行那每一里格。你已经有了一个不错的开端。你环顾四周，欣赏着船和船员们工作的景象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28355
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_61a263ab:

    # "Nomax is standing on the poop deck; the light from the water catches his glasses. As you watch, he pulls out a small book and scratches a few notes into it, a look of fascination written across his muzzle."
    "诺马克斯站在艉楼甲板上；水中的光芒映在他的眼镜上。你看着他掏出一本小书，在上面草草记了几笔，脸上写满了着迷的神情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28357
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_f3e3c2bc:

    # "Most of the crew, even the watch-standers, are out."
    "大多数船员，甚至值班的，都出来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28361
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_aaf7db7a:

    # "Julian is pointing towards the water, chatting excitedly with one of the other sailors. You can't hear the story being told, but the other man shakes his head—and grins."
    "朱利安正指着水面，兴奋地和另一个水手聊天。你听不清他们在讲什么故事，但另一个人摇了摇头——然后咧嘴笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28365
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_af42f152:

    # "Samuel and Konrad are chatting; the maned wolf's tail sways contentedly. Konrad jerks his thumb in the direction of the landward horizon."
    "塞缪尔和康拉德在聊天；鬃狼的尾巴满足地摇晃着。康拉德用拇指朝陆地方向的地平线戳了戳。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28367
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_4bddbcb6:

    # "Whatever he's said, Samuel punches him in the shoulder."
    "不管他说了什么，塞缪尔一拳打在他肩膀上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28369
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_64c330ab:

    # "Then they both laugh. Sam shrugs [his] shoulders, and makes an encompassing gesture with a wave of [his] paw. This time, the sound of their laughter is enough to reach your ears."
    "然后两人都笑了。萨姆耸了耸[他的]肩膀，用[他的]爪子做了个包罗万象的手势。这次，他们的笑声足以传到你的耳朵里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28371
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_a14746d6:

    # "One figure is standing by himself. Wolf is at the railing; his dark fur turns him into a crisp, formless silhouette, lit from behind by dazzling blue."
    "有一个人独自站着。沃尔夫在栏杆边；他深色的皮毛在身后耀眼的蓝光映衬下，变成了一道清晰而无形的剪影。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28373
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_9d15ca94:

    # "You consider going to him, but stop yourself. It occurs to you that neither you nor Rajeeyah have moved. He could've gone to the other side of the ship, or the forecastle. He did not."
    "你考虑过走过去，但制止了自己。你意识到你和拉吉娅都没动。他本可以去船的另一边，或者艏楼。但他没有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28375
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_888fcc93:

    # "As if sensing your thoughts, Wolf glances briefly in your direction. When your eyes meet, he keeps looking back at you longer than usual before finally turning away."
    "仿佛感知到了你的想法，沃尔夫短暂地朝你的方向瞥了一眼。当你们目光相遇时，他比平时更久地回望着你，最后才转过身去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28377
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_c27a032c:

    # "You take a deep breath as the {i}Conway{/i} continues to smoothly cut her way through these ethereal waters."
    "当{i}Conway{/i}继续平稳地在这片空灵的水域中破浪前行时，你深深地吸了一口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28379
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_rajeeyah_only_7065ecd8:

    # "Wolf..."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28416
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dd9558fe:

    # "It's stunning how quickly things can turn around."
    "事情转变得如此之快，真是令人惊叹。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28418
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_03a314f0:

    # "Every storm runs out of rain, or so they say."
    "每场暴风雨都有停歇的时候，人们都这么说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28420
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a3f7e080:

    # "This one did, too."
    "这一场也不例外。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28422
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c64b138d:

    # "And when it passed, the sky greeted you and the crew with its most brilliant blues, the sea smoothing out as if nothing had ever disturbed it."
    "当它过去后，天空以最灿烂的蓝色迎接你和船员们，海面平静下来，仿佛从未被惊扰过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28424
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9b61fbb5:

    # "But night has fallen now. You're back on the midwatch—steady as clockwork—just past midnight."
    "但现在夜幕已经降临。你又回到了午夜过后的中班岗上——像钟表一样规律。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28426
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_27ab0b1b:

    # "It'll probably be a while before they trust you with another weather watch. Instead, even with your eyes, you've been demoted to just another deckhand for the night shift."
    "他们可能得过一阵子才会再把观测天气的任务交给你。结果，即使有你这双眼睛，今晚你也降级成了普通的甲板水手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28428
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_96a4eb3d:

    # "Not that you mind."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28430
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_05a78a90:

    # "Some calm will do you good."
    "一些平静对你有好处。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28432
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f0821960:

    # "And few things are calmer than a night on a ship."
    "而很少有比船上的夜晚更平静的了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28443
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dba3012e:

    # "That is, if you can even manage to enjoy it..."
    "也就是说，如果你还能设法享受它的话……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28445
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1b1b4cae:

    # s "I love the night sky."
    s "我喜欢夜空。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28447
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f626b68d:

    # p "Mhm."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28450
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b37456bb:

    # p "I love the night sky."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28452
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5891b815:

    # s "Mhm."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28454
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a41666d5:

    # s "Quiet out here. Easy to forget the sea's got teeth sharp enough to glow in the moonlight."
    s "外面很安静。很容易忘记大海的牙齿锋利得能在月光下发光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28458
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c240b661:

    # s "That hand feel any better?"
    s "那只手感觉好些了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28460
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d7c56885:

    # "You bring up the hand you injured earlier and run your thumb across the still sensitive skin of your knuckles."
    "你抬起之前受伤的手，用拇指划过指关节上仍然敏感的皮肤。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28464
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_85fb939f:

    # "The sudden jolt of pain is a clear enough sign not to touch it"
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28466
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_62a90c93:

    # "At least it doesn't flare up when you leave it alone."
    "至少你不碰它的时候，它不会突然疼起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28468
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e17a25ee:

    # p "Better by now."
    p "现在好多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28470
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_03685500:

    # p "Another day or two and it'll be fully healed."
    p "再过一两天就会完全愈合。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28472
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b4423ec2:

    # s "Mhm...{w} be careful though. Easy enough to break something and let me tell ya—the ship always wins those duels."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28474
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_267a775c:

    # s "A busted hand can put you out for a while."
    s "手坏了能让你歇好一阵子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28476
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_aa1b2b77:

    # "Wind plucks at your clothes, the Milky Way stretching from one end of the horizon to the other with its thick, clustered stars pale where the sails don't block them."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28478
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9db8db93:

    # "Somehow, since boarding the ship, the stars seem different."
    "不知怎的，自从上了船，星星看起来就不一样了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28480
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fa9cb75b:

    # "More vivid. More... all-encompassing."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28482
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d283f95a:

    # "As if gravity itself might let go at any moment, and you'd drift up to join them."
    "仿佛重力本身随时可能消失，你会飘上去加入它们。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28486
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_49550400:

    # p "There is something to them."
    p "它们确实有些特别之处。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28490
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_178dfdc3:

    # p "There's something magical about them, don't you think?"
    p "它们有种魔力，你不觉得吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28492
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b2e00b8d:

    # "Moonlight glazes Samuel's scarred muzzle as [he] tracks your gaze upward."
    "月光洒在塞缪尔有疤痕的口鼻上，此时[他]正随着你的目光向上望去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28494
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_051efda3:

    # "[His] tail flicks once before falling still."
    "[他的]尾巴甩了一下，然后静止不动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28498
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b8c7b910:

    # p "Like eyes scattered across the sky. Looking down upon us."
    p "像眼睛一样散落在天空。俯视着我们。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28500
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c453d11e:

    # p "Hopefully they don't judge our missteps."
    p "希望它们不会评判我们的过失。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28502
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_030ac97d:

    # s "I doubt it."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28504
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2596229d:

    # s "They're too beautiful to hold a grudge."
    s "它们太美了，不会心怀怨恨。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28508
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_11e5ee7b:

    # p "Like seeds scattered across the sky, sprouting and glowing to life each night..."
    p "像种子一样撒在天空，每夜发芽、发光……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28510
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d5234b0f:

    # p "Only to disappear again for their short winter."
    p "只为在它们短暂的冬天再次消失。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28516
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fa796099:

    # s "You've got a poetic streak, you know that?"
    s "你还挺有诗意的，知道吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28518
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_76398197:

    # "You grin and scratch the nape of your neck with your claws."
    "你咧嘴一笑，用爪子挠了挠后颈。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28520
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_56f73a30:

    # s "They are beautiful."
    s "它们很美。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28524
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bf4b3a6f:

    # p "I guess I just had a lot of time to think about it."
    p "我想我只是有很多时间去思考这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28526
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a98e2ccd:

    # "You tap an absent-minded rhythm against the belaying pins."
    "你心不在焉地在系索栓上敲着节奏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28528
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4d0d85be:

    # p "I remember that I first really realized just how vast it all was when I was out in the field at night."
    p "我记得我第一次真正意识到这一切有多么广阔，是在夜晚的田野里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28532
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7d062a4e:

    # s "You worked the field at night?"
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28534
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8ba5e835:

    # p "Cat eyes."
    p "猫的眼睛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28538
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bb96c310:

    # s "Right. Of course."
    s "对。当然。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28542
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d1a06918:

    # p "When it was too warm, I preferred working at night instead."
    p "天气太热的时候，我更喜欢在晚上工作。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28546
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2615fed6:

    # p "I don't know, but one night it just hit me how small I was."
    p "我不知道，但有一晚，我突然意识到自己是多么渺小。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28548
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b9a435b4:

    # p "A bug. A speck of dust. No—less than that, even."
    p "一只虫子。一粒尘埃。不——甚至比那还小。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28552
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8b4cd3a8:

    # p "I remember lying in the dirt, back against the cool, damp soil, arms flung wide."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28554
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b971238d:

    # p "Looking up, with them looking right back at me."
    p "向上望去，而它们也正回望着我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28556
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9ca0a105:

    # s "Well, did they judge you for your laziness then?"
    s "那么，它们当时有没有评判你的懒惰呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28558
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5ff5f2ba:

    # "You pause. The waves below lap against the hull with a soothing calmness."
    "你停顿了一下。下方的波浪轻柔地拍打着船体，带着令人舒缓的平静。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28560
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2728735b:

    # p "I don't know."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28562
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b69f9f69:

    # s "Sounds like they didn't."
    s "听起来它们没有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28564
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_088a9972:

    # s "Y'know, maybe you should learn navigation? Could put that fascination to use."
    s "你知道吗，也许你应该学学航海？可以把那份着迷派上用场。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28567
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b6cf0ade:

    # p "One night, I don't know what stirred it, but it hit me all at once—the sheer immensity of the sky above me."
    p "有一晚，我不知道是什么触动了它，但我一下子全明白了——头顶天空那纯粹的浩瀚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28569
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2ee8a5f4:

    # p "How small I was beneath it."
    p "我在它下面是多么渺小。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28571
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b9a435b4_1:

    # p "A bug. A speck of dust. No—less than that, even."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28573
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f5ddc2cf:

    # p "But I didn't {i}feel{/i} like less."
    p "但我并没有{i}感觉{/i}自己更渺小。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28577
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2eded7bd:

    # p "I remember lying in the dirt, back against the cool, damp soil, arms flung wide. Just... there, you know?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28579
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1d120791:

    # p "No thoughts. Just feeling the breath of the night itself."
    p "没有思绪。只是感受着夜晚本身的呼吸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28581
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5ff5f2ba_1:

    # "You pause. The waves below lap against the hull with a soothing calmness."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28583
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_14c06d2c:

    # s "Somehow, I expected nothing else from you."
    s "不知怎的，我对你别无期待。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28587
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_963dad89:

    # s "And your poor mum had to scrub those clothes clean again."
    s "而你可怜的妈妈又得把那些衣服洗干净了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28591
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_10241040:

    # p "I didn't have a shirt on."
    p "我没穿上衣。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28593
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c6dce1ca:

    # "Somehow that appears to take [him] by surprise, though judging by [his] expression it was not an unpleasant one."
    "不知怎的，这似乎让[他]吃了一惊，不过从[他]的表情来看，这并非不悦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28597
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5b37434d:

    # s "Working topless, eh?"
    s "光着膀子干活，嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28599
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b8df8eb8:

    # p "What's with that look?"
    p "你那是什么表情？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28601
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3ef922de:

    # s "Nothin'."
    s "没什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28605
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_730b014b:

    # s "Maybe you should learn navigation. It won't dirty up your clothes and you could put that fascination to use, like."
    s "也许你该学学航海术。那不会弄脏你的衣服，还能让你那点着迷劲儿派上用场，是吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28607
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_85cc5b19:

    # p "Smooth."
    p "漂亮。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28611
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_be5017f9:

    # "Samuel laughs."
    "Samuel笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28614
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_211914e4:

    # s "Maybe you should learn navigation. You could put that fascination to use, like."
    s "也许你该学学航海术。你正好能把你那点着迷劲儿派上用场。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28618
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b89dac5e:

    # p "I don't think they'll let me within ten feet of anything important anytime soon, Sam."
    p "我觉得他们短时间内不会让我靠近任何重要东西十步之内，萨姆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28620
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ad2c5a23:

    # s "Don't be an idiot. I'm not sayin' snatch the charts—just hang back, listen when they teach."
    s "别犯傻。我又没叫你去偷海图——就是往后站站，他们教的时候听着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28622
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_49af83b4:

    # "You think about it for a moment but shake your head."
    "你想了片刻，但还是摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28624
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_91d9a704:

    # p "Not right now."
    p "现在不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28626
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d3c1681b:

    # p "There are too many people here who barely even look at me, Sam."
    p "这里有太多人连看都不看我一眼，萨姆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28630
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a722c387:

    # p "I need to prove that I'm not who they think I am."
    p "我得证明我不是他们以为的那种人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28632
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_546a111e:

    # p "That I'm not just here because of-"
    p "证明我不是仅仅因为——"

# game/script day12.rpy:28634
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_be9149f3:

    # "You swallow the end of your sentence."
    "你把后半句话咽了回去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28636
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_080df857:

    # p "I can't be the quiet guy jotting down notes right now."
    p "我现在不能当那个埋头记笔记的安静家伙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28638
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_394f4f36:

    # "Samuel, still leaning against the mast, tilts [his] head."
    "塞缪尔仍倚着桅杆，歪了歪头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28640
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_748e47c9:

    # p "You... you, of all people, should understand."
    p "你……你，尤其是你，应该能理解。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28642
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b889dc78:

    # p "Since you..."
    p "既然你……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28646
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1bfc629e:

    # p "I need to show I belong before thinking about stuff like that."
    p "我得先证明我属于这里，才能考虑那种事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28650
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_546a111e_1:

    # p "That I'm not just here because of-"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28652
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b79346b9:

    # "You swallow the end of your sentence. God, you hope no one ever finds out you got here because of your... {i}skills.{/i}"
    "你把后半句话咽了回去。天啊，你真心希望没人发现你是因为你的……“本事”才来到这里的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28656
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bc27edaf:

    # p "That I'm not just here because of someone's pity."
    p "证明我不是仅仅因为别人的怜悯才待在这里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28658
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1f39adb9:

    # p "No, Samuel. I can't be the quiet guy jotting down notes right now."
    p "不，塞缪尔。我现在不能当那个埋头记笔记的安静家伙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28660
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_394f4f36_1:

    # "Samuel, still leaning against the mast, tilts [his] head."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28664
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a393c105:

    # p "You, of all people, should understand me."
    p "你，尤其是你，应该理解我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28666
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8a3a8e7e:

    # p "And should understand how important it is to actually {i}belong{/i} to the crew."
    p "也应该理解真正“属于”这个船员集体有多重要。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28670
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2d680b79:

    # p "You should understand me."
    p "你应该理解我的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28674
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_000b0b15:

    # s "I-..."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28676
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_015f469d:

    # p "How long have you been here?"
    p "你来这里多久了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28680
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7819d340:

    # s "Five years."
    s "五年。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28684
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c44fd900:

    # p "Five years where you had to prove yourself every day. And now you're trying to become a Mate."
    p "五年，每一天你都得证明自己。而现在你正努力要当上大副。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28688
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1527dc49:

    # p "Five years. Five years of dedicating yourself to this, and now you're trying to become a Mate."
    p "五年。全心全意投入的五年，而现在你正努力要当上大副。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28692
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3e67a98e:

    # p "You fought against the odds, and because of your ambition, you came out ahead."
    p "你逆流而上，因为你的野心，你走到了前面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28701
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6800279d:

    # "Samuel pushes off the mast, meandering toward the edge of the deck."
    "塞缪尔离开桅杆，漫无目的地走向甲板边缘。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28703
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5b6575e0:

    # "[His] steps are slow, thoughtful."
    "他的步伐缓慢，若有所思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28705
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9db3dfef:

    # s "It's hardly a rank they hand out easily, and Arthur made that very clear to me."
    s "这可不是个轻易授予的职位，亚瑟跟我讲得很清楚了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28707
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5f397632:

    # "[He] exhales, almost a laugh, though there's no humor in it."
    "他呼出一口气，几乎像在笑，但毫无笑意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28711
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bbe99646:

    # s "If I don't go for it? Someone else will. You think you've done enough, and then-"
    s "如果我不去争取？别人就会。你以为自己做得够多了，然后——"

# game/script day12.rpy:28713
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8ca708c3:

    # s "Someone faster—smarter—will snatch it right from under me."
    s "更快、更聪明的人就会从我眼皮底下把它抢走。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28715
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_40ebd33f:

    # s "Then you become just another guy."
    s "然后你就变成了又一个普通人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28719
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3c4640f2:

    # p "And I don't want to be {i}just another guy{/i} that can be ditched at the next harbor."
    p "而我不想成为那个在下个港口就能被随便抛弃的“又一个普通人”。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28723
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2220144a:

    # p "Feeling disposable..."
    p "感觉自己可以被随意取代……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28725
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8be20585:

    # p "I still do... I don't know if I even fully trust this yet."
    p "我现在还是……我甚至不知道自己是否完全相信这一切。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28727
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c70e0f15:

    # p "He could just change his mind... again."
    p "他可能又会改变主意……再一次。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28731
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fa5744e7:

    # p "And I-... I don't want that."
    p "而我——……我不想要那样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28739
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_01406d96:

    # "You begin to follow [him] when [he] makes it about halfway, catching up and matching [his] slow steps."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28741
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c6b9fa96:

    # s "I understand..."
    s "我理解……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28743
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_de8b7317:

    # "Samuel stops at the gunwale, staring into the dark sea below."
    "塞缪尔在船舷边停下，凝视着下方黑暗的大海。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28745
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f3946211:

    # "[He] leans over enough that you reach out and hold [his] tail, just in case. You feel as it squirms in your grip, the soft fur of it enveloping most of your paw."
    "他俯身探出足够多，以至于你伸出手抓住了他的尾巴，以防万一。你感觉到它在你的抓握中扭动，柔软的皮毛包裹了你爪子的大部分。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28750
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c8f8a638:

    # "After a moment, [he] comes back up and faces you with a grin."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28752
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2a1a7ccf:

    # s "I'll allow it."
    s "我允许了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28754
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b8fa39f0:

    # p "Thank you, oh benevolent Samuel."
    p "谢谢你，哦，仁慈的塞缪尔。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28756
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f6c2f789:

    # s "Under one condition."
    s "有一个条件。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28758
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bdbd5257:

    # p "Hm?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28763
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8a630e64:

    # "[He] swats your hand away before [he] responds."
    "他回答前先拍开了你的手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28765
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c1557f5f:

    # s "Let go of my tail."
    s "放开我的尾巴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28767
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_57af0f1b:

    # s "I won't fall in."
    s "我不会掉下去的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28769
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a459eae5:

    # p "I saw that same line on one of the gravestones near the harbor."
    p "我在港口附近的一块墓碑上看到过同样的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28777
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3c9ede2b:

    # "You wind past [him] and peer over the gunwale yourself, watching the water churn in the ship's wake. "
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28782
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b83b957d:

    # "Just like the stars above, you wonder how many fathoms stretch below. Another world, just out of reach."
    "就像头顶的星空一样，你想知道下面延伸着多少英寻。另一个世界，遥不可及。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28792
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6b1cd92c:

    # j "DON'T FALL!"
    j "别掉下去！"

# game/script day12.rpy:28794
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_33940b99:

    # "Samuel jolts so violently Julian nearly ends up pitching [him] overboard, only stopped by the lizard still holding onto [him]."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28803
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9089d9f3:

    # "Once steady footing returns, Samuel wheels around and plants a backhanded slap across Julian's face."
    "刚一稳住脚步，塞缪尔就转过身，反手给了朱利安一记耳光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28808
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bb949a0d:

    # s "Motherfucker!"
    s "混蛋！"

# game/script day12.rpy:28810
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ca192ad1:

    # j "OW!"
    j "嗷！"

# game/script day12.rpy:28812
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_78e2aef5:

    # s "I will throw your ass next time!"
    s "下次我就把你扔下去！"

# game/script day12.rpy:28817
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3bc645a5:

    # "Julian grins, dancing back just in case."
    "朱利安咧嘴一笑，防备地向后退了几步。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28819
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c37126af:

    # j "Didn't think you'd startle that easy."
    j "没想到你这么容易受惊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28821
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f30e48d4:

    # s "I am not easy to-"
    s "我才不容易——"

# game/script day12.rpy:28825
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9fd48975:

    # "[He] stops and groans."
    "他停住，呻吟了一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28827
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7b2c612c:

    # s "... Now I'm squabbling with a child."
    s "……现在我在跟一个小孩子吵架。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28831
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f4207066:

    # p "You really shouldn't be doing this, Julian."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28835
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a22ed37a:

    # p "Whether it's gossiping or playing these jokes, it's easy to rub people the wrong way."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28837
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_31b90ce2:

    # p "I'm saying it as a friend."
    p "我是作为朋友才这么说的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28839
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_284c78d0:

    # "He sighs and tips his head to the side."
    "他叹了口气，把头歪向一边。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28845
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_463b8286:

    # j "Hey, rude."
    j "嘿，真没礼貌。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28849
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ae8ced30:

    # j "Alright, I won't do it again."
    j "好吧，我不会再这样了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28854
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1fce0502:

    # "He gingerly takes a step towards Samuel and extends a hand for a truce."
    "他小心翼翼地朝塞缪尔迈了一步，伸出手表示休战。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28858
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f6b9657b:

    # j "No more startling the maned wolf, and no more smacking the lizard."
    j "不再吓唬鬃狼，也不再打蜥蜴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28860
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_866d22a1:

    # j "Fair?"
    j "公平吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28862
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_12d3d3b2:

    # "You snort."
    "你哼了一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28864
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5e7eae7b:

    # p "That sounds like an uneven trade. Smacking you is a universal pleasure, while you have to work to-"
    p "听起来像是不平等的交易。打你是普天同庆的事，而你却需要努力才能——"

# game/script day12.rpy:28866
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c4feaab4:

    # j "Shh!"
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:28870
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_86b65a48:

    # s "I don't make promises like that, lizard. You started something and then immediately call for a truce the second you get smacked across the snout."
    s "我不做那种承诺，蜥蜴。是你先挑事的，然后刚挨了一巴掌就立刻喊休战。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28874
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d7b97893:

    # "Julian watches [him] for a moment, then, seeing no budge in Samuel's stance, sighs and lowers his outstretched hand."
    "朱利安看了他一会儿，见塞缪尔毫无让步之意，叹了口气，放下了伸出的手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28876
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d579cef6:

    # j "Well, I tried."
    j "好吧，我试过了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28882
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a37d1cb5:

    # "He pauses and shifts his attention to you."
    "他停顿了一下，把注意力转向你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28884
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_885f9149:

    # j "And how are your efforts going?"
    j "那你努力得怎么样了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28886
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3d48137a:

    # p "You don't know yet?"
    p "你还不知道？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28890
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fbb8ee21:

    # j "Know what?"
    j "知道什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28892
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0087d1e0:

    # p "Arthur told me I'm staying."
    p "亚瑟告诉我我可以留下了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28896
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cd3c0a66:

    # p "For now, at least."
    p "至少目前是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28898
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d117c039:

    # p "But with him? Who knows."
    p "但跟着他？谁知道呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28900
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ecba4dd6:

    # "You dip your head, falling quiet."
    "你低下头，沉默下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28902
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_958d5764:

    # "Slowly, the tension coiled inside you drips away, lost under the veil of the night sky. You'd found peace in the stillness of the night on land before, back home, among the fields in quiet midsummer..."
    "慢慢地，你心中紧绷的弦松开了，消融在夜空的帷幕下。你以前在家乡寂静的仲夏田野里，曾在夜晚的宁静中找到过平静……"

# game/script day12.rpy:28904
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_50e35be2:

    # "But this is different."
    "但这次不同。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28907
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_90f07e63:

    # "There's something about the sea that makes it feel like so much more. And-"
    "大海有种特质，让这一切感觉更加宏大。而且——"

# game/script day12.rpy:28915
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f7c8fde7:

    # "Samuel leans over and gives you a playful push. [He] must have felt the doubts bubbling up again."
    "塞缪尔俯身过来，开玩笑地推了你一下。他一定是感觉到你又开始怀疑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28917
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3b3f1266:

    # s "Chin up—he won't change his mind."
    s "打起精神——他不会改变主意的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28921
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7f121726:

    # "You hope not. With the stakes you've thrown in."
    "你希望如此。考虑到你已经押上的赌注。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28928
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_110d0652:

    # "Julian's head darts back and forth between you, but the maned wolf's muzzle is frozen there, [his] half-grin catching faintly in the ocean's bloom."
    "朱利安的头在你们俩之间来回转动，但鬃狼的嘴却僵在那里，他半带笑意的表情在海洋的微光中隐约可见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28930
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8af73264:

    # j "Are you serious?"
    j "你是认真的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28932
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d779e5da:

    # j "Really?!"
    j "真的？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:28936
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_19f1506e:

    # "His whole body tenses for a moment before he bursts into a chorus of half-flustered, half-excited sounds, his reptilian vocal cords fully testing their range."
    "他全身紧绷了一瞬，随即爆发出半是慌乱半是兴奋的声响，爬行动物的声带充分测试着它们的音域范围。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28940
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f1beb663:

    # j "And there I was biting my lip thinking I was about to say something dreadful!"
    j "我刚才还咬着嘴唇，以为我要说出什么可怕的话呢！"

# game/script day12.rpy:28944
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9a241062:

    # "He harrumphs, folding his arms, leaning forward and staring down into the sea."
    "他哼了一声，双臂交叉，身体前倾，凝视着下方的大海。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28946
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0c833d74:

    # j "When exactly were either of you going to tell me?"
    j "你们两个到底打算什么时候告诉我？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28953
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_243efd0b:

    # s "Don't be salty about it, he had a lot on his mind."
    s "别为此不高兴了，他当时心事重重。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28955
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f99c1b1d:

    # "He glances to you."
    "他瞥了你一眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28957
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c4008947:

    # s "When'd you learn?"
    s "你什么时候知道的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28963
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bf0d163b:

    # p "That's where I've just come from."
    p "我刚从那里过来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28967
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c477fec0:

    # p "Earlier today."
    p "今天早些时候。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28969
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f29bbea7:

    # p "I just... well, wasn't quite sure how to say-"
    p "我只是……嗯，不太确定该怎么开口——"

# game/script day12.rpy:28976
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7ea3b5cf:

    # "Julian tilts his head, brow ridge raising as he looks at you. Dumbfounded."
    "朱利安歪着头，眉骨抬起看着你。一脸茫然。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28978
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_14d7f1dd:

    # j "You don't know how to present good news?"
    j "你不知道怎么宣布好消息？"

# game/script day12.rpy:28982
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b4bd9692:

    # "He lets out a short, incredulous huff, arms still crossed."
    "他短促而不信地哼了一声，双臂依然交叉着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28984
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e47ac608:

    # "He seems skeptical at the implication that good news can be hard to announce, but in fairness you hadn't exactly considered how you were going to break it to them—if you even could, given it was Arthur's decision."
    "他似乎对“好消息可能难以宣布”这个暗示表示怀疑，但公平地说，你确实没仔细考虑过要怎么告诉他们——如果这件事由你决定的话，毕竟这是亚瑟的决定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28988
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8ce64173:

    # "Never mind what it had taken to secure it."
    "更别提为了确保这件事所付出的代价了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28990
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d404effc:

    # p "This ship's not all about me."
    p "这艘船不全是为了我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28994
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f8cc5e35:

    # "You shrug, trying to move the conversation away from yourself, and any potential question about the turn of events."
    "你耸耸肩，试图将话题从自己身上移开，避开任何关于事态转变的潜在问题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:28998
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a59503e2:

    # "You shrug, trying to move the conversation away from yourself."
    "你耸耸肩，试图将话题从自己身上移开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29002
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_085a1e8b:

    # "You bite your lip and take a sharp breath through your nose, praying that none of Arthur's scent lingers on you. That would be awkward to explain. On many levels."
    "你咬着嘴唇，用鼻子深吸一口气，祈祷亚瑟的气味没有残留在你身上。那解释起来会很尴尬。在多个层面上都是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29004
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_27a1a681:

    # "\"Oh yes, our discussions about my performance were very fruitful. I showed him that I am a truly worthwhile addition to the crew-\""
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29006
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d765c62f:

    # "\"And I even got to meet the monster he's packing.\""
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29008
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b1d05731:

    # "Though now that you've had a little distance from it, you find yourself wondering just how common an {i}arrangement{/i} like that is."
    "不过，现在你与那件事有了一些距离，你开始好奇那样的{i}安排{/i}究竟有多普遍。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29010
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3712608f:

    # "He-...{w} well, he did not exactly fight it."
    "他-……{w}嗯，他并没有真的反抗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29012
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_de5b11c2:

    # "Your gaze flickers to Samuel, and before you can stop them, thoughts begin to stir-"
    "你的目光扫向塞缪尔，还没等你阻止，思绪就开始翻腾——"

# game/script day12.rpy:29015
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a427bd0e:

    # "Oh God, stop!{w} Invasive thoughts are the last thing you need right now."
    "哦天哪，打住！{w}侵入性的想法现在是你最不需要的东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29018
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_71e6e015:

    # "Hopefully, they can't smell the lingering scent of alcohol on your breath, or at the very least, think that it isn't anything out of the ordinary."
    "希望他们闻不到你呼吸中残留的酒气，或者至少，认为这没什么不寻常的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29020
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ec42b171:

    # "You probably have better cause than most to get properly drunk tonight."
    "你今晚大概比大多数人更有理由好好醉一场。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29027
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4b4465fe:

    # "Samuel is the first to respond."
    "塞缪尔是第一个回应的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29029
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6a363cea:

    # s "Modest, but you figured we weren't curious?"
    s "谦虚是好事，但你以为我们不好奇吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29031
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e2496591:

    # "[He] flashes you a grin."
    "[他]对你咧嘴一笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29035
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bb327f44:

    # s "After all, we're getting close to port and all, and we were starting to get concerned-"
    s "毕竟，我们快到港口了，而且我们开始有点担心——"

# game/script day12.rpy:29037
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a09b1629:

    # j "Yeah! I'd say your news is far more important than whatever we were idling on about."
    j "是啊！要我说，你的消息可比我们刚才瞎聊的那些事重要多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29039
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_31204266:

    # "Julian nods in firm agreement, matching Samuel."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29041
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fc389cf0:

    # "You're taken aback by their sentiment."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29043
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_005f48c0:

    # "The weight of it all in recent days had made you feel that you were dealing with this all on your own."
    "最近所有这些事的重压让你觉得你是在独自面对这一切。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29045
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_58b7d829:

    # p "Yeah... that's kind, but-"
    p "是啊……这很贴心，但是——"

# game/script day12.rpy:29047
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a2dcc09f:

    # "You fumble, not wanting to get too sappy. Sailors have a reputation to uphold after all."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29049
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_00f90d9d:

    # p "It was just... awkward to say. And it doesn't change the fact that I still let you down."
    p "只是……说起来有点尴尬。而且这改变不了我依然让你们失望的事实。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29051
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_66f0dfa4:

    # "You glance at Samuel, catching [his] eye before turning toward Julian."
    "你瞥了塞缪尔一眼，与[他]目光相接，然后转向朱利安。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29055
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a178adfc:

    # "You hear Samuel's drawn-out exhales, shaking [his] head."
    "你听见塞缪尔长长的呼气声，[他]摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29057
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4ae6c1f7:

    # s "Nothing wrong with a bit of humility."
    s "有点谦卑没什么不好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29059
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8ab4afad:

    # "[His] tone feels softer now."
    "[他的]语气现在听起来柔和了些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29064
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0c85bd31:

    # s "But you didn't let us down. You made a mistake. We survived, didn't we?"
    s "但你没有让我们失望。你犯了个错。我们都活下来了，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29068
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_56c2117d:

    # s "I was annoyed in the moment, sure.{w} But shit on here goes wrong all the time."
    s "我当时是有点恼火，没错。{w}但这破地方总他妈出岔子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29073
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3d68f761:

    # s "If we'd get rid of everyone who makes a mistake then the {i}Conway{/i} would be a ghost ship within months. So it's hardly something worth seeing you gone over."
    s "要是我们把每个犯错的人都赶走，那{i}Conway{/i}不出几个月就会变成鬼船了。所以这根本不值得让你离开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29080
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0c9cde6d:

    # "[He] leans back against the gunwale, folding [his] arms."
    "[他]向后靠在船舷上，双臂交叉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29084
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fb55b990:

    # s "Besides, it's in the past. Quit gnawing on it."
    s "再说了，都过去了。别再耿耿于怀了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29086
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_381ce655:

    # "Julian nods."
    "朱利安点点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29090
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1ba753b3:

    # j "Yeah. I had never heard of someone being dismissed after they're found asleep on watch once. They wouldn't do that even on a navy ship."
    j "是啊。我从没听说过有人因为一次站岗时睡着就被开除。即使在海军舰艇上他们也不会那么做。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29092
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4ff92614:

    # j "But, seriously though."
    j "不过，说真的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29099
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3f21676c:

    # "He sighs, swallowing down whatever lighthearted remark was on the tip of his tongue."
    "他叹了口气，把到了嘴边的俏皮话咽了回去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29101
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1b0d9ee0:

    # j "Maybe it's the quiet of the night, I don't know."
    j "也许是夜晚的宁静吧，我不知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29107
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_59354734:

    # "He shifts his weight against the gunwale, adjusting himself, eyes tracking the water beneath the ship."
    "他靠在船舷上调整了一下重心，眼睛追随着船下的水流。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29109
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_18a086f2:

    # j "But I think you know—I {i}would{/i} have been sorry to see you go."
    j "但我想你知道——我{i}会{/i}为你的离开感到遗憾的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29120
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_eb2285f8:

    # "He pushes himself back up again, fidgeting with a crease on the arm of his jacket."
    "他又直起身，摆弄着夹克袖子上的一道褶皱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29122
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dd395eb2:

    # j "You've been a good friend, you know that?"
    j "你一直是个好朋友，你知道的，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29124
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3f852517:

    # "You tilt your head, caught off guard by the sudden earnestness in his voice."
    "你歪着头，被他声音里突如其来的认真打了个措手不及。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29126
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bc7f04aa:

    # "None of his usual cheek or bravado."
    "没有他平日的嬉皮笑脸或虚张声势。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29128
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ae3fb6fd:

    # "It's just Julian—uncharacteristically so."
    "这就是朱利安——一反常态的朱利安。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29130
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a413ac70:

    # p "What's wrong?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29132
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f6eb54ff:

    # j "Wrong?"
    j "不对吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29136
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f8569c14:

    # "He lets out a short breath."
    "他短促地呼出一口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29138
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4bbe67f6:

    # j "Nothin'."
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29140
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2edb059a:

    # "He grabs one of the lines running up the rigging and leans forward, his gaze dropping into the moving waves below once again."
    "他抓住一根通向索具的绳索，身体前倾，目光再次垂落到下方涌动的波浪中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29142
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_71c8810b:

    # j "Just thinking, I guess."
    j "只是在想事情，我猜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29147
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c45ec83d:

    # "Samuel leans closer to your ear, his voice barely above a whisper."
    "塞缪尔凑近你的耳朵，声音低得几乎像耳语。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29149
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c614ac85:

    # s "{alpha=0.5}Doesn't sound like nothin'.{/alpha}"
    s "{alpha=0.5}听起来可不像是‘没什么’。{/alpha}"

# game/script day12.rpy:29151
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_03e274e0:

    # p "{alpha=0.5}I gathered that much.{/alpha}"
    p "{alpha=0.5}我也听出来了。{/alpha}"

# game/script day12.rpy:29153
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1ce728a3:

    # j "The thought of losing a friend—a {i}good{/i} friend—was, well..."
    j "想到失去一个朋友——一个{i}好{/i}朋友——嗯，那是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:29155
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_954d824f:

    # "He's chewing on his thoughts."
    "他正在咀嚼着自己的思绪。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29157
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_77cb5852:

    # j "Sam?"
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29164
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ccc0161d:

    # "Samuel straightens up, ears flicking to attention."
    "塞缪尔挺直身子，耳朵警觉地动了动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29166
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2e524fe3:

    # j "What did you do before you joined the crew?"
    j "你加入船员之前是做什么的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29170
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dc1cd401:

    # s "Hm?"
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29174
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_85b48f11:

    # s "Uh, y'know. This 'n that."
    s "呃，你知道的。干过这个，干过那个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29176
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_63f2f25f:

    # s "Grew up with my folks and a few siblings. Helped in my pa's workshop when I could, and well. Eventually felt I was... I guess ready for something else."
    s "和父母还有几个兄弟姐妹一起长大。有空的时候就在我爸的作坊里帮忙，然后，嗯。最后觉得我……我猜是准备好干点别的了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29178
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_420472e0:

    # s "That 'something else' turned out to be this ship."
    s "那个‘别的’最后就是这艘船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29182
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2772e2e6:

    # s "Why?"
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29184
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4b3398f1:

    # j "Do you ever miss them?"
    j "你会想他们吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29186
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2a8f6814:

    # j "Your family and-"
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29190
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6933ccb0:

    # "Samuel waves the question off with a casual flick of [his] wrist."
    "塞缪尔随意地摆了摆[他的]手腕，示意这个问题无关紧要。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29192
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_33eaae2f:

    # s "'Course I do."
    s "当然想。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29194
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_110df509:

    # s "Sometimes."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29196
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4ba8e396:

    # s "Did we always get on? Not really—{w} hell, probably argued more than we talked."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29198
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_442ad5fe:

    # s "But that's how it is, right? Sometimes you clash."
    s "但事情就是这样，对吧？有时候就是会起冲突。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29200
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_133367f1:

    # s "They're still same blood, though. That ain't changing."
    s "但他们毕竟血脉相连。这点不会变。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29208
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_992a71f7:

    # j "Yeah... see, that's the thing. I guess I just...{w} don't."
    j "是啊……你看，问题就在这儿。我想我只是……{w}不想。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29210
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_548e7eaf:

    # "It's a struggle for him to say it."
    "对他来说，说出这话很艰难。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29212
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d4fa9918:

    # j "I don't miss them, not any of them. But... I don't enjoy my work on this ship either."
    j "我不想念他们，一个都不想。但是……我也不喜欢在这艘船上的工作。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29214
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_871402fd:

    # j "I knew I wouldn't from the start since I never cared for my father's stupid aspirations."
    j "我从一开始就知道我不会喜欢，因为我从来不在乎我父亲那些愚蠢的抱负。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29218
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6f6ac587:

    # j "How it would be a stain on the family legacy if I'd be anything less than a captain of my own ship someday."
    j "说什么如果我将来不能成为自己船的船长，就会是家族传承上的污点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29220
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fe917470:

    # j "How the Preble name will be listed among the other great names of the navy through me and my achievements. And how he'd make sure I would achieve it, come hell or high water."
    j "说什么普雷布尔这个名字将通过我和我的成就，被列入海军其他伟大人物的名单。还说什么他会确保我做到，无论付出什么代价。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29222
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_96ec123f:

    # j "Damn all of that..."
    j "去他妈的这一切……"

# game/script day12.rpy:29224
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_968c2c59:

    # j "I-... I just..."
    j "我-……我只是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:29226
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_55f2954e:

    # "Julian looks at Samuel for a long moment, like he's turning something over in his mind. His fingers grip the line tighter, hard enough to drain some of the color from his knuckles."
    "朱利安看了塞缪尔好一会儿，仿佛在脑海里反复思量着什么。他的手指更紧地抓住了绳索，用力到指关节都有些发白。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29228
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_27198cdc:

    # "You wait for him to continue.{w} He doesn't."
    "你等着他继续说下去。{w}他没有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29230
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0488e857:

    # "You open your mouth, trying to find the right thing to say—but you draw a complete blank."
    "你张开嘴，试图找到合适的话说——但脑子里一片空白。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29234
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8bcc59c6:

    # "Then, with a quiet exhale, Julian shakes his head. Dismissing whatever thought is threatening to loudly take root."
    "然后，随着一声轻轻的呼气，朱利安摇了摇头。驱散了那个几乎要大声扎根下来的念头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29236
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fc0a1e09:

    # j "Sorry, I feel I'm being so dramatic here."
    j "抱歉，我觉得我在这里太小题大做了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29238
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7c2dd3f5:

    # p "You're not, Julian."
    p "你没有，朱利安。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29240
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_805083c0:

    # "He eases up at even simple reassurances coming from you."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29242
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5785b1f5:

    # j "I guess what I'm trying to say is... I'm glad I found people like you on this ship."
    j "我想我要说的是……我很高兴能在这艘船上遇到像你们这样的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29246
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2d243980:

    # "He forces a smile which turns genuine once he must have realized he can allow himself to be."
    "他挤出一个微笑，但当他意识到自己可以允许自己这样时，那笑容变得真诚起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29248
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0e64f343:

    # j "{i}Especially{/i} you, [name]."
    j "{i}特别是{/i}你，[名字]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29250
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bcdbc6b7:

    # j "When I stepped on this ship, I thought..."
    j "当我踏上这艘船时，我以为……"

# game/script day12.rpy:29254
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_676f88fe:

    # j "Well, I thought my life was over, you know? I tried to play it cool, but I expected everyone to be like Wolf, or Arthur, or...{w} my father, really."
    j "嗯，我以为我的人生完蛋了，你知道吗？我试图表现得冷静，但我以为每个人都会像沃尔夫，或者亚瑟，或者……{w}说真的，像我父亲那样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29256
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9ad506fe:

    # j "Pricklier than hedgehogs, the lot of them."
    j "他们一伙人比刺猬还扎人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29258
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_226e5db9:

    # "He points at you and Samuel."
    "他指了指你和塞缪尔。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29262
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3cc60781:

    # j "Don't tell them I said that, though."
    j "不过，别告诉他们是我说的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29264
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_53976138:

    # "You shake your head."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29268
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1560e303:

    # p "We won't."
    p "我们不会的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29270
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_351a5532:

    # p "I'm glad I can be a good friend."
    p "我很高兴能成为一个好朋友。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29272
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c9fabaf7:

    # j "Mhm..."
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29274
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bf40eb67:

    # j "Good friend."
    j "好朋友。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29276
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6b469461:

    # "His fingers tap absently against the railing. Then he speaks abruptly."
    "他的手指心不在焉地轻敲着栏杆。然后他突然开口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29280
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_36b1ada2:

    # j "Actually, Sam. Could you do me a favor and leave us for a moment?"
    j "其实，萨姆。你能帮个忙，让我们单独待会儿吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29282
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6f828581:

    # s "What, having secrets now?"
    s "怎么，现在有秘密了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29284
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a7832171:

    # j "I just-"
    j "我只是——"

# game/script day12.rpy:29286
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8d5df9c1:

    # "He gestures vaguely between the two of you, not quite finding the words."
    "他含糊地在你们两人之间比划了一下，没找到合适的词。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29290
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cf5b2807:

    # s "Kiddin'. I'll give you some space."
    s "开玩笑的。我给你们点空间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29296
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_51f7e2f6:

    # "[He] grins but waves you off and wanders towards the bow of the ship."
    "[他]咧嘴一笑，但摆摆手让你离开，然后溜达着朝船头走去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29307
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5d4c712f:

    # p "What was that about?"
    p "那是什么意思？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29309
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_632f763a:

    # "He hushes you gently."
    "他轻轻地让你噤声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29311
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_94f254fc:

    # j "I've been trying to say this all day. After this morning... when I thought you might leave—the more time I had to think about it the more it shook me."
    j "我一整天都想说这个。今天早上之后……当我以为你可能会离开——我越想这件事，就越感到不安。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29313
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9ac6a8de:

    # j "Did what I always do... tried to just ignore it."
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29315
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_931eee8f:

    # j "I don't know, it just became clear to me, I guess."
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29317
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f05571b1:

    # "He rubs the back of his neck."
    "他揉了揉后颈。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29319
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a509c4f2:

    # j "When I say you're a good friend, I mean {i}really{/i} good. {w}Like {i}good{/i}-good."
    j "当我说你是个好朋友时，我是说{i}真的{/i}很好。{w}就像{i}好{/i}得不得了那种。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29323
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3d11b8b5:

    # "His face contorts into a grimace."
    "他的脸扭曲成一副苦相。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29325
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_61360cd3:

    # j "Sorry, I'm messing up. I'm not very good at this."
    j "抱歉，我说得乱七八糟。我不太擅长这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29327
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_de6acd46:

    # j "I just- I haven't had many of those. And when I did, it always ended in trouble."
    j "我只是——我并没有很多这样的朋友。即使有过，也总是以麻烦收场。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29329
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_db9ccd7a:

    # j "When I went out to play?{w} I'm {i}'Not showing the discipline required of someone of my station.'{/i}"
    j "{/i}"

# game/script day12.rpy:29333
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_60fe88f7:

    # j "If I was reading a book it wasn't the {i}'proper literature.'{/i}"
    j "{/i}"

# game/script day12.rpy:29335
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8f90ee05:

    # j "Music?{w} {i}'It's for the meek, lay aside these womanly pursuits and start behaving like a real man.'{/i}"
    j "{/i}"

# game/script day12.rpy:29337
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_483649b4:

    # "It hurts even just to hear it."
    "光是听着就让人难受。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29339
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_25c4950b:

    # p "Your old man sounds unbearable."
    p "你家老爷子听起来真让人受不了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29343
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8c218b65:

    # j "And you'd be correct."
    j "你说得一点没错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29345
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_952fb851:

    # j "It was always about what he expected of me, or what my 'station' expects of me. Whatever the hell my station is, when I'm out here scrubbing decks on this piece of crap."
    j "对我的期望。管他妈的我的身份是什么，反正我现在是在这艘破船上刷甲板。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29347
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8ca0e5f3:

    # j "But one thing it never was, was about what I wanted..."
    j "但从来就没有一件事，是关于我自己想要的……"

# game/script day12.rpy:29349
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e6e82795:

    # j "Even when I hid it wasn't right, and when they found me I got dragged back and-"
    j "即使我躲起来，那也是不对的，当他们找到我，我就被拖回去，然后——"

# game/script day12.rpy:29353
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9ee430b4:

    # "His voice fractures mid-sentence.{w} Another grimace.{w} Memories that clearly pain him even to this day."
    "他的声音在句子中间破碎了。{w}又是一副苦相。{w}显然是时至今日仍让他痛苦的回忆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29355
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_42d51484:

    # "You hesitate, unsure whether to reach for him here on the open deck. You hope your presence might be enough."
    "你犹豫了，不确定是否该在这开阔的甲板上伸手触碰他。你希望你的存在就足够了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29357
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_01d99bdd:

    # j "He didn't want me there. Didn't want me gone either..."
    j "他并不想我在那里。但也不想我离开……"

# game/script day12.rpy:29359
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_283c3654:

    # "You take a deep breath, holding it for a moment."
    "你深吸一口气，屏住片刻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29361
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f6245447:

    # "Julian's words tug at you."
    "朱利安的话触动了你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29363
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_af912974:

    # "At something deeper."
    "触动了更深层的东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29365
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_eeb5f2db:

    # "You struggle to place your feeling."
    "你努力想理清自己的感受。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29367
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_55739f57:

    # "It's a sense of..."
    "那是一种……"

# game/script day12.rpy:29369
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_19a21831:

    # "Selfishness?"
    "自私感？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29371
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ee7752dd:

    # "The fear that your friendship means more to him than..."
    "是害怕你的友谊对他而言意味着太多，超过了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:29373
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_77abd598:

    # "A frightening chill spreads through your chest"
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29375
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_97af9966:

    # "You're not sure if you've been the great friend he makes you out to be."
    "你不确定自己是否真是他所说的那种了不起的朋友。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29377
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7ebe31cc:

    # "You do know you're grateful for his friendship. And no doubt, you wouldn't have enjoyed your time on the ship nearly as much without his exuberance."
    "你确实知道你很感激他的友谊。而且毫无疑问，如果没有他的热情洋溢，你在船上的时光绝不会如此愉快。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29379
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ba1d39d4:

    # "Still."
    "但是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29381
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f9f3d293:

    # "Twelve days."
    "十二天。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29383
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3bfe55dd:

    # "That's all it's been. Can you really mean this much to him in twelve days?"
    "仅仅十二天而已。你真的能在十二天里对他如此重要吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29385
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ab66e17b:

    # "Or is it just his inexperience speaking?"
    "还是说这只是他缺乏经验的表现？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29387
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6377e305:

    # "He is younger than yourself after all..."
    "他毕竟比你年轻……"

# game/script day12.rpy:29389
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a0f6d9df:

    # "Do you really deserve to be the source of these emotions?"
    "你真的配成为这些情感的源头吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29393
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3c2aad8c:

    # "Is it even your place to question it?"
    "你甚至有权质疑这一点吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29395
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f112803f:

    # "You look out at the sea. The dark waves roll, their peaks catching just enough moonlight to glow with a faint blue shimmer."
    "你望向大海。黑色的波浪翻滚着，浪尖刚好捕捉到足够的月光，泛着微弱的蓝色幽光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29397
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7bb7ea87:

    # p "I'm sorry."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29401
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_337c7ca7:

    # j "Don't be."
    j "别这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29403
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2f5a6ada:

    # j "Not you."
    j "别是你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29405
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8ec88fb2:

    # j "You've made my stay on here bearable.{w} {i}Fun{/i} even."
    j "你让我在这里的时光变得可以忍受。{w}甚至{i}有趣{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29409
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9be71b45:

    # j "Don't you {i}ever{/i} pull something like today again. Got it?"
    j "你{i}绝对{/i}不要再像今天这样乱来了。明白吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29413
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_044b5a75:

    # "You feel a rush of anxiety at his words, that feeling in the moment where your parents caught you doing something you weren't supposed to do."
    "他的话让你感到一阵焦虑，那种父母抓到你做不该做的事时的感觉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29415
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3382a2e7:

    # "He is talking about your mistake earlier in the day."
    "他指的是你今天早些时候犯的错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29417
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f5d5dc84:

    # "But it doesn't feel like it."
    "但感觉又不像仅仅在说那个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29419
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cd75599e:

    # "You struggle to find the right words as you work to bury the feeling."
    "你一边努力压下那种感觉，一边挣扎着寻找合适的词语。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29421
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_01fc34b8:

    # p "You sound so sincere."
    p "你听起来好真诚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29425
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_adb99ea4:

    # p "You know, Julian... I don't think I've ever heard you sound like this before."
    p "你知道吗，朱利安……我觉得我从没听你这样说过话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29427
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_164b1701:

    # p "Heard you sound so sincere."
    p "从没听你如此真诚过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29431
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ace802c0:

    # j "Because I am, you idiot!"
    j "因为我就是认真的，你这个白痴！"

# game/script day12.rpy:29433
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dfddbd48:

    # "Julian winds up like he's about to shove you, but then stops himself."
    "朱利安作势要推你，但又停住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29437
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_81c46502:

    # j "I'll have you know that—despite my vast and undeniably impressive repertoire of jokes—I do know when to refrain."
    j "我要让你知道——尽管我拥有庞大且无疑令人印象深刻的笑话储备——但我确实知道什么时候该克制。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29441
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_29a1abf0:

    # p "I believe you."
    p "我相信你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29445
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_15b21f9d:

    # "You have a subtle smile tugging at the corners of your mouth."
    "你的嘴角勾起一丝若有若无的微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29447
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7c639c4f:

    # p "Doubtful."
    p "我才不信。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29451
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c0301eb9:

    # j "You-!"
    j "你——！"

# game/script day12.rpy:29453
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9b22eb4f:

    # "You see his hand trembling, fighting the urge to push you."
    "你看到他的手在颤抖，强忍着推你的冲动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29455
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2badbeaa:

    # "Push you overboard, maybe."
    "也许是想把你推下船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29457
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_89e47f49:

    # "To finish what Arthur couldn't."
    "去完成亚瑟没能做到的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29459
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_66f9dadf:

    # "Before he can decide, you reach out, fingers curling gently around his wrist. His scales are cool against your palm."
    "在他做出决定之前，你伸出手，手指轻轻环住他的手腕。他鳞片的触感在你掌心微凉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29461
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fcc5854d:

    # "You mean to lower his hand to defuse the moment, but he doesn't let you."
    "你本想放下他的手来缓和气氛，但他没让你这么做。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29463
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ebbf9806:

    # "Instead, he pulls you in."
    "相反，他把你拉了过去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29473
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7cd26fa8:

    # "His arms wrap around you, his palms pressing firmly against your shoulder blades. You jolt a bit at the sudden, unexpected closeness."
    "他的手臂环住你，手掌稳稳地按在你的肩胛骨上。这突如其来的亲密接触让你微微一惊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29475
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_329d998b:

    # "Tension still keeping hold over you."
    "紧张感依然攫住你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29477
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d144ad17:

    # p "What if someone sees us?"
    p "要是有人看见我们怎么办？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29481
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3ef9d5d2:

    # j "Let them."
    j "让他们看好了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29483
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f39ff37b:

    # j "At least we'd be thrown off the ship together if they don't like it."
    j "至少如果他们不喜欢，我们可以一起被扔下船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29485
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_840fffcf:

    # "Slowly, you allow yourself to breathe—to lean into it. You give him a dainty, awkward pat on the back."
    "慢慢地，你让自己放松下来——靠向他。你笨拙而轻柔地拍了拍他的背。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29487
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0ffd7a1f:

    # p "I could do without that part, you know."
    p "你知道，没有那部分也行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29491
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_85f23662:

    # j "I know."
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29493
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_080f23a3:

    # j "They won't."
    j "他们不会的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29495
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_66c66a33:

    # j "Might make fun of us, though."
    j "不过可能会取笑我们。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29497
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6a8a8e18:

    # p "Julian..."
    p "Julian……"

# game/script day12.rpy:29499
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7d993a34:

    # j "It's a risk I'm willing to take."
    j "这是我愿意承担的风险。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29501
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c8ea8a4a:

    # p "..."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29505
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_84874861:

    # "His grip tightens slightly, drawing a little of your warmth with it."
    "他的拥抱稍微收紧了些，仿佛汲取了你的一点温暖。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29507
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9a6fb353:

    # j "Thank you."
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29509
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4e833c7f:

    # "You swallow, unsure what to do with yourself. He's holding you so tight, your arms are pinned awkwardly against your chest and making it difficult to return the gesture."
    "你咽了口唾沫，不知如何是好。他抱得太紧，你的手臂尴尬地被压在胸前，难以做出回应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29511
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_688d8275:

    # "But his hands feel... nice."
    "但是他的手感觉……很舒服。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29513
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b9fd5675:

    # p "For what?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29515
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a213c912:

    # "Julian exhales, his voice softer now."
    "朱利安呼出一口气，声音现在柔和了许多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29517
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_53b1c49a:

    # j "For being you."
    j "谢谢你做你自己。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29519
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5a6831df:

    # j "For being one of the rare bright spots on this damn ship."
    j "谢谢你成为这艘该死的船上为数不多的亮点之一。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29521
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7b2ec9ea:

    # "There it is again, the praise you're unsure you deserve. Especially after today."
    "又来了，这种你不确定自己是否配得上的赞美。尤其是在今天之后。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29523
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1b8b34a2:

    # p "I don't think I-"
    p "我觉得我不——"

# game/script day12.rpy:29525
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9f57755b:

    # s "Julian! [name]!" with hpunch
    s "朱利安！[姓名]！" with hpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:29531
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b2f093d2:

    # "You flinch at Sam's voice, hurried footsteps closing in."
    "萨姆的声音让你吓了一跳，急促的脚步声正在逼近。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29536
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_51fe9d70:

    # "The two of you break apart instantly, even giving each other a little shove to sell the casual act."
    "你们俩立刻分开，甚至还互相轻轻推了一下，以显得若无其事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29538
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e6f16f2c:

    # "You stumble, tugging your shirt into place just as Samuel rounds the mast."
    "你踉跄了一下，正好在塞缪尔绕过桅杆时，把衬衫拉回原位。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29543
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_73831b0b:

    # "[He] skids to a stop, more animated than usual—in stark contrast to you two trying your best to look composed."
    "[他] 一个急刹停下，比平时更加激动——与你们俩竭力保持镇定的样子形成鲜明对比。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29545
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c1778555:

    # s "Are you seeing it?!"
    s "你们看到了吗？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:29547
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7bc7a252:

    # p "What?... Seeing what?"
    p "什么？……看到什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29549
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5d5d5da5:

    # j "Did the ship catch fire? What happened?"
    j "船着火了吗？发生什么事了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29551
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b7f31505:

    # "No, it isn't fear in Samuel's voice."
    "不，塞缪尔的声音里没有恐惧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29553
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_772251fb:

    # "You doubt it's a fire."
    "你怀疑不是火灾。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29555
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1de0d676:

    # "Instead the tone of [his] voice is... excitement. Like someone who just cleaned up the table at dice."
    "相反，[他] 的语调是……兴奋。就像一个刚在骰子桌上大获全胜的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29557
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7cc378c3:

    # s "What the hell were you doing that you haven't noticed?"
    s "你们刚才到底在干什么，居然没注意到？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29559
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_55510506:

    # s "Look at the sea behind you!"
    s "看你们身后的海！"

# game/script day12.rpy:29564
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7a55d1a7:

    # "Julian turns first, while you are still trying to figure out if Sam's being genuine or playing you for a fool."
    "朱利安先转过身，而你还在琢磨萨姆是认真的还是在耍你们。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29566
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a61b4398:

    # "Then you notice it."
    "然后你也注意到了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29568
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a8fd8af5:

    # "A strange blue glow behind him."
    "他身后那片奇异的蓝色光芒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29570
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_035778de:

    # "Framing Samuel in shimmering turquoise, casting soft reflections across [his] cheeks and muzzle."
    "塞缪尔笼罩在闪烁的青绿色光芒中，柔和的光影映照在[他]的脸颊和口鼻上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29582
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ae01ae3c:

    # "You whip your head around, rushing to the gunwale beside Julian."
    "你猛地转过头，冲到朱利安旁边的船舷边。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29584
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_29801378:

    # "And there it is—spreading out across the sea. The vast ocean, covered in an otherworldly glow just beneath the waves."
    "就在那里——光芒在海面上蔓延开来。浩瀚的海洋，波浪之下覆盖着一层超凡脱俗的辉光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29586
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e0f71669:

    # "Sam joins you, moving with the ease of a cat. [He] swings up onto the gunwale before grabbing the shrouds, climbing just high enough to perch above the rail to watch the sea below with the awe of someone admiring the sunset."
    "萨姆也凑了过来，动作轻巧得像只猫。[他] 一跃上了船舷，抓住侧支索，爬到刚好能俯视栏杆下方的高度，像欣赏日落般满怀敬畏地注视着下方的海面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29588
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0272240e:

    # "You lose yourself for a couple of moments trying to wrap your head around what you're seeing."
    "有那么一会儿，你迷失了，试图理解眼前所见的一切。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29590
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_26de1819:

    # "You follow the bow wave, brightly illuminated as if it's whipped into a burning frenzy."
    "你顺着船首浪看去，它被照得通亮，仿佛被鞭打成了燃烧的狂澜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29592
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_13546ea2:

    # "It looks like the crest of a snow-capped mountain range, just beneath the ship"
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29594
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_923f24d1:

    # "Your fur bristles. A thread of unease tugs at your gut."
    "你的毛发竖了起来。一丝不安拉扯着你的内脏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29596
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d1c62893:

    # "You glance up, searching the sky for some trick of light.{w} A reflection.{w} Stars, maybe?"
    "你抬头望去，在天空中寻找某种光的把戏。{w} 倒影？{w} 也许是星星？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29598
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bcf6dd4d:

    # "No."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29600
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_549b2254:

    # "It's no reflection, that much is certain."
    "那不是倒影，这一点可以肯定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29602
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_37a54a18:

    # s "How's that for a show, like?"
    s "这场表演怎么样，嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29604
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_72392cd1:

    # j "What in the world..."
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29606
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_58049261:

    # j "Will someone please tell me what is going on?"
    j "有没有人能告诉我到底发生了什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29608
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f36a8034:

    # "You hear Julian gasp, finally managing to swallow again."
    "你听见朱利安倒吸一口气，终于又能咽下口水了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29610
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5f7a711d:

    # "It's as if some energy in the agitated waves ssparked the lights and set them aflame."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29612
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f269c626:

    # "Fire and ships, a combination that does not go well together. But this isn't fire, not like any you've seen before."
    "火和船，这个组合可不太妙。但这又不是火，至少不是你以前见过的任何一种火。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29616
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_641671a6:

    # "What it is, however..."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29618
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_92fc662b:

    # "...is breathtakingly beautiful."
    "……却美得令人窒息。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29620
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cedee539:

    # "The light grows stronger, deep and luminous, and when you follow a particular spot you see how it fades again in the ship's wake, dimming slowly behind you like a lantern drifting into fog."
    "光芒越来越强，深邃而明亮，当你盯住某个特定的光点时，会看到它又在船尾的航迹中逐渐黯淡，像一盏飘入雾中的灯笼，在你身后缓缓熄灭。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29631
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3cb0184d:

    # "You glance at Samuel. There's a small, knowing smile on [his] lips."
    "你瞥了一眼塞缪尔。[他] 的嘴角挂着一丝了然的微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29633
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f1498bb5:

    # s "That, my dear Julian, is the {i}burning of the sea.{/i}"
    s "那个，我亲爱的朱利安，就是所谓的{i}海之燃烧{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29635
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_22206093:

    # "[He] says it with flair, arms sweeping wide for emphasis."
    "[他] 说得很有派头，双臂夸张地张开以示强调。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29642
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c7777b24:

    # j "{i}Burning{/i} of the sea?! I'd prefer to stay raw, Sam."
    j "{i}海之燃烧{/i}？！我宁愿保持原样（不被“烧熟”），萨姆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29644
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5adbf20e:

    # "You catch the tremble in Julian's voice as he clutches the sheet more tightly."
    "你听出朱利安声音里的颤抖，他更紧地抓住了帆索。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29646
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ccf555e5:

    # j "What do we do?"
    j "我们该怎么办？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29653
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_96cea89c:

    # s "Fuck me, look at this... It—it's been three—no, four years since I last saw it."
    s "天啊，看看这个……我上次见到它已经是三——不，四年了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29655
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f961c2f4:

    # "[His] voice drops to a softer register. {w}Reverence?"
    "[他] 的声音放得更轻了。{w} 是敬畏吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29657
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_501b58a6:

    # s "Ain't it stunning?"
    s "是不是很震撼？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29659
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_16739a84:

    # p "Stunning?{w} Sam—What is it?! Are we {i}safe?{/i}"
    p "震撼？{w} 萨姆——那到底是什么？！我们{i}安全吗？{/i}"

# game/script day12.rpy:29661
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8cdd7ca0:

    # "You feel a flicker of panic clawing up your chest."
    "你感到一阵恐慌正爬上胸膛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29663
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2c0d8e37:

    # p "Fire and ships usually don't mix! Should we get the buckets?!"
    p "火和船通常水火不容！我们要去拿水桶吗？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:29665
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fa56d8d8:

    # "But Samuel doesn't answer."
    "但塞缪尔没有回答。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29667
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b603f82a:

    # j "Sam?!"
    j "萨姆？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:29669
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a0e4ebb6:

    # "Samuel waves a hand dismissively."
    "塞缪尔不以为然地挥了挥手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29673
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e1c85e9d:

    # s "Relax. Don't piss yourselves. We're not in danger."
    s "放松。别吓尿裤子。我们没有危险。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29675
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0a423c56:

    # s "It isn't actual fire—that's just its name."
    s "那不是真的火——只是它的名字而已。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29677
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_39fdc2b3:

    # s "Last time, we sailed right through.{w} Nothing happened to us. Apart from the hell of a view we got to witness."
    s "上次，我们径直穿过去了。{w} 我们什么事也没有。除了有幸目睹了那地狱般壮丽的景色。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29681
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3095a5ef:

    # "[He] idly kicks a leg against the rigging, looking down at you both."
    "[他] 随意地用一条腿踢了踢索具，低头看着你们俩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29685
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e50550df:

    # s "And hey, look at me—still standin', eh? Raw.{w} Uncooked.{w} Absolutely unpalatable."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29687
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_75a447ab:

    # "You exhale, [his] calm demeanor steadying your nerves more than you expected."
    "你呼出一口气，[他] 平静的态度比你预想的更能稳住你的心神。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29693
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ad6946dc:

    # s "For what it's worth, I checked with Arthur and our prior captain. Neither ever heard or saw it cause any harm."
    s "不管怎样，我问过亚瑟和我们之前的船长。他们都没听说或见过它造成任何伤害。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29695
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c6c427c9:

    # s "What it is? Well, that's a grand question, isn't it?"
    s "它是什么？嗯，这可是个大问题，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29697
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4ca97781:

    # s "They didn't have an answer. Maybe no one does."
    s "他们也没有答案。也许没人有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29704
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5304f217:

    # "Julian swallows hard and turns to you."
    "朱利安艰难地咽了口唾沫，转向你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29706
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2523aa99:

    # j "What do you think it is?"
    j "你觉得它是什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29708
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6400c4ce:

    # p "You expect me to know?"
    p "你指望我知道？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29710
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_586c893d:

    # p "I've got just as much clue as you..."
    p "我跟你一样毫无头绪……"

# game/script day12.rpy:29712
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a8c0b7fc:

    # p "Magic?{w} Maybe?"
    p "魔法？{w} 也许？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29716
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_89867a78:

    # "Samuel grins, a bit of mischief creeping back into [his] voice."
    "塞缪尔咧嘴笑了，一丝顽皮又悄悄溜回[他]的声音里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29720
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a3377081:

    # s "Maybe."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29722
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1bd24b78:

    # s "Or maybe Davy Jones left his locker open, and now the sea's spilling out all those we lost to her."
    s "或者也许是戴维·琼斯忘了锁上他的柜子，现在大海正把她吞噬的那些人全都吐出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29724
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_413a697c:

    # s "Who's to say?"
    s "谁说得准呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29744
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_63038ce6:

    # s "But if you ask me? Beauty like this? That's beyond men. Even among the gods."
    s "但如果你问我？这样的美？那超越了人类。即使在众神之中也是如此。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29746
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_34c98439:

    # s "Only a woman's touch could create something like this. My bet is on Mother Nature herself."
    s "只有女性的巧手才能创造出这样的东西。我赌是自然母亲本人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29748
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_968f944d:

    # "Others of the crew begin to notice the glow, and soon, rugged hands join yours on the gunwale. One by one, the sailors gather to watch the spectacle just as you are."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29750
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c4fc5245:

    # "A quiet awe settles over the deck."
    "一种寂静的敬畏笼罩了甲板。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29752
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_228476a7:

    # j "Mother Nature, huh?"
    j "自然母亲，嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29754
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_54f3eb6c:

    # p "You don't think so?"
    p "你不这么认为？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29756
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4a5177a3:

    # j "I do, I do."
    j "不，我信，我信。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29758
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e44a5957:

    # j "I just never realized she'd be quite so beau-"
    j "我只是从没意识到她会如此美——"

# game/script day12.rpy:29760
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_78edab2e:

    # "His voice breaks. He sniffs, quick and quiet."
    "他的声音哽住了。他快速而轻微地吸了吸鼻子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29762
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_42ec7294:

    # p "Julian? Are you-"
    p "朱利安？你——"

# game/script day12.rpy:29764
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_77bc6cca:

    # "No reply."
    "没有回应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29766
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f76cb1e0:

    # "You lay your palm gently on his back."
    "你轻轻把手掌放在他的背上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29768
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ced26a79:

    # j "I don't know what's coming over me. I'm sorry."
    j "我不知道我是怎么了。对不起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29770
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_12fa6abf:

    # "He swipes at his eyes with the back of his wrist."
    "他用腕背擦了擦眼睛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29772
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ad0517d1:

    # "Clearly fighting tears."
    "显然在强忍着泪水。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29774
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2a6f85fd:

    # "You hesitate, then give his shoulder a soft squeeze."
    "你犹豫了一下，然后轻轻捏了捏他的肩膀。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29776
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2e55e5a2:

    # p "Don't be."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29778
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bb0fc6b2:

    # "Some of the sailors, more intrigued than startled, begin climbing into the shrouds to seek a better vantage point."
    "一些水手，与其说是受惊不如说是好奇，开始爬上侧支索，想找个更好的 vantage point（有利位置）。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29780
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_100dc9be:

    # "Julian climbs up too, cautious at first, but his eyes gleam in the sea's glow—curiosity winning out over fear."
    "朱利安也爬了上去，起初小心翼翼，但他的眼睛在海光的映照下闪闪发亮——好奇心战胜了恐惧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29782
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_eb73e6ee:

    # "Others cling to the rigging as the ship heels leeward. Silhouetted against the high moon, their figures are rimmed in silver and faint green—where the moonlight kisses the clouds."
    "当船向背风侧倾斜时，其他人紧抓着索具。在高悬的月亮映衬下，他们的轮廓镶着银边和淡淡的绿色——那是月光轻吻云层的地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29784
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c5af2e46:

    # s "It's awesome, isn't it?"
    s "很壮观，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29786
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_472d4b3c:

    # "By now the spectacle is in full force. The ship, adrift in an ocean of light, surrounded on all sides."
    "此刻，奇景正全力上演。船漂流在光的海洋中，四面八方都被光芒包围。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29788
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_993c3e2c:

    # s "My memory didn't do it justice."
    s "我的记忆没能完全呈现它的美。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29790
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7d2c076a:

    # j "It is..."
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29792
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_34e59c5b:

    # j "It's like a... a symphony. A symphony played in light. The way it flows with the motion of the ship and draws instruments in and letting them go."
    j "它就像……一曲交响乐。一首用光演奏的交响乐。它随着船的运动流淌，将乐器引入又让它们离去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29794
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a1d51938:

    # j "The wide, slow swaths of sea—like a cello, mournful tones of the musician come to life."
    j "那广阔、缓慢的海域——像一把大提琴，音乐家那哀伤的音调仿佛活了过来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29796
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2740d7c2:

    # "The ship settles between the waves, its weight throwing up sprays of water that catch the light. Droplets of water sparkling like diamonds before they vanish again."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29798
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_46045ed2:

    # j "The flash of percussion in the spray, and the violin in the bow wave."
    j "水花中是打击乐的闪光，船首浪里是小提琴的旋律。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29800
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_88c1162d:

    # j "Bright, played full of energy with a soulful tremble."
    j "明亮，充满活力地演奏着，带着深情的颤音。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29802
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_57e4769b:

    # "You try to follow his imagination as he guides it with a sweep of his hands."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29804
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6d9b7a3d:

    # "It's not easy, but slowly, the image begins to build in your mind. You start to feel a subtle rhythm beneath the movement."
    "这并不容易，但慢慢地，画面开始在你的脑海中构建。你开始感觉到运动之下一种微妙的节奏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29806
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f03c3fc0:

    # "...Or maybe you're just imagining it."
    "……或者也许你只是在想象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29808
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_648864c1:

    # p "That's... beautiful, Julian."
    p "那……真美，朱利安。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29816
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4e50068b:

    # p "What part would you be playing?"
    p "你会演奏哪一部分？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29818
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8e526e8e:

    # "He goes quiet. In the soft blue glow you can see his head droop."
    "他沉默了。在柔和的蓝色光芒中，你能看到他的头垂了下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29820
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3b258699:

    # j "Me? Playing?"
    j "我？演奏？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29822
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2854dc3e:

    # j "Nothing."
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29824
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ee3c438d:

    # j "I'd ruin this one-"
    j "我会毁了这首——"

# game/script day12.rpy:29826
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c72487ae:

    # p "You wouldn't."
    p "你不会的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29828
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c27897ee:

    # j "I would."
    j "我会的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29830
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_449e0838:

    # "The melancholy in his expression fades, replaced by something warmer."
    "他表情中的忧郁褪去，被某种更温暖的东西取代。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29832
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f504889d:

    # j "But... thank you."
    j "但是……谢谢你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29834
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f5dac439:

    # j "I think right now, more than playing my part in some orchestra, I'm just looking forward to the day we dock in Morocco."
    j "我想，比起在某个乐团里演奏我的部分，我现在更期待的是我们抵达摩洛哥的那一天。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29836
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_43cc34db:

    # p "Really?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29838
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_080b9d73:

    # j "Really."
    j "真的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29840
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ee25147d:

    # j "Because, you'll be there."
    j "因为，你会在那里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29844
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a185d43b:

    # p "Did you ever read anything about this?"
    p "你读过关于这个的任何东西吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29846
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9fdc3089:

    # p "Why it's glowing, I mean."
    p "我是说，它为什么会发光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29848
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_aeca2ff7:

    # "He shakes his head."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29850
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_088a1987:

    # j "Never."
    j "从来没有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29852
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bf0e807e:

    # j "Come on, you don't take me to be someone hunched over my table at night, perusing scientific tomes by candlelight, do you?"
    j "得了吧，你不会把我当成那种晚上蜷缩在桌前、借着烛光研读科学巨著的人吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29854
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dda374d9:

    # j "You know ol' Julian better than that."
    j "你更了解老朱利安，不会这么想的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29856
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5d92e505:

    # j "No, I want a bit more drama."
    j "不，我想要多一点戏剧性。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29858
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2a21dd3e:

    # j "Frances Burney, now she's got a wonderful instinct with a pen."
    j "弗朗西斯·伯尼，她的笔触有着绝妙的本能。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29860
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_51c4ac16:

    # j "But none of them ever write about something like this.{w} Maybe they should."
    j "但他们谁都没写过这样的东西。{w} 也许他们应该写。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29862
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_469cd171:

    # "Maybe."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29864
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_45277747:

    # p "A drama about a cat and a lizard drifting out at sea."
    p "一出关于一只猫和一只蜥蜴在海上漂流的戏剧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29866
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9f7d508b:

    # "You see a warm smile spread across his features."
    "你看到他脸上绽开一个温暖的微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29868
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ce086207:

    # j "Witnessing magic like nothing else and realizing that perhaps things are not so bad because at least they've got a friend to share the world with."
    j "见证着无与伦比的魔法，意识到也许事情并没有那么糟，因为至少他们有一个朋友可以分享这个世界。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29870
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1c77cd81:

    # j "And perhaps something to wet our chops come Mogador?"
    j "也许到了摩加多尔，我们还能有点东西润润嗓子？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29874
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_29f6611d:

    # p "Hopefully Mogador will come close to it."
    p "希望摩加多尔能符合期望。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29876
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ca774585:

    # p "What do you think, are you going to explore much of it?"
    p "你觉得呢，你会好好探索一番吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29878
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d56df0e8:

    # "He doesn't even need a second to think about it and his answer comes quickly."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29880
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5f925933:

    # j "Of course!"
    j "当然！"

# game/script day12.rpy:29882
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_818b8e08:

    # j "Unless they chain me to this thing, that is."
    j "除非他们把我拴在这玩意儿上，那就另当别论了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29884
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7dd78b92:

    # j "But we're in a foreign harbor with some exotic town I've never seen before right at my fingertips?"
    j "但我们身处一个外国港口，眼前就是一个我从未见过的异域小镇？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29886
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_337b2fd9:

    # j "Of course I'll make sure to spend any moment of my free time in it."
    j "我当然会确保把每一刻空闲时间都花在里面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29888
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_97d12262:

    # j "And you know what makes the whole thing even better?"
    j "你知道让这一切更棒的是什么吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29890
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b6941d01:

    # "You turn to him to wait for the answer, but he doesn't come forth."
    "你转向他，等待答案，但他没有立刻说出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29892
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0f79024c:

    # j "Guess."
    j "猜猜看。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29894
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_162a901b:

    # p "Uh... because the weather will be sunny and warm?"
    p "呃……因为天气会晴朗温暖？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29896
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_76d2a9e0:

    # j "What? No.{w} Because you'll be there."
    j "什么？不是。{w} 因为你会在那儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29898
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cd4ab7a6:

    # j "What do you say? Hit the pub first?"
    j "你说呢？先去酒馆？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29900
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7ef9cdb5:

    # j "Or whatever they call their public houses over there."
    j "或者管他们那边叫公共酒馆什么的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29904
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2e090555:

    # j "You owe me a drink anyway, so I don't know if you have a choice in the matter."
    j "反正你欠我一杯酒，所以我不知道在这件事上你还有没有选择权。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29906
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f6af1497:

    # j "Don't think I've forgotten just because it's been a few days."
    j "别以为过了几天我就忘了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29908
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fc8300e7:

    # j "A lizard never forgets."
    j "蜥蜴从不健忘。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29910
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c34adb5c:

    # "You hadn't either."
    "你也没忘。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29912
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f3fc3124:

    # p "I think that was elephants, Jules."
    p "我想那是大象吧，朱尔斯。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29914
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e2067866:

    # j "So? They have hardly hogged all the good memory for themselves, have they?"
    j "那又怎样？它们总不至于把所有的好记性都占为己有了吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29916
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_20ba7377:

    # p "If you say so."
    p "随你怎么说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29918
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_480ff844:

    # s "Bathhouse is where I'll be heading."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29920
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b64ab2d8:

    # "You glance over to see Samuel leaning toward you."
    "你瞥了一眼，看到塞缪尔朝你倾过身来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29922
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_21039315:

    # s "Can never skip on it. A proper soak."
    s "绝不能错过。好好泡个澡。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29924
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_292ba3fd:

    # s "To actually feel clean again."
    s "真正重新感受干净的感觉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29926
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_03006b6c:

    # "[He] sighs."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29928
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_94bdaa0c:

    # j "Sam, I've got priorities. And on top of that list of priorities is to experience as little of my time on the ship sober as physically possible."
    j "山姆，我有我的优先事项。而那张优先事项清单的榜首，就是尽可能少地在清醒状态下度过我在船上的时间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29930
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d19422e3:

    # s "I ain't stopping you."
    s "我没拦着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29932
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9163dccd:

    # j "Bath comes later. Preferably in the company of one of the local girls."
    j "洗澡晚点再说。最好是找个当地姑娘作伴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29934
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_74086f4d:

    # "And just like that, the Julian you've gotten to know is back."
    "就这样，你认识的那个朱利安又回来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29936
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3c101452:

    # j "Now {i}that{/i}... That would be exactly what I need."
    j "那个嘛……那正是我需要的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29938
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_790cd643:

    # "Samuel arches a brow."
    "塞缪尔挑起一边眉毛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29940
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_35bbb4ab:

    # s "What if it's just guys around?"
    s "如果周围只有男人呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29942
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_66808a88:

    # "Julian shrugs."
    "朱利安耸耸肩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29944
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_69449286:

    # j "If he's cute? Why not?"
    j "如果他长得可爱？有何不可？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29946
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4838f40e:

    # "...Why is he looking at you like that?"
    "……他为什么那样看着你？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29948
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_09320980:

    # s "Really?{w} Huh."
    s "真的吗？{w} 哼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29950
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b2f28e92:

    # "On second thought, you can guess why."
    "再一想，你能猜到原因。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29952
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a4c955e3:

    # "Once again the conflicting thoughts come bubbling to the surface."
    "矛盾的想法再次涌上心头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29954
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1d521221:

    # "It becomes hard for you to look at him and you turn to look out at sea again."
    "你变得难以直视他，于是又转头望向大海。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29956
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c44a3eef:

    # "They should hate you."
    "他们应该恨你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29960
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a82f0e7e:

    # "You had risked their lives, used them and yet... Here they were, laughing under a sky of scattered stars."
    "你曾让他们冒生命危险，利用了他们，然而……他们就在这里，在繁星点点的天空下欢笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29964
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cd0e0c90:

    # "You had risked their lives. Yet here they were, laughing under a sky of scattered stars."
    "你曾让他们冒生命危险。然而他们就在这里，在繁星点点的天空下欢笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29966
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7ad4cbe3:

    # "Have they really forgiven you this easily?"
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29968
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_46c1c971:

    # "Did the past 12 days really mean as much as he said they did?"
    "过去的十二天真的像他说的那么重要吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:29970
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d529f4f3:

    # "You curse your damn head."
    "你咒骂着自己该死的脑袋。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29972
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_022596f4:

    # "They show no sign of resentment, but the thoughts keep creeping in."
    "他们没有表现出怨恨的迹象，但这些念头却不断潜入。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29974
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1f52c58d:

    # "Trying to convince you that they should."
    "试图说服你，他们应该恨你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29976
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c9168db0:

    # j "What about you?"
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:29978
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b0545fd7:

    # "In your absent-mindedness you don't realize that he is asking you."
    "你心不在焉，没意识到他正在问你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29980
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e4638232:

    # "Only when he repeats himself do you snap to attention."
    "直到他重复了一遍，你才猛地回过神来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:29996
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_26bf2e5c:

    # p "Me?!"
    p "我？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:29998
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dc503cb9:

    # p "I-... Well, I guess maybe if the guy-"
    p "我-……嗯，我想也许如果那个家伙-"

# game/script day12.rpy:30004
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5df72f66:

    # j "Oh believe me, I {i}know{/i} that you'll take a guy. I was asking if you have any plans for the harbor."
    j "哦，相信我，我知道你会接受一个男人。我问的是你对港口有什么计划。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30006
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4dbf59ff:

    # "A stray blush rushes across your cheeks."
    "一抹红晕不经意间掠过你的脸颊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30010
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bacbb994:

    # j "I meant whether you have any plans for the harbor."
    j "我的意思是，你对港口有什么计划。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30014
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a357aa8f:

    # p "Oh. Right. Uh..."
    p "哦。对。呃……"

# game/script day12.rpy:30016
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_252182f5:

    # p "Nothing firm, honestly."
    p "说实话，没什么确定的计划。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30018
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e9b68df2:

    # p "Haven't had much time to think.{w} I guess I'll see when I get there?"
    p "没什么时间去想。{w} 我想等到了那儿再看？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30020
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e142d048:

    # p "Figured I'd just wander once we dock. See what catches my eye."
    p "想着等我们一靠岸就随便逛逛。看看有什么吸引我的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30022
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_38ec1ed6:

    # p "Have you been there before, Sam?"
    p "你以前去过那里吗，山姆？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30029
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7e3d86ed:

    # s "Mogador? Yeah, I think so—a few years back."
    s "摩加多尔？是的，我想我去过——几年前。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30031
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3a66d013:

    # p "So, you'd know if there's anything worth doing in town?"
    p "那么，你知道镇上有什么值得做的事情吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30033
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bee39554:

    # "Samuel tilts [his] head, muzzle slightly parted and eyes turned toward the sky."
    "塞缪尔歪着头，口鼻微微张开，眼睛望向天空。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30035
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3290efac:

    # s "Er..."
    s "呃……"

# game/script day12.rpy:30037
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c582becc:

    # s "To be honest, harbors begin to blend together after a while..."
    s "说实话，港口待久了就开始混在一起了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:30039
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_55a0da26:

    # "[He] appears to be digging deep in the recesses of [his] memory."
    "他似乎在记忆深处努力挖掘。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30041
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c243b4b3:

    # s "Mogador was still pretty new when we stopped there. There's an island off the coast, if I remember right."
    s "我们停靠那里的时候，摩加多尔还挺新的。如果我没记错的话，海岸外有个岛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30043
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_808b58bd:

    # s "Some of the lads talked about rowing over, but we never went."
    s "有些伙计提到要划船过去，但我们从来没去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30047
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_11128a5e:

    # s "That's about all I can remember."
    s "这就是我能记得的全部了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30049
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8dccfdf8:

    # j "Island, huh?"
    j "岛，是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30051
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_871bea5b:

    # p "Doubt they let us use one of the boats for it. Certainly not us two, Jules."
    p "我怀疑他们会让我们用船过去。肯定不是我们俩，朱尔斯。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30053
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a84a05b3:

    # j "I guess you're right."
    j "我想你说得对。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30055
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4e5121ee:

    # p "Don't even know if I'll have coin to do much, anyway. Might just stroll around the harbor, then sit myself down back here."
    p "反正我甚至不知道自己有没有钱做太多事。可能就在港口附近转转，然后回到这儿坐下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30057
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_918ab314:

    # s "Our purser's usually willing to give an advance if we're stuck in port."
    s "如果我们困在港口，我们的管事通常愿意预支点钱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30059
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c580b3ae:

    # s "Tell him that you need to replace some work clothes if you want to make sure."
    s "告诉他你需要换些工作服，如果你想确保能借到的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30061
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_026e3e46:

    # s "Surefire way for him to agree. Nobody wants to see ya arse hanging out when working the rigging."
    s "这是让他同意的万全之策。没人想看到你爬索具时屁股露在外面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30068
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5e7fbd47:

    # "A laugh escapes under Julian's breath."
    "朱利安忍不住轻笑一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30070
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4057d0d1:

    # j "Speak for yourself."
    j "那是说你自己吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30074
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6769e418:

    # j "I wouldn't mind. His ain't so bad."
    j "我不介意。他的屁股又不赖。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30076
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c41c9f54:

    # "Samuel eyes him sidelong."
    "塞缪尔斜眼看着他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30078
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b6791ffe:

    # s "Sooo... Do I {i}want{/i} to know how you know?"
    s "那么……我到底想不想知道你是怎么知道的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30082
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f9948817:

    # "You shake your head quickly, but Julian presses on."
    "你快速摇头，但朱利安继续追问。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30086
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f4aa40b4:

    # j "Just a game of dice."
    j "只是一场掷骰子游戏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30088
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8b4e35fa:

    # j "Dice game. No money, so we bet something else."
    j "掷骰子游戏。没钱，所以我们赌点别的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30090
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4e10fe44:

    # "Julian..."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30092
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d82d052c:

    # j "So, I can vouch that he's pretty good looking."
    j "所以，我可以作证他长得相当不错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30099
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_557b9c7c:

    # s ". . ."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30105
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_822531f8:

    # j "Honestly?"
    j "说真的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30107
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5f291087:

    # j "Probably best you don't."
    j "你最好还是别知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30113
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_909ace81:

    # "Samuel turns slowly to look at you."
    "塞缪尔慢慢转过身看着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30115
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c0c0cebc:

    # "The two of you hold eye contact in silence."
    "你们俩沉默地对视着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30117
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_02584f61:

    # s "Got it..."
    s "懂了..."

# game/script day12.rpy:30119
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_13c1a4f2:

    # "Julian!"
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30121
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b521536b:

    # "Oh, how badly you want to smack him."
    "哦，你多想给他一巴掌。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30135
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8d82c27d:

    # s "Look, I can appreciate a good looking ass as much as the next guy, but there's a time and place."
    s "听着，我也和普通人一样欣赏好看的屁股，但总得看场合。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30137
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9215c31c:

    # s "Heaving to is {i}not{/i} that time."
    s "收帆停船的时候{i}可不是{/i}时候。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30139
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3530a80b:

    # p "If you two keep talking about asses I swear I will spend time with-... I don't know, Wolf instead."
    p "要是你俩再继续讨论屁股，我发誓我就去和——...我不知道，和沃尔夫待着去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30143
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_366657d0:

    # s "I didn't start it."
    s "又不是我挑的头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30147
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_88057329:

    # j "Well..."
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30149
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_409b59a1:

    # j "Kind of did."
    j "算是你挑的吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30153
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b908bcb8:

    # s "I just said it to clarify {i}why{/i} he'd get his pay. The arse was just to show my point."
    s "我只是为了说清楚{i}为什么{/i}他能拿到工钱。提屁股只是为了说明我的观点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30155
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_848582e7:

    # s "Not that I have anything against asses, but-"
    s "倒不是说我对屁股有什么意见，但是——"

# game/script day12.rpy:30162
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a39907f7:

    # j "Favorite ass, Sam.{w} Go."
    j "最喜欢的屁股，萨姆。{w}说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30164
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f4a0c1be:

    # "Both of you turn to Julian in an instant."
    "你们俩立刻转向朱利安。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30166
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2e77fd6a:

    # j "What? Want me to be glum forever?"
    j "怎么？想让我永远闷闷不乐？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30170
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7e91b4c7:

    # j "With you two around that'd be difficult."
    j "有你们俩在身边，那可难了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30172
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c8f46553:

    # p "No, that's not-..."
    p "不，不是那个意思——..."

# game/script day12.rpy:30174
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a8192522:

    # j "You staying on the ship is worthy of a little bit of a celebration, is it not? And what better way to celebrate than showing some appreciation for backsides made in the image of the gods?"
    j "你留在船上，难道不值得小小庆祝一下吗？还有什么庆祝方式比欣赏诸神亲手打造的翘臀更好呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30178
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5148e4a4:

    # s "I can imagine a few."
    s "我能想到几种别的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30183
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_255c3836:

    # "He leans forward, trying to capture Samuel's attention by pushing himself right into [his] field of view."
    "他向前倾身，试图挤进[他的]视野，吸引塞缪尔的注意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30185
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1a8b7cb4:

    # j "That's not an answer to my question."
    j "这可不是我问题的答案。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30187
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_753af554:

    # s "Because it's a daft question, Jules...{w} Uh, fine, there was this girl I met a few years ago."
    s "因为这是个蠢问题，朱尔斯...{w}呃，好吧，几年前我遇到过一个姑娘。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30189
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6029d193:

    # s "Probably hers?"
    s "大概是她的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30195
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8394dd5d:

    # s "I don't know. Ask me something less stupid."
    s "我不知道。问点不那么蠢的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30197
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e4435a4d:

    # "These two will be the end of you."
    "这两个家伙迟早会把你逼疯。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30201
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4ead3b60:

    # "You prop up your head on your fist, listening to them go on about asses for several more minutes."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30203
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4f4d81e1:

    # "How Julian manages to rope others into these conversations, you'll never know."
    "朱利安到底是怎么把别人拉进这种对话的，你永远搞不懂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30207
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_df670378:

    # "But he always does."
    "但他总能办到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30209
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a4c1a465:

    # "Something about the excitement he exudes is impossible to resist."
    "他身上散发出的那种兴奋劲儿让人难以抗拒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30211
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6c883f65:

    # "Especially on nights like this."
    "尤其是在这样的夜晚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30215
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a4f3b146:

    # "For them, but {i}especially{/i} for you."
    "对他们来说是，但{i}尤其{/i}是对你而言。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30219
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_782a47a3:

    # "You find yourself smiling as he starts gesturing with his hands, miming some shape."
    "当他开始用手比划，模仿着某种形状时，你发现自己笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30221
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_15f037de:

    # "But like the last flickers of the ocean's glow, the moment begins to fade and you feel your eyelids growing heavier."
    "但就像海面上最后闪烁的微光，这一刻开始消逝，你感到眼皮越来越沉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30225
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_46c1db63:

    # "Some joke—you don't even catch the whole thing—still manages to coax a soft chuckle from you."
    "某个笑话——你甚至没听全——却依然让你轻声笑了出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30227
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1505c8ea:

    # "Even today, he never fails to make you laugh."
    "即使到了今天，他也总能逗你笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30231
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c9d0ae5d:

    # "As for Samuel..."
    "至于塞缪尔..."

# game/script day12.rpy:30233
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_83d864ad:

    # "[He] doesn't have to know."
    "[他]没必要知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30235
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f239c71b:

    # "It's for the best."
    "这样最好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30237
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_289ea628:

    # "Just keep it from [him]."
    "只要瞒着[他]就行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30239
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3d560862:

    # "There is no reason why he needs to know, and as long as [he] doesn't, it'll all be good."
    "他没有理由知道，只要[他]不知道，一切就都安好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30241
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ec0f7538:

    # "Arthur left you no choice.{w} It's as simple as that."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30243
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_34f3b2ec:

    # "And as long as he keeps his word, you don't have to think about this."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30247
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e594fb48:

    # j "My guide on that trip was a strapping lion. Regal beyond belief."
    j "那次旅行的向导是头健壮的狮子。高贵得令人难以置信。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30249
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_063c2818:

    # j "Didn't speak much, but I guess father paid him enough to tolerate me."
    j "话不多，但我想父亲付了他足够的钱来容忍我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30251
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_13af3e06:

    # j "Hot day though, so we stopped at a stream a few miles from the fort to refresh."
    j "不过那天很热，所以我们在离堡垒几英里远的小溪边停下歇息。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30253
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b63c8fa2:

    # "Something about horses?"
    "是跟马有关的事？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30255
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_73019fe7:

    # "Or riding?"
    "还是骑马？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30259
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fcc0fd21:

    # p "Anyway..."
    p "总之..."

# game/script day12.rpy:30261
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_65709608:

    # "Both of them look at you."
    "他们俩都看向你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30263
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e479ad06:

    # p "If I don't walk away now, you'll drag me into the whole asses thing too."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30274
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_91fb8cc2:

    # "You wave them off and push yourself upright."
    "你挥挥手让他们打住，然后支撑着站起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30276
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_59119419:

    # j "We asked you about your asses already—you didn't answer."
    j "我们问过你关于你屁股的事了——你没回答。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30278
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9965d4d0:

    # "The urge to stretch is threatening to win, but you fight against it for fear that it might wake you up again."
    "想要伸懒腰的冲动快要占了上风，但你克制住了，怕这会让你再次清醒过来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30280
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_99edd973:

    # p "Shows you how awake I am."
    p "这说明我有多清醒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30282
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c5acc5a4:

    # p "But... thank you again.{w} Both of you."
    p "但是...再次谢谢你们。{w}你们俩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30286
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_eb1de930:

    # s "No need."
    s "不必。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30290
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ca4469b8:

    # j "Sleep well, you do look like you need it."
    j "睡个好觉，你看上去确实需要休息。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30292
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_45858ab2:

    # p "Coming from you? Just wait—you two have the same watch. You'll look just like this by the end of the watch."
    p "这话从你嘴里说出来？等着瞧——你们俩是同班岗。等站完岗，你们也会是这副样子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30299
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0166fca7:

    # "Sam stretches, yawns wide and slicks back [his] mane with one hand."
    "萨姆伸了个懒腰，打了个大大的哈欠，一只手将[他的]鬃毛向后捋顺。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30301
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a45696d2:

    # "Only for it to bounce back into place the moment [he]'s done."
    "但刚一捋完，头发就又弹回了原样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30303
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_25c7ed31:

    # "The yawn is persistent though and [he] talks through the tail end of it."
    "不过哈欠还没打完，[他]就拖着哈欠的尾声说话了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30307
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8633c4a2:

    # s "Wise words, wise words."
    s "至理名言，至理名言。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30309
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_39a1f787:

    # s "You've grown so much since the day I met you."
    s "自从我认识你那天起，你真是成长了不少。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30311
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fa936cff:

    # s "Sleep well. Try not to wake the others with your snoring."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30313
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f769f4bb:

    # "You sigh, too tired to even protest the accusation."
    "你叹了口气，累得连反驳这个指控的力气都没有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30315
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d7460324:

    # p "I don't."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30319
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9c45a27c:

    # "Oh God, you sounded pathetic."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30326
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_39281aeb:

    # "And of course, Julian barely contains his laughter. Only confirming that fear."
    "当然，朱利安几乎憋不住笑。这恰好证实了你的担忧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30328
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_db26bca5:

    # j "He really doesn't, Sam.{w} He {i}purrs{/i} though."
    j "他真的不打鼾，萨姆。{w}不过他{i}会发出咕噜声{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30332
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fefbd6cb:

    # s "No shit?"
    s "真的假的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30334
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_753e7484:

    # j "Swear on my scales. And it's goddamn {i}adorable{/i}!"
    j "我以我的鳞片发誓。而且那该死的{i}可爱极了{/i}！"

# game/script day12.rpy:30338
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_961cae8d:

    # j "Didn't dare touch him, but I imagine it'd feel quite nice."
    j "没敢碰他，但我想感觉应该相当不错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30342
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4a0e7b6b:

    # "He effortlessly rolls his R's as he imitates the sound."
    "他模仿着那个声音，轻松地滚动着R音。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30344
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6e588b1b:

    # "You furrow your brow."
    "你皱起眉头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30346
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7bef7fa7:

    # "This is a battle you ain't winning."
    "这场仗你赢不了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30348
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d828ddf9:

    # "You know the lizard well enough to realize that."
    "你足够了解这只蜥蜴，知道这一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30350
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_58900093:

    # "You shake your head slowly, trying to look disappointed."
    "你慢慢摇头，试图做出失望的样子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30352
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_00481d47:

    # p "Careful there, or I might never allow you to find out."
    p "小心点，不然我可能永远不会让你发现。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30356
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fe6ed152:

    # "That shuts him right up."
    "这话立刻让他闭嘴了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30362
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_121e4a7a:

    # "He fidgets with his jacket, trying to look innocent."
    "他摆弄着自己的夹克，试图显得无辜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30364
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d20f13b5:

    # "That idiot.{w} That lovable, lovable idiot."
    "那个白痴。{w}那个可爱，可爱的白痴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30372
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4927848d:

    # "You wave and turn towards the stern, picking your way past masts, boats and other sailors to get your well-earned rest."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30374
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_75836983:

    # "The conversation of the two carries for a few steps before being swallowed into the ambiance around you."
    "那两人的谈话声在你走了几步后，便融入了周围的夜色中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30376
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5fb58021:

    # "You glance back at the sea. The glow's nearly gone now—if it's even there at all."
    "你回头瞥了一眼大海。微光现在几乎消失了——如果它真的存在过的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30378
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6348a2a9:

    # "The hatch creaks as you pull it open, and you wonder how long it'll be before you see something like that again."
    "你拉开舱门时，铰链发出嘎吱声，你不知道要过多久才能再看到那样的景象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30380
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_66bccf4b:

    # "If you ever will."
    "如果还能看到的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30382
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_79ab25a9:

    # "And whether next time you'll be able to enjoy it more thoroughly."
    "也不知道下次是否能更尽情地享受它。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30393
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_76f3a2e6:

    # j "After all, greenhorns gotta stick together, eh?"
    j "毕竟，菜鸟们得抱团取暖，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30395
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_605ac66c:

    # p "It's okay... Not like that's going to happen now."
    p "没事的...现在又不会发生那种事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30397
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_625a7bcb:

    # "You're not sure quite how to put it either, but you feel on instinct the need to try and cheer things up. Yes, you understand the sentiment, but why dwell on what hadn't come to pass?"
    "你也不太确定该怎么表达，但本能地觉得需要试着让气氛轻松起来。是的，你理解那种情绪，但何必纠结于尚未发生的事情呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30399
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_42aa35a6:

    # "You don't want to keep sounding so morose."
    "你不想一直听起来这么忧郁。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30401
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fdbea626:

    # p "Unless, of course, I fall asleep on another weather watch."
    p "当然，除非我又一次在瞭望天气时睡着了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30405
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cb459da1:

    # s "Yeah, then you might wreck the ship for good next time!"
    s "是啊，那下次你可能就把船彻底搞沉了！"

# game/script day12.rpy:30407
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4bf6fa71:

    # "Samuel lays [his] hand on your shoulder and tries to ease things with [his] teasing tone."
    "塞缪尔把[他的]手搭在你肩上，试图用[他]戏谑的语气缓和气氛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30409
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b9884f90:

    # s "If ya do, you better be a damn good swimmer, 'cause we're a long way west of the coast, and I ain't lettin' you drown until you've carried my ass all the way there."
    s "如果你真那么做了，你最好是个他妈游泳好手，因为我们现在离西海岸很远，在你把我的屁股一路驮到那儿之前，我可不会让你淹死。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30411
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a8fe4b7a:

    # "You know you'd deserve nothing less, even now."
    "你知道你活该如此，即使是现在。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30413
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_91b707c6:

    # s "I ain't swimmin' that on my own, like. And I sure as shit ain't dying before I get a proper bath."
    s "我才不会自己游那么远呢。而且我他妈肯定要在好好洗个澡之前死掉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30419
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3604d0f1:

    # j "Oh, I'm sure I'll piss you off eventually, Sam. Probably sooner rather than later."
    j "哦，我肯定迟早会惹毛你的，萨姆。可能很快。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30421
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8865c911:

    # "He grins, trying to pull you away from your perceived faults."
    "他咧嘴一笑，试图把你从你自认的过错中拉出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30425
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5a797743:

    # s "Don't {i}try{/i} to."
    s "别{i}试图{/i}那么做。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30429
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9c7af664:

    # "Julian gives the maned wolf a side-eye."
    "朱利安斜睨了那只鬃狼一眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30431
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b4e7d51c:

    # j "I'm not {i}trying{/i} to."
    j "我可不是{i}故意{/i}的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30435
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_001a61ff:

    # j "Just saying—it's inevitable. Given enough time."
    j "只是说——这是不可避免的。只要时间足够长。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30437
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_aa96327e:

    # s "Well, then try in [name]'s direction instead of mine."
    s "那好，那就去惹[name]，别来惹我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30443
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_753eb7b9:

    # "Samuel's voice dips slightly, [his] tone shifting just enough to make you pause."
    "塞缪尔的声音略微低沉，[他的]语气转变的幅度刚好让你停顿了一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30445
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_406e5f3a:

    # s "Or have you ever wondered how I came to carry around these scars?"
    s "或者你有没有想过，我这些伤疤是怎么来的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30447
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e809d9db:

    # "[He] turns [his] head slowly, [his] sharp eyes sliding from Julian to you."
    "[他]慢慢转过头，[他]锐利的目光从朱利安滑向你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30449
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_96c39149:

    # "[He] narrows them into an intense gaze, and moves slowly enough to give you ample opportunity to have another look at the scars criss-crossing over [his] left eye."
    "[他]眯起眼睛，形成一种专注的凝视，并且动作缓慢，给了你充足的机会再次打量那些交错在[他]左眼上的伤疤。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30451
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ae52b562:

    # s "Came from the last bastard who pissed me off."
    s "是上一个惹恼我的混蛋留下的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30453
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c12aaa0a:

    # p "But... they're old."
    p "但是……它们有些年头了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30455
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_25954701:

    # s "{i}Exactly.{/i}"
    s "{i}没错。{/i}"

# game/script day12.rpy:30457
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_edade34f:

    # "A chill traces down your spine, you've never heard Samuel bring [his] voice to this low of a register."
    "一股寒意顺着你的脊梁滑下，你从未听过塞缪尔把[他的]声音压得这么低。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30459
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b6fb99fd:

    # s "They're old."
    s "它们很旧了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30461
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_592d00d5:

    # s "Something that guy never got to be."
    s "那个家伙可没机会变老。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30463
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7e98a40c:

    # "With a flick of [his] wrist, Samuel snaps open [his] sailor's knife."
    "塞缪尔手腕一抖，啪地打开了[他的]水手刀。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30465
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0bd65f25:

    # "The polished edge gleams with a faint, blueish sheen, reflecting the movement of the sea."
    "打磨过的刀刃闪烁着微弱的、带点蓝色的光泽，映照着海面的波动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30467
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_41555420:

    # "Effortlessly, [he] spins it around [his] finger before catching the handle."
    "[他]毫不费力地用手指转了个刀花，然后握住刀柄。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30473
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_602e32d2:

    # s "Carved the son of a bitch like a butcher."
    s "把那狗娘养的家伙像屠夫处理肉一样给开了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30475
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3e582630:

    # "The hushed whisper morphs into a threatening growl originating from the back of [his] throat."
    "压低的声音变成了从[他]喉咙深处发出的威胁性低吼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30479
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_78d266a4:

    # "[His] red eyes glint in the dark, locked firmly on the two of you."
    "[他]红色的眼睛在黑暗中闪烁，牢牢锁定你们两人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30481
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_71247044:

    # s "{i}Nobody{/i} dared since."
    s "从那以后，{i}没人{/i}敢了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30483
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_51df08ce:

    # "Silence.{w} Not even a breath leaves you."
    "一片寂静。{w}你甚至屏住了呼吸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30485
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_983c577f:

    # "For a moment, nothing exists but the wind and the waves. Even Julian does not dare to speak."
    "有那么一刻，除了风浪，什么都不存在。连朱利安也不敢说话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30489
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7db1ead7:

    # "Then—Samuel's lips curl, sharp teeth flashing in a grin. Wicked at first, but as the tension lingers, [his] expression shifts—shoulders shaking as [he] breaks into laughter."
    "接着——塞缪尔的嘴唇弯起，尖牙在咧嘴一笑中闪现。起初带着邪气，但随着紧张气氛持续，[他的]表情变了——肩膀抖动，[他]突然大笑起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30493
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a7eae3b7:

    # s "Fuck me, did ya really believe that?"
    s "操，你们还真信了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30495
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b9b494de:

    # s "The look on your faces was priceless!"
    s "你们脸上的表情真是绝了！"

# game/script day12.rpy:30497
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9fe836f6:

    # "You and Julian exchange a look."
    "你和朱利安交换了一个眼神。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30501
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2a494e9a:

    # "Then, simultaneously, you both roll your eyes—Julian adding a flat \"Whatever.\""
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30505
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_afd998ea:

    # p "You've got a colorful imagination, Sam. First about Wolf and now this."
    p "你的想象力可真丰富，萨姆。先是关于沃尔夫，现在又是这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30511
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bf0f0daa:

    # "Samuel's ears flick back in exaggerated offense."
    "塞缪尔的耳朵向后一甩，做出夸张的受冒犯状。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30513
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2101e629:

    # s "What?!"
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30515
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1375b81b:

    # s "I had you."
    s "我唬住你们了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30517
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8132b0e1:

    # s "Both of you.{w} Don't you try and play it off now."
    s "你们两个都是。{w}别想现在装作没事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30519
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a5aa3370:

    # j "Sam, you are too small to beat anyone up. That story would never fly."
    j "萨姆，你个子太小了，打不过任何人。那故事根本站不住脚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30521
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fe18fa1d:

    # s "You better mind your muzzle or I'll show you who's too small."
    s "你最好管好你的嘴，不然我就让你看看谁才是小个子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30523
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6c2f5f88:

    # s "I saw what I saw!{w} And what I saw were two pups, sitting around the fireplace at night, trembling at the tale being told."
    s "我亲眼看到的！{w}我看到的是两只小狗，晚上围坐在壁炉边，被讲的故事吓得发抖。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30525
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f5b27802:

    # s "Bet you believed every word of it."
    s "我打赌你们当时信了每一个字。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30529
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b9806284:

    # s "'Sides, clearly I gotta put some respect back into you lot, don't I?"
    s "再说了，显然我得让你们这群家伙重新对我有点敬意，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30531
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e98d4bbf:

    # j "Do you want us to 'Sir' you now, too? {i}Mr. O'Connor?{/i}"
    j "你现在也想让我们叫你‘长官’吗？{i}奥康纳先生？{/i}"

# game/script day12.rpy:30535
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_72ac4dbf:

    # "Samuel snorts."
    "塞缪尔哼了一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30537
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_548fe3ea:

    # s "Please don't. Not {i}that{/i} much respect."
    s "可别。不用{i}那么{/i}尊敬。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30548
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d3b0a7f6:

    # "You shake your head, smirking as you turn back to the sea."
    "你摇摇头，咧嘴一笑，转身重新看向大海。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30550
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4e56e67d:

    # "You lose yourself for a couple of moments... Wasn't the water darker before?"
    "你出神了片刻……刚才海水是不是更暗一些？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30552
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_70ef03ce:

    # "Then—the tip of the bow wave begins to glow, a faint but noticeable turquoise against the dark water."
    "接着——船首波的尖端开始发光，在深色的水面上呈现出微弱但明显的蓝绿色。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30554
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_88e064c0:

    # "Like the crest of a snow-capped mountain, right underneath the ship."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30556
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2dc16ce3:

    # "It remains for a brief glimpse before fading again."
    "它只闪现了一瞥，便再次消逝。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30558
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b6c103c1:

    # "Your fur bristles, unease creeping in as you glance up, searching for some trick of reflection—perhaps from the stars above."
    "你的毛发竖起，不安感悄然袭来，你抬头望去，想寻找某种反射的把戏——也许是来自天上的星星。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30560
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_036047aa:

    # "But it's not their light."
    "但那不是它们的光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30562
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8ee7ca33:

    # s "Seen your reflection, or what's got you so spooked?"
    s "看到你自己的倒影了，还是什么东西把你吓成这样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30564
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a61f1bab:

    # "Before you can respond, it happens again. A soft blue flash, illuminating the crest of a wave."
    "你还没来得及回答，它又出现了。一道柔和的蓝色闪光，照亮了一道浪尖。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30566
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3988b373:

    # "Like ghosts rising from the abyss to follow the ship."
    "像是从深渊升起的幽灵，跟随着船只。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30568
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8eeb97da:

    # p "Uh, no... nothing.{w} Just a reflection or something."
    p "呃，不……没什么。{w}只是倒影什么的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30570
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bd40a188:

    # "But the little flashes of light don't stop.{w} Quite the opposite. They multiply."
    "但那些微小的闪光并没有停止。{w}恰恰相反。它们增多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30572
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b7a548af:

    # "With each passing moment, they grow more numerous, swirling in the water, trailing in the ship's wake like embers caught in a current."
    "每过一刻，它们就变得更加密集，在水中旋转，在船尾的航迹中拖曳，如同被水流卷走的余烬。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30574
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_123d9f01:

    # p "Actually, maybe not a reflection?"
    p "其实，也许不是倒影？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30576
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e23a74e7:

    # "Your voice tightens."
    "你的声音绷紧了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30580
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bd980b9c:

    # "Perhaps it's not the stars who judge you for your misdeeds, but the very sea itself?"
    "或许审判你罪行的不是星星，而是大海本身？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30582
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bab50722:

    # p "Sam?!"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30584
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1db8816d:

    # "You see [his] snout in your periphery as [he] joins next to you, with Julian following suit shortly after."
    "你从余光中看到[他的]口鼻，[他]来到了你身边，朱利安不久后也跟了过来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30586
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_48e43d77:

    # "Now the entire bow wave glows, an ethereal blue radiance dragged along on the surface. You watch, mesmerized, as the water parts against the ship's hull, spreading outward like light caught in liquid."
    "现在整个船首波都在发光，一种空灵的蓝色光辉被拖曳在海面上。你着迷地看着海水在船体两侧分开，向外扩散，如同光芒被液体捕捉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30588
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b81ea81e:

    # "Julian is the one who breaks the silence after a while."
    "过了一会儿，打破沉默的是朱利安。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30590
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_45663109:

    # j "What is going on...?"
    j "这是怎么回事……？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30592
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_87458710:

    # "You hear him gasp, finally managing to swallow again."
    "你听到他倒吸一口气，终于又能咽下口水了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30594
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6e7f97a2:

    # "It's as if some energy in the agitated waves sparked the light, and set them aflame. But you can't grasp {i}how.{/i}"
    "仿佛是激荡波浪中的某种能量激发了这光芒，让它们燃烧起来。但你无法理解{i}这是怎么做到的。{/i}"

# game/script day12.rpy:30598
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7a0fe195:

    # "But it's undeniably beautiful."
    "但这无疑很美。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30605
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_30988407:

    # "The light grows stronger, deep and luminous, only to fade once it has passed the ship."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30616
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3cb0184d_1:

    # "You glance at Samuel. There's a small, knowing smile on [his] lips."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30618
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4219fefd:

    # s "Unbelievable."
    s "不可思议。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30620
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f1498bb5_1:

    # s "That, my dear Julian, is the {i}burning of the sea.{/i}"
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30624
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bd84972c:

    # s "It's still weak."
    s "它还比较弱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30631
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5d79c09f:

    # p "Burning of the sea?! Is it the fires of hell rising to drag us under?"
    p "海火？！是地狱之火升起来要把我们拖下去吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30633
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a294046c:

    # "Your voice trembles as the guilt of your actions begins to nest ever deeper inside of you."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30635
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_71433599:

    # p "Wh-... what are we supposed to do?"
    p "我-……我们该怎么办？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30639
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_95460618:

    # j "Burning of the sea?! I'd prefer to stay raw, Sam."
    j "海火？！我宁愿保持原样（不被烧熟），萨姆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30641
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_794dce8c:

    # "You hear a slight tremble in the lizard's voice as he clings to the sheet he is holding."
    "你听到蜥蜴的声音里有一丝颤抖，他紧紧抓着他手里的那块帆布。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30643
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ccf555e5_1:

    # j "What do we do?"
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30645
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ef8caa07:

    # s "Fuck me, look at this... It- it's been three, maybe four years since I last saw it."
    s "我的天，看看这个……我上次见到它，已经是三、也许是四年前了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30647
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9521d550:

    # "[His] voice carries something softer now. {w}Reverence?"
    "[他的]声音现在带上了一些更柔和的东西。{w}崇敬？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30649
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_501b58a6_1:

    # s "Ain't it stunning?"
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30651
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_036e2575:

    # p "Stunning?{w} Sam—What is going on?! Are we safe?"
    p "震撼？{w}萨姆——到底是怎么回事？！我们安全吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30655
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_77161bd6:

    # "You feel a flicker of panic rising in your chest."
    "你感到胸中升起一丝恐慌。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30660
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e67129dc:

    # p "Fire and ships usually don't mix well! Should we get the buckets?!"
    p "火和船通常可不太搭！我们是不是该去拿水桶？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:30662
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fa56d8d8_1:

    # "But Samuel doesn't answer."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30673
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_55dfd264:

    # "Instead, [he] moves—effortless as a cat—swinging [himself] up onto the gunwale before catching onto the shrouds. [He] climbs a foot or two, finding a perch to sit, watching the sea below with the awe of someone admiring the sunset."
    "相反，[他]动了——像猫一样轻盈——荡身跃上船舷上缘，抓住侧支索。[他]往上爬了一两英尺，找了个位置坐下，带着一种欣赏日落般的敬畏，观看着下方的海面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30675
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b603f82a_1:

    # j "Sam?!"
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30680
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6748597d:

    # "Samuel waves a lazy hand."
    "塞缪尔懒洋洋地挥了挥手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30687
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e1c85e9d_1:

    # s "Relax. Don't piss yourselves. We're not in danger."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30689
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0a423c56_1:

    # s "It isn't actual fire—that's just its name."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30691
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_39fdc2b3_1:

    # s "Last time, we sailed right through.{w} Nothing happened to us. Apart from the hell of a view we got to witness."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30693
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a26c9989:

    # s "As best I could, at least—I'd be lying if I said I wasn't anxious myself."
    s "至少，我尽力了——如果我说我自己不紧张，那就是撒谎。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30697
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_62dfc57d:

    # "[He] kicks a leg idly against the rigging, looking down at you both."
    "[他]随意地用一条腿踢了踢索具，低头看着你们俩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30701
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e50550df_1:

    # s "And hey, look at me—still standin', eh? Raw.{w} Uncooked.{w} Absolutely unpalatable."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30705
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_726e9581:

    # "Even [his] assurances struggle to calm you."
    "即使是[他的]保证也难以让你平静下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30709
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_75a447ab_1:

    # "You exhale, [his] calm demeanor steadying your nerves more than you expected."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30715
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ad6946dc_1:

    # s "For what it's worth, I checked with Arthur and our prior captain. Neither ever heard or saw it cause any harm."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30717
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c6c427c9_1:

    # s "What it is? Well, that's a grand question, isn't it?"
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30719
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4ca97781_1:

    # s "They didn't have an answer. Maybe no one does."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30721
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ba9bb1d5:

    # "Julian swallows."
    "朱利安咽了口唾沫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30723
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e8970c53:

    # j "So, what?{w} Some kind of magic?"
    j "所以，什么情况？{w}某种魔法？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30727
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1588074b:

    # "Samuel grins, a bit of mischief creeping back into [his] tone."
    "塞缪尔咧嘴笑了，[他的]语气里又爬回一丝顽皮。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30729
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a3377081_1:

    # s "Maybe."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30731
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1bd24b78_1:

    # s "Or maybe Davy Jones left his locker open, and now the sea's spilling out all those we lost to her."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30733
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_413a697c_1:

    # s "Who's to say?"
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30737
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_63038ce6_1:

    # s "But if you ask me? Beauty like this? That's beyond men. Even among the gods."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30739
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_34c98439_1:

    # s "Only a woman's touch could create something like this. My bet is on Mother Nature herself."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30741
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_968f944d_1:

    # "Others of the crew begin to notice the glow, and soon, rugged hands join yours on the gunwale. One by one, the sailors gather to watch the spectacle just as you are."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30743
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c4fc5245_1:

    # "A quiet awe settles over the deck."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30745
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_228476a7_1:

    # j "Mother Nature, huh?"
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30749
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_efc349c4:

    # p "Not convinced, Julian?"
    p "不信吗，朱利安？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30753
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_29892746:

    # "Julian's lips press together, his grip still firm on the sheet."
    "朱利安抿紧了嘴唇，手仍然紧紧抓着帆布。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30755
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2f175f06:

    # j "I'm not sure."
    j "我不确定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30757
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3cdc27e4:

    # "Those sailors, more intrigued than startled, appear to search for a better vantage point and find their places up in the shrouds."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30762
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2b0d009a:

    # "Julian being one of them, despite any lingering uncertainty. He hoists himself onto the gunwale, squatting down for a better vantage point."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30764
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b84dcc05:

    # "Others cling to the lines as the ship leans leeward; some of them are framed by the moonn high up in the sky, its bright shine illuminating the edges of the clouds in a faint greenish tint."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30768
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8a4c8707:

    # "Just then, a deep, shuddering creak rolls through the ship. It's nothing unusual—ships are alive with sounds like these—but at this moment, the noise sends a cold shiver down your spine and bristles your fur in response."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30772
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d6b265dc:

    # j "Are you absolutely certain we're safe?"
    j "你绝对确定我们安全吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30776
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1ae513d4:

    # p "Are you absolutely certain we're safe?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30778
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_19fe48e6:

    # s "Certain enough."
    s "足够确定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30789
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dea417ff:

    # "You hoped for a more convincing answer, but trusting [him] is all you can do."
    "你希望得到一个更有说服力的答案，但信任[他]是你唯一能做的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30791
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9b057d40:

    # "For a time, the three of you simply watch. The glow grows in intensity until it catches on the faces of Samuel and Julian."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30793
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2634cd96:

    # "Both of them are as enraptured as you are."
    "他们两个和你一样着迷。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30797
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_33742337:

    # "You inhale."
    "你吸气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30799
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d05dcce7:

    # "Deeply."
    "深深地。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30803
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8641523b:

    # "Trying to calm yourself down."
    "试图让自己冷静下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30805
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6e91b3e3:

    # "Your eyes drift skyward."
    "你的目光飘向天空。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30807
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d3ef25cc:

    # "Thousands of glinting eyes staring back."
    "成千上万只闪烁的眼睛正回望着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30809
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4df5dcee:

    # "Exhale."
    "呼出一口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30811
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e31fe6e8:

    # "What the hell was wrong with you?"
    "你到底是怎么了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30813
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f74d879d:

    # "Using Samuel like this..."
    "这样利用塞缪尔..."

# game/script day12.rpy:30815
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9aa4f95b:

    # "You tell yourself to forget it. Keep your muzzle shut, and no one ever has to know."
    "你告诉自己忘掉它。管好你的嘴，就永远不会有人知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30817
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5ed9712c:

    # "But the anxiety clings to you. The exhaustion seeps into every muscle."
    "但焦虑仍紧抓着你。疲惫渗入每一块肌肉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30841
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_95dbbbc3:

    # "Even Julian seems to settle now that the initial hesitation is fading."
    "随着最初的犹豫逐渐消退，连朱利安似乎也平静了下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30843
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_33742337_1:

    # "You inhale."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30845
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d05dcce7_1:

    # "Deeply."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30847
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4df5dcee_1:

    # "Exhale."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30867
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f7fb0721:

    # "There's something comforting in the cool night breeze, the hush that has fallen over the ship. For the first time in what feels like too long, you feel your body begin to relax."
    "凉爽的夜风、笼罩船只的寂静，带来某种慰藉。在感觉太过漫长的时光后，你第一次感到身体开始放松。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30869
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_310d3734:

    # "The exhaustion lingers, ever-present—but now that you're allowing it, it soaks your muscles all at once."
    "疲惫挥之不去，始终存在——但既然你允许了它，它便立刻浸透了你的肌肉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30871
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_98063e48:

    # "These past few days have been..."
    "这些日子真是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:30873
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_756f9565:

    # "Too much."
    "太过分了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30875
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2bca81f5:

    # "That much you can say with confidence."
    "这一点你可以肯定地说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30877
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cca4458a:

    # s "You doing all right?"
    s "你还好吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30879
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_69f1b9d6:

    # "Something that Samuel must have noticed as well."
    "这一定是塞缪尔也注意到了的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30881
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4b212bb7:

    # "You give a small nod."
    "你轻轻点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30885
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bd94212b:

    # p "I... I think so."
    p "我...我想还好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30887
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ffd8d096:

    # p "Just tired."
    p "只是累了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30891
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c3c3eaaa:

    # p "I think so."
    p "我也这么想的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30893
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3959b7c1:

    # p "Just tired, is all."
    p "只是累了，仅此而已。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30895
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b815534d:

    # "Samuel hums, leaning back against the shrouds."
    "塞缪尔哼了一声，向后靠在桅索上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30897
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dfa07b59:

    # s "Not surprised. It was a lot for you."
    s "不意外。这对你来说太过了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30901
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_27eeee02:

    # j "He's a tough son of a bitch."
    j "他是个硬骨头，狗娘养的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30905
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e02d49e2:

    # j "He'll make it."
    j "他会挺过去的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30907
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_64e7f74b:

    # s "Maybe so. But I mean it. It was a lot."
    s "也许吧。但我是认真的。这太过了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30909
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4e904b29:

    # s "It would be for anyone. And if you need to talk about anything, then—y'know."
    s "对任何人来说都是。如果你需要谈点什么，那么——你知道的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30911
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3035287e:

    # "Samuel makes a point of flicking [his] ears to attention."
    "塞缪尔特意竖起[他的]耳朵，表示在听。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30915
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b8911125:

    # "You force yourself to smile."
    "你强迫自己微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30917
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_913a4b2b:

    # p "No, it's nothing."
    p "不，没什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30919
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4739cb45:

    # s "If you say so."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30921
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d0e5fdc6:

    # s "Just know that it wasn't your fault."
    s "只是要知道，那不是你的错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30925
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5ddaba6b:

    # "You smile. It starts off forced, but as [his] words settle, you find it relaxing into something more genuine."
    "你笑了。起初是强装的，但随着[他的]话语沉淀，你发现笑容放松下来，变得更为真诚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30927
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c3f0f6e9:

    # p "I just don't know what I did wrong."
    p "我只是不知道我做错了什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30929
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4507641a:

    # s "You didn't."
    s "你没有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30931
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_92f7c622:

    # s "That's why you won't be leaving."
    s "这就是为什么你不会离开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30933
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3745c0cc:

    # s "Look, Arthur is..."
    s "听着，亚瑟是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:30935
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_457d3a9b:

    # s "He's..."
    s "他是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:30937
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1d8a6a30:

    # s "How do I put it... {w}He's got his own demons chasin' him at night."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30939
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ed28198d:

    # j "No shit-"
    j "得了吧——"

# game/script day12.rpy:30941
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_01b4c10b:

    # "Julian wants to say more but Samuel cuts him off."
    "朱利安想再说下去，但塞缪尔打断了他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30943
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a62019a4:

    # s "Just like we all do."
    s "就像我们所有人一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30945
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c76b9a22:

    # s "I think he saw those demons in you."
    s "我想他在你身上看到了那些恶魔。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30949
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_681e3962:

    # "You sigh."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30951
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fe8bf612:

    # "Perhaps he was right to see them in you."
    "也许他在你身上看到它们是对的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30953
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a6f663ef:

    # s "I'm sorry that he did. I just hope you can forgive him."
    s "我很抱歉他这么做了。我只是希望你能原谅他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30955
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8534ca42:

    # ". . ."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30959
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b7e7453f:

    # "A faint snarl rises in your throat before you even realize it."
    "你甚至还没意识到，一声低吼就从你喉咙里升起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30961
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9894c6be:

    # p "Some demons they are."
    p "好一群恶魔啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30963
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4cd6ac2b:

    # "You had yet to meet a demon that demanded sexual favors."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30965
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6c6a2a00:

    # "The memory of his taste resurfaces."
    "他味道的记忆重新浮现。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30967
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_898f2af4:

    # p "He-"
    p "他——"

# game/script day12.rpy:30969
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8b868e1e:

    # "You catch yourself before you say something you shouldn't."
    "你在说出不该说的话之前刹住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30971
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4febf8b7:

    # "Better if they don't know."
    "他们不知道更好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30973
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bbb46683:

    # "For your sake."
    "为了你好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30975
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6dd8f7f8:

    # "What would they think if they knew you dropped to your knees to stay?"
    "如果他们知道你跪下来求留下，会怎么想？"

# game/script day12.rpy:30977
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0482712e:

    # "You don't know. And, more importantly, you don't intend to find out."
    "你不知道。而且，更重要的是，你也不打算去弄清楚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30979
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_752c7fe5:

    # j "Still doesn't give him the right to take it out on [name]."
    j "但这仍然不能给他权利拿[姓名]出气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30981
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_508f425c:

    # "He shouldn't have."
    "他不应该那么做。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30983
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_708e6289:

    # s "No, he shouldn't have."
    s "是的，他不应该。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30985
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a269d95a:

    # s "Still, he's a good man, in his own way. Even if it doesn't always seem like it, and even if—sometimes—he isn't."
    s "尽管如此，以他自己的方式，他是个好人。即使并非总是如此，即使——有时候——他也不是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30987
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_75c01253:

    # s "At his core, though, I know he is."
    s "但在他的内心深处，我知道他是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30989
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_67f32c4b:

    # "All you remember of his 'core' is the strong, salty taste—And just {i}how much{/i} of it there was."
    "你对他“内心”的全部记忆，就是那浓烈咸涩的味道——以及{i}有多少{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30991
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_beb94029:

    # j "Not sure I'd agree."
    j "我不确定我同意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30993
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_96c22e26:

    # s "You don't have to. And I won't try to convince you. I'm just saying—I've known him for years."
    s "你不必同意。我也不会试图说服你。我只是说——我认识他很多年了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30995
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8d12b236:

    # s "What I want to make sure of now, though, is that you don't do something stupid, [name]."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:30997
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bcc10ff5:

    # s "I know that you're ambitious. That you want this and are willing to fight for it."
    s "我知道你有野心。你想要这个，并且愿意为之奋斗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:30999
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_984fee75:

    # p "That's why I'm here."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31001
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_503fcd0c:

    # s "You've shown as much."
    s "你已经充分证明了这一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31003
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cc458c26:

    # s "But there's a fine line where you stand."
    s "但你站的位置有一条微妙的界线。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31005
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_732606a9:

    # s "Cross it, and you're not ambitious—you're a liability."
    s "越过了它，你就不是有野心——而是个累赘。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31007
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8111f657:

    # s "And I want you to stay on the safe side of that line, [name]."
    s "我希望你站在那条线的安全一侧，[姓名]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31011
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a6f663ef_1:

    # s "I'm sorry that he did. I just hope you can forgive him."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31013
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_687b460f:

    # p "Forgive him?"
    p "原谅他？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31016
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1ac811d6:

    # p "{cps=5000}Forgive him?{/cps}" nointeract
    p "{cps=5000}原谅他？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day12.rpy:31020
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2e18d8e5:

    # p "I'm not sure I can, Sam."
    p "我不确定我能否做到，萨姆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31022
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_758bcb0f:

    # p "I get that he has his struggles, but that doesn't erase the way he singled me out—day after day."
    p "我明白他有他的挣扎，但这并不能抹去他日复一日针对我的方式。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31024
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ae3eb1f0:

    # j "Don't think I could either."
    j "我觉得我也做不到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31026
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_77fffb7c:

    # j "I didn't know how to help you, but... it wasn't easy watching you go through that."
    j "我不知道如何帮你，但是...看着你经历那些并不好受。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31028
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5be64b67:

    # s "I get it. That's why I didn't ask you to forgive him—only hoping you would."
    s "我明白。这就是为什么我没有要求你原谅他——只是希望你能。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31030
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_51374bdd:

    # s "He's a good man, you know. Even if he doesn't always seem like it. Even if, well...{w} sometimes, he isn't."
    s "他是个好人，你知道的。即使他并非总是看起来如此。即使，嗯...{w}有时候，他确实不是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31032
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_576365c3:

    # s "But at his core, I mean."
    s "但我是说，在他的内心深处。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31034
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_125fe5ab:

    # p "Maybe one day. When I've actually seen proof of it."
    p "也许有一天吧。当我真正看到证据的时候。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31036
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3175b364:

    # p "If I ever do."
    p "如果我真能看到的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31038
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_47943881:

    # s "Just don't do anything stupid."
    s "只是别做任何傻事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31040
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2fdce3b6:

    # "Your eyes narrow at him and your response is sharper in tone."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31042
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3ee68402:

    # p "Thanks for the stellar advice..."
    p "谢谢你这绝妙的建议..."

# game/script day12.rpy:31044
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b20ef2ee:

    # s "No, I didn't mean it like that.{w} What I mean is—I know you, [name]. You're ambitious and want this."
    s "不，我不是那个意思。{w}我的意思是——我了解你，[姓名]。你有野心，想要这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31046
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_984fee75_1:

    # p "That's why I'm here."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31048
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_463f75d9:

    # s "I was the same way when I first came aboard. Still am."
    s "我刚上船时也一样。现在也是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31050
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a844ed5b:

    # s "That's why you didn't give up, even when you could've."
    s "这就是为什么你没有放弃，即使在你可以放弃的时候。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31052
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fb791901:

    # s "I just don't want to see you push too far."
    s "我只是不想看到你走得太远。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31054
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2632713b:

    # s "There's a fine line between proving yourself and being reckless."
    s "证明自己与鲁莽行事之间只有一线之隔。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31056
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e89fe2ba:

    # s "And I want to make sure you stay on the right side of it, [name]."
    s "我想确保你站在正确的一边，[姓名]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31061
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4a29de44:

    # p "I can't promise I can, but I will try."
    p "我不能保证我能做到，但我会试试。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31063
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e309247f:

    # p "Maybe he deserves a second chance... even if he had plenty of second chances since we first met."
    p "也许他值得第二次机会...即使自我们初次见面以来，他已经有过很多次机会了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31065
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3ff7e66e:

    # j "You're a better man than I'd be."
    j "你是个比我更好的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31067
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1aabeb87:

    # j "Hell, if it were me, I'd be packing my things for Morocco right now—waving him goodbye with one hand and giving him the finger with the other."
    j "见鬼，如果是我，我现在就该收拾行李去摩洛哥了——一只手跟他挥手告别，另一只手对他竖中指。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31069
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a68a2484:

    # s "And I wouldn't blame you for it."
    s "而且我不会为此责怪你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31071
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_91caa5fe:

    # p "So tell me then—why are you so loyal to him? No offense, but I think you can understand why I don't see why he gets so much goodwill from the crew."
    p "那么告诉我——你为什么对他如此忠诚？无意冒犯，但我想你能理解为什么我看不出他凭什么得到船员们如此多的善意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31073
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2dfd97b2:

    # "Samuel exhales, propping an elbow on [his] knee, resting [his] jaw in [his] palm."
    "塞缪尔呼出一口气，将手肘支在[他的]膝盖上，下巴搁在[他的]掌心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31075
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a0d1f2fd:

    # s "Believe it or not, he is a good man at his core."
    s "信不信由你，他本质上是个好人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31077
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_74932284:

    # s "Strict. Rough around the edges, sure. But that's how things run on a ship."
    s "严格。确实，棱角分明。但船上就是这样运作的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31079
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9dc91423:

    # s "He came from the navy—manned warships in active combat. It carried over."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31081
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_98e73260:

    # p "And that's where the demons come from, I take it?"
    p "我猜，这就是那些恶魔的来源？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31083
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2a3c8b98:

    # "Samuel gives a short nod."
    "塞缪尔简短地点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31085
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_18039245:

    # j "Fighting for glory and honor...{w} What a damn pile of horseshit."
    j "为了荣耀和名誉而战...{w}真他妈是一堆狗屎。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31087
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ab4e32e3:

    # "The lizard spits into the water below—just to make sure there's no doubt about his stance."
    "那条蜥蜴朝下面的水里啐了一口——就是为了明确表明它的立场。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31089
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_52ae78f5:

    # j "I've heard it plenty. And I've seen the results even more."
    j "这种话我听得够多了。结果我也见得更多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31091
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7fb5e8de:

    # j "It spits out nothing but broken men. {w}If it spits out anything at all."
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31093
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8718118f:

    # s "Sometimes it isn't much different for us merchants."
    s "对我们商人来说，有时情况也差不了多少。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31095
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7c9ec72c:

    # s "Injuries are a risk, 'course—as I've been reminded of myself."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31097
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6a6d262c:

    # s "But I'm talking about other things as well, [name]."
    s "但我也在说别的事，[name]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31099
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8aa50bcf:

    # s "I know you. I know you're ambitious. You want this—and you're ready to fight for it."
    s "我了解你。我知道你有野心。你想要这个——而且你准备好为之奋斗了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31101
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_984fee75_2:

    # p "That's why I'm here."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31103
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a2c64fe5:

    # s "And you've shown as much."
    s "你也已经证明了这一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31105
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cecf2a11:

    # s "But there's a fine line in your position."
    s "但在你的位置上，有一条微妙的界线。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31107
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_732606a9_1:

    # s "Cross it, and you're not ambitious—you're a liability."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31109
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e89fe2ba_1:

    # s "And I want to make sure you stay on the right side of it, [name]."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31111
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f1907396:

    # "[He] hesitates, mulling [his] words over in [his] head for a few moments."
    "[他]犹豫了一下，在脑子里斟酌了一会儿[他的]措辞。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31113
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bb1d8117:

    # s "Y'know... I actually feel pretty damn stupid about the lot of it."
    s "你知道……说实话，我觉得整件事都他妈蠢透了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31115
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_697f94c6:

    # p "About what?"
    p "想什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31117
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fd9d97d3:

    # s "The scars. The real reason why I have 'em."
    s "这些伤疤。我身上有它们的真正原因。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31119
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_04455131:

    # "Samuel leans back against the shrouds, arms draped lazily over the ropes. The glow of the sea flickers against [his] face."
    "塞缪尔向后靠在侧支索上，胳膊懒洋洋地搭在绳索上。海面上的波光在[他]脸上闪烁。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31123
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f091c7a7:

    # s "It's a bit of a bloody tale, so I'll spare you those details."
    s "这是个有点血腥的故事，细节我就不跟你细说了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31125
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_289bde6a:

    # s "I signed on when I was about your age, Jules. Young, stupid.{w} But not lackin' enthusiasm."
    s "我大概在你这个年纪签约上船的，朱尔斯。年轻，愚蠢。{w} 但可不缺热情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31127
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_823a9b05:

    # "[He] watches the water, eyes distant—caught somewhere between past and present."
    "[他]望着水面，眼神飘远——思绪在过去和现在之间徘徊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31129
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d04c8e18:

    # s "Knew nothing of this life. But I damn well knew I wasn't gonna end up stuck waitin' for someone else to decide who I should be."
    s "对这种生活一无所知。但我他妈很清楚，我可不想等着别人来决定我该成为什么样的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31131
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4b30345f:

    # s "It was {i}my{/i} life."
    s "那是我自己的人生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31133
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c94c314e:

    # s "Didn't care if it was dangerous."
    s "不在乎它危不危险。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31135
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bfd47b97:

    # s "Didn't care if it killed me."
    s "不在乎它会不会要了我的命。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31137
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ddb42902:

    # s "At least it would have been on my terms."
    s "至少那是按我的方式活的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31139
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_11a16e26:

    # "[He] shifts slightly, the ropes creaking beneath [his] weight."
    "[他]微微挪动身体，绳索在[他]的重量下吱嘎作响。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31141
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8decd88b:

    # s "And when I made it on this ship I had somethin' to prove.{w} I thought if I swung hard enough, talked loud enough, drank deep enough-"
    s "当我上了这艘船，我就想证明点什么。{w} 我以为只要我挥拳够狠、嗓门够大、喝酒够猛——"

# game/script day12.rpy:31143
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_54319755:

    # "[His] lips pull into a smirk, but you feel there's something bitter underneath it."
    "[他的]嘴角扯出一丝讥笑，但你能感觉到那底下藏着些苦涩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31145
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d685e3f3:

    # s "-then no one would doubt I belonged."
    s "——那就没人会怀疑我属于这里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31147
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3bcd2c68:

    # "The glow in the waves pulses, stretching long across the water like a ghostly scar."
    "波浪中的光芒脉动着，像一道幽灵般的伤疤长长地铺展在水面上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31149
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ff6a9e90:

    # s "I was in port, barely a few months in. Thought I was doin' alright—hadn't made a complete fool of myself. Even felt respected."
    s "我当时在港口，上船才几个月。以为自己做得很不错——没把自己搞成个彻头彻尾的傻瓜。甚至觉得受到了尊重。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31151
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3e50ba9d:

    # s "But respect don't mean shit if you can't back it up. {w}At least, that's what I thought."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31153
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_64ec52e5:

    # s "And one night in some piss-soaked tavern, I found out just how fragile I was."
    s "然后，在一个某个尿骚味熏天的酒馆里，我发现了自己有多脆弱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31155
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_259a7777:

    # s "We was killing time with dice, as usual."
    s "我们像往常一样，玩骰子打发时间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31157
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a3c57cf4:

    # s "I'd been drinkin'—a lot.{w} Had a hot streak, coins stacked high like I was king of the table."
    s "我一直在喝酒——喝了很多。{w} 手气正旺，钱堆得老高，好像我是赌桌上的国王。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31159
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_68c8ef4a:

    # s "When fortune changed, I got cocky."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31161
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6e2e016a:

    # "[He] pauses and rolls [his] jaw, as if the memory still sits wrong in [his] bones."
    "[他]停顿了一下，活动着下巴，仿佛那段记忆仍然让[他]骨头里不舒服。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31163
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0efbee3f:

    # s "Called a guy a cheat. Big bastard, hands as large as my head."
    s "骂一个人是骗子。一个大块头混蛋，手大得跟我的脑袋似的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31165
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8482e82a:

    # s "Maybe he was. Maybe he wasn't.{w} Didn't matter—my pile shrank, and I said it loud enough for him to hear."
    s "也许他是。也许不是。{w} 不重要——我的钱堆变小了，而我骂得够响，让他听见了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31167
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b76278c6:

    # s "I was told to let it go."
    s "有人叫我算了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31169
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_31386868:

    # s "That it was none of my business."
    s "说这不关我的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31171
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_090564b2:

    # s "The fuck it wasn't my business, I thought."
    s "去他妈的不关我的事，我当时想。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31173
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_da06c012:

    # "[He] exhales through [his] nose in a quiet laugh."
    "[他]从鼻子里呼出一口气，轻声笑了笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31175
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_440fd5e3:

    # s "Respect don't mean shit if I can't back it up."
    s "如果我不能捍卫它，尊重就屁都不是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31177
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7b78250b:

    # s "I threw my chair aside and went for him."
    s "我把椅子甩到一边，朝他冲了过去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31181
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_944c7bb8:

    # s "Didn't even know what hit me. The sound of glass shattering—a flash of jagged edges in the candlelight—then fire-hot pain, sharp as hell.{w} Didn't even realize it was {i}my{/i} blood 'til I hit the floor."
    s "甚至不知道是什么打中了我。玻璃碎裂的声音——烛光下闪过锯齿状的边缘——然后是火辣辣的剧痛，尖锐得要命。{w} 直到我倒在地板上，才意识到那是我自己的血。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31185
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6a7d9cfa:

    # s "Can probably imagine how it went for me."
    s "你大概能想象到我当时的下场。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31187
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_386355ae:

    # "[He] drags a thumb over the scar on [his] cheek, tracing its length absently."
    "[他]用拇指划过[他]脸颊上的伤疤，心不在焉地描摹着它的长度。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31191
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_18c34d18:

    # s "Bled all over the damn place. Bled all over myself, for fuck's sake.{w} Just me, lyin' there, seeing nothing but red in one eye, starin' at the ceiling, wondering how long it'd take me to die."
    s "血他妈流得到处都是。血他妈流了我自己一身，真该死。{w} 就我一个人，躺在那里，一只眼睛除了红色什么也看不见，盯着天花板，想知道我还要多久才会死。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31193
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_76654e7d:

    # s "Just another nobody, left to rot in the gutters of some foreign port."
    s "又一个无名小卒，被丢在某个外国港口的阴沟里腐烂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31195
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4fe1fd72:

    # s "Got the fucker good, mind.{w} He just got me gooder."
    s "不过我也把那混蛋揍得不轻，听着。{w} 只是他把我揍得更惨。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31197
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c223f7e8:

    # "[He] shakes [his] head with a dismissive laugh."
    "[他]摇了摇头，带着不屑的笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31199
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6a969281:

    # s "Nobody came runnin'. Not even death had the courtesy."
    s "没人跑过来。连死神都没他妈赏脸光顾。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31203
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_67197178:

    # s "I made it back to the ship on my own, leaving a trail of blood the whole damn way."
    s "我自己爬回了船上，一路留下了他妈一长串血迹。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31205
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_406d30c5:

    # s "You won't believe how head wounds just keep pouring out the stuff. No idea how I wasn't drained dry by the end."
    s "你不会相信头上的伤口能一直往外涌出那玩意儿。真不知道我最后怎么没流干血死掉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31207
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ec379207:

    # "At that, [his] smirk returns—softer this time."
    "说到这里，[他]的讥笑又回来了——这次柔和了些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31209
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_090abbd9:

    # s "Arthur stitched me up."
    s "是亚瑟给我缝的伤口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31211
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9e38faa0:

    # s "Kept mutterin' about how he ain't never been trained as a surgeon—only knew how to saw off limbs, not stitch them."
    s "他一直嘀咕说他从来没受过外科医生训练——只知道怎么锯掉肢体，不知道怎么缝合。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31213
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_94c2f440:

    # s "'Course I told him to shut the fuck up and keep going."
    s "我当然叫他他妈闭嘴继续缝。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31215
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e70a29d3:

    # s "He told me to shut the fuck up or he'd amputate my damn head."
    s "他叫我他妈闭嘴，不然就把我的脑袋锯下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31219
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_869543b5:

    # s "Didn't think I'd survive."
    s "我以为我活不成了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31221
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_618786c8:

    # s "Arthur was the one to help me when I made it back to the ship."
    s "我回到船上时，是亚瑟帮了我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31223
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dc215c72:

    # s "We were throwing insults at each other until he was done."
    s "我们互相骂骂咧咧，直到他缝完。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31225
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3e96555e:

    # "The memory has [him] tucking [his] head down in a child-like giggle."
    "这段回忆让[他]像孩子一样咯咯笑着低下了头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31227
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_85857875:

    # s "Great craic that guy, knew we'd get on after that."
    s "那家伙真有意思，打那以后我就知道我们能合得来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31230
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f53979c9:

    # s "He was scary as shit back then already, so you best believe that I was convinced that he meant it."
    s "他那时候就已经吓人得要命了，所以你最好相信我当时确信他是认真的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31234
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_aca78756:

    # s "He was scary as shit back then already, so you best believe that I was convinced that he meant them all."
    s "他那时候就已经吓人得要命了，所以你最好相信我当时确信他说的那些话都是认真的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31236
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e04c8cc9:

    # s "Anyway, lookin' back, I realize now—it wasn't respect I earned—it was fear, and I was too dumb to see it."
    s "总之，回头看看，我现在明白了——我赢得的不是尊重——是恐惧，而我当时蠢得没看出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31238
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0bfb1c7b:

    # s "Took only someone who wouldn't take my shit to show me. No one on deck did."
    s "只需要一个不吃我那一套的人来让我看清这一点。甲板上没人这么做。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31240
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_16b37aa1:

    # s "Guess they figured I wasn't even worth the punishment they'd have to take if they taught me a lesson."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31242
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ac8b3b70:

    # s "I had plenty to learn."
    s "我要学的东西还多着呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31244
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1789ecd2:

    # s "Not too long after, Rajeeyah joined.{w} If you ask me, someone must've had enough and finally convinced the owner to cough up the funds for a proper surgeon."
    s "没过多久，拉吉雅就加入了。{w} 要我说，肯定是有人受够了，终于说服船主掏钱雇个正经的外科医生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31246
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3efb4a0a:

    # s "So we wouldn't have to rely on clumsy bastards like us to stitch each other up."
    s "这样我们就不用依赖我们这种笨手笨脚的混蛋互相缝伤口了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31248
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8d170939:

    # s "But that's it. Ain't some grand tale. Hell, ain't even a fight I bloody won."
    s "但就是这样。不是什么了不起的故事。妈的，甚至都不是一场我他妈赢了的架。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31250
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5b4dd884:

    # s "And what did I get for my effort? Nothin'.{w} Except being called {i}\"Mosaic\"{/i} for the better part of a year 'til they got tired of it."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31252
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_66ff72dd:

    # "[He] pauses, staring at the glowing waves as if seeing something else entirely."
    "[他]停顿了一下，凝视着发光的波浪，仿佛看到了完全不同的东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31254
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fda64196:

    # s "Mockery instead of an ounce of the respect I was after."
    s "是嘲弄，而不是我追求的那一丝尊重。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31256
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7baa855d:

    # s "That's my point."
    s "这就是我的重点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31258
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_af4399eb:

    # s "I crossed that line. I wasn't ambitious—I was stupid."
    s "我越过了那条线。我不是有野心——我是愚蠢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31260
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e8bb464f:

    # s "I aimed to be a big shot—instead I ended up an inch from losing an eye. Maybe my life, if he'd wanted."
    s "我本想成为个大人物——结果却差点丢掉一只眼睛。也许连命都丢了，如果他想的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31262
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f2427076:

    # s "I don't want you making that mistake."
    s "我不希望你犯那个错误。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31264
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_efea9ae8:

    # p "I'm not trying to gamble away my money and pick fights, Sam."
    p "我不是想赌掉我的钱或者找人打架，萨姆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31266
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_72d7d21a:

    # s "That's not what I mean."
    s "我不是那个意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31268
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_43f0a916:

    # s "Recklessness shows up many ways. On a ship, it often ends in injury—or worse."
    s "鲁莽的表现形式有很多种。在船上，它往往以受伤告终——或者更糟。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31270
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6fc8bb8f:

    # s "I don't want that.{w} Not for you."
    s "我不希望那样。{w} 不希望发生在你身上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31272
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c95e7205:

    # j "You're acting so motherly."
    j "你表现得像个老妈子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31274
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e9955abd:

    # s "I don't want him to die just because he thought helping the topmen would impress the gentlemen."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31276
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7710e824:

    # p "No—I appreciate it, Sam. Really, I do."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31278
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_141281d1:

    # "Silence settles between you for a moment or two. Then, with a breath, [he] pushes off the shrouds and grins."
    "你们之间沉默了片刻。然后，[他]吸了口气，从侧支索上撑起身子，咧嘴笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31280
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_127f18fb:

    # s "Anyway! That's enough of my ramblin'."
    s "总之！我的絮叨到此为止。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31282
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_eb02bbba:

    # "[He] slaps [his] palms against [his] thighs and stretches."
    "[他]用手掌拍了拍[他的]大腿，伸了个懒腰。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31284
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_de132566:

    # s "We got a whole sea burnin' beneath us, and here I am going on about some old fight and trying to spin some lessons."
    s "我们脚下有一整片燃烧的海，我却在这儿絮叨一场陈年旧架，还想说教一番。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31286
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d9166f11:

    # "Finishing his stretch, [he] grips the edge of the shrouds and smoothly slips back down onto the deck—landing with a softer thump than you expect."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31303
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_40b8c53b:

    # s "The striking sight of the burning seas, and the great news of you sticking around."
    s "眼前是燃烧之海的壮丽景象，还有你决定留下的好消息。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31305
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dd92cc22:

    # s "What more could we hope for?"
    s "我们还能奢望什么呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31309
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f8169766:

    # j "Rhetorical question? Since I wouldn't mind some nice foo-"
    j "反问句？因为我不介意来点好吃的——"

# game/script day12.rpy:31313
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b90cc974:

    # s "Rhetorical question."
    s "反问句。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31319
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ff1d432c:

    # "Samuel's footsteps circle their way behind you and stop—lingering."
    "塞缪尔的脚步声在你身后绕了一圈，然后停住了——徘徊着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31321
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_64f73d3c:

    # "You feel what must be brief hesitation before a palm presses lightly against your shoulder, as if testing whether it's okay."
    "你感觉到一阵短暂的犹豫，然后一只手掌轻轻按在了你的肩膀上，好像在试探这样是否合适。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31323
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b3c09d40:

    # "Your ears twitch at the contact and you instinctively glance over your shoulder."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31335
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3870ca84:

    # s "Glad you're stickin' around."
    s "很高兴你决定留下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31337
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0e491746:

    # s "I mean it."
    s "我是认真的"

# game/script day12.rpy:31341
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6290caa1:

    # "The words are simple, whispered, but something in [his] tone that carries more than just casual relief."
    "话语很简单，是低声说出的，但[他]的语气里蕴含着某种东西，不仅仅是如释重负那么简单。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31343
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7dcc0b56:

    # "You keep your voice low just the same, listening to the waves, hoping they'll swallow your words for anyone but the two of you."
    "你同样压低声音，听着海浪声，希望除了你们俩之外，海浪能吞没你的话语。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31345
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c01280b2:

    # p "Sam?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31349
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dc1cd401_1:

    # s "Hm?"
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31351
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9e853ab1:

    # s "Do you want me to stop?"
    s "你想让我停下吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31353
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2e8b6890:

    # "You hear a tinge of uncertainty in [his] voice."
    "你听出[他]声音里有一丝不确定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31355
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_41b5649d:

    # "Anxiousness."
    "焦虑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31357
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_85c54f1e:

    # "Anxiousness at the possibility of you saying yes."
    "是担心你可能说“是”的那种焦虑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31361
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_300701d2:

    # p "I..."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31371
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8e6c38df:

    # "[His] expression drops as those anxieties materialize right in front of [him]. Slowly, he pulls his hands back to [himself]."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31373
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2a67cd7d:

    # p "Sam, I..."
    p "山姆，我……"

# game/script day12.rpy:31375
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9b0d7a6f:

    # "[He] gives a soft shake of [his] head."
    "[他]轻轻摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31377
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_89872ebb:

    # s "It's alright. I understand. Maybe I was a bit too forward."
    s "没关系。我明白。也许我有点太冒进了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31379
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c21393fd:

    # p "N-no! I-it's not like that."
    p "不——不是的！我——我不是那个意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31381
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4df65054:

    # p "It's..."
    p "这……"

# game/script day12.rpy:31383
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_77f1f8c0:

    # "You draw in another breath."
    "你又吸了一口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31385
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6323ef8f:

    # p "I can't say, but it's not your fault, Sam. Believe me."
    p "我不能说，但这不怪你，山姆。相信我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31387
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4be36757:

    # s "What do you mean, 'you can't say'?"
    s "“你不能说”是什么意思？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31391
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_89bdc240:

    # "Samuel's looking for eye contact that you are unable to keep."
    "塞缪尔试图与你眼神接触，你却无法回应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31393
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8b611bf1:

    # "[His] brow furrowed with quiet concern."
    "[他]眉头微蹙，带着无声的关切。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31395
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4cc883b3:

    # s "You been acting different. You're going to stay, right? That's what you wanted."
    s "你最近表现得很不一样。你会留下的，对吧？那是你想要的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31397
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_06ee3281:

    # s "But now... you're more glum than you were before."
    s "但现在……你比以前更忧郁了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31399
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_47c2c0b8:

    # s "What the hell happened when you talked to Arthur?"
    s "你和亚瑟谈话时到底发生了什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31401
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2ae04f78:

    # s "Clearly something's off."
    s "显然有什么不对劲。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31403
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9f9b88dd:

    # p "No, it's nothing. {w}Don't worry."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31405
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_14d65a3d:

    # "It's not true and [he] knows it."
    "这不是真的，[他]也知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31407
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e9f3fe3e:

    # "[He] gives you a look and sighs."
    "[他]看了你一眼，叹了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31411
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0a8f1a4f:

    # "For a moment [he] looks out at the sea, fingers tugging restlessly at [his] sash."
    "有那么一会儿，[他]望向大海，手指不安地拉扯着[他的]腰带。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31413
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7939776f:

    # "When it's adjusted just so, the knife flicks out again, thumb working it open and closed in practiced rhythm."
    "腰带刚调整好，[他]又把刀弹了出来，拇指熟练地以惯常的节奏开合着刀刃。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31415
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1b53abaf:

    # p "It really is nothing, Sam. I've just... it's been a lot these past few days."
    p "真的没什么，山姆。我只是……这几天发生了太多事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31417
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_02e80a63:

    # s "I get that."
    s "我懂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31421
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_eb1116cc:

    # s "Can hardly force ya to talk, but... you know I'm here."
    s "我没法逼你说，但是……你知道我在这儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31423
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_92c29ede:

    # "You nod stiffly."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31425
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_17b4e151:

    # "For a fleeting second, the thought of confessing flickers inside you, but you smother it just as fast."
    "有那么一瞬间，坦白的念头在你心中闪过，但你立刻就把它压了下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31427
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a31acbcf:

    # "You can't."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31429
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_60b7bcce:

    # "How would you even begin?"
    "你甚至不知从何说起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31431
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6b769ed8:

    # "\"Sorry Sam, I just had to use you to save my own hide.\""
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31433
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1767f709:

    # "\"It was really convenient that I stumbled in on you two talking, or I would have been {i}really{/i} screwed.\""
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31435
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4914da37:

    # "Yeah..."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31437
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c2512148:

    # "Great..."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31439
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c217afc1:

    # "Come on, keep it together, [name]."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31441
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_289ea628_1:

    # "Just keep it from [him]."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31443
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6caddb96:

    # "[He] doesn't have to know, and as long as [he] doesn't, it'll all be good."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31451
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ec0f7538_1:

    # "Arthur left you no choice.{w} It's as simple as that."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31453
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_34f3b2ec_1:

    # "And as long as he keeps his word, you don't have to think about this."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31455
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b38dbfd1:

    # p "I think it's best if I get some sleep."
    p "我想我最好去睡一会儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31457
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e0cfbfc0:

    # p "Isn't long until the next watch starts."
    p "离下一班岗开始没多久了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31459
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_77bab124:

    # "He nods and watches you as you step away from them."
    "他点点头，看着你从他们身边走开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31461
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_19c1568f:

    # "You pick your way past the mast, boats, and other sailors to head to your hammock."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31463
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5fb58021_1:

    # "You glance back at the sea. The glow's nearly gone now—if it's even there at all."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31465
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6348a2a9_1:

    # "The hatch creaks as you pull it open, and you wonder how long it'll be before you see something like that again."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31467
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_66bccf4b_1:

    # "If you ever will."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31469
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cf193bcc:

    # "And whether next time you'll be able to enjoy it..."
    "而下一次你是否还能享受其中……"

# game/script day12.rpy:31473
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cde92cc7:

    # p "No."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31483
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ce66aae0:

    # "You crane your neck, nervous that someone might see. But most are still too occupied with the glow of the sea—even as it begins to fade."
    "你伸长脖子，紧张地怕有人看见。但大多数人仍专注于海上的光芒——即使它已经开始消退。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31485
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_52b582bd:

    # "A few, though, are returning to their tasks. Arthur and Perce among them, appearing to be in conversation on the other side of the ship."
    "不过，有几个人正回到自己的工作中。亚瑟和珀斯也在其中，似乎在船的另一边交谈。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31487
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8fa0d5af:

    # s "I've got my eyes open. Relax."
    s "我睁着眼睛呢。放松。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31489
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9d495ba5:

    # p "What if someone notices?"
    p "要是有人注意到怎么办？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31491
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a58d0157:

    # s "It's dark."
    s "天黑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31493
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1765c4e2:

    # s "I'll let go if I notice someone turning their head."
    s "要是发现有人转头，我就松开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31495
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_155c458c:

    # p "Shouldn't I be on the lookout instead?"
    p "不该是我来放哨吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31499
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_315f2b1c:

    # "Fingers dig into the base of your neck and you lift your shoulders in response."
    "手指按进你的后颈，你本能地耸起了肩膀。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31501
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ee52f6d7:

    # s "Re-lax."
    s "放——松。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31503
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7f5cdcac:

    # s "I'll spot 'em before they do."
    s "我会在他们发现之前先发现他们。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31505
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_982d3d9b:

    # s "Trust me, I have enough experience."
    s "相信我，我经验丰富。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31509
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_195cdf5d:

    # s "And wasn't it you who told me the crew wouldn't think less of me for having a softer side?"
    s "而且，当初不就是你告诉我，船员们不会因为我展现柔软的一面就看轻我吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31511
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d0f4caa3:

    # s "Shouldn't be much of a problem for you then, no?"
    s "那对你来说应该也不成问题，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31513
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e5581ad4:

    # p "Sam..."
    p "山姆……"

# game/script day12.rpy:31515
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1d3eb8f9:

    # "It was so easy to say at the time."
    "当时说起来可轻松了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31517
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c9da80ba:

    # "Back when you weren't the one second-guessing everyone's impression of yourself."
    "那时你还没开始怀疑每个人对你的看法。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31519
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_11bd6b3c:

    # p "What about him?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31523
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_25d4d3f3:

    # s "I said relax, man."
    s "我说了放松，伙计。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31525
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d7c43aea:

    # s "I've got my eyes open."
    s "我睁着眼睛呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31527
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_97dfad07:

    # "You're not sure you can, no matter how much you'd like to."
    "你不确定自己能否做到，无论你多么希望如此。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31529
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f73039c5:

    # j "What about me?"
    j "那我呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31541
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_067e28e3:

    # "The voice rips you from whatever little moment of peace you may have had, sending your fur to stand on end immediately."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31543
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0d84ff56:

    # "You weren't as quiet as you thought."
    "你并没有自己想的那么安静。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31545
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dc79294f:

    # j "I'm not gonna say a word to anyone."
    j "我不会对任何人说一个字的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31547
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3692813a:

    # "Julian whispers without turning to face you."
    "朱利安没有转身面对你，低声说道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31549
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3767b49e:

    # "He stands there, wind tousling his clothes—looking oddly noble."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31551
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_43cc34db_1:

    # p "Really?"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31553
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5e4ace8e:

    # j "Of course."
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31555
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_7dab1a11:

    # s "Good lad."
    s "好小子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31559
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_30a5f4b2:

    # j "Not about to spoil the tender moment between two lovebirds."
    j "不会去破坏两只爱情鸟之间的温馨时刻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31561
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bcabd7cb:

    # s "We're not in love! Just... grateful."
    s "我们不是恋人！只是……心存感激。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31563
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cc5e28a7:

    # j "As am I."
    j "我也是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31565
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ec254c08:

    # j "But I'm not getting in line to massage—"
    j ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31569
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4c082ec7:

    # "He must have caught the shake of your head from the corner of his eye and cuts off mid-sentence."
    "他一定是用眼角余光瞥见了你摇头，话说到一半就停住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31571
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fabf2e6b:

    # "Not now."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31573
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_64fa67e9:

    # "Samuel steps a little closer."
    "塞缪尔走近了一些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31585
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_262a2506:

    # "[His] hands place onto your shoulders with full-palmed confidence now."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31587
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2adaaec6:

    # "If only [he]'d just wrap [his] arms around you..."
    "要是[他]能就这样抱住你就好了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:31589
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_606a7117:

    # "You're not sure if you could enjoy it, out here in the open with the potential of someone seeing you."
    "你不确定自己能否享受这个，在这露天的地方，随时可能被人看见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31591
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_763ff816:

    # "Still, you can't help wishing for it."
    "尽管如此，你还是忍不住这样期望着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31593
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f33b1653:

    # "Even if it is nothing but a nice dream."
    "哪怕这只是一个美好的梦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31595
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c26cc3ef:

    # "Fading just like the glow of the sea around you."
    "就像你周围海上的光芒一样渐渐消逝。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31597
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2febc32d:

    # "Just like the warmth of Samuel's hands as they glide down your shoulder blades before [he] pulls away."
    "也像塞缪尔双手的温暖，在[他]抽身离开前，从你的肩胛骨滑落。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31609
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_aec31164:

    # "You turn and watch as [he] drifts back to your side."
    "你转过身，看着[他]飘然回到你身边。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31611
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c948b031:

    # p "That was...{w} nice."
    p "那感觉……{w} 很好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31615
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_35686fa1:

    # "[He] smiles and flicks [his] ears back softly."
    "[他]微笑着，轻轻向后拨了拨[他的]耳朵。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31617
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4cf60e76:

    # p "Mmm... I didn't realize how much I'd missed it."
    p "嗯……我没意识到我有多想念这种感觉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31621
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_61ba1ffd:

    # "Samuel glances at you, waiting for you to elaborate."
    "塞缪尔瞥了你一眼，等着你继续说下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31623
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bc89b749:

    # p "Some... closeness, I guess."
    p "一些……亲近感，我想。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31625
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a2882bbe:

    # p "This ship is, well.{w} The tone's harsher than what I was used to back on land."
    p "这艘船，怎么说呢。{w} 气氛比我以前在陆地上习惯的要严酷。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31627
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_80072e08:

    # p "Everyone's more distant."
    p "每个人都更疏远。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31631
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a23f8481:

    # s "We all haul on the same line, but kin we ain't—there's not much room for us to be."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31633
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a13074ef:

    # s "We'd never leave anyone behind, but it's not a familial closeness."
    s "我们绝不会抛下任何人，但这并非家人般的亲密。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31635
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_47e24686:

    # s "Nobody will tear your head off for enjoying the company of one another, but it carries a risk when you're confined in such a tight space."
    s "没人会因为你们彼此作伴而拧掉你的脑袋，但被限制在这么狭小的空间里，这本身就带有风险。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31639
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8f7e8d96:

    # s "A bit o' distance can be healthy."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31643
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_664c037f:

    # s "Rumors be like wildfire—"
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31645
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_33ca9745:

    # "[He] stops [himself] and eyes Julian briefly."
    "[他]停住话头，短暂地瞥了朱利安一眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31647
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_48da03be:

    # s "And-"
    s "而且——"

# game/script day12.rpy:31649
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bb7dfb49:

    # p "I understand."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31651
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e4111095:

    # "Just like you understand that it might complicate things for you two."
    "就像你明白这可能会让你们俩的关系复杂化一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31653
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cf7a9330:

    # "The last thing you want is to get Sam into trouble."
    "你最不想的就是给山姆惹麻烦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31657
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d981fcaa:

    # s "So for many, some distance is healthy. Stops us from being at each other's throats if things go south."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31659
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bb7dfb49_1:

    # p "I understand."
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31665
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_eb5263a0:

    # s "That'll keep for later, though. I've already made you part of my plans for Mogador."
    s "不过，这些以后再说吧。我已经把你算进我去莫加多的计划里了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31667
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dcf402bd:

    # s "Can hardly bail now, eh?"
    s "现在可不能反悔了，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31671
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_8105ba6e:

    # s "I'd be a proper bastard."
    s "那我可真是个十足的混蛋了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31673
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_51c820be:

    # s "Unless you'd forgotten. Then I could play it off cool, like."
    s "除非你忘了。那样我就可以装酷，蒙混过去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31675
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f81d6b72:

    # p "Too bad for you, I haven't forgotten."
    p "可惜啊，我没忘。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31679
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c9080872:

    # "[He] begins to laugh."
    "[他]开始笑起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31681
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_95ecd56b:

    # s "Yeah, well. Guess I'll be crying myself to sleep tonight."
    s "是啊，好吧。看来今晚我要哭着入睡了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31683
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_547dff4b:

    # p "You're still not gonna tell me what it is, are you?"
    p "你还是不打算告诉我那是什么事，对吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31687
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_32ce7ba7:

    # s "Naaaah..."
    s "才不呢..."

# game/script day12.rpy:31691
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_98cb8a43:

    # "[He] leans in, lips curling into a sly smirk."
    "[他]凑近了些，嘴角勾起一抹狡黠的坏笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31693
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bc70e8ac:

    # s "Or... maybe I already did? You think on that, boy."
    s "或者...说不定我已经说漏嘴了呢？你好好想想吧，小子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31695
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_592d2366:

    # "You grimace in exaggerated frustration."
    "你夸张地皱起脸，一副懊恼的样子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31697
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_fe8bac3b:

    # p "Don't say that. Now I'll be obsessing over it all night."
    p "别这么说。这下我今晚可要琢磨一整夜了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31699
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_6dbb74fe:

    # s "Sounds like your headache, not mine."
    s "听起来那是你的烦恼，不关我的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31701
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_77e57089:

    # s "Just like I'm claimin' your rum ration at supper."
    s "就像晚餐时我要拿走你的朗姆酒配额一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31703
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ae1e95dc:

    # p "What?! You're not-"
    p "什么？！你不会——"

# game/script day12.rpy:31707
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ed64ad54:

    # s "All part of the plan."
    s "都是计划的一部分。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31711
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c3995cdd:

    # s "Didn't I mention that?"
    s "我没提过吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31713
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e9c5e963:

    # s "You wouldn't want to ruin it, would ya?"
    s "你总不想搞砸它吧，嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31718
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c8fecd35:

    # "Before you can argue, [he] pushes off the gunwale and excuses [himself]."
    "还没等你争辩，[他]便从船舷边撑起身子，找了个借口开溜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31720
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1bbdccb8:

    # "Something about being needed elsewhere."
    "说什么别处需要他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31722
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_37d7ae18:

    # "A bald-faced lie."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31734
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_86bc5d7e:

    # "[He]'ll have to fight you for that rum."
    "那朗姆酒，[他]可得跟你抢一抢了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31736
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_13aafcf1:

    # p "You're a right ol' bastard, Sam!"
    p "你可真是个不折不扣的老混蛋，萨姆！"

# game/script day12.rpy:31738
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_42f59705:

    # "[He] just waves over [his] shoulder, never even turning around."
    "[他]只是头也不回地挥了挥手，连身子都没转过来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31747
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cb7af291:

    # "Your eyes follow [him] as [he] strolls past the main mast, tail swaying in the wind, fingertips trailing along the wood."
    "你的目光追随着[他]，看着[他]闲庭信步般走过主桅杆，尾巴在风中摇曳，指尖轻轻划过木料。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31751
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ea77ec1d:

    # "And you still owe Julian some drinks as well..."
    "而且你还欠朱利安几杯酒呢..."

# game/script day12.rpy:31753
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_62357a49:

    # "At least that's for Mogador itself."
    "至少那是为了摩加多尔本身。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31758
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ba8b57ec:

    # "The thump of Julian landing on the deck rattles the planks beneath your paws."
    "朱利安落在甲板上的重击声，震得你爪下的木板都咯咯作响。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31760
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_551d2ca6:

    # j "Sounds like someone's staying dry tomorrow."
    j "听起来明天有人要滴酒不沾了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31762
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5ba047ff:

    # p "We'll see about that."
    p "走着瞧吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31766
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4122d2bd:

    # j "Don't worry, I'll think of you while I'm sipping mine."
    j "别担心，我小酌的时候会想着你的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31768
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e4435a4d_1:

    # "These two will be the end of you."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31770
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9555ab3c:

    # "But truthfully? You vastly prefer to be sober in their company than drunk out of your mind and watching this ship disappear behind the horizon."
    "但说实话？比起喝得烂醉如泥、眼睁睁看着这艘船消失在地平线后，你更愿意在他们身边保持清醒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31772
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b38fefb4:

    # p "A right ol' bastard..."
    p "一个不折不扣的老混蛋..."

# game/script day12.rpy:31774
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_c974e7c5:

    # "You repeat it softer this time, a grin stretching across your snout."
    "这次你低声重复了一遍，咧开嘴笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31780
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ffc8b8c4:

    # p "And for you?"
    p "那么对你来说呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31784
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1263afef:

    # "[He] straightens slightly."
    "[他]稍稍挺直了身子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31786
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_49c95ed0:

    # s "What do you mean?"
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31788
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_0c8cd577:

    # p "Well, do you consider yourself to be someone needing the distance... or do you prefer—"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31792
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dd4bdfbe:

    # "You trail off, struggling to not make it sound too intimate, but thankfully, [his] expression softens into a smile."
    "你话没说完，努力不让它听起来太过亲密，但幸好，[他]的表情柔和下来，露出了微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31794
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_09f47d18:

    # s "A bit of both.{w} Depends on the person, really."
    s "两者都有点吧。{w}真的，这得看人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31796
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_f0089275:

    # s "But for Morocco..."
    s "但说到摩洛哥..."

# game/script day12.rpy:31800
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_99426bd3:

    # "[He] hesitates for a second, then continues."
    "[他]犹豫了一下，然后继续说下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31802
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e653ab68:

    # s "Actually, I was thinking—maybe we could do something together."
    s "其实，我在想——也许我们可以一起做点什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31804
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_d76f3be3:

    # s "If you're up for it?"
    s "如果你有兴趣的话？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31806
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2c5a2683:

    # "What kind of question is that?"
    "这算什么问题？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31810
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_aa4b2ca1:

    # p "Of course!"
    p ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31812
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_e74faef4:

    # "Hopefully that didn't sound too eager."
    "希望这话听起来没显得太急切。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31814
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_01a7cc9b:

    # p "What did you have in mind?"
    p "你有什么想法？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31816
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1ec5d342:

    # p "Though, fair warning—I don't know much about Morocco. Or even harbors, for that matter."
    p "不过，事先声明——我对摩洛哥了解不多。甚至对港口什么的，也一窍不通。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31818
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_146a68b0:

    # s "Now that I would like to keep to myself."
    s "这个嘛，我想先保密。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31820
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_12584d15:

    # s "Think of it as a surprise."
    s "就当是个惊喜吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31822
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cd6dba21:

    # "You try to think of what kind of surprise Samuel might come up with, but without any starting point, it could be anything."
    "你试着想象塞缪尔会搞出什么惊喜，但毫无头绪，一切皆有可能。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31824
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_72185075:

    # p "You're really not going to tell me?"
    p "你真的不打算告诉我？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31829
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_5a34e4e8:

    # "[He] pushes off the gunwale and gives you a rough pat on the shoulder."
    "[他]从船舷边撑起身，粗鲁地拍了拍你的肩膀。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31831
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ee4bb6c8:

    # s "Would hardly be a surprise if I did, would it?"
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31833
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_9b354b4f:

    # p "Not even a tiny hint?"
    p "一点点暗示都不给？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31838
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_cf6b2231:

    # "[He] sticks [his] tongue out as [he] slips past you toward the back of the ship."
    "[他]从你身边溜向船尾时，冲你吐了吐舌头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31840
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_1bfae857:

    # s "No."
    s ""

# game/script day12.rpy:31852
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_122c698f:

    # s "I'm heading in. Getting some sleep while I can."
    s "我要进去了。趁现在能睡就睡会儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31854
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_bcb458dc:

    # s "Looks like it's pretty much over anyway. A shame—but probably better for my mood tomorrow if I'm not tempted to linger another hour."
    s "反正看起来也差不多结束了。真可惜——不过，如果我忍住不留恋这一个小时，明天的心情大概会更好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31858
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_229486d1:

    # s "Want to catch the sunrise again?"
    s "想再看一次日出吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:31860
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_ed641151:

    # s "I kind of want to after today."
    s "经过今天这么一天，我倒是有点想了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31862
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_716b173e:

    # "You do, too. {w}You really do. But..."
    "你也是。{w}你确实也想。但是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:31864
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_a282337e:

    # "The thought of waking up so early..."
    "一想到要起那么早..."

# game/script day12.rpy:31866
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_b30f8b4f:

    # "Especially after today."
    "尤其是在今天之后。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31868
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_4fdf1f8d:

    # "Ugh..."
    "呃啊..."

# game/script day12.rpy:31870
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_294ebe08:

    # p "I'd love to."
    p "我很乐意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31872
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_2bfcea35:

    # "You'll manage."
    "你能搞定的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31876
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_dff31c32:

    # s "I'll see you two at the next shift then."
    s "那下一班岗见啦，你们两个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:31878
translate Chinese day12_bioluminescence_sam_julian_3bdb9a8c:

    # s "And [name]? Welcome back aboard."
    s "还有，[姓名]？欢迎回到船上来。"

translate Chinese strings:

    # game/script day12.rpy:675
    old "\"Nothing. Nothing, Wolf.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:689
    old "\"Some sympathy would be nice for once.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:709
    old "\"I don't know, just nod as if you care.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:723
    old "\"How about massaging my back with some soothing ointment after we're done here, if you're already asking?\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:865
    old "Do you mention it and apologize?"
    new "你要再提起这件事并道歉吗？"

    # game/script day12.rpy:1262
    old "Do you play along with Julian's gossiping?"
    new "你要和朱利安一起八卦吗？"

    # game/script day12.rpy:1267
    old "Ah what the hell, sure, go along with it."
    new "啊，管他呢，好吧，就一起八卦吧"

    # game/script day12.rpy:1339
    old "Let's not gossip behind someone's back."
    new "我们还是别在背后说人闲话了"

    # game/script day12.rpy:1370
    old "What? No!"
    new "什么？不！"

    # game/script day12.rpy:1601
    old "Do you break the silence with Samuel?"
    new "你要打破与Samuel之间的沉默吗？"

    # game/script day12.rpy:1605
    old "Don't break the silence"
    new "不打破沉默"

    # game/script day12.rpy:1631
    old "Ask [him] if you are making enough progress to keep the ship safe"
    new "询问[他]目前的进度是否足以保证船只安全"

    # game/script day12.rpy:1651
    old "Apologize for your mistake"
    new "为你的错误道歉"

    # game/script day12.rpy:2379
    old "You..."
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:2383
    old "...climb up and help them"
    new "……爬上去帮助他们"

    # game/script day12.rpy:2387
    old "...stay safe on deck"
    new "……安全地留在甲板上"

    # game/script day12.rpy:3000
    old "Curse him under your breath"
    new "低声咒骂他"

    # game/script day12.rpy:3020
    old "Swallow your frustrations"
    new "咽下你的沮丧"

    # game/script day12.rpy:3044
    old "Punch the hull of the ship"
    new "一拳砸向船体"

    # game/script day12.rpy:3255
    old "Will you allow Julian to pay Nomax a \"visit?\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:3258
    old "Sure"
    new "当然"

    # game/script day12.rpy:3672
    old "Do you want to try and convince Arthur to keep you around?"
    new "你想试着说服Authur把你留下吗？"

    # game/script day12.rpy:3676
    old "\"Of course I'll stay. Arthur will have to boot me off this thing with his own hands.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:3689
    old "\"Maybe it's best to leave. What good would it be to work under someone who despises me?\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:3843
    old "\"It's nice that being chipper comes so easily to you, while I'm faced with the prospect of just being dumped from this fucking thing.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:3894
    old "...will you?"
    new "……你会吗？"

    # game/script day12.rpy:3898
    old "\"Of course, Sam. I'll try, at least.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:3910
    old "\"I appreciate your effort, but if he wants me gone, I'll leave in Morocco and find another ship.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:3925
    old "\"Why? Clearly Arthur doesn't share your enthusiasm.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:3950
    old "...are you?"
    new "……你会吗？"

    # game/script day12.rpy:3954
    old "\"Fuck no! As if I would give him that pleasure.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:3966
    old "\"I admire your effort, but if he wants me gone, I'll leave in Morocco and find another ship.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:3980
    old "\"I'll try, but it's difficult to enjoy it under these circumstances...\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:4021
    old "...can you?"
    new "……你能吗？"

    # game/script day12.rpy:4025
    old "\"Of course, Sam! As if I would give him the pleasure of feeling justified about dismissing me from the ship.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:4037
    old "\"I admire your effort, Sam. I really do. But if he wants me gone, I'll leave in Morocco and find another ship.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:4225
    old "What's your plan?"
    new "你有什么计划？"

    # game/script day12.rpy:4229
    old "Two days are enough to convince him, and you always have the option of the bribe"
    new "两天时间足够说服他，而且你总还有行贿这个选项"

    # game/script day12.rpy:4236
    old "You might be better served on a different ship if Arthur wants you gone this badly"
    new "如果Authur这么想让你离开，或许换一艘船对你更有利"

    # game/script day12.rpy:5263
    old "How do you want to respond?"
    new "你想如何回应？"

    # game/script day12.rpy:5267
    old "\"Just because you have your struggles doesn't mean mine are any easier, Julian.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:5273
    old "\"Are you though? He is God knows how many miles away. You actually {i}can{/i} just do what you want.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:5639
    old "Nod"
    new "点头"

    # game/script day12.rpy:5645
    old "\"I'm not in the mood for it.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:5817
    old "...but do you act on it?"
    new "……但你会吗？"

    # game/script day12.rpy:5821
    old "Help along and get yourself ready"
    new "你顺势配合，准备好自己"

    # game/script day12.rpy:5825
    old "Don't touch yourself"
    new "不碰自己"

    # game/script day12.rpy:6165
    old "It's your turn. How would you like to handle it?"
    new "轮到你了，你想怎么玩？"

    # game/script day12.rpy:6169
    old "Take it easy on him and let Nomax set the pace."
    new "温柔一点，让Nomax自己把握节奏"

    # game/script day12.rpy:6174
    old "Let your dominant side take the reins. Nomax can be coy later."
    new "自己掌握主导权，Nomax可以之后再装矜持"

    # game/script day12.rpy:8799
    old "\"Yes, what every sailor does when they get to shore!\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:8874
    old "\"I don't know.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:8975
    old "\"I will figure it out when I get there.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:9437
    old "\"I know, I know, you can't.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:9510
    old "\"What am I saying... The harbor is probably going to be boring as sin.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:9585
    old "\"The wood grain really looks like a smile.\""
    new ""

    # game/script day12.rpy:9836
    old "{cps=5000}You feel helpless. Too weak for this shit right now.{/cps}"
    new "{cps=5000}你感到无助。现在太虚弱了，没力气应付这种破事。{/cps}"

    # game/script day12.rpy:9840
